window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4101,"title":"Chapter 4101 - Settling Down","paragraphs":["Chapter 4101: Settling Down","The Nine Luminaries Great Star Field was an extremely ancient great star area. Originally, it had a large number of Star Worlds. There were even quite a number of grade one Star Worlds, and there were even more grade two and grade three Star Worlds.","However, after the previous disaster, close to 90% of the Star Worlds in the Nine Luminaries Great Star Field had completely collapsed. Only a small portion of the Star Worlds that were lucky had not been destroyed and were still preserved.","At this moment, in the Wood Spirit Star World, a second-class Star World that had luckily survived.","“Miss Eighth, from today onwards, you will stay in the Wood Spirit Star World. I have already informed the major forces of the Wood Spirit Star World. They will ensure your safety,” Jian Wushuang said.","!!","“Well, thank you.” Eighth nodded slightly.","Eighth was born a slave and had always been very humble. It was only when she met Xuan Yi that her life began to change.","For Eighth, she did not have any extravagant expectations. As long as she could live a normal life, she would be very satisfied. Jian Wushuang’s arrangement of her naturally satisfied her.","“Devil Flame.” Jian Wushuang looked at Devil Flame, who had been following him.","“Ruler.” Devil Flame immediately looked at him.","“You’ve been following me for a while. You’ve helped me a lot over the years. I said that as long as you work for me, I’ll give you your freedom. Now, I’ll fulfill my promise,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What?” Devil Flame stared at him.","He was caught off guard by this sudden surprise.","Yes, Jian Wushuang had said that as long as he was honest, he could give him his freedom in the future.","But Devil Flame knew very well that Jian Wushuang had said this to appease him. Devil Flame had not even thought about whether there would really be a day.","Over the years, he had indeed been well-behaved by Jian Wushuang’s side. There was nothing he could do. His life was in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","Of course, if he had been forced to submit to Jian Wushuang at the beginning, he was still unwilling to do so. However, as Jian Wushuang’s strength increased step by step, his talent and potential continued to show, now, in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, he was fighting against the Ultimate Ruler in the third level of the Ruler realm.","He had seen all of these Devil Flames. Such a terrifying and incredible super genius had long convinced Devil Flame.","He was no longer dissatisfied. Now, he was willing to follow Jian Wushuang. Moreover, Jian Wushuang was very kind and would restore his divine body Whenever he had the chance, by now, his divine body had already recovered 50%.","However, even though Jian Wushuang was good to him, he still did not have freedom.","And now, without any warning, Jian Wushuang wanted to let him go?","“Ruler, are you...are you serious?” Devil Flame was in disbelief.","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “But before I let you go, you must swear an oath to the universal principle and not tell anyone about me or my hometown, the Divine Beginning Realm. You can do that.”","“Of course. I’ll swear it now.” Devil Flame immediately swore an oath to the universal principle.","Jian Wushuang also fulfilled his promise and directly removed the mark in Devil Flame’s soul origin. Without the soul mark, Devil Flame was free and naturally regained his freedom.","“I’ve finally regained my freedom.” Devil Flame clenched his eyes, his face full of ecstasy. But then he raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated look. “Ruler, I...”","“I’ve removed my control over you. From today on, you don’t have to call me Ruler anymore.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. “By the way, your divine body has only recovered 50%. Your strength is still far from your peak, and you don’t have any resources. How about this...”","Jian Wushuang flipped his hand and an interspatial ring appeared in his hand.","“There are 5,000 origin stones in this interspatial ring. Take it.” Jian Wushuang handed the interspatial ring to Devil Flame.","“5,000 origin stones, this...” Devil Flame looked at the interspatial ring in front of him in astonishment. Indeed, he needed origin stones now. After all, only with sufficient origin stones could he buy a large number of special gems to help him recover his divine body.","But 5,000 origin stones was not a small amount. He needed origin stones, so Jian Wushuang should also need them?","“Don’t be so pretentious. Take it.” Jian Wushuang smiled again and said, “When I was being hunted by those people, I killed an Ultimate dominator. That Ultimate Dominator is quite rich, probably close to 20,000 origin stones. In other words, I have a lot of money now, so 5,000 origin stones is nothing.”","“Thank you, Ruler!” Devil Flame thanked him and took out a token. “Ruler, this is my message token. If you need it in the future, I will go through fire and water.”","“I’ll take this token. Ok, go.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","Devil Flame bowed respectfully to Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang, then turned and left.","Seeing Devil Flame leave, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang looked at each other and sighed.","Devil Flame had been by his side for more than 200,000 years. He had always been a servant and guard, and he never left Jian Wushuang’s side.","To be honest, Devil Flame had been by Jian Wushuang’s side for a long time, so Jian Wushuang naturally had feelings for him. The reason why he let Devil Flame go was that after entering the depths of the universe, he would definitely find the Life Palace and go there, of course, he could not bring too many people. It was enough to bring his wife, so it was not convenient to bring another guard.","Secondly, it was also because Devil Flame’s current strength was not very helpful to Jian Wushuang.","Devil Flame’s peak strength was only at the Ultimate Ruler level. However, Jian Wushuang was now able to fight against the Ultimate Ruler, so his strength would definitely be stronger in the future. Devil Flame’s strength would definitely not be able to keep up with his.","Of course, the most important reason was that Jian Wushuang had witnessed Devil Flame’s loyalty to him all these years, even going through fire and water. That was why he had allowed Devil Flame to be free.","After all, he knew very well how important freedom was to any cultivator.","“Husband, let’s go. Don’t let Lord Heart Slayer wait for too long,” Leng Rushuang suddenly said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded. They soon arrived at the void outside the wood spirit star realm, where Ruler Heart Slayer had been waiting quietly.","“Why, have you settled everything?” Ruler Heart Slayer could not help smiling when he saw Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang arrive.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Now I can go to the depths of the universe with you, Lord.”","..."]},{"number":4102,"title":"Chapter 4102 - Never Give Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 4102: Never Give Up","“Don’t worry. Before I leave, I have to say hello to those people. You should come with me,” said Heart Slayer with a smile.","Jian Wushuang immediately followed Heart Slayer and left. As for Leng Rushuang, she stayed in the independent space of the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","In the center of the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, in the vast universe void, several Supreme experts gathered together again.","Six Supreme experts, including Ruler Heart Slayer and Blackhawk, gathered together. Their divine power formed a terrifying storm that shook heaven and earth.","!!","Jian Wushuang, who was beside Ruler Heart Slayer, was also in the middle of the storm. Even with the protection of Ruler Heart Slayer, he was still a little scared.","“Heart Slayer, who’s this little guy next to you?” A five-meter-tall, iron-tower-like Supreme expert asked.","“I just got to know him. He’s also on the Nine Emperor List. He’s going to the depths of the universe soon, so I’ll give him a ride,” Ruler Heart Slayer said.","“Oh, the Nine Emperor List?”","The other four Supreme Rulers could not help but look at Jian Wushuang.","These Supreme Rulers knew the Nine Emperor List very well. They also knew that anyone who was valued by the Nine Emperor Pavilion, even if he was only a third-level Ruler, must be extraordinary.","Without sufficient ability, it was impossible for him to be recognized by the Nine Emperor Pavilion, let alone let Ruler Heart Slayer personally take him to the depths of the universe.","On the other hand, Ruler coldly glanced at Ruler Heart Slayer and Jian Wushuang, but he was gritting his teeth in his heart.","A perfect life!","As long as he killed Jian Wushuang, he would be able to receive a huge reward from the Cosmos Temple. That reward would definitely be more than what he could collect at once. This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","Unfortunately, just because of the appearance of Ruler Heart Slayer, the duck that was at the tip of his tongue had flown away.","When he heard that Ruler Heart Slayer was going to take Jian Wushuang to the depths of the universe, he became even more anxious, but there was nothing he could do about it.","In terms of strength, Ruler Heart Slayer was much stronger than him. Moreover, Ruler Heart Slayer had risen through the process of slaughter. Whether it was his fighting ability or his life-saving methods, he was very good. Even if he risked everything to ask a top-tier Supreme expert to help him, he might not be able to do anything to Ruler Heart Slayer.","In addition, Ruler Heart Slayer was a core expert of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. He did not dare to ask an expert to deal with Ruler Heart Slayer. That would infuriate the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“I’ve met this little guy before.” A gentle voice sounded. The speaker was a child-faced, white-haired elder.","“Eh?” Jian Wushuang could not help looking at the white-haired elder.","The white-haired elder smiled and said, “Little guy, you forgot that I stopped you when you were being chased by that mysterious Supreme. You owe me a favor.”","Jian Wushuang immediately understood that the white-haired elder was the owner of the giant face.","The giant face had blocked the Supreme who was chasing him, which gave him a chance to escape. Although the elder’s purpose was not to save him, judging from the result, Jian Wushuang did owe him a favor.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang immediately bowed and said, “Blood Sword, thank you for saving me. I will remember this favor.”","“Haha, my name Is Jue Shui. Remember it well.” The white-haired elder smiled very happily.","He did not intend to save Jian Wushuang to resist the Supreme. Saving Jian Wushuang was just a side trip. He did not care about it before, but now he knew that Jian Wushuang was a genius on the Nine Emperor List, he could not ignore it.","The favor of a genius on the Nine Emperor List was a pleasant surprise to Supreme Ruler Jue Shui.","After all, a genius recognized by the Nine Emperor Pavilion usually had great potential. There was a chance for him to become a Supreme or even a top Supreme in the future. When that time came, the favor would be precious.","“Alright, let’s not talk about this little guy. Let’s talk about how the investigation is going.” Heart Slayer waved his hand,","“What can we do? There aren’t any clues at all.” One of the Supreme-beings waved his hand.","“We’ve already investigated everything we can. Unfortunately, those people acted too quickly and destroyed all the traces. We can’t find any reason at all.” The tall Supreme-being added.","“Suddenly making a move and erasing all traces. This is how those people do things.” A purple-robed, long-haired Supreme-being shook his head and sighed.","These Supreme-beings had indeed used everything they could. Unfortunately, more than 90% of the Star Worlds in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy had been destroyed, especially those major Star Worlds. What was left were just some Star Worlds at the periphery, it did not matter at all.","They tried their best to investigate, but they could not find out the reason why those people had taken action.","Of course, they had actually found the bounty issued by the Thunder God Palace more than 100,000 years ago. However, they had never thought of such a bounty at all. After all, the bounty issued by the Thunder God Palace...was only for a third-level Ruler.","They did not care about the reward, so naturally, they found nothing.","“Forget it if you can’t find it. Let’s call it a day. As for the rest of the matter, let the subordinates handle it. I’ll go back first.” After saying that, the tall Ruler moved and left.","“Goodbye, everyone.” The other Rulers also left one after another.","“Let’s go, little guy.”","With Jian Wushuang in tow, Ruler Heart Slayer also left.","However, as soon as they left, Blackhawk caught up with them.","In the vast dark universe void, a silver universe boat was moving ‘slowly’.","It was called ‘slowly’ because it was indeed not fast. In fact, it was not even as fast as Jian Wushuang’s previous universe boat. However, the universe boat that Ruler Heart Slayer took out...in terms of level, it was much higher than Jian Wushuang’s universe boat, so it was definitely faster.","However, it was clear that the universe boat was moving slowly because Ruler Heart Slayer had deliberately made it so.","“Haha, my guess was right. That Blackhawk really didn’t give up. I told him that I would personally take you to the depths of the universe, but he still followed me.” Ruler Heart Slayer laughed.","“Blackhawk followed me?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","He knew that Ruler Heart had deliberately slowed down the speed of the universe boat in order to detect Blackhawk’s movements. It seemed that Blackhawk had indeed followed him.","It seemed that Blackhawk had not given up completely."]},{"number":4103,"title":"Chapter 4103 - Deep Within the Universe","paragraphs":["Chapter 4103: Deep Within the Universe","“Since he wants to tag along, let him tag along. He won’t dare to attack me even if he has the guts to. In fact, he won’t even have the guts to invite a great being to deal with me.” Ruler Heart Slayer was filled with disdain for Ruler Blackhawk.","Once he knew exactly where Ruler Blackhawk was going, Heart Slayer was satisfied and began to accelerate.","The universe boat that he had been traveling on suddenly sped up dozens of times, hundreds of times, and instantly pierced through the universe void, traversing a long distance.","“So fast!” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","!!","It was too fast. The universe boat was indeed a little too fast. It was dozens of times, hundreds of times faster than the universe boat that he had been on before!","It must be known that he had taken a universe boat all the way from the Divine Beginning Realm to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy. It had taken him more than 100,000 years to get there. However, if it had been Heart Slayer Ruler’s universe boat...if the speed was several times faster than 100 times faster, it would only take him more than 1,000 years to get there.","Heart Slayer Ruler, on the other hand, said with a smile, “When adventuring in the universe, there are many times when we can not use the universe passage. First of all, not every place has a universe passage, and not every place can be reached directly. Secondly, the price of universe passage transmission is too high.”","“This time, I rushed to the Nine Luminaries Galaxy from the depths of the universe mainly because the Nine Luminaries Galaxy was in great danger. It was too urgent, so I didn’t care about the cost and reached the Nine Luminaries Galaxy directly through the universe passage. But now, after returning to the depths of the universe from the Nine Luminaries Galaxy, I can’t use the universe passage so extravagantly.”","Jian Wushuang also understood.","In the vast universe, it was not easy to build a universe passage. Especially, the deeper one went into the universe, the more stable the universe void became, and the more laborious it was to build a universe passage, the cost of the universe passage was also greater.","Because of this, even Supreme experts would not easily rely on the universe passage to reach every corner of the universe, unless it was an emergency.","“If you do not rely on the universe channel and have to travel through the universe void space on your own,” Heart Slayer said indifferently, “a high-level universe boat is a must-have for every great being. After all, having a high-level universe boat that can travel through the universe void space at an extremely fast speed can save you a lot of time. This universe boat of mine was bought by me at a special auction a long time ago, and I spent nearly a million universe origin stones to buy it so that I could travel through the universe void space.”","“Of course, my universe boat is also very strong in terms of body protection. If there’s a crisis, I can hide in the universe boat. Even a top-tier Supreme-being wouldn’t be able to do anything to me in a short time. I can wait for the arrival of the experts from the Nine Emperor Pavilion in the universe boat. Little Guy, if you want to explore the depths of the universe in the future, if you have the chance, you can find a way to get a universe boat that can save your life.”","When Jian Wushuang heard this, he was secretly shocked.","He had spent nearly a million universe origin stones to buy this universe boat. No wonder it was so fast.","Moreover, this universe boat had both protective abilities. Even a top-tier Supreme-being could not do anything to it in a short period of time. It was truly impressive.","Jian Wushuang could not help but think of his universe boat that had been smashed into pieces. His universe boat was indeed a little too shabby. Its value could not even be compared to a low-grade principle true treasure.","When he reached the depths of the universe, he could indeed find a way to get a stronger universe boat. Although it could not be compared to the universe boat of Ruler Heart Slayer, at least it could not be too bad.","“The level of the Blackhawk’s universe boat is not as high as mine, and its speed is also not as fast as mine. It won’t be so easy for him to catch up,” Ruler Heart Slayer said with a faint smile.","The silver universe boat shuttled through the universe void at high speed. It had taken Jian Wushuang tens of thousands of years to reach the depths of the universe, but it had only taken him hundreds of years to reach it with Heart Slayer.","Now, Jian Wushuang had arrived at the first divine kingdom in the depths of the universe.","This divine kingdom was called the ice-snow divine kingdom.","“In the depths of the universe, there are still numerous large Star Fields. There are many experts in these Star Fields, but there are more experts and more concentrated divine kingdoms created by Supreme-beings.”","“For example, this divine kingdom of ice and snow was created hundreds of thousands of chaos cycles ago by a Supreme expert in the universe, the Snow Emperor. This Snow Emperor could be said to have been extremely dazzling in the past. He was a true Supreme genius just like you. Although he didn’t gain any insights into the principles of the universe at the Ruler of principles level, his rate of improvement wasn’t any slower than those Supreme geniuses who were rarely seen in the trillions of Star Worlds. In less than ten million years after he broke through to become a Ruler, he broke through to become an Ruler, and his combat power was infinitely close to that of a Supreme Ruler!”","“After he broke through two chaos cycles, his combat strength reached that of a top-tier Ruler. Later on, he became an influential figure among the top-tier Rulers. He was even close to being a match for a universe overlord. Unfortunately, he died in an accident,” Heart Slayer said with a sigh.","“He died?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. “If the Snow Emperor is dead, why is his divine kingdom still alive and so prosperous?”","Jian Wushuang walked in the Ice and Snow Divine Kingdom. It was prosperous with countless experts.","“Haha, little guy, you’ve misunderstood something. It’s true that the divine kingdom needs a top-tier Supreme to be qualified to establish, but it doesn’t mean that the divine kingdom will decline or even collapse after the death of the top-tier Supreme. After all, a divine kingdom will absorb a large number of cultivators. After a long period of growth, many experts will be born. Some of the top-tier experts born in the divine kingdom even have the hope of surpassing the top-tier Supreme who established the Divine Kingdom!”","“When the Snow Emperor was around, the Ice and Snow Divine Kingdom could prosper for a long period of time. Although the Snow Emperor died later, most of the experts under his command did not die. When these experts joined forces, they could naturally keep the divine kingdom from declining.”","“In the depths of the universe, there are thousands of divine kingdoms. However, not all of the kings who founded these divine kingdoms are still alive. Many of them have died long ago,” Heart Slayer said with a smile.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","“Little guy, don’t you have a message token from a Supreme from the Life Palace? Now that you’re in the depths of the universe, you can send a message to him and ask him to come and fetch you,” Heart Slayer said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded and immediately took out Blood Wave’s message token.","..."]},{"number":4104,"title":"Chapter 4104 - Receiving","paragraphs":["Chapter 4104: Receiving","“Senior Blood Wave.” Jian Wushuang quickly contacted Blood Wave.","“The Life Palace should have a universal passage that leads directly to the ice-snow divine kingdom. We’ll wait here for a while. The expert from the Life Palace who will receive you should be here soon,” said Ruler Heart Slayer.","Jian Wushuang and Ruler Heart Slayer were waiting quietly in the ice-snow divine kingdom.","In less than ten days...a handsome middle-aged man in a black robe appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and Ruler Heart Slayer.","!!","“Haha, Jian Wushuang, you’ve finally come to the depths of the universe.” The handsome middle-aged man in a black robe immediately let out a hearty laugh when he saw Jian Wushuang.","“You’re Senior Blood Wave?” Jian Wushuang sized up the newcomer.","The unique aura that made his heart tremble was naturally that of his Ruler. The person who could directly call his name must be Blood Wave himself.","However, although Jian Wushuang had met Blood Wave’s consciousness in the Blood Wave Realm of the Divine Beginning Realm, the Blood Wave in his consciousness at that time was only a dark figure, Jian Wushuang could not see his face clearly.","That was why Jian Wushuang tried to ask him this question.","“Haha, who else could it be?” The handsome middle-aged man in the black robe laughed. He naturally noticed the existence of Ruler Heart Slayer beside him. “Ruler Heart Slayer from the Nine Emperor Pavilion? Why are you here?”","“Supreme Blood Wave, I didn’t expect that you, the Chief Supreme of the Life Palace, would personally come to welcome this little guy.” Ruler Heart Slayer revealed a surprised look.","“Chief Supreme? Is he very strong?” Jian Wushuang could not help but ask.","“Nonsense. Although there are many Supreme-beings in the Life Palace, there are only five Chief Supremes. Those who can become Chief Supremes are all Supreme-beings. Do you think they are strong?” Ruler Heart Slayer rolled his eyes at Jian Wushuang.","“Supreme-beings?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","When he first came into contact with Blood Wave’s consciousness in the Divine Beginning Realm, he had heard from Blood Wave that he was the chief Supreme-being of the Life Palace. However, at that time, he did not have any concept of the identity of the chief Supreme-being, he thought that Blood Wave was just an ordinary Supreme-being.","He did not expect that Blood Wave was actually a Supreme-being!","A Supreme-being was someone who could establish a large divine kingdom alone. The king of the Ice and Snow Divine Kingdom and the Patriarch of the Red Cloud bloodline were both Supreme-beings.","Furthermore, Blood Wave came from the Life Palace. In other words, he was also a special life-form and had the innate advantage of a special life-form. In terms of strength, he was probably one of the strongest Supreme-beings.","“Heart Slayer, why are you with this little guy with my life divine ability?” Supreme Blood Wave asked casually.","“Not only is this little guy a member of Your Life Palace, he is also listed on the Nine Emperor List. He is a guest of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Previously, a large Star Field suffered a devastating blow from a mysterious powerhouse. The Nine Emperor Pavilion sent me there and I met this little guy. I happened to see the people of the Cosmos Temple chasing after this little guy. I conveniently saved him and brought him to the depths of the universe.”","“Is that so?” Ruler Blood Wave raised an eyebrow, he smiled. “Heart Slayer, thank you for taking care of this little fellow. The Life Palace will remember this favor. The tree of life will bear fruit thirty million years from now. If you can pay the price, I’ll think of a way to save one for you.”","“The fruit of Life!” Ruler Heart Slayer trembled as a look of wild joy appeared in his eyes. “Ruler Blood Wave, are you for real?”","“Of course, but only if you can afford to pay the price,” Supreme Blood Wave said.","“Alright, I’ll remember it. I’ll try my best to gather enough money over the past 30 million years. Thank you, Supreme Blood Wave,” Ruler Heart Slayer said gratefully.","“You can be considered a friend of the Life Palace since you were able to save this little guy from the Cosmos Temple. The Life Palace will never be stingy with its friends,” Supreme Blood Wave said with a smile.","Supreme Heart Slayer’s was still pleasantly surprised. He glanced at Jian Wushuang, he said with a smile, “Little guy, since Supreme Blood Wave has come to pick you up personally, you don’t need me to escort you anymore. I’m leaving now. When your strength increases in the future, don’t forget what you said before.”","After finishing his words, Supreme Heart Slayer’s left in a flash.","After Supreme Heart Slayer left.","“Jian Wushuang, what did you say to Supreme Heart Slayer?” Supreme Blood Wave asked.","“It’s nothing. It’s just that Supreme Heart Slayer did save my life at a critical moment. This is a great favor. I said that if I grow up in the future, I’ll have a chance to return the favor,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It’s just a favor. It’s nothing.” Supreme Blood Wave smiled faintly.","“By the way, Senior Blood Wave, what was the divine fruit of life that you mentioned to Ruler Heart Slayer just now? Why was Ruler Heart Slayer so surprised when he heard it?” Jian Wushuang asked doubtfully.","He could tell that Ruler Heart Slayer was indeed very surprised just now.","It was just a divine fruit, and he did not give it to him for free. He also had to pay a sufficient price. was there a need for such a surprise?","“Haha, it’s normal for Heart Slayer to be pleasantly surprised. The Divine Fruit of life is unique to the Life Palace. Even in the entire vast universe, among the countless natural treasures, it is a super treasure that can be ranked in the top five. It can be said that a single divine fruit of life is enough to cause a large number of Rulers to go crazy over it. Even top-tier Rulers would go crazy over it.”","“As for Heart Slayer, he rose from slaughter. Although he’s not a Supreme-being, he’s very close to one. Once he eats the fruit, not only will he be able to reach the Supreme-being level easily, but he’ll also gain many unexpected benefits. In short, this fruit will definitely make a Supreme-being like Heart Slayer do whatever it takes,” Supreme Blood Wave said with a smile.","“This is precious?” Jian Wushuang stared at it.","He did not know what the so-called unexpected benefit was, but he could imagine how incredible this divine fruit of life was just to make it so easy for Ruler Heart Slayer to break through to the Supreme-level.","Blood Wave had agreed to leave such a precious treasure for Ruler Heart Slayer Just because he had saved his life.","“Senior Blood Wave, that divine fruit of life...” Jian Wushuang was about to speak, but was immediately interrupted by Blood Wave’s wave of his hand.","“I know what you want to say. Don’t worry. The reason why I agreed to give him a divine fruit of life is not only because he saved your life, but also because of other more important reasons. You Don’t have the right to know these reasons yet. You will know them when you become an Ruler in the future,” said Blood Wave with a smile.","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang let out a sigh of relief.","If Blood Wave had taken out such a precious life fruit purely for his own reasons, Jian Wushuang would feel bad about it.","..."]},{"number":4105,"title":"Chapter 4105 - The Wealth of a Supreme-Being","paragraphs":["Chapter 4105: The Wealth of a Supreme-Being","“Let’s not talk about Heart Slayer for now, but the Supreme-being Blackhawk who tried to kill you in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy...humph...Blackhawk is an expert from a major force in the depths of the universe. Later, he joined the Cosmos Temple and has been an enemy of the Life Palace for many years. He has attacked the experts of the Life Palace many times. In addition, this time, the Life Palace will remember this grudge. The Life Palace has been looking for an opportunity to kill him and has begun to prepare. Just wait. It Won’t be long before Supreme-being Blackhawk dies.” Blood Wave’s voice was cold, his eyes were filled with killing intent.","Blood Wave’s words shocked Jian Wushuang.","It was clear that the experts of the Life Palace were not the only ones looking for an opportunity to kill the special life. The experts of the Life Palace were also looking for an opportunity to kill the experts of the Life Palace.","Just as what Ruler Heart Slayer had said, the Life Palace and the Life Palace were like fire and water. There was no way to resolve the killing and grudges between them, unless one day...one side would completely disappear from the universe, and the grudges would come to an end.","!!","But who knew how long they would have to wait for that day.","“By the way, Senior Blood Wave, my wife will come with me to the Life Palace this time.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and Leng Rushuang, who had been staying in the independent space of the Heaven Suppression Tablet, appeared in the void around him. “Shuang ‘er, let me introduce you. This is Senior Blood Wave that I mentioned to you before.”","“Leng Rushuang, greetings, Senior Blood Wave.” Leng Rushuang also bowed respectfully.","“This is your wife?” Blood Wave looked at Leng Rushuang and frowned. “What’s going on? Your wife doesn’t seem ordinary to me, but she is clearly not a special life form.”","“Senior Blood Wave, my wife is indeed not a special life form, but she is different from ordinary cultivators.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “To be honest, my wife had been in a deep sleep for a long time. Later, I happened to obtain an astral heart by chance and let her absorb it. That’s how she woke up.”","“Is that so? No wonder it gave me such a strange feeling. It turns out that she has absorbed the Astral Heart.” Blood Wave laughed, “The astral heart is very rare. Since your wife has absorbed an astral heart, her future achievements will not be too low.”","“Let’s go back to the Life Palace together.” Blood Wave waved his hand.","Jian Wushuang nodded and then left with Blood Wave together with Leng Rushuang.","Under the guidance of Blood Wave, Jian Wushuang soon arrived in front of a universe passage in the ice-snow divine kingdom.","“My Lord.” A Ruler in charge of guarding the universe passage obviously knew Blood Wave’s identity. When he saw Blood Wave, he immediately greeted him with great respect.","“Go open the universe passage,” Blood Wave instructed.","“Yes.” The Ruler immediately went to open the universe passage.","“The universe passage.” Jian Wushuang looked at the vast universe passage in front of him.","He knew that in the depths of the universe, opening the universe passage, even if it was only a short distance teleportation, would require a very high price.","“Senior Blood Wave, can this universe passage lead directly to the Life Palace?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s not that simple.” Blood Wave smiled, “In the depths of the universe, except for the divine kingdom controlled by the Life Palace, there is no other place that can lead directly to the Life Palace. We can only take this universe passage to the divine kingdom controlled by the Life Palace. When we get there, we can take another universe passage to reach the Life Palace.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","“We’re going to the Twilight Divine Kingdom, which is the closest divine kingdom to the Ice and Snow Divine Kingdom. The Twilight Divine Kingdom is only four divine kingdoms away from the Ice and Snow Divine Kingdom, so it’s more convenient,” Blood Wave said.","“Only four divine kingdoms?” Jian Wushuang did not know how big a divine kingdom was, so he could not tell how far it was.","Blood Wave continued to smile and said, “Although four divine kingdoms are relatively close, it still costs 100,000 universe origin stones to take the universe passage to get there.”","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","It was only four divine kingdoms, which was obviously close to Blood Wave, but it still cost 100,000 universe origin stones to take the universe passage?","100,000 universe origin stones was too much for most of the Ultimate Rulers to afford. Only some of the more powerful and terrifying Ultimate Rulers could afford so many origin stones.","However, this was only the cost of a short-distance universe passage.","Judging from Blood Wave’s appearance, he did not seem to care at all.","“It seems that Supreme experts are richer than I thought, and top-tier Supreme experts are even more superior. Their wealth is probably even more amazing,” Jian Wushuang thought.","Blood Wave did not even blink his eyes at the 100,000 universe origin stones.","Jian Wushuang was shocked when Lord Xiao, who came from the Divine King Palace, gave him the Purple Blood Secret Manual, which was worth millions of universe origin stones, just because he liked him.","Now it seemed that the so-called 100,000 or a million universe origin stones was a large sum of money for Rulers like them. It might even be an astronomical figure, but in the eyes of a Supreme-being, it was just a drop in the ocean, it was nothing at all.","The wealth of a Supreme-being was beyond his imagination.","Blood Wave smiled faintly as if he had seen through Jian Wushuang’s thoughts, “100,000 universe origin stones might be a fortune for the weaker Supreme-beings, but some of the experts among the Supreme-beings or the top-tier Supreme-beings are negligible. Little guy, you are still too weak to touch the highest level of the universe. When you break through to become a Supreme-being and become one of the top-tier experts in the universe, you will know that no matter how many universe origin stones there are, they are just a number.","“To many powerful Rulers, Apex Rulers, and unrivalled Rulers who have long since become overlords, origin stones are of no use at all. Most of the time, these powerful Rulers trade with the special resources and treasures of the universe.”","“For example, the divine fruit of the Heaven Lake and the Divine Fruit of the chaos era...these are incredibly rare treasures in the universe that are extremely useful to even Rulers. As for the divine fruit of life i mentioned earlier, just one of them is enough to drive countless Rulers crazy. Even Apex Rulers would fight over it. These are truly valuable treasures that can not be measured by origin stones.”"]},{"number":4106,"title":"Chapter 4106 - Flame Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 4106: Flame Mountain","After hearing Blood Wave’s words, Jian Wushuang immediately understood.","For example, when Blackhawk wanted to kill him, he was stopped by Ruler Heart Slayer. He said that he would take out three portions of Heaven Lake Divine Fruit and ask Ruler Heart Slayer to leave at the price of the fruit, however, he did not mention the universe origin stone.","It seemed that the universe origin stone could only be used as a trade between Rulers and some weaker Rulers. However, the ones who were really powerful were used as a trade, they were all kinds of special treasures.","“My Lord, the universe passage has been opened.” The Ruler who was guarding the universe passage came to Blood Wave’s side.","!!","“Yes.” Blood Wave nodded and glanced at Jian Wushuang. “Let’s go.”","Blood Wave immediately led Jian Wushuang and his wife into the universe passage.","With a flash of light, Jian Wushuang and his wife arrived at the divine kingdom controlled by the Life Palace, the Twilight Divine Kingdom.","After arriving at the Twilight Divine Kingdom, Blood Wave immediately arranged for the second universe teleportation. The destination of this teleportation was the Life Palace.","After two consecutive universe passage teleportation, Jian Wushuang finally arrived at the Divine Life Palace.","It was a lush world filled with mountains and forests. The mountains and trees in this world were generally very tall.","After Jian Wushuang arrived at this world, he saw a huge mountain that was hundreds of thousands of feet tall and so vast that he could not see its edge.","“So huge!”","Looking at the mountain in front of him, Jian Wushuang could not help being shocked.","This was not a mountain range made of mountains. It was just a mountain, but it was so huge that it covered tens of thousands of miles.","With the height of hundreds of thousands of feet, such a mountain was simply huge.","Jian Wushuang had cultivated for hundreds of thousands of years and had adventured in the universe, but this was the first time he had seen such a huge mountain.","“Supreme Blood Wave, who is this little guy beside you? His life level seems to be very high.” A simple, gong-like voice suddenly sounded.","“Who is it?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. He immediately looked around and spread out his soul power, but he did not sense any aura in the surroundings.","He did not know who the voice came from.","Blood Wave, who was next to him, had a strange smile on his face. “Flame Mountain, this little guy has just been brought to my Life Palace. Don’t scare him. Greet him properly.”","“Okay.” The gong-like voice sounded again. The next moment, Jian Wushuang found that the huge mountain in front of him, which was hundreds of thousands of feet tall, began to tremble slightly, then, a blurry human face appeared on the mountain wall.","“Hello, little guy. My name is Flame Mountain. You can call me Lord Flame Mountain or Supreme Flame Mountain.” The blurry human face on the mountain wall said.","“You, you are...this mountain?” Jian Wushuang stared at it.","Leng Rushuang, who was beside him, was also shocked.","But soon, Jian Wushuang understood.","“Yes, yes. The Life Palace is the base camp of the special life forms. In the vast universe, there are countless special life forms. Among these special life forms, there are trees, mountains, and even rivers...” Jian Wushuang looked at the huge mountain again, his mood had gradually calmed down. “Jian Wushuang, greetings, Supreme Flame Mountain.”","“Haha, little guy, you’re not bad. You’ve calmed down so quickly. Many Rulers who came to the Life Palace for the first time were shocked for a long time when they saw me.” Supreme Flame Mountain continued to speak in a voice that sounded like a gong.","“Alright, Flame Mountain, go back to sleep.” Blood Wave waved his hand.","The human face formed by Supreme Flame Mountain smiled and then disappeared from the mountain wall. The entire mountain calmed down again.","Jian Wushuang exhaled slightly, but he was still a little surprised.","“Ruler Blood Wave, is Supreme Ruler Flame Mountain a special life form formed by the mountain?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes.” Blood Wave nodded. “The mountain in front of you is his original body. It’s 60,000 feet tall and 8,000 miles long.”","“Hiss!” Jian Wushuang could not help but take a deep breath.","60,000 feet tall and 8,000 miles long. This size was a little too scary.","“Don’t be surprised. There are all kinds of special life forms in the universe. Many of them are big, and the bigger they are, the more divine power they have and the more vast they are.","“Flame Mountain, for example, is a special life form at the peak of the creation level. He joined my Life Palace many years ago. Under the cultivation of the resources of my Life Palace, he has developed nearly 70 percent of his innate advantage, which is why he has a size of more than 8,000 miles. With such a huge size, he can store a huge amount of divine power.” Blood Wave smiled.","“A special life-form at the peak of the creation level?” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","When he was in the Divine Beginning Realm, Blood Wave’s avatar had told him that special life-forms were divided into four levels. The first level was the initial level, the second level was the universe level, the third level was the creation level, and the highest level was the fourth level, it was the perfect level.","A life-form at the peak of the creation level was only one step away from the perfect level.","“Unfortunately, Flame Mountain’s talent is limited. He can only exploit 70% of his innate advantages, and there are still many that he can not fully exploit. This means that although he has such a huge divine body, he can not fully utilize it. He can not even compress his divine power to the size of an ordinary human. He can not compress his divine power, so he can only maintain such a huge appearance. Even moving is extremely difficult. Therefore, Flame Mountain has been staying here for a long time. He can be considered as a guardian of my Life Palace,” Blood Wave said.","“Guardian?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“You’re underestimating him. Although his divine body is too big to move, his strength is terrifying. With his powerful divine body, he can fight against a Supreme-being. With such a huge body and endless divine power, let alone a Supreme-being, even an invincible Supreme-being would not be able to kill him,” Blood Wave said.","Jian Wushuang understood.","As a Supreme-being, he could fight against a Supreme-being head-on. However, with such a huge divine body and endless divine power, the invincible Supreme-being naturally could not do anything to him.","“Ruler Blood Wave, can I also fully utilize my innate advantage in the Life Palace?","“And if I perform it perfectly, will my divine body become as big as that of Supreme-being Flame Mountain?” Jian Wushuang asked.","..."]},{"number":4107,"title":"Chapter 4107 - Life Test","paragraphs":["Chapter 4107: Life Test","“Under normal circumstances, once a perfect life-form develops its advantages to a certain extent, it will also have an enormous divine body. However, whether it can be comparable to Flame Mountain depends on luck. However, the potential of a perfect life-form is naturally greater than that of a creation-level life-form, but the prerequisite is that you can develop your innate advantages,” Blood Wave said.","“How do I develop it?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“First, it depends on secret skills, such as the Life Divine Power, which was created by the Palace Master. It’s purely for the special creatures to develop their innate superiority. Previously, I only gave you the first volume of the Life Divine Power in your hometown. The first volume of the life divine power can only give you an additional 10% of your innate superiority. But in fact, there are six volumes in the Life Palace. If you Ruler all of them, you can exert 60% of your innate superiority,” Blood Wave said.","!!","“60%?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","Flame Mountain could exert nearly 70% of his innate advantage, but he could not even compress his divine power to make his body smaller.","If he could only develop 60% of his innate advantage, he would not be as good as Flame Mountain.","“In addition to the life abhijna, there are some amazing treasures in the universe that can also make use of your innate advantage to a greater extent. In my Life Palace, there is a pool of life nirvana that is specially created to develop the innate advantage of special life forms at great cost. Any special life form who joins my Life Palace will have a chance to enter the pool of life Nirvana. In the pool of life nirvana, the innate advantage of special life forms will be further developed. As for how much more can be developed, it depends on one’s ability,” Blood Wave said.","“Everyone has a chance to enter, so do I?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","“Of course.” Blood Wave smiled. “Moreover, the Nirvana Pool of life not only allows you to develop your innate advantages, but also helps you to awaken your innate divine power.”","“Innate divine power?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“The special life forms in the vast universe all have innate divine power, but they can not be awakened easily. They can only awaken their innate divine power by developing their innate advantages to 60% to 70% and then using special treasures, such as the pool of life in the Life Palace. Moreover, the innate divine power awakened by the special life forms are usually very good, and some of them can even complement one’s own body,” Blood Wave said.","“Complementary? What do you mean?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","“Flame Mountain, for example, has also awakened his innate divine power, which is a unique doppelganger technique. You should know that Flame Mountain’s divine body is huge and difficult to move, which makes it impossible for him to travel, fight, or fight. However, with that innate divine power, he can create his own doppelganger. That doppelganger has nearly 90% of his strength, but his divine body is not as strong and his divine power is not as vast. Therefore, Flame Mountain’s original body has been staying in the Life Palace, but his doppelganger has been wandering and killing.”","“In addition, he doesn’t have to worry about his own death because he’s just a doppelganger. This kind of talent is complementary to him,” Blood Wave said.","Jian Wushuang understood.","His original body could not move, so he could not travel. Therefore, he had the talent to form a special doppelganger.","This kind of talent indeed complemented Flame Mountain.","“Come with me.”","Blood Wave led Jian Wushuang to the void ahead.","Along the way, Jian Wushuang saw all kinds of mountains, lakes, and dense forests. They were undoubtedly huge, and Jian Wushuang vaguely felt some special aura in these lakes and dense forests.","Obviously, there were some special lives hidden in those lakes and forests.","Soon, Jian Wushuang arrived at the core of the Life Palace.","There was an ancient and towering building complex. The first thing Jian Wushuang saw was a huge ancient stone gate that was hundreds of feet tall. It was majestic and magnificent, and at the top of the stone gate was..! There were four gilded words...Life Palace!","There were two huge statues of exotic beasts guarding the stone gate.","When they came to the foot of the stone gate, they immediately felt a suffocating pressure.","This pressure was not emitted by a cultivator, but by the ancient stone gate. The four gilded words on the stone gate and the two statues of exotic beasts around it naturally carried a sense of pressure.","This kind of pressure was so strong that even Jian Wushuang could not help but tremble in his heart.","“Is this the majesty of a top force in the Universe?” Jian Wushuang secretly exclaimed. Fortunately, he had kept Leng Rushuang in the Heaven Suppression Tablet. Otherwise, with her strength, she would have been very embarrassed under the stone door.","“Come with me.” Blood Wave led Jian Wushuang into the stone door.","Soon, they arrived in front of a purple temple.","At the entrance of the Purple Temple, a barefoot, dirty girl was sitting there with a chicken leg in her hand.","“Nine deaths,” Blood Wave said.","“Supreme Blood Wave.”","Seeing Blood Wave, the dirty girl immediately stood up and bowed. “How come you are free today?”","“I came with a little guy.” Blood Wave pointed at Jian Wushuang.","“Oh?” The dirty girl glanced at Jian Wushuang with surprise. “It’s your first time in the Life Palace. How come you are here to welcome the little guy?”","“It seems that this little guy is extraordinary. Is he a top-tier or even a peak creation-level life-form?” The dirty girl said.","“No need to ask so many questions. Arrange a life test for this little guy immediately,” Blood Wave said.","“Yes.” The dirty girl nodded and immediately went into the purple temple to prepare.","“Senior Blood Wave, what is this life test?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s very simple. It’s a test for the level of life. All special creatures that come to the Life Palace for the first time have to go through a life test to find out what level of life they are. In the Life Palace, the authority of different levels of life will naturally be different,” Blood Wave said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","The dirty girl quickly walked out of the purple temple.","“Supreme Blood Wave, it’s been arranged,” the dirty girl said.","“Well, Jian Wushuang, you can go in,” Blood Wave instructed.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded, took a deep breath, and then directly walked into the purple temple.","..."]},{"number":4108,"title":"Chapter 4108 - Red Light Filled the Sky","paragraphs":["Chapter 4108: Red Light Filled the Sky","Jian Wushuang had already entered the Purple Temple, while Ruler Blood Wave and the dirty girl were waiting outside.","“This little guy must have a high level of life to be led by Ruler Blood Wave himself,” the dirty girl thought to herself. At the same time, she secretly glanced at Ruler Blood Wave, however, she noticed that Ruler Blood Wave had a calm, confident look on his face.","This confidence made the dirty maiden even more certain of what she was thinking.","“Right. We have a result.” The dirty maiden’s face lit up as she raised her head to look at the shrine in front of her.","!!","The towering violet shrine suddenly began to emit a dazzling red light.","This red light was like the setting sun, illuminating the surrounding void and causing it to turn red.","“Red light permeating the sky, it’s actually red light permeating the sky?” The dirty girl was shocked.","She had been guarding the purple shrine for a long time, during which a large number of special life forms came to the purple shrine to test their life levels, and the final result of the life test was no more than four types.","The first type was emitting white light, this white light represented an initial level life form, and this was the most mediocre among the special life forms.","The second type was a silver light, which represented a universe level special life form.","The third type was a cyan light, which represented a creation level life form. The denser the cyan light, the higher the level of a creation level life form.","The fourth type was the highest level, which was a perfect level life form. The light emitted by the Purple Temple was a red light!","Now, the Purple Temple was emitting a sky full of red light. Clearly, Jian Wushuang, who was being tested in the Purple Temple, was a perfect life-form!","“It’s actually a perfect level life-form!” The dirty girl’s expression was solemn. She immediately understood why Jian Wushuang was qualified to let one of the first Supreme-beings, Ruler Blood Wave, personally receive him.","A perfect level life-form was definitely a treasure for the Life Palace.","Under normal circumstances, it would be very difficult for a perfect life-form to be born within a hundred Chaos cycles in the vast universe.","Although the Life Palace was the base camp for all kinds of special life-forms, in reality, there were only three perfect life-forms in the Life Palace.","Two of these three were extremely ancient Rulers who had lived for countless years. Up until now, the one who had lived for more than a hundred chaos cycles was a Ruler at the Ultimate level. Although he was younger, he had lived for more than a hundred Chaos cycles. These three people held extremely high positions in the Life Palace, all three of them held extremely high positions in the Life Palace.","As for Jian Wushuang, he was the fourth perfect life-form in the Life Palace.","“When the red light appeared, those old guys must have been alarmed,” the dirty girl thought.","Indeed, although the red light did not cover a large area, there were countless experts in the Life Palace.","As soon as the red light appeared, quite a few experts in the Life Palace were startled and began to rush over at high speed.","Moments later, dozens of figures had gathered in front of the Purple Temple.","Nearly half of the figures were Rulers, and when they arrived, they saw Blood Wave.","“Ruler Blood Wave.”","“Greetings, Ruler Blood Wave.”","The experts all began to pay their respects.","Although they were all experts from the Life Palace, and there were quite a few Rulers present, Ruler Blood Wave was one of the Chief Supremes of the Life Palace. He was a Supreme Ruler, and so in terms of status and power...he was naturally a bit more powerful than the others present.","“Blood Wave.” Another person hurried over. This was a muscular man dressed in scarlet armor.","This muscular man carried an enormous mountain-cleaving axe on his back. His entire body was like an enormous axe, ready to cleave apart the heavens.","This muscular man was the only person present who could call Blood Wave by his name. Clearly, his status was not any lower than Blood Wave’s.","“Giant Axe, you’re here, too.” Ruler Blood Wave looked at the burly man.","“The red light represents a perfect life. I’m in the palace and not far from here, so I came to take a look.” The burly man smiled faintly and then looked at the Purple Temple in front of him, “Who is in the temple?”","“Supreme Axe, the one in the temple is a little guy named Jian Wushuang. Ruler Blood Wave personally brought him to the palace. The first time he came to the palace, his life was tested according to the principles, so this is what happened,” the dirty girl said.","“Blood Wave, did you bring him here yourself?” The strong man looked at Blood Wave.","“Yes,” Blood Wave nodded with a smile. “More than 100,000 years ago, I saw this little guy in an ordinary level-three Star World. At that time, I knew he was a perfect life, so I contacted him and asked him to join my Life Palace. Not long ago, he came to the depths of the universe and sent a message to me, so I brought him to the palace,” Blood Wave said.","“You’ve brought in a perfect lifeform. Blood Wave, you’ve once again rendered a great service to the Life Palace,” the muscular man said with a laugh.","“Although the level of life is important, it is still unknown whether or not this little fellow will be able to become a Supreme expert in the future.” Blood Wave waved his hand.","But right at this moment...","“Eh?” Ruler Blood Wave and the muscular man both raised their heads as they sensed something.","The Purple Temple in front of them was glowing with red light. In the very center of the temple, a dazzling golden light suddenly began to shine.","“What? !”Ruler Blood Wave and the muscular man were both shocked.","“Golden Light? What’s Going On?”","“The sky is filled with red light. It’s true that it is a perfect lifeform, but why is it still glowing with golden light despite the Red Light?”","“So far, no one has detected a golden light in this purple shrine, right?”","“What’s going on?”","The expressions of the experts from the Life Palace became strange.","There were four different levels of special life forms, and they corresponded to four different lights. However, there was no golden light!","“It seems that this little guy’s life level is not as simple as a perfect life form.”The muscular man narrowed his eyes.","“He’s out,”Blood Wave said.","The door of the Purple Temple was opened again, and Jian Wushuang slowly walked out of it.","As soon as he walked out of the temple, Jian Wushuang immediately saw a large group of experts gathered in front of him. Each of these experts had extremely powerful auras, and the weakest one was at the Ultimate Ruler level, the aura of more than a dozen of them, which was invisible, shocked him.","Obviously, these people were all experts at the Supreme level.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang could not help but be shocked.","..."]},{"number":4109,"title":"Chapter 4109 - Greeting Gift","paragraphs":["Chapter 4109: Greeting Gift","“So many Supreme-beings?” Jian Wushuang was secretly amazed.","Supreme-beings were the pinnacle existences in the universe. Even in the depths of the universe, it was very difficult to meet one. But now, in the Life Palace, there were more than ten Supreme-beings gathered in front of him.","Moreover, these ten Supreme-beings were staring at him. It was obvious that they were here because of him.","“Jian Wushuang, come here.” Blood Wave waved at Jian Wushuang.","!!","“Senior Blood Wave.” Jian Wushuang immediately came to Blood Wave’s side.","“Let me introduce you. This person beside me is Giant Axe. Like me, he is also one of the first Supreme-beings in the Life Palace,” Blood Wave said.","There were five Chief Supremes in the Life Palace, all of whom were Supreme-beings.","Since Giant Axe was also a Chief Supremes, he was naturally a powerful Supreme-being who could establish his own divine kingdom.","“Greetings, Giant Axe Supreme-being.” Jian Wushuang bowed respectfully.","“Third-level Ruler?” Giant Axe Supreme-being looked down at Jian Wushuang. “Jian Wushuang, how long have you been cultivating?”","“More than 300,000 years,” Jian Wushuang replied.","“Only more than 300,000 years?” The Giant Axe Ruler could not help but be surprised.","The experts from the Life Palace were also shocked to hear this.","300,000 years was too short for everyone present.","It was known that it took an extremely long time for an ordinary cultivator to grow from birth to the Ruler level.","Unless a cultivator with a heaven-reaching background could save a lot of time by cultivating with a large amount of resources. However, even under such circumstances, it only took him 300,000 years to reach the third level of the Ruler level, it was still very impressive.","However, Jian Wushuang did not have a heaven-reaching background. He just relied on himself to slowly cultivate at the edge of the universe. Most importantly, he was a cultivator with a perfect life...it must be known that a cultivator with a perfect life level...breaking through the bottleneck was many times more difficult than ordinary cultivators.","It was incredible that he could reach this level in about 300,000 years.","“Haha, it seems that my Life Palace will soon have another Supreme expert.”","Supreme Giant Axe laughed. Suddenly, he flipped his hand and a crystal-clear fruit appeared in his hand. He took the fruit to Jian Wushuang, “I’m one of the chief supremacies of the Life Palace. It’s rare to see another perfect life form with great potential in the Life Palace. I have to show you something. Take this middle-grade principle divine fruit as my welcome gift.”","“Welcome gift?” Jian Wushuang was stunned and hesitated.","“Take it. You can use this principle divine fruit,” Blood Wave said with a smile.","“Thank you, Supreme Giant Axe.” Jian Wushuang accepted the crystal fruit without hesitation.","Jian Wushuang immediately sensed an extraordinary power of universe principles from the crystal fruit.","“Although this fruit is common among the many divine fruits in the universe, it has the most extensive use. A divine fruit of universe principles contains an extremely rich power of universe principles. Under normal circumstances, if a Ruler can eat an ordinary low-grade divine fruit of universe principles, he has the hope of comprehending a trace of universe principles,” Blood Wave said, “Jian Wushuang, have you comprehended any universal principles yet?”","“I’ve already comprehended some of the universal principles,” Jian Wushuang said, but he did not mention that his comprehension of the universal principles had reached a certain level.","“Oh?” Ruler Blood Wave’s eyes lit up. “You’ve only reached the third-level Ruler level, but you’ve already comprehended a trace of the universal principles. Your comprehension is extraordinary.”","“Not bad at all.” Supreme Giant Axe nodded with a smile.","“Since you have already comprehended a hint of the principles of the universe, this fruit will be of even greater use to you. After all, those who haven’t comprehended any of the principles of the universe might have a chance of comprehending a hint of the principles by devouring the fruit, but that chance is far too low. If you have already comprehended a hint of the principles of the universe, after devouring the fruit, your comprehension of the principles of the universe will increase dramatically in the next year.”","“This is only a low-grade principle divine fruit. The middle-grade principle divine fruit that Giant Axe just gave you can be sold for 500,000 universe origin stones in the universe. If you swallow this middle-grade principle divine fruit, your comprehension of the universe principles will greatly increase in the next ten years,” Blood Wave said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang was immediately delighted.","The mid-grade principle divine fruit was worth 500,000 origin stones. It would be useful even for an ordinary Supreme expert, but it would definitely be more useful for him.","“Of course, although the mid-grade principle divine fruit is very useful to you, don’t eat it in a hurry. After all, there is only one fruit. You can wait for an opportunity. For example, if you have a special encounter, you can eat it with half the effort,” Blood Wave said.","“I understand.”Jian Wushuang nodded heavily.","“Well, I’ve given you the gift. Cultivate well, and I’ll leave now.” Giant Axe Supreme said.","“Thank you, Giant Axe Supreme.” Jian Wushuang thanked him again.","Giant Axe Supreme waved his hand and left.","After Giant Axe Supreme left...","“Gu Yi,” Blood Wave suddenly said.","“Ruler Blood Wave.” A Supreme immediately came forward.","“This little guy just came to the Life Palace and hasn’t been baptized by the Life Nirvana Pool. You’ve been in charge of this pool for a long time. Tell me, when will the next Life Nirvana Pool open?” Blood Wave asked.","“Normally, the Life Nirvana Pool will only open once every million years. However, Jian Wushuang is a perfect life, and he has only cultivated for about 300,000 years. There’s no need to wait so long. How about this? I’ll go back and make some preparations. In 20 years, the Life Nirvana Pool will open,” Supreme Gu Yi said.","“Okay.” Blood Wave nodded.","“Jian Wushuang, come with me. I’ll take you to the palace to find a place to live.” Blood Wave flew up with Jian Wushuang.","After Jian Wushuang and Blood Wave left, the experts of the Life Palace who were strong in the Purple Temple began to discuss among themselves.","“The treatment of a perfect life is really different. Not only does Ruler Blood Wave receive him personally, but he also brings him here for a life test, and he even brings him to find a place to live.”","“Not only that, didn’t you see Supreme Giant Axe give him a welcome gift just now?”","“I dare say that if it had been a manifestation-level creature, even a peak manifestation-level creature, Supreme Giant Axe wouldn’t have given him a mid-grade principle-god fruit as a welcome gift.”","“A mid-grade principle-god fruit? That’s quite a valuable treasure for an ordinary Ruler, isn’t it?”"]},{"number":4110,"title":"Chapter 4110 - Exploiting the Innate Advantage","paragraphs":["Chapter 4110: Exploiting the Innate Advantage","“However, Jian Wushuang is indeed powerful. He is a perfect life-form and has already comprehended the universe principles. More importantly, he has only cultivated for 300,000 years. Such a genius is indeed worthy of the attention of Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe.”","“To have such achievements after cultivating for 300,000 years, tsk, tsk...”","“Let’s wait and see. Maybe Jian Wushuang will really become another super existence in the Life Palace in the future.”","These experts were talking in secret. They felt that Jian Wushuang was treated well, but no one felt that it was inappropriate for Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe to do so.","!!","After all, in the Life Palace, or even in the entire universe, strength determined one’s status.","Jian Wushuang was at the perfect level of life and had comprehended the principles of the universe. Such a super genius was absolutely rare in the Life Palace. It was only natural that he would be treated very well.","These experts were at most envious of him, but they would not complain.","The Life Palace was huge and boundless, and there were countless experts hidden in it.","Blood Wave took Jian Wushuang through a large number of buildings and finally came to a continuous mountain range.","There were many manors and manors in this huge mountain range.","“My Life Palace can be said to be the base camp of countless special life forms in the entire universe. There are so many special life forms in the entire vast universe, and more than half of them chose to join my Life Palace. Most of these special life forms are adventuring outside, and only a small number choose to live in my Life Palace. But even if it’s only a small number, there are still a lot of them.”","“Because there are so many of them, there are a total of nine mountains in my Life Palace. The first to the third mountains are inhabited by Supreme experts, while the fourth to the ninth mountains are inhabited by Rulers and some principle Rulers. You are now in the sixth mountain range.”","“The sixth mountain range stretches for three million miles and has countless manors, pavilions, and palaces. Many of them are uninhabited. Jian Wushuang, you can choose a place to live,” Blood Wave said.","Jian Wushuang nodded.","He asked Leng Rushuang to come out of the independent space of the Heaven Suppression Tablet. After searching in the sixth mountain range for a while, they finally found a more satisfactory manor to live in.","“Jian Wushuang, in the Life Palace, ordinary creation-level creatures are qualified to arrange some servants and maids for you. You are a perfect-level creature, so you have the right. Should I arrange some for you?” Blood Wave asked again.","“Servants and maids?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","“Don’t worry. These servants and maids are carefully selected from the divine kingdom under the Life Palace. They have been trained since they were young and are completely loyal to the Life Palace,” Blood Wave said.","“No need for servants. Choose ten maids for me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay, I’ll get someone to arrange it,” Blood Wave said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang glanced at his wife.","He did not need any maids. The reason why he asked Blood Wave to arrange ten maids was for his wife.","After all, he spent most of his time in the Life Palace cultivating. He would not spend much time with his wife, and his wife did not have many friends in the Life Palace, it was inevitable that he would feel bored. With these maids around, he could at least talk to his wife.","“By the way, this token is also for you.” Blood Wave waved his hand and took out a token.","“What is this token?” Jian Wushuang took it in confusion.","“This token is the content of the second to sixth volumes of the Life Divine Power.”","Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang, he said, “I told you before that as a special life form, to develop your innate advantage, you must first rely on secret skills. Under normal circumstances, if you Ruler all six volumes of the Life Divine Power, you can develop at least 60% of your innate advantage. Previously, you only cultivated the first volume and barely developed 10% of your innate advantage. After 20 years, Gu Yi will take you to the Life Nirvana Pool. At that time, you will be baptized with life, and you can develop your innate advantage as much as possible. At that time, you can also directly cultivate this life divine power.”","“Senior Blood Wave, do you want me to cultivate the life divine power while I’m undergoing the Life Baptism?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Yes.” Blood Wave nodded. “The life divine power is quite profound. It’s very difficult and slow for an ordinary person to Ruler all six volumes of the life divine power. However, if you combine it with the Life Baptism of the Life Nirvana Pool and cultivate this secret skill at the same time, you’ll get twice the result with half the effort.”","“Most of the special lives in the life divine palace cultivate the life divine power during the Life Baptism. Generally, they can cultivate the life divine power to the fourth or even the fifth volume. With the Life Baptism and absorbing a large number of treasures, they can more or less develop their innate advantages to 60% to 70%, and some can even develop to 80% or 90%.”","“Is it only 80% or 90%? Haven’t you developed your innate advantage to 100%?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s almost impossible to achieve 100% by relying on secret skills or special treasures, but it’s possible to combine the two. However, it’s too difficult to perfectly develop your innate advantage. Since the birth of the Life Palace, it has absorbed countless special lives, but there haven’t been more than 10 people in history who can perfectly develop their innate advantage,” Blood Wave said.","“There have been less than ten of them since the birth of the Life Palace?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","How long had it been since the creation of the Life Palace?","Tens of thousands, hundreds of thousands of chaos cycles, or even longer?","How many special life forms had joined the Life Palace during this long period of time?","This number was absolutely terrifying.","However, among so many special life forms, only less than 10 people could fully exploit their innate advantages, which showed how difficult it was.","Of course, although it was difficult, at least someone had succeeded before, which was a great hope for Jian Wushuang.","He was a perfect life form. If he could fully exploit his innate advantages...","“You can try your best to fully exploit your innate advantage, but you’d better not expect too much.” Blood Wave poured cold water on Jian Wushuang. “But you are a perfect life. Even if you don’t fully exploit your innate advantage, even if you only exploit 70-80% of it, it should be very good.”","..."]},{"number":4111,"title":"Chapter 4111 Looking Forward to It","paragraphs":["4111 Looking Forward to It","“Well, I’ve told you everything I need to tell you. As for the rest, you can feel it out yourself. I’ll take my leave now,” Blood Wave said.","“Thank you, Senior Blood Wave,” Jian Wushuang quickly thanked him.","Blood Wave waved his hand and left.","“Husband, the Life Palace is really powerful.” Leng Rushuang could not help sighing as she watched Blood Wave disappear.","“The base camp of countless special life forms in the entire universe is certainly powerful.” Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at his wife. “Shuang ‘er, I’m afraid we’ll have to spend a long time here.”","“As long as you’re by my side, you can be anywhere.” Leng Rushuang smiled. “Unfortunately, Qing ‘er and Xuan ‘Er are both in the Divine Beginning Realm. It would be perfect if they were here.”","“Qing ‘er and Xuan ‘Er are too weak. They haven’t broken through to become Rulers yet. They don’t have the ability to establish a foothold in the universe. Let’s wait for a while. When they break through to become Rulers and I have a firm foothold in the depths of the universe, I’ll think of a way to bring them over. By then, our family will be reunited,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Well, I believe that it won’t be too far away.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","In the following time, Jian Wushuang began to familiarize himself with the environment of the Life Palace.","Soon, the news of a perfect life in the Life Palace spread throughout the entire Life Palace.","It was also in a group of exquisite pavilions in the sixth mountain range.","“Ruler, Ruler.”","A black-robed elder hurriedly walked up to the top floor of a pavilion.","There, a white-haired youth was leisurely drinking the wine in his bowl.","This white-haired youth’s face was as warm as jade. He was extremely beautiful and bewitching. He was even more beautiful than many women. This was especially so for the white-haired youth’s eyes. They were like gemstones, emitting a special light that was incomparably eye-catching.","“Yi Nu, what’s so urgent?” The white-haired youth was still drinking wine as he casually glanced at the black-robed old man.","Yi Nu was what the black-robed old man called him.","The black-robed old man was one of the white-haired youth’s slaves. Because he was highly regarded by the white-haired youth, he was ranked first among all the slaves.","“Ruler, I just received news that a sky full of red light has appeared in the life testing divine palace. A new perfect life has arrived in the Life Palace,” Yi Nu said.","“Oh? A new perfect life?” The white-haired young man’s expression changed, and he put down the wine bowl in his hand. “After so many years, has the palace finally welcomed a new perfect life?”","“Yi Nu, have you found out everything?” The white-haired young man asked.","“I’ve found out everything. His name is Jian Wushuang, and he was personally brought back by Ruler Blood Wave from the outside world. I heard that Jian Wushuang has cultivated for less than 300,000 years, but he has already reached the level of a third-level Ruler and has comprehended a trace of universe principle,” Yi Nu said.","“He has comprehended a trace of the universe principle?” The white-haired young man could not help narrowing his eyes.","He did not care that Jian Wushuang had cultivated for 300,000 years and reached the third-level Ruler level.","After all, there were all kinds of opportunities to improve one’s realm. There was not much difference between cultivating for 300,000 years and cultivating for three million years.","However, it was unusual for a third-level Ruler to be able to comprehend a trace of the universe principle.","It must be understood that perfect life-forms were extremely rare, and to be able to comprehend a hint of the principles of the universe at the third-tier Ruler level meant that he was definitely one of the most incredible geniuses in the universe.","His potential was simply immeasurable.","“He’s a perfect life-form, and he has a hint of the principles of the universe at the third-tier Ruler level. No Wonder Ruler Blood Wave was able to personally lead him.” The white-haired youth smiled calmly.","“Not only that, after Jian Wushuang tested his life-form, Supreme Giant Axe also rushed there personally and gave Jian Wushuang a middle-grade principle divine fruit. Ruler Blood Wave also ordered Supreme Gu Yi, who manages the Life Nirvana Pool, to open it in 20 years.” Yi Nu added.","“A middle-grade principle divine fruit?” The white-haired youth’s expression finally changed. “Humph, even when I entered the Life Palace, I was only given a low-grade spirit-enlightening divine fruit, which was worth less than 100,000 origin stones. However, Jian Wushuang was given a middle-grade principle divine fruit by Supreme Giant Axe. It seems that the old men in the palace are more optimistic about Jian Wushuang than I am.”","“Exactly.” Yi Nu nodded. “The news about Jian Wushuang has spread throughout the entire Life Palace. In the sixth mountain range alone, many servants and maids are secretly discussing that the higher-ups of the Life Palace are too biased and are fighting for you, Ruler.”","“Biased?”","“There’s no such thing as bias. In the Life Palace, any resources have to be fought for based on one’s own strength. Since those old guys think that Jian Wushuang has more potential than me, I just have to prove that Jian Wushuang is not as good as me.” The white-haired youth smiled faintly. “Yi Nu, do you know where Jian Wushuang lives?”","“Just like us, in the sixth mountain range. Ruler, are you going to find trouble with Jian Wushuang now?” Yi Nu looked at him.","“Stupid,” the white-haired youth scolded, he said, “Jian Wushuang just came to the Life Palace and hasn’t even been to the Life Nirvana Pool. If I go to find him now, even if I defeat him, there is nothing to be proud of. If I want to fight with him and prove that he is far inferior to me, he has to go through the baptism of life, develop his innate advantage to the extreme, and walk out of the Life Nirvana Pool. It’s not too late.”","“Ruler is right.” Yi Nu smiled bitterly.","“Just wait. In another twenty years, he will go to the Life Nirvana Pool. At that time, we can see how much benefits he can get in the Life Nirvana Pool. How much of his innate advantage can he develop?” The white-haired youth smiled.","“When Ruler went to the Life Nirvana Pool for the first time, he used the life divine power to develop 70% of his innate advantage. Later, he got some special opportunities to develop his innate advantage again. Now, he has developed 80%. For a perfect life, it is already very impressive to develop 80% of his innate advantage. As for Jian Wushuang, he has only cultivated for more than 300,000 years. He is definitely not as good as you, Ruler. I estimate that it is already good enough for him to develop 60% of his innate advantage in the Life Nirvana Pool,” Yi Nu said.","“Then wait and see.” The white-haired youth heart also has a glimmer of expectation."]},{"number":4112,"title":"Chapter 4112 Competition","paragraphs":["4112 Competition","The Life Palace, as a transcendent force that had dominated the universe for countless years, was also the base camp of countless special life forms in the universe. Its lair had always been peaceful.","Over the long years, there had been countless forces that fought against the Life Palace. Powerful forces like the Cosmos Temple were even more incompatible with the Life Palace. However, no matter how fierce the battle was...the Cosmos Temple could not pose a threat to the Life Palace’s lair.","Since the Life Palace was established, no force or expert had dared to attack the Life Palace’s lair. Those who dared to do so were already dead.","Jian Wushuang stayed in the Life Palace, so he naturally did not have to worry about encountering any danger.","In the blink of an eye, 20 years had passed.","“Jian Wushuang.”","A loud voice resounded in the air above the manor where Jian Wushuang lived.","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang immediately flew out of the manor and into the void.","“Who are you?” Jian Wushuang looked at the man and woman in front of him.","Both of them were Rulers, and they were at the Ultimate level.","In the nest of the Life Palace, it was very easy to see even Supreme experts. As for Ultimate Rulers, there were even more of them.","“We are the Rulers under Lord Gu Yi. Under his orders, we will take you to the Life Nirvana Pool,” the red-clothed woman said with a smile.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood. Then he glanced at Leng rushuang and said, “Shuang ‘er, I’ll go first.”","“Okay.” Leng Rushuang nodded.","Jian Wushuang immediately followed the man and the woman to the Life Nirvana Pool.","On the way...","“You said that you are the Rulers under Supreme Gu Yi. What do you mean?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","Because they were both cultivators of the Life Palace, the two Ultimate Rulers would not use the word ‘subordinates’ if they were only assisting Supreme Gu Yi in managing the Life Nirvana Pool.","‘Subordinate’ usually referred to themselves as ‘subordinate’ because they were loyal to the other party.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s question, the man and woman looked at each other, then the purple-haired man chuckled and said, “Jian Wushuang, you just came to the Life Palace, so you don’t know many things. There are many experts in the Life Palace, but the resources are still limited. In order to get these resources, there is a great competition in the Life Palace.”","“Perfect life-forms like you, or most of the creation-level life-forms, because of their high life-level and high treatment in the Life Palace, naturally don’t have to worry about not getting resources. However, the more ordinary creation-level life-forms, or universe-level and initial-level life-forms, can get fewer resources. In addition, many senior and weak people have fewer opportunities to get resources. Therefore, at this time, the best way to get more resources is to find a real expert and rely on him.”","“The two of us are only ordinary universe-level beings. When we first arrived at the Life Palace, we were not Ultimate Rulers. In addition, we did not have many advantages in developing the Life Nirvana Pool, so our potential was limited. Therefore, we could not get too many resources. However, the two of us were smart enough to work under Supreme Gu Yi. Supreme Gu Yi manages the Life Nirvana Pool and has some power and status in the palace. Naturally, the two of US received a lot of benefits. Now, we have reached the level of Ultimate Rulers.”","“I see.” Jian Wushuang understood.","Indeed, there was competition wherever they went.","It was the same even for the Life Palace.","“In fact, these things have been made public in the Life Palace for a long time. With more and more competition, there are more and more factions in the Life Palace. The competition between these factions is fiercer, but they are all Supreme-beings and have nothing to do with us Rulers,” the purple-haired man said, he took a look at Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, in fact, people like you are the most comfortable. With a perfect life level, you can get all the resources you want when you come to the Life Palace. Even Supreme Giant Axe gave you a medium-grade principle divine kingdom as a welcome gift. Few people in the Life Palace have received such treatment. There’s no need for you to rely on other experts, because Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe both have high hopes for you. You can be considered as one of their factions. Naturally, no one dares to neglect you in the palace.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smacked his lips.","He did not know about these things before, but now it seemed that Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe should be from the same faction.","For a faction to have two Supreme-beings, it must be very powerful in the Life Palace.","“Thank you for telling me.” Jian Wushuang thanked them.","Their conversation gave Jian Wushuang a new understanding of the Life Palace.","Soon, they led Jian Wushuang to a vast open space.","There were already many people waiting there.","“Well?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the people on the open space. There were hundreds of them, and most of them were Supreme-beings, but there was no Supreme-being.","Most of them were at the third or fourth level, but very few were at the fifth or Ultimate level.","“Like you, these people have just arrived at the Life Palace. This time, they will enter the Life Nirvana Pool and experience the baptism with you,” the purple-haired man said.","“Are they all newcomers?” Jian Wushuang looked around and found that most of their eyes were fixed on him.","“Is he Jian Wushuang?”","“Yes, he is the only perfect life-form among us!”","“Perfect life-form. It is said that there are less than five perfect life-forms alive in the entire Life Palace. No wonder the Life Palace places so much importance on him. We came to the Life Nirvana Pool on our own, but he was led here by two Ultimate Rulers. This treatment is really extraordinary.”","“It’s not a big deal. Even if it’s a perfect life form, it might not be able to become a top-tier warrior in the future. And we are only at the initial and universe levels. It’s not like we don’t have the possibility of becoming a top-tier warrior in the future. Everything depends on our future efforts and opportunities.”","“That’s right. In the next Life Baptism, those of us with lower life levels will find it easier to develop our innate advantages. And since he’s a perfect life form, the difficulty of developing our innate advantages is much harder than ours. In the Life Nirvana Pool, with the help of life techniques, it’s not difficult for us to develop 70% to 80% of our innate advantages. It’s probably even difficult to develop 60%.”","A lot of new people are talking about it."]},{"number":4113,"title":"Chapter 4113 Nirvana Pool of Life","paragraphs":["4113 Nirvana Pool of Life","The higher the level of life, the more difficult it was to develop one’s innate advantage, which had long been recognized.","These newcomers thought that Jian Wushuang’s development of his innate advantage was not as good as theirs, which was reasonable. However, they forgot that Jian Wushuang was a perfect life. Even if he only developed 50-60% of his innate advantage, he was still much more powerful than these initial, universe, or even creation-level life-forms who exploited 100% of their innate advantage.","Whoosh!","A figure suddenly appeared in the open space. It was none other than Supreme Gu Yi, who was in charge of managing the Life Nirvana Pool.","After Supreme Gu Yi arrived, he first glanced at Jian Wushuang with a smile in his eyes before looking around.","“Is everyone here?” Supreme Gu Yi asked.","“My Lord, all the special life forms who have joined the Life Palace during this period of time are here. There are 438 of them, including one in the perfect life level, four in the creation level, 161 in the universe level, and 272 in the initial level,” said the man and woman who had led Jian Wushuang here, the red-clothed woman said.","“Yes.” Supreme Gu Yi nodded and waved his hand. Immediately, a spatial passage appeared in the empty space in front of him.","“Remember, after you enter the Life Nirvana Pool, your body will begin to transform. This transformation will take a long time. You can cultivate your life divine power while transforming and develop your innate advantages as much as possible. As long as your transformation ends, you can come out of the Life Nirvana Pool. Since the transformation has stopped, no matter how hard you try, you can’t improve at all,” Supreme Gu Yi instructed.","“Yes.” The rookies on the open ground, including Jian Wushuang, nodded in unison.","“Alright, let’s go in.” Supreme Gu Yi said.","Immediately, the rookies on the open ground rushed toward the universe passage, and Jian Wushuang stepped into the universe passage.","Soon, all the rookies on the open ground had entered the Life Nirvana Pool.","As soon as they entered, whoosh. A figure suddenly appeared beside Supreme Gu Yi.","“Ruler Blood Wave.” Supreme Gu Yi looked at the newcomer and bowed slightly.","“Gu Yi, those little guys have already entered?” Ruler Blood Wave looked over.","“Yes, including the little guy named Jian Wushuang, who you think highly of. He has also entered the Life Nirvana Pool. This little guy has only cultivated for 300,000 years and reached his current level. He has even comprehended a trace of the universe principle and is extremely talented. If nothing goes wrong, he can at least develop 70% of his innate advantage in the Life Nirvana Pool.” Supreme Gu Yi said with a smile.","“Seventy percent?” Ruler Blood Wave narrowed his eyes slightly, then asked with a smile, “How much of the lifeforce in the Nirvana Pool is left?”","“It wasn’t too long ago that the lifeforce was put into the Nirvana pool. Although we went through more than ten baptisms, we should still have about a quarter of it left,” Ruler Gu Yi said.","“A quarter?” Ruler Blood Wave frowned. “That’s too little. Let’s get a new lifesource.”","“A quarter is too little?” Ruler Gu Yi was startled.","The lifesource was the most important treasure used to form the Nirvana Lake.","The enormous Nirvana Lake was able to help special lifeforms develop their innate advantages. The lifesource was the main reason why it was so useful.","And the source of life was extremely precious in the universe.","Under normal circumstances, a complete source of life could allow the Life Nirvana Pool to undergo dozens of baptisms.","For example, the recent baptism of life was more than ten times. Because there were more blessed-level life forms coming for the baptism, there were even a few peak blessed-level life forms, so the cost was much more. However, after more than ten baptisms...only three-quarters of it had been used up.","There was still a quarter of the lifeforce left. Logically speaking, it should be able to support several more baptisms of life.","“Don’t forget, this time, there is a perfect lifeform coming for the baptism of life, and this little fellow has great potential. Who knows how much lifeforce he can absorb in the nirvana lifepool, so there is no harm in making more preparations. In any case, if this lifeforce is put into the nirvana lifepool in advance, its effects won’t be weakened.” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“That makes sense. Alright, I will add a new life source into the Life Nirvana Pool.” Ruler Gu Yi waved his hand and tore through space, entering the Life Nirvana Pool.","The Life Nirvana Pool was called a pool, but it was actually a vast green sea.","The newcomers who entered the Life Nirvana Pool entered the green sea and immediately entered the endless green sea.","They all knew that the most important thing in the Life Nirvana Pool was the cyan sea water. The cyan sea water contained an extremely unique medicinal power, which was formed by the Life Palace at a great cost.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and directly rushed into the cyan sea. The moment his body flew into the sea, he immediately felt waves of scalding strange power surging toward his body.","“So hot.”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and felt his whole body suddenly become hot. The waves of hot strange power flowed through his pores and his whole body was instantly stimulated by the strange power, the hidden power in his body also began to be gradually stimulated.","What was stimulated was Jian Wushuang’s innate advantage.","The innate advantage of a perfect life was far beyond the imagination of ordinary cultivators. However, the power had been hidden in his body for a long time, so he could not activate it, he could not use it.","The purpose of the green seawater in the Life Nirvana Pool was to fully activate the hidden power.","“What a special feeling.”","Jian Wushuang had already felt that as the hidden power in his body was gradually being developed, the process of development was very comfortable, and his body was also undergoing a transformation during the process of development.","“The function of the pool of life has begun to show. I can’t waste time and begin to cultivate the second volume of the Divine Power of life.” Jian Wushuang’s heart moved, and he immediately began to cultivate the second volume of the Divine Power of life.","He had already cultivated the first volume of the Divine Power of life a long time ago and had the experience of cultivating the first volume. Now, he was very familiar with cultivating the second volume.","In less than half a day, he had already cultivated the second volume of the Divine Power of life. As soon as he finished cultivating the second volume of the Divine Power of life, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled. The hidden power in his body...had also been greatly developed at this moment."]},{"number":4114,"title":"Chapter 4114 The Divine Body Expanded Rapidly","paragraphs":["4114 The Divine Body Expanded Rapidly","After the second volume, the third and the fourth volume...","In the Life Nirvana Pool, everyone was immersed in the transformation of their bodies and the development of their innate advantages.","Under normal circumstances, only by Rulering all six volumes of the life divine ability could their innate advantages be developed to more than 60%. However, when the life divine ability was combined with the green seawater in the Life Nirvana Pool...it was very easy to develop one’s innate advantage to 60% or even 70%.","After Jian Wushuang mastered the fourth volume of the Life Divine Power, his Divine Body finally underwent a greater transformation.","Rumble! Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body trembled crazily. At this moment, he was like a huge black hole that was devouring the endless green seawater around him with an incredible devouring power.","“Has my Divine Body finally begun to expand?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes had long opened, and his hands were tightly clenched. His eyes were emitting an unprecedented fierce light.","After staying in the Life Palace for 20 years, he had long learned that special life forms, especially those above the creation level, had a high chance of expanding their divine bodies as long as they developed more than 70 percent of their innate advantages.","Such an increase in Divine Body could make his Divine Body grow many times larger. With such a huge Divine Body, the divine power he could store would become even more vast and boundless.","For example, Flame Mountain, the Guardian Jian Wushuang had met when he first entered the Life Palace, had a huge and boundless Divine Body. It was 60,000 feet tall and 8,000 miles long. It was incredible.","Because of his enormous Divine Body, Flame Mountain was not afraid of Supreme-beings at all. Even Supreme-beings who stood at the peak of the universe and were invincible among Supreme-beings could not do anything to him, there was nothing they could do to him.","Such a vast and majestic Divine Body was the envy of countless cultivators.","However, Flame Mountain was only at the peak of the creation level, while Jian Wushuang was at the perfect life level.","In terms of potential, he was much greater than Flame Mountain. Even though he was a human cultivator in terms of size, it was not necessarily impossible for him to surpass Flame Mountain.","Now, Jian Wushuang had the opportunity to expand his Divine Body.","“The opportunity is right in front of me. Let’s see how much I can expand my Divine Body.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands and crazily swallowed the endless green seawater around him.","The cyan sea water contained a unique power. After being swallowed by him, most of it was directly refined into his divine power. As he refined it, his Divine Body grew rapidly.","In the blink of an eye, it had grown to a height of 300 meters, but this was just the beginning.","Rumble! Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body shook violently. As the endless cyan sea water entered his body, his Divine Body grew rapidly like a giant standing up.","300 meters tall, 30,000 meters tall, and 30,000 meters tall!","It was still expanding crazily.","In the Life Nirvana Pool, there were 437 other special life forms besides Jian Wushuang.","They were also cultivating life divine power and trying to exploit their innate advantages.","However, at this moment, they could feel the vibration of the Life Nirvana Pool. Immediately, they all looked toward the source of the vibration.","“What’s that?”","“It’s so big. It must be hundreds of thousands of feet tall.”","“It’s a Divine Body. It’s said that it has developed 70% of its innate advantage and has a chance to expand its Divine Body. However, this Divine Body is too big.”","“The appearance of this Divine Body is Jian Wushuang!”","“It’s him? He’s a perfect life form. How could he develop 70% of his innate advantage so quickly?”","The Life Nirvana Pool was in a state of shock.","Many special life-forms who had also developed their innate advantages in the Life Nirvana Pool thought that Jian Wushuang was a perfect life-form when they entered the Life Nirvana Pool, it should be extremely difficult to develop their innate advantages.","However, it had only been a short time since they entered the Life Nirvana Pool, and Jian Wushuang had already developed 70% of his innate advantages. Moreover, his Divine Body had begun to grow rapidly.","“His Divine Body is still growing. It seems that he is already more than a hundred miles tall.”","The many special creatures in the pool of life were shocked.","Indeed, Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body was still growing rapidly, and now it was more than a hundred miles tall.","At this point, Jian Wushuang gradually felt the pain coming from his Divine Body. As his Divine Body continued to grow rapidly, the pain gradually increased.","“Sure enough, when my Divine Body expands to a certain extent, there is a risk of collapse. The pain I’m feeling has just begun, which means that I haven’t reached the limit of collapse yet. I can still continue to improve.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","It was like eating too much, and one’s stomach would burst.","Jian Wushuang was a perfect life. He had developed his innate advantage to more than 70%. He could indeed increase his Divine Body to a whole new level by devouring divine power, but the increase was not endless, there was still a limit. What Jian Wushuang needed to do now was to find that limit, but he had to hold on for as long as possible so that his Divine Body could expand to the maximum.","The pain from his Divine Body alone could be ignored by him. Obviously, he was still far from reaching the limit of his Divine Body.","Jian Wushuang continued to crazily devour the endless green seawater around him. As his Divine Body grew larger, the devouring power became more and more terrifying. Before long, his Divine Body was more than 3,000 miles tall.","At this moment, he stood in the middle of the Life Nirvana Pool. He was like a giant, and his every move was enough to cause the entire Life Nirvana Pool to move.","As his Divine Body grew to such an extent, the speed at which he absorbed the green seawater around him became faster and more astonishing.","The entire Life Nirvana Pool was crazily swirling under his devouring. Endless seawater surged toward him from all directions. He had completely become the absolute core of the Life Nirvana Pool.","As for the other special creatures in the pool, they could only protect the green seawater around them and use it to transform their bodies.","“He’s over 3,000 miles tall, but he’s still growing!”","“A Divine Body that’s 3,000 miles tall, my God!”","“I remember that protector Flame Mountain, whom we met when we first entered the Life Palace, is only 6,000 miles long. Is it possible that Jian Wushuang’s size can surpass Flame Mountain’s?”"]},{"number":4115,"title":"Chapter 4115 68,000 Miles","paragraphs":["4115 68,000 Miles","Everyone in the Life Nirvana Pool was paying attention to the changes in Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body.","Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body grew from 3,000 miles to 5,000 miles, and then to 10,000 miles in just a moment!","10,000 miles of Divine Body was even larger than that of the guardian, Flame Mountain, but Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body was still growing rapidly.","10,000 miles, 15,000 miles, 20,000 miles, 30,000 miles...","When his Divine Body grew to a height of 30,000 miles, the pain in his Divine Body and consciousness intensified, and Jian Wushuang’s expression began to change slightly.","“I’m almost at my limit.” Jian Wushuang’s expression was solemn, but his Divine Body was still growing rapidly.","40,000 miles, 50,000 miles, until it grew to 55,000 miles, the pain in his Divine Body and consciousness had reached its limit.","“I feel that I’ve almost reached my limit. But as long as my Divine Body doesn’t collapse, my divine power can continue to change, and I can continue to increase my strength.” Jian Wushuang bit his lips. The pain he was experiencing right now...was enough to make his consciousness collapse.","But he still stubbornly held on.","He had greatly slowed down the speed of devouring the surrounding green seawater, but the green seawater was still being devoured by him.","As time went by, Jian Wushuang kept his Divine Body in a state of near collapse. After another hour, his Divine Body had improved from 55,000 miles to 68,000 miles.","At this point, Jian Wushuang had finally reached his limit.","At this moment, his Divine Body was completely saturated. He even felt that if he swallowed even a little bit more of the cyan seawater, his Divine Body would collapse and burst.","“That’s it.” Jian Wushuang exhaled lightly, and then his Divine Body began to shrink at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Divine power compression...","The reason why Flame Mountain’s original body could only stay in the Life Palace for a long time was that his Divine Body was too big and he could not compress his divine power, so he could only stay there.","However, Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body was much bigger than Flame Mountain’s, but he could compress his divine power.","Under the compression of the divine power, his Divine Body quickly returned to its original appearance.","Although his body was restored, in fact, the divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body was far from what it had been before.","“My Divine Body has grown to the extreme. I can’t absorb the surrounding green sea water anymore, but the transformation of my Divine Body is still not over. I haven’t reached the limit of my innate advantage,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile, then he slowly closed his eyes.","He had not completely mastered the fifth volume of the Divine Life Palace, so he was still far from the perfect development of his innate advantage.","In the following time, Jian Wushuang began to cultivate the fifth volume of the Divine Power of life.","In every corner of the Nirvana of life, the beings who were also trying to develop their innate advantage heaved a sigh of relief when they saw Jian Wushuang shrink.","In one of the void, Supreme Gu Yi was standing there. He was looking in the direction of Jian Wushuang.","“That Divine Body should be almost 70,000 miles away, right?” Supreme Gu Yi was also shocked, “Nearly 70,000 miles of Divine Body. Tsk, tsk. I’ve been managing this pool of life for so many years. During that time, I’ve seen many beings above the creation level who have developed more than 70% of their innate advantages in the pool. Their divine bodies have soared, but their divine bodies have soared to a height of nearly 70,000 miles. This is the first time I’ve seen Jian Wushuang...isn’t he too heaven-defying!”","Ruler Gu Yi secretly praised him, but he quickly regained his senses and began to inspect the entire pool of life.","This inspection caused Ruler Gu Yi’s eyes to instantly widen.","“How is this possible?” Ruler Gu Yi was completely stunned.","“The portion of Life Source I just placed in is actually, actually less than half?” Ruler Gu Yi was truly stunned.","One had to know that there was originally only a quarter of the life essence left in this Nirvana Pond.","According to what Ruler Gu Yi said, that quarter of the life essence could support several baptisms of life.","But later on, he listened to Ruler Blood Wave’s suggestion and considered that among the many lifeforms that entered the nirvana pond this time, there was a perfect lifeform, so he put in a new portion of the life essence.","Now, however, not only had one-quarter of the original source of life been used up, but more than half of the new source of life had been used up, and it was obvious that less than half was left.","In total, almost one complete source of life had been used up.","This was only one Life Baptism, and it was not over yet?","“Jian Wushuang, that Jian Wushuang.”Supreme Gu Yi’s eyes shone with a strange light, “Before his Divine Body expanded, I checked carefully and found that there was still a lot of one-fourth of his life source left. But after his Divine Body expanded, not only did he lose one-fourth of his life source, but he also used up more than half of his new life source...”","“I’m sure that all the other little guys combined didn’t even use one-tenth of the life source. But this time, Jian Wushuang must have absorbed almost all of it!”","“No wonder!”","“No wonder his Divine Body has grown so much!”","“He has a Divine Body of nearly 70,000 miles. If he becomes a Supreme-being in the future, who can do anything to him with such a Divine Body?”","Supreme Gu Yi sighed in his heart.","He did not feel sorry for the consumption of the source of life.","After all, the source of life was designed to allow the special creatures under the Life Palace to develop their innate advantages to the best of their abilities. Jian Wushuang, a perfect life with such great potential, was the perfect life form, it was exactly what they wanted to see that they could benefit greatly and transform with the help of the source of life.","“I’m really curious about how much this little guy will change after walking out of the pool of life.” Supreme Gu Yi had a trace of anticipation in his heart. He did not stay in the pool of life anymore, instead, he left directly.","After all, the process of the Divine Body that consumed the source of life the most had already ended. The remaining source of life should be enough for Jian Wushuang and the others to use, so he did not have to worry anymore.","Not long after Supreme Gu Yi left the Life Nirvana Pool, Jian Wushuang had completed the fifth volume of the Life Divine Power. His innate advantage had been further developed.","With this development, Jian Wushuang instantly awakened his innate divine power!"]},{"number":4116,"title":"Chapter 4116 The Baptism Was Over","paragraphs":["4116 The Baptism Was Over","“Hmm, I’ve awakened two innate divine abilities at the same time?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","When he had finished the fifth volume of the life divine ability and his innate advantage was further developed, he had awakened his own innate divine ability, but what he did not expect was that...he had awakened two innate divine powers at the same time.","These two innate divine powers were life deterrence and divine power decomposition.","Jian Wushuang immediately received all the information about these two innate divine powers.","Life deterrence relied on one’s life level to cause a momentary suppression and shock to life below one’s level, causing the opponent to fall into a short period of shock.","Jian Wushuang was not unfamiliar with this innate skill.","Back when he was still weak, he had received the heaven-cleaving skill from his Ruler Xuan Yi. The heaven-cleaving skill could also exert a part of his innate advantage, and at the same time, it could also cause a shock to the opponent’s life level, the effect was just average.","However, now that his innate skill had been awakened, no matter who he met in the future, as long as the opponent’s life level was lower than his, his innate skill would instantly cause a shock to life even to an expert at the Supreme level, the only difference was the strength of the effect.","This move could undoubtedly be his trump card in the future.","As for the second innate divine power, divine power decomposition, it was an innate divine power used for life-saving purposes. It was also very impressive.","“I actually awakened two innate divine powers at the same time. Moreover, I was previously recognized by the universal principles, which also granted me an innate divine power in the original universe. In other words, I now have three innate divine powers at the same time?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Innate divine abilities alone could not be awakened by ordinary people or living beings.","Under normal circumstances, living beings above the creation level would only have a certain chance to awaken their innate divine abilities after they had developed 70% to 80% of their innate advantage. However, the probability was not high.","And even if they had awakened their innate divine abilities, it was only one type.","But now, Jian Wushuang had awakened two innate divine abilities at the same time. With the help of the universal principle, he had a total of three innate divine abilities. He was simply a freak.","“Although I don’t know what’s going on, the more innate divine abilities I awaken, the better it will be for me.” Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised. Then, he closed his eyes again.","His Divine Body and divine power were still transforming in his body.","Outside the Life Nirvana Pool, in the vast open space.","Ruler Blood Wave was still waiting there quietly.","Whoosh!","Supreme Gu Yi walked out of the Life Nirvana Pool and came to Ruler Blood Wave’s side.","“Gu Yi, how is it?” Blood Wave asked.","“Monster, Ruler Blood Wave, the little guy called Jian Wushuang that you brought is a monster.” Supreme Gu Yi sighed.","“Oh?” Blood Wave raised his eyebrows. “What do you mean?”","“He didn’t stay in the pool for long, but he had already developed more than 70% of his innate advantage. He had a chance to expand his Divine Body, but he suddenly expanded his Divine Body to nearly 70,000 miles high. Not only did he use up the remaining one-quarter of the source of life in the pool, but he also used up more than half of the source of life that I just put in. In other words, he absorbed almost a complete source of life when his Divine Body expanded. It’s incredible.” Gu Yi was shocked.","“Close to seventy thousand miles of Divine Body? He absorbed close to a complete source of life?” Blood Wave’s eyes lit up. “Haha, looks like this little guy’s gains in the Life Nirvana Pool are not small. A Divine Body that is close to seventy thousand miles tall, tsk tsk, is much bigger than Flame Mountain.”","“That’s right, I don’t know if he has awakened his innate ability. If he awakens his innate ability, then his gains this time will be really big.” Gu Yi said.","“This is purely dependent on luck. After all, even if he is at the perfect life level and has already developed his innate advantage to over seventy percent, it is still hard to say if he can awaken his innate ability.” Blood Wave smiled.","“The awakening of an innate ability was indeed purely dependent on luck.","“If you were lucky, you could awaken it, but if you were unlucky, it would be useless even if you had developed your innate advantage to ninety percent.","“Of course, if you could perfectly develop your innate advantages, you could definitely awaken your innate abilities.","“Just wait. When this little guy comes out of the Life Nirvana Pool, we will ask him.” Blood Wave smiled and continued to wait.","Time passed. In the blink of an eye, more than half a month had passed.","In the Life Nirvana Pool, many people had stopped the transformation of their divine bodies and divine powers. They also came out of the Life Nirvana Pool one after another.","In this half a month’s time, these special life forms who entered the Life Nirvana Pool had more or less gained a lot. Their innate advantages were generally exploited to more than 60%.","After all, those with a lower life level could easily exploit their innate advantages. With the life divine ability and the Life Nirvana Pool, they could easily exploit their innate advantages to 60-70%, even if they could develop it to 80-90%, it would still be very easy.","Unfortunately, although some of these people had developed their innate advantage to 80-90%, because their life level was too low, they did not have the chance to grow their divine bodies. Similarly, they did not have the chance to awaken their innate ability.","As for the few destiny level creatures that entered the Life Nirvana Pool this time, only one of them was lucky enough to develop his innate advantage to 70%. He also had the chance to grow his Divine Body, unfortunately, his Divine Body only grew to 3000 feet before it stopped.","A 3000-foot-tall Divine Body was considered huge compared to ordinary cultivators. However, compared to Jian Wushuang and Flame Mountain, he was just a little guy. Moreover, he had not awakened his innate divine power.","Another five days passed. Almost all the special beings who entered the pool had come out. The only one who had not come out was Jian Wushuang.","“Only the little guy is left,” Supreme Gu Yi said.","“After all, the little guy is at the perfect life level, so it’s normal for his Divine Body to transform for a long time. However, since the others have already come out of the pool, his Divine Body transformation should have ended by now,” Blood Wave said.","“Let’s wait a little longer,” Supreme Gu Yi said.","After waiting for another three days, there was finally some movement in the space passage ahead.","Whoosh!","With a flash of light, Jian Wushuang walked out of the space passage.","“Huh?”","After walking out of the space passage, Jian Wushuang immediately saw the people in the open space in front of him.","Not only were there two Supreme beings like Blood Wave and Gu Yi, but also the many special beings who had entered the Life Nirvana Pool with him were also waiting quietly."]},{"number":4117,"title":"Chapter 4117 Strength of Divine Power","paragraphs":["4117 Strength of Divine Power","When they were in the Life Nirvana Pool, they had seen Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body grow to a height of nearly 70,000 miles with their own eyes. They were extremely shocked. They could have left directly after coming out of the pool, however, none of them left. They chose to wait here to see how much Jian Wushuang, the perfect life, had benefited from the Life Nirvana Pool.","“Jian Wushuang, come here quickly.” Ruler Blood Wave waved at Jian Wushuang.","“Senior Blood Wave, Supreme Gu Yi.” Jian Wushuang immediately stepped forward and bowed respectfully.","“I heard from Gu that you’ve gained a lot in the Life Nirvana Pool. Your Divine Body alone has grown to 70,000 miles tall?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Less than 70,000 miles, only about 68,000 miles,” Jian Wushuang replied.","“That’s impressive.” Ruler Blood Wave smiled, but then he asked seriously, “Little guy, let me ask you, have you awakened your innate divine power in the Life Nirvana Pool?”","Beside him, Ruler Gu Yi looked at Jian Wushuang with anticipation.","As for the special creatures around them, they were also looking at him with eager eyes.","Upon hearing Ruler Blood Wave’s question, Jian Wushuang did not answer. He just smiled meaningfully and blinked at the same time.","Ruler Blood Wave immediately understood.","“Haha!” Ruler Blood Wave laughed.","Supreme Gu Yi, who was beside him, also smiled. “Indeed, he has awakened his innate divine ability. I’m really envious of him.”","Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Gu Yi only knew that Jian Wushuang had awakened his innate divine ability. They subconsciously thought that Jian Wushuang had only awakened one, but in fact, Jian Wushuang had awakened two innate divine abilities at the same time, of course, since Ruler Blood Wave did not ask, Jian Wushuang would not take the initiative to talk about it.","“Your Divine Body has skyrocketed to 68,000 years, and your innate divine power has also been awakened. The only problem now is how much of your innate advantage you have developed and how much of your divine power has changed,” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“How much of your divine power has changed?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Under normal circumstances, the strength of a special life-form’s divine power will increase greatly with the development of its innate advantage. This increase is related to the level of life-form and the degree of its innate advantage. For example, an ordinary initial stage life-form’s divine power will be 100 times stronger than an ordinary cultivator’s once it has developed its innate advantage to the extreme,” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“100 times?” Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat.","The strength of divine power was 100 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator?","Take an ordinary Ruler for example. An ordinary cultivator’s divine power was, of course, the strength of an ordinary Ruler, but the strength of a special life form at the same level was 100 times stronger than that of an ordinary Ruler! And this was only an initial level life form?","“What about higher universe-level and creation-level life forms?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Universe-level life forms can have divine power 500 times stronger than ordinary cultivators when their innate advantages are fully developed, while creation-level life forms can have divine power about 2,000 times stronger than ordinary cultivators when their innate advantages are fully developed!” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“2,000 times?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“This is a creation-level life-form, and perfect-level life-forms that are above creation-level life-forms are rare in the entire universe. It’s extremely difficult to form such a life-form, and their innate advantage is much greater than that of a creation-level life-form. Under normal circumstances, if perfect-level life-forms develop their innate advantage to the extreme, their divine power will be 10,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator! 10,000 times!” Ruler Blood Wave said.","Jian Wushuang was a little confused.","10,000 times?","What did that mean?","“Of course, as a perfect level life form, it’s very difficult to develop one’s innate advantage to the extreme. It’s also very difficult for one’s natural divine power to be 10,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. However, even if one only develops 60% to 70% of one’s innate advantage, the strength of one’s divine power is still 6,000 times or 7,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. It’s still very heaven-defying,” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“Little guy, you have a chance to expand your Divine Body in the Life Nirvana Pool, and you can also awaken your innate divine power. That means you have developed at least 70% of your innate advantage, maybe even more. However, we still have to make a judgment based on the strength of your divine power.”","“How do I test the strength of your Divine Power?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“That’s easy. There’s a place in my Life Palace that tests the strength of your divine power. It can accurately test how much stronger your divine power is compared to other cultivators of the same level. I’ll take you there,” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Come with me.” Ruler Blood Wave led Jian Wushuang to the void nearby.","As for Ruler Gu Yi, he did not follow them. Instead, he looked around at the people around him and said in a deep voice, “Well, the baptism of life is over. You can all go back now.”","With that, Ruler Gu Yi turned and left.","On the open ground, those who had walked out of the Life Nirvana Pool looked at each other with complicated expressions.","“That Jian Wushuang is a perfect life. Not only did he receive a great increase in his Divine Body, but he also awakened his innate divine power. He is really lucky.”","“Indeed, his luck is too good.”","“His huge Divine Body is already heaven-defying. Moreover, he has awakened his innate divine power. This Jian Wushuang really has unlimited potential!”","“He has developed at least 70% of his innate advantages, which means that his divine power is at least 7,000 times stronger than ordinary cultivators. In the future, he will have a huge advantage in the universe. If he can break through to the Supreme-being level one day, he will probably reach the Supreme-being level.”","The people present sighed in admiration.","The baptism had shown them how powerful Jian Wushuang was. At the same time, they also understood how much potential he had in the future.","They had no desire to compete with such a monster. Unless they could break through to the Supreme realm in the future, they would have to look up to him.","While Ruler Blood Wave was taking Jian Wushuang to test his divine power, in the exquisite pavilion complex in the sixth mountain range, the white-haired young man stood in front of the white-haired young man.","“Ruler, the news from the Life Nirvana Pool has arrived.” Yi Nu, the black-clothed elder, stood respectfully in front of the white-haired youth.","“What’s the result?” The white-haired youth asked casually.","“Jian Wushuang has at least developed 70% of his innate advantage in the Life Nirvana Pool, and his Divine Body has soared to a height of 68,000 miles. In addition, he has also awakened his innate divine power,” Yi Nu said solemnly."]},{"number":4118,"title":"Chapter 4118 Danger","paragraphs":["4118 Danger","The white-haired youth, who was originally very casual, immediately changed his expression when he heard the words of the black-robed elder Yi Nu.","“68,000 miles of Divine Body? How is this possible?” The white-haired youth’s face was filled with disbelief.","One had to know that when he first entered the Life Nirvana Pool, he also received the opportunity for his Divine Body to expand explosively. At that time, his Divine Body had expanded to a height of 9,000 miles. This was already terrifying enough.","After all, Flame Mountain’s huge Divine Body, which was 6,000 miles long, had already attracted the envy of countless cultivators and special beings.","His 9,000-mile-tall Divine Body was even bigger than Flame Mountain’s, which was already very shocking.","However, compared to his 68,000-mile-tall Divine Body, his 9,000-mile-tall Divine Body was completely different.","“How is this possible? How could Jian Wushuang have such an incredible Divine Body?” The white-haired youth was extremely shocked.","“Although it’s incredible, many people have witnessed the process of Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body growing rapidly in the Life Nirvana Pool. It Can’t be faked. His Divine Body is indeed 68,000 miles tall. Moreover, he has also awakened his own innate divine power. This has made Ruler Blood Wave, who had been optimistic about him, even more fond of him.”","“Now, Ruler Blood Wave has personally brought Jian Wushuang to test the strength of his divine power. Ruler, the result of your Divine Power Test was 7,600 times that of an ordinary cultivator. It’s very heaven-defying. However, based on Jian Wushuang’s performance in the Life Nirvana Pool, it’s possible that his innate advantage will be further developed.”","“If Jian Wushuang’s divine power is stronger than yours, then Jian Wushuang’s basic potential will completely surpass yours. In the future, Ruler’s position in the Life Palace will also be greatly reduced,” Yi Nu said solemnly.","Hearing Yi Nu’s words, the white-haired youth’s face turned completely gloomy.","He was a perfect life form that was rare in the entire universe. He had grown up from the beginning of cultivation and was extremely talented and dazzling. As soon as he broke through to become a principle Ruler, he was taken to the Life Palace, after he arrived at the Life Palace, he was also valued and looked forward to by many higher-ups.","He had been far too dazzling, and his journey had been far too smooth. This had caused him to feel incomparably arrogant and even a bit conceited.","There were countless special lifeforms in the Life Palace, but not many of them were worthy of his attention.","However, perhaps it was because his path of growth had been far too smooth that when he reached the level of an omega Ruler, he had encountered his greatest bottleneck.","He had tried all sorts of methods and methods to reach the Omega Ruler level. He had tried everything he could, but he had been unable to break through to become an Ruler.","He was not the only one. The Life Palace had worked very hard to help him break through. They had given him all sorts of resources and treasures for free, in fact, the Life Palace had even sent the two perfect Rulers over to give him some personal guidance, all in the hopes that he would break through to become an Ruler as soon as possible.","However, despite the countless resources and treasures he had accumulated, he still showed no signs of breaking through at all.","Dozens of chaos cycles had passed, and he was still an omega Ruler. There was not even a hint of hope for him to make a breakthrough.","Because of this, the higher-ups of the Life Palace no longer held much hope for him to make a breakthrough. The Rulers who had been looking forward to his breakthrough had long since grown disappointed in him.","His status within the Life Palace was no longer as high as it had been before.","However, in the past, he had been the only perfect being amongst the Rulers of the Life Palace. Even if his chances of breaking through to become an Ruler in the future were slim, his status would not be any lower than before.","Over the years, the white-haired youth’s strength had not improved much, but the life sacred palace had always given him the resources he deserved.","The white-haired youth was unwilling to accept this situation, but he could still accept it.","But now, with Jian Wushuang’s arrival, everything was different.","Previously, he was the only perfect life-form in the Ruler-level of the Life Sacred Palace. For this reason, he was treated well.","However, now that Jian Wushuang had arrived, the white-haired young man was no longer the only one. Many of the higher-ups of the Life Palace were completely attracted to Jian Wushuang.","This made the white-haired young man feel a great crisis in his heart.","“I have already been disliked by the higher-ups in the Life Palace, and now Jian Wushuang has appeared. If the higher-ups of the Life Palace think that Jian Wushuang’s potential is much greater than mine, they will do their best to cultivate Jian Wushuang. I’m afraid that even the treatment that originally belonged to me will be omitted, not to mention fighting for more resources.” The white-haired young man clenched his hands, his eyes were extremely cold.","His Divine Body was 68,000 miles tall, and he had awakened his own innate divine power. If his divine power was stronger than his, then Jian Wushuang would be above him in all aspects.","The senior officials of the Life Palace would certainly not focus on him, a perfect life with little hope of making a breakthrough. Instead, they would focus all their attention on Jian Wushuang.","At that time, he would never be treated like this in the Life Palace. At most, he would be treated like a creation level life form, which was unacceptable to the white-haired young man.","“No matter what, I can’t lose what belongs to me. Jian Wushuang, you’re just a new kid. You want to challenge my status and treatment? Dream on!”","“I’ll prove it to those old guys. I’ll let them know that Jian Wushuang is just a kid. I’m the one who has the best chance of becoming the next Supreme-level perfect life-form in the Life Palace!”","The white-haired young man’s eyes shone with a fierce light.","“Yi Nu, let’s go and find him!”","The white-haired young man took Yi Nu, the black-clothed elder, and flew directly toward the place where Jian Wushuang was testing his divine power.","...","Jian Wushuang was led by Ruler Blood Wave to a temple.","The inside of the temple was actually a huge independent space. The entire independent space was a martial arts practice field, where there were all kinds of tools for cultivation.","In one corner of the martial arts practice field, there was a special magic array with puppet fighters standing inside.","Ruler Blood Wave brought Jian Wushuang to the magic array."]},{"number":4119,"title":"Chapter 4119 Divine Power Test","paragraphs":["4119 Divine Power Test","“Is this magic formation used to test the strength of divine power?”Jian Wushuang looked at the magic formation and asked, “Senior Blood Wave, what should I do?”","“It’s very simple. After you enter the magic formation, don’t use any secret skills. Just rely on your own divine power and fight with the puppet fighters in the magic formation. The magic formation can naturally determine the strength of your divine power,” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“Understood.” Jian Wushuang nodded and stepped into the formation without hesitation.","Inside the formation, Jian Wushuang did not use any secret skills or even the principles of the universe. He quickly fought with the puppet fighters with his own brute strength.","It was a fight, but in fact, it was just a simple collision with the puppet fighters. After only a few collisions, the puppet fighters stopped.","Jian Wushuang also walked out of the formation.","“Is it over?” Jian Wushuang looked a little strange.","“It’s done. As for the result, look here.” Ruler Blood Wave pointed at a transparent crystal standing next to the formation.","Although the transparent crystal was next to the formation, Jian Wushuang could clearly sense that it was the core of the formation.","“There are scales on this crystal. In a while, you will see the scales and colors on this crystal. A golden scale represents 1,000 times divine power, a silver scale represents 100 times divine power, and the lowest white scale represents 10 times divine power. You are a third-level Ruler, and the strength of your divine power will be many times stronger than an ordinary third-level Ruler. It will soon appear on the scale of this crystal,” said Ruler Blood Wave.","Jian Wushuang watched with anticipation.","“Don’t be so nervous. Since you’ve awakened your innate ability, you must have developed more than 70% of your innate advantage. In other words, your basic divine power is at least 7,000 times that of an ordinary cultivator. If I’m not mistaken, there will be at least seven golden scales on the transparent crystal later,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a smile.","“I know, but I have a feeling that my basic divine power is more than 7,000 times that of an ordinary cultivator,” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","“More than 7,000 times?” Ruler Blood Wave’s expression changed, and then he smiled and said, “Can it be 8,000 times?”","“Maybe more,” Jian Wushuang said again.","“Oh?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise, but he found that Jian Wushuang’s eyes were burning with excitement.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was indeed very excited.","The Life Baptism in the Life Nirvana Pool had greatly transformed his body, and the strength of his divine power was much stronger than before.","Now, he only felt that his entire body was filled with power. Jian Wushuang did not know how strong this power was.","But he felt that his current basic divine power should be more than 7,000 times that of an ordinary cultivator.","It was even more than that...","“It’s coming,” Blood Wave suddenly said.","Jian Wushuang immediately went too far.","Sure enough, a light began to shine on the transparent crystal.","And the first light that lit up was the golden light that represented 1,000 times divine power.","The dazzling golden light filled the entire transparent crystal and instantly occupied the first few scales of the transparent crystal.","In just an instant, the five scales were filled with a rich golden light.","This meant that Jian Wushuang’s basic divine power was already 5,000 times that of an ordinary cultivator.","But this was obviously just the beginning. The golden light continued to spread, and then it occupied the sixth and seventh scales, and then it completely occupied the Eighth.","“It’s 8,000 times.” Ruler Blood Wave’s eyes focused. “But the golden light continues to extend. Well, it’s 9,000 times, and it hasn’t stopped!”","“Could it be...” Ruler Blood Wave suddenly thought of something, and a look of shock appeared on his face.","As expected, after the golden light filled up the ninth tick on the translucent crystal, it immediately filled up the tenth tick. A short moment later, it filled up the tenth tick as well.","The first ten tick on the translucent crystal were completely filled up by the dazzling golden light.","“10,000 times!”","“10,000 times what? To fully develop the innate advantage?”","Ruler Blood Wave was shocked.","He had told Jian Wushuang before that it was too difficult for special creatures to perfectly develop their innate advantage.","Since the creation of the Life Palace, there had only been less than 10 people, and most of them had lower life levels, so it was easier to develop them.","As for the perfect life level, it had never been fully exploited since the creation of the Life Palace.","Because of this, Ruler Blood Wave had told Jian Wushuang not to expect him to exploit his innate advantage perfectly, but in the end...","The scene before him was a slap to Ruler Blood Wave’s face.","It was equivalent to a divine power foundation 10,000 times that of an ordinary cultivator. Was this not something that could only be achieved by a perfect life form that had developed its innate superiority to the extreme?","“No, that’s not right!”","Ruler Blood Wave’s body shook violently, and his eyes were fixed on the transparent crystal in front of him.","When he saw that the first ten scales of the transparent crystal were filled with golden light and that the golden light continued to spread toward the eleventh scale, even with Ruler Blood Wave’s knowledge, he could not help but widen his eyes at this moment, an extremely exaggerated expression appeared on his face.","“Impossible!”","Ruler Blood Wave stared at the transparent crystal in front of him. He could already see that the eleventh scale on the transparent crystal had also been filled with dazzling golden light.","However, this was not the end. The golden light continued to spread out, and in the blink of an eye, the twelfth and thirteenth scale had been filled.","After the thirteenth scale was completely filled up, the rich golden light began to slowly calm down. But even though the golden light had calmed down, a rich silver light immediately rose up.","The silver light represented a hundred times divine power.","The silver light rose crazily, and in the blink of an eye, it filled up five scale points in succession, and then immediately dimmed.","At this point, the crystal finally calmed down and no other light appeared.","Ruler Blood Wave and Jian Wushuang stared at the scales filled with light on the crystal.","13 scales filled with golden light.","Five scales filled with silver light.","The golden light represented 1,000 times divine power, and 13 represented 13,000 times.","Together with the five silver scales representing 100 times divine power, Jian Wushuang’s basic divine power was 13,500 times that of an ordinary cultivator!","It was an exaggerated number that even exceeded Ruler Blood Wave’s imagination.","Judging from Ruler Blood Wave’s expression, he was obviously stunned."]},{"number":4120,"title":"Chapter 4120 13,500 Times","paragraphs":["4120 13,500 Times","“13,500 times?”","“How is this possible?”","Even Ruler Blood Wave, who was a superior Supreme-being, could not help but feel a surge of emotions when he saw the scale displayed on the crystal.","13,500 times of basic divine power was completely impossible in Ruler Blood Wave’s eyes.","After all, even a perfect life-form’s divine power was only 10,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. Jian Wushuang’s divine power was obviously stronger than that.","“Jian Wushuang, let me ask you, when you fought those puppet fighters in the Magic Formation, did you really not use any other tricks?” Ruler Blood Wave stared at Jian Wushuang with a burning gaze.","“I fought with them with my own divine power according to your instructions, Senior Blood Wave,” Jian Wushuang said.","Ruler Blood Wave nodded. In fact, he knew that if Jian Wushuang had used some secret skills or other means to increase the strength of his divine power in the magic formation, the test result would not be shown on the crystal.","Since the test result was shown, it was Jian Wushuang’s normal divine power strength.","However, it was 13,500 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. Even Ruler Blood Wave had never heard of it.","“Impossible. Even if it’s the most extreme development of a perfect life, the strength of divine power should only be 10,000 times stronger?” Ruler Blood Wave frowned, but at this moment, he suddenly remembered, he had just arrived at the Life Palace and carried out the life-level test in the Purple Temple.","During the life-level test, Jian Wushuang had not only triggered a sky full of red light, but there was also a burst of dazzling golden light behind the red light.","The sudden golden light confused everyone. Even Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe did not know what was going on with the Golden Light.","However, they did not delve into the issue. They only thought that there had been some changes in the life-level test. Now that Jian Wushuang had undergone the divine power strength test...when they thought of the golden light that burst out from the life-level test, Ruler Blood Wave’s expression immediately became solemn.","“When it comes to the life test, I’ve never heard of anyone testing out a large amount of golden light. I’ve also never heard of anyone testing out the strength of his divine power, which is more than 10,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator.”","“But both of those things happened to the same person. Could it be...?”","Ruler Blood Wave’s eyes were filled with a hint of shock. He had already come up with a possibility.","However, this possibility caused his hair to stand on end.","The most heaven-defying life-forms in the vast universe were those at the perfect level.","The birth of a perfect life-form was extremely difficult. Not even the entire vast universe or an entire era would be able to produce a perfect life-form.","After a long period of time, a perfect life-form was recognized as the pinnacle of life-forms.","However, was a perfect life-form really the pinnacle of life-forms in the Universe?","In the past, Ruler Blood Wave would have answered yes to this question, but now, he did not dare to think so.","After all, in his eyes, Jian Wushuang had completely exceeded the scope of a perfect life-form.","Perhaps Jian Wushuang was still a perfect life, but it was definitely different from the perfect life he had encountered before.","“Jian Wushuang.” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang again with a solemn expression, “Listen carefully. What happened here today, including the specific strength of your life, must not be known by anyone else, including your wife. Do you understand?”","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He could see how serious Ruler Blood Wave was. He could also guess that in the vast universe, it had always been recognized that even if one was at the perfect level of life, one could develop one’s innate advantage to the extreme, the strength of his divine power was only 10,000 times that of an ordinary cultivator, but he had reached 13,500 times. This was clearly beyond the scope of a perfect life.","If this matter were to spread, he did not know how big of a storm it would cause in the universe. However, in the Life Palace, there would definitely be a huge commotion. Although he was highly regarded by Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe, his own strength was too weak. He might not be able to withstand a storm.","“Oh, Senior Blood Wave, there’s something,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","“What is it?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at him.","“Although the strength of my divine power is 13,500 times stronger than that of an ordinary perfect life, I still feel that I haven’t reached the limit of my innate advantage. In fact, I’m still far from it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","The strength of his divine power was 13,500 times stronger than before, but Jian Wushuang’s innate advantage had not been fully developed yet?","In other words, there was a possibility that he could develop his divine power again.","“Are you sure?” Ruler Blood Wave asked seriously.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “I can feel that there are still a lot of hidden powers in my body that I haven’t used yet. Moreover, I’ve only cultivated to the fifth volume of the six volumes of life divine power. I feel that as long as I Ruler the sixth volume, my innate advantage will be further developed. Of course, after I Ruler the sixth volume, I’m also not sure if my innate advantage will be developed to the extreme.”","“It seems your level of life really isn’t as simple as an ordinary perfect life-form,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a sigh. He had long ago been shaken to the core, but he was still a Supreme Ruler after all, he quickly calmed down.","“You’ve already experienced the baptism of the pool of life. There’s no point in going in for a second baptism. In the future, if you wish to continue developing your innate advantages, you’ll have to either Ruler the sixth volume of the life divine ability or acquire some heaven-defying true treasures to further develop them.”","“However, no matter how well you develop your innate advantage, I will only announce to the public that you have developed 80% of your innate advantage and your divine power is only about 8,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. As for how you will hide this secret from now on, it’s up to you,” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He knew that this matter was extraordinary, so he had decided that from now on, he would only use about 8,000 times the divine power of an ordinary cultivator in a battle unless it was a life-or-death situation.","..."]},{"number":4121,"title":"Chapter 4121 Ninth Kalpa King","paragraphs":["4121 Ninth Kalpa King","In fact, the divine power of an ordinary cultivator was 8,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator.","For Jian Wushuang, he was a third-level Ruler, and his divine power was 8,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. This made him stronger than most fifth-level Rulers, if he used the power of the will given by the universal principle, his divine power would be ten times stronger...this made Jian Wushuang’s divine power comparable to that of an Ultimate Ruler.","It was incredible that a third-level Ruler’s divine power was comparable to that of an Ultimate Ruler!","If Jian Wushuang used all his strength, his divine power would be 13,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary Ultimate Ruler with the power of the will given by the universal principle, only an Ultimate Ruler at the top level would be stronger than him in terms of divine power.","“8,000 times stronger is enough,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Your life level is very special. I don’t know the specific reason. If I have the chance to meet the Palace Master alone, I will ask him for you,” Blood Wave said.","“Palace Master?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. He knew that Blood Wave was referring to the Palace Master of the Life Palace.","The Palace Master had created the Life Palace and allowed the Life Palace to dominate the universe for so many years. He had given the universe countless special life forms a place to live. Jian Wushuang admired such a super existence.","There was no doubt that the Palace Master’s strength was also earth-shattering and enough to intimidate the vast universe.","“The Palace Master is a super existence standing at the top of the universe. In terms of status, he is on par with the temple Ruler of the Universe Temple, the Pavilion Ruler of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, and other super existences. Moreover, the Palace Master is not only terrifyingly strong, but he is also a special life form. He knows a lot. Perhaps he will know why your divine power is 13,500 times stronger,” Blood Wave said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","At this moment...","“Someone is coming.” Blood Wave suddenly narrowed his eyes and waved his hand. The light and the scale value emitted by the transparent crystal in front of him instantly disappeared.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the void in front of him. There were two figures rushing toward them.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","Two figures appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and Ruler Blood Wave one after the other.","“Greetings, Ruler Blood Wave.” The white-haired youth in the lead bowed humbly to Ruler Blood Wave.","The black-haired elder behind the white-haired youth also bowed respectfully.","“Nine tribulations?” Ruler Blood Wave’s gaze was calm as he glanced at the white-haired youth. “What brings you here?”","“Supreme, I heard that there was a very heaven-defying perfect life in the palace. In the Life Nirvana Pool just now, his divine power soared to 68,000 miles high. I thought it was incredible, so I came here to get to know him. If I’m not wrong, Ruler Blood Wave, the person next to you should be Jian Wushuang?” The white-haired youth’s gaze was fixed on Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang also looked at the white-haired youth, and their eyes met.","Jian Wushuang’s face was calm, but his heart sank.","His simple eyes met, but he saw a trace of hostility in the depths of the white-haired youth’s eyes.","Although the hostility was hidden, Jian Wushuang still sensed it.","Obviously, it was not friendly.","“Ninth disaster, are you really here to meet Jian Wushuang?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at the white-haired youth with interest, then he sneered and said, “In my opinion, you think that Jian Wushuang has too much potential and is too dazzling. You are worried that his appearance will make you lose your precarious position and treatment in the palace, right?”","The smile on the white-haired youth’s face suddenly froze.","He was indeed worried about his position and treatment because Jian Wushuang had made him feel a great sense of crisis. Although he thought so in his heart, he still looked extremely humble and amiable on the surface, however, he did not expect that Ruler Blood Wave would expose this matter right away.","“Status and treatment?” Jian Wushuang frowned and was puzzled.","At this moment, Ruler Blood Wave said with a chuckle, “Jian Wushuang, the person in front of you is Ninth Kalpa King. Before you, he was the only perfect life-form who was at the Overlord level in the Life Palace. Moreover, he has been at the Overlord level for a very long time. Our Life Palace has thought of a lot of ways to help him. We have spent a lot of resources and costs, but he hasn’t made a breakthrough yet. Many high-level officials in the Life Palace have given up on him...”","Ruler Blood Wave did not finish his words, but Jian Wushuang had already understood everything.","“The perfect life that the senior officials of the Life Palace had almost given up...his status in the Life Palace is probably not as high as before. Now that I, a perfect life form at the same level as a Ruler, have appeared, Ninth Kalpa King will naturally regard me as a threat and think that I will cause a great impact on his status and treatment. That’s why he is hostile to me.” Jian Wushuang understood.","To put it bluntly, it was a competition between status and treatment.","If he had not appeared, the Ninth Kalpa King would not have been able to break through to the Supreme-being level. However, he was the only Supreme-being in the Life Palace, so his status and treatment would not have been too bad.","However, now that he had appeared, the Ninth Kalpa King was no longer the only one. His status and treatment would naturally be greatly affected.","It was normal for Ninth Kalpa King to be hostile toward him, but Jian Wushuang could not be blamed for this. He could only blame himself for not being able to break through to the Supreme-being level.","Although he had already been named by Ruler Blood Wave, Jian Wushuang was very clear about his background, however, Ninth Kalpa King still smiled and said, “Ruler Blood Wave, you’ve misunderstood. There’s a new perfect life in the Life Palace, and it has such great potential. I’m very happy, so I won’t be afraid of it.”","“Then why are you here now?” Ruler Blood Wave asked casually.","“I’m really here to get to know Jian Wushuang. Besides, it’s rare to see a perfect life, and it happens to be at the Overlord level. If I have the chance, I’d like to go to the trial field with him.” Ninth Kalpa King said with a smile.","“Trial field?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“Of course.” Ruler Blood Wave was not surprised at all, he explained, “Jian Wushuang, the trial field is a special space in the Life Palace. It’s used by the cultivators in the Life Palace to fight. Unlike ordinary arenas, the two sides in the trial field fight each other with their own divine bodies, so there’s no need to worry about their divine bodies being damaged.”"]},{"number":4122,"title":"Chapter 4122 Accepting the Challenge","paragraphs":["4122 Accepting the Challenge","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang immediately understood, “This Ninth Kalpa King said that he wanted to communicate with me in the trial field, but in fact, he wanted to fight me directly. As for his purpose...I guess he wanted to prove himself to the senior officials of the Life Palace.”","“You’re right.” Ruler Blood Wave looked over. “As far as I know, nine disaster emperor hasn’t broken through to become an Ruler in the past few years, but thanks to the accumulation of all sorts of precious resources and treasures, he has made tremendous progress. His comprehension of the principles of the universe alone has reached a very high level. If we were to judge him by the generally accepted principles of the universe, he would have long ago reached the level of power needed to break through to the fourth level of the sea of principles.”","“In addition, he is a perfect life form and has developed 70% of his innate advantage. His divine power is 7,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. All these factors add up to make his strength among the Rulers heaven-defying!”","“Although it’s rare to see someone who can rival an Ruler at the Ruler level in the universe, I estimate that if the Ninth Kalpa King really fights recklessly, his battle strength should not be much weaker than that of the most ordinary Rulers.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","A Ruler who could rival an Ruler...","This was indeed incredible in the universe.","Jian Wushuang had heard from Ruler Heart Slayer that an Ultimate Ruler could rival an Ruler. He had barely met one in 10,000 chaos cycles. He was definitely the most incredible genius in the universe.","Jian Wushuang had fought with an Ruler before and knew that there was an insurmountable gap between an Ruler and an Ultimate Ruler. Therefore, he had agreed with what Ruler Heart Slayer had said.","Back then, he had thought that he would be able to rival an Ruler if he became an Ultimate Ruler. At that time, he had thought that it was inconceivable.","However, now that he had come to the Life Palace and undergone the Life Baptism, he no longer felt that way.","After all, his divine power was now 13,500 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator!","Compared to an Ultimate Ruler, an Ruler’s divine power was probably only about 10,000 times stronger than Brother Qiang’s. It was probably less than 13,500 times stronger.","Once he broke through to the Omega Ruler level, he would be able to rely on his life force to ensure that his divine power would not be any weaker than any other Ruler’s. Only his divine power would not be any weaker, naturally, he would be able to easily rival an Ruler.","As for the Ninth Kalpa King, he was also a perfect lifeform. Although his divine power was only 7,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator, he had long since broken through to become an Omega Ruler, furthermore, the Life Palace had spent so many resources and treasures on him, so his divine power was naturally extremely powerful. Coupled with his comprehension of the universe principles at the fourth level of the principle sea, it was not impossible for him to rival an Ruler.","“Because of you, the Ninth Kalpa King realized that his status and treatment would be affected, so he can’t wait to fight with you. He wants to prove himself by defeating you. He wants to tell the higher-ups in the palace that at least you’re not as good as him now, so he can keep his position temporarily. With your potential, as long as you have enough time, it should be easy for you to surpass him. He knows that he may not be a match for you in the future, so he’s taking the opportunity to fight with you now,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a smile.","“The Ninth Kalpa King is an Ultimate Ruler, and his combat strength is comparable to that of an Ruler. Why is he fighting me?” Jian Wushuang was amused and annoyed.","After all, he was only a third-level Ruler. Even if his strength had improved after the baptism, he would not be so foolish as to think that he could fight the Ninth Kalpa King now.","“Don’t worry. Since he came to you on his own accord and said that he wanted to talk to you, he won’t bully you. If you agree to fight him, his Divine Body will only remain at the level of a third-level Ruler when we get to the trial field,” said Ruler Blood Wave.","“Oh? The same cultivation?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“It’s just the same cultivation realm. As for other techniques, such as the comprehension of the universe principles, secret skills, and unique skills, including the strength of your divine power and your innate divine abilities as a perfect being, they won’t be restricted. You can use them to your heart’s content,” said Ruler Blood Wave with a smile. “In other words, except for your cultivation realm, nothing else has changed. “Jian Wushuang, you can think about it and see if you want to fight him. If you don’t want to, you can refuse him directly. He can’t force you.”","“Refuse?” Jian Wushuang smiled. “The Ninth Kalpa King came to me of his own accord, and it’s obvious that he wants to use me to prove himself. If I refuse him now, wouldn’t I be admitting that I’m inferior to him?”","“Oh, so you’re going to accept it?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","Jian Wushuang nodded slowly.","Jian Wushuang and Ruler Blood Wave had been talking, and during the conversation, Ruler Blood Wave had blocked the surrounding space and time. Although the Ninth Kalpa King was standing in front of Jian Wushuang, he knew that Jian Wushuang and Ruler Blood Wave were talking, however, he had no idea what Jian Wushuang and Ruler Blood Wave were talking about.","He did not interrupt them. Instead, he calmly waited for Jian Wushuang and Ruler Blood Wave to finish their conversation.","Finally, Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at Ninth Kalpa King again.","“Ninth Kalpa King, are you really looking for me just to talk?” Jian Wushuang looked at Ninth Kalpa King.","“Of course.” Ninth Kalpa King smiled very gently.","“Well, I’ll accept this battle. However, I have just finished my Life Baptism and haven’t fully familiarized myself with the changes in my Divine Body, so you have to give me some time. How about we fight again in ten days?” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“No problem.” Ninth Kalpa King nodded. “Then it’s settled. I’ll wait for you in the trial field in ten days. I hope you won’t make me wait too long.”","“Don’t worry. I’ll definitely be there in ten days.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Ninth Kalpa King’s expression remained calm, but a sharp glint flashed in the depths of his eyes. He still bowed respectfully to Ruler Blood Wave, then turned and left.","After Ninth Kalpa King left...","“Jian Wushuang, it won’t take you as long as ten days to familiarize yourself with the changes in your Divine Body, right?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang with a faint smile.","“I can’t hide it from Senior Blood Wave. To tell you the truth, I’ve gained something else in the Life Nirvana Pool,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","The other things he had gained were the two innate divine abilities he had awakened.","He had not studied the two innate divine abilities properly, so it would take some time.","“Besides, since I’m going to fight the Ninth Kalpa King, I have to know myself and the enemy. But I don’t know anything about the Ninth Kalpa King other than what you just told me,” Jian Wushuang looked at Ruler Blood Wave.","“That’s easy. I’ll have someone send you the details of the Ninth Kalpa King right away,” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“Thank you, Senior Blood Wave.” Jian Wushuang was delighted.","..."]},{"number":4123,"title":"Chapter 4123 In Front of the Trial Field","paragraphs":["4123 In Front of the Trial Field","Ten days passed in the blink of an eye.","In an attic in the sixth mountain range, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes. A magnificent pressure exploded with him at the center, and then immediately withdrew into his body.","“After ten days, I can finally control the divine power in my body.” Jian Wushuang smiled. After the baptism of the Life Nirvana Pool, not only had his Divine Body increased by 68,000 miles, but his divine power was also much stronger, even he was unable to control his divine power in the first place.","It took him ten days to perfectly control the strength of his divine power and suppress it to about 8,000 times.","“The harvest from this trip to the Life Nirvana Pool is too great. My strength is much stronger than before.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself with a hint of amazement on his face.","In the past ten days, not only had he completely controlled his skyrocketing strength, but he also knew his two innate divine abilities like the back of his hand, he believed that with these two innate divine abilities, he would be able to protect himself even against a Supreme-being.","Of course, he could only rely on his innate divine abilities to protect himself.","“Now, it’s time to go to the appointment.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed coldly. The Ninth Kalpa King wanted to step on him to prove his strength, which was exactly what he wanted. He could use the Ninth Kalpa King’s hand to see how powerful he was after his baptism, how powerful he was!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang flashed and disappeared into the attic.","“Husband.”","Outside the attic, Leng Rushuang and Ruler Blood Wave were already waiting for him.","“Shuang ‘er.” Jian Wushuang glanced at his wife.","Ten days ago, when he returned, he had already told Leng Rushuang about his appointment with the Ninth Kalpa King.","However, it was only a sparring match in the trial ground, not a life-and-death battle, so Leng Rushuang was naturally not worried.","“Senior Blood Wave.” Jian Wushuang bowed respectfully to Ruler Blood Wave again.","“Ten days have passed. How are your preparations?” Ruler Blood Wave asked with a smile.","“Not bad.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“You should have read the information on Ninth Kalpa King. Are you confident in fighting him?” Ruler Blood Wave asked again.","“According to the information, his strength was almost 20 chaos cycles ago. During these 20 chaos cycles, Ninth Kalpa King barely fought. I don’t know how much his strength has increased during these 20 chaos cycles.”","“If he was 20 chaos cycles ago, I’m 100% sure that I can win against him.”","“But if he makes a big breakthrough in his strength during these 20 chaos cycles, then I’m not absolutely sure that I can win.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“If I’m not sure, then I’m more or less sure that I can win?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","Jian Wushuang smiled slightly.","Indeed, the Ninth Kalpa King might be very strong, but Jian Wushuang was also absolutely confident in his own strength.","In the trial field, both of them maintained the same realm, which was the third-level Ruler realm. In terms of strength, he was definitely stronger than the Ninth Kalpa King.","In terms of comprehending the universal principles, he had long been able to pass the fifth level of the principle sea. Later, he studied the Purple Blood Secret Manual and reached the first level. He was even very close to the sixth level of the principle sea.","At the same time, he also awakened two innate divine abilities. In addition to the original universe given by the universe principles, there were three innate divine abilities.","Moreover, the universe principles also gave him a strong will power.","All these things added together, he really did not believe that anyone in the same level could be his opponent. Even though the Ninth Kalpa King was an Ultimate Ruler, he was not afraid at all.","Even if the Ninth Kalpa King had made a great breakthrough in his strength in the past 20 chaos cycles, Jian Wushuang was still more than 90% confident that he could defeat him in a head-on fight!","“Judging from your smile, it seems that victory is in your hands.” Ruler Blood Wave smiled as well. “Alright, come with me. Don’t let them wait too long.”","“Them?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Haha, the Ninth Kalpa King has already sent people to spread the news of your battle. Now, many people in the Life Palace know that you fought with him on the trial field today. The battle between two perfect lives will naturally attract many people. As far as I know, even many ancient existences in the palace are very concerned about your battle.”","“So, you must perform well in this battle. Don’t let the nine disasters steal the limelight,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a smile.","“I see.” Jian Wushuang understood and then smiled. “Since so many people will pay attention to this battle, I won’t let them down.”","Immediately, Jian Wushuang was led to the trial field by Ruler Blood Wave.","...","An ancient cyan temple stood alone in a corner of the Life Palace.","The Cyan Temple was where the trial field of the Life Palace was located.","The Cyan Temple did not look big on the outside, but in fact, it contained a vast trial space, let alone a Ruler, even two Supreme experts could fight freely in the trial space.","Of course, whether they were Rulers or Supreme experts, they only entered the trial space with their divine bodies condensed by consciousness. As for their original bodies, they remained in the outside world.","At this moment, the green temple was crowded with people. They stood in the void, revealing their auras and discussing in low voices.","“Have you heard? Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body expanded to 68,000 miles in the Nirvana Pool! It’s the record in the history of the Life Palace!”","“Haha, it’s said that he has awakened his innate divine power. Jian Wushuang is indeed very talented. I dare to say that once he breaks through to the Supreme realm, he will become another pillar of the Life Palace.”","“But...","“He is still too immature and arrogant. He actually dared to agree to the challenge of the Ninth Kalpa King. He really doesn’t know himself.”","“Jian Wushuang is indeed reckless.”","Many people shook their heads as they spoke. They sighed at Jian Wushuang’s high talent and expressed their incomprehension and irrationality about the fight between Jian Wushuang and the Ninth Kalpa King.","They did not know much about Jian Wushuang. They only knew that he was a perfect life, that his Divine Body had grown to a height of 68,000 miles in the Life Nirvana Pool, and that he had awakened his talent and supernatural power. However, they did not know anything else.","After all, Jian Wushuang had just entered the depths of the universe and was not well-known in the universe."]},{"number":4124,"title":"Chapter 4124 Jackpot","paragraphs":["4124 Jackpot","Although Jian Wushuang had fought against the Ultimate Ruler in the third level, it was still in the nine luminaries star area, which was almost completely destroyed by the disaster, naturally, no one knew his actual strength.","No one even knew how high his comprehension of the principles of the universe was.","But Ninth Kalpa King was different.","Those who stayed in the Life Palace all year round knew a lot about Ninth Kalpa King’s strength.","Once upon a time, he was publicly acknowledged as the number one genius in the Life Palace. Moreover, he had received countless resources and benefits from the Life Palace at the Ruler level. In the Ultimate Ruler realm, he had already remained there for dozens of chaos cycles. In addition, the power he had displayed during those twenty chaos cycles had already reached a terrifying level. During those twenty chaos cycles, he had rarely fought. His power and his trump cards...he had long ago reached a level where no one could see through him!","No one knew how much power he had reached during those twenty chaos cycles before becoming an Ruler!","It could be said that Ninth Kalpa King was the uncrowned king of the Ruler realm in the vast universe!","He was the number one in the universe!","They could not figure out how Jian Wushuang, who had cultivated for more than 300,000 years, could fight Ninth Kalpa King!","Was it because their realms were similar in the trial field?","Or was it because Jian Wushuang had a huge Divine Body that made his divine power stronger than Ninth Kalpa King’s?","Even so, he was still no match for Ninth Kalpa King, right?","At this moment, Ruler Blood Wave led countless people to the green temple.","“Jian Wushuang, this temple is the location of the trial. Ninth Kalpa doesn’t seem to be here yet. Wait here,” Ruler Blood Wave ordered.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Ruler Blood Wave had already rushed toward the void nearby.","As Jian Wushuang arrived, there was a commotion in the surrounding void.","“Is he Jian Wushuang?”","“Does he look ordinary?”","“As expected, he’s only a third-level Ruler and has been cultivating for less than 300,000 years. Tsk, tsk, he’s too young.”","“To be able to have such achievements after cultivating for 300,000 years is already very heaven-defying.”","Some of the experts who came to watch the battle laughed.","At the same time, in the void on the other side of the Cyan Temple, there were three Supreme-level experts whose aura could suppress the ancients.","“Blood Wave, did Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body expand to 68,000 miles in the Life Nirvana Pool?” An old man with white hair, white eyebrows, and a black robe, who was full of rotten aura, asked indifferently.","“Ruler Gai Fu, this is absolutely true!” Ruler Blood Wave, who was half a body behind the old man, nodded and replied.","“In that case, this is interesting.” The old man raised his eyelids, and his turbid eyes were calm and emotionless.","This man was none other than Gai Fu, the strongest of the five Chief Supremes of the Life Palace!","He had cultivated for so long that it was impossible for him to record it. Even the chief supremacies such as Blood Wave and Giant Axe could only call themselves juniors in front of him.","It could be said that his position in the entire Life Palace was second only to that of the mysterious Palace Master.","This was not the most important thing. The most important thing was that he had brought Ninth Kalpa King to the Life Palace from a remote Star World.","He had not expected that the battle between Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang would draw him out.","“Blood Wave, you shouldn’t have let Jian Wushuang fight. Ninth Kalpa King has cultivated for dozens of chaos cycles, and Jian Wushuang has only cultivated for less than 300,000 years. His foundation is too weak. If Jian Wushuang loses this battle, it may cause some damage to him and hinder his future development,” said Giant Axe, one of the three Supreme figures, he frowned as he spoke.","“Giant Axe, you’ve underestimated this little fellow. When I first brought him here, he was filled with confidence in this battle,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a mysterious smile.","“It’s good to be confident, but blind confidence is arrogance,” Ruler Gai Fu said.","“Although I have high hopes for this little fellow as well, and I believe that when he grows up in the future, he’ll be even more powerful than the Ninth Kalpa King, that’s only after he grows up. As for now...I really don’t know how he’ll be able to defeat the Ninth Kalpa King after just 300,000 years of training,” Supreme Giant Axe said, shaking his head.","“Haha, let’s wait and see.” Blood Wave smiled and said nothing more.","Time passed slowly. Not long after Jian Wushuang arrived at the arena, the white-haired young man, Ninth Kalpa King, who was dressed in black and had a cold expression, also arrived.","“Jian Wushuang, you came very quickly.” Ninth Kalpa King looked at Jian Wushuang with a teasing smile.","“You came too slowly.” Jian Wushuang glanced at Ninth Kalpa King coldly.","“You should know the principles of the trial field. You and I only enter it with our consciousness. The trial field will fight according to our new divine bodies. However, considering that you’re only a third-level Ruler, I won’t bully you. The divine bodies I condense in the trial field will only be at the third-level Ruler level,” Ninth Kalpa King said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","No one was surprised.","It was a must that Ninth Kalpa King had a lower realm in the trial ground.","After all, if he went to the trial ground with his peak strength, the fight would be meaningless.","No matter how powerful Jian Wushuang was, he could not defeat Ninth Kalpa King, who had reached the peak of the Ultimate Dominator and had a divine power that was 7,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator.","In terms of divine power alone, they were not on the same level. Ninth Kalpa King’s divine power was barely comparable to that of a Supreme-being.","“Should we enter the trial field directly?” Jian Wushuang looked at Ninth Kalpa King.","“There’s no rush. Let’s discuss it before we enter the trial field.” Ninth Kalpa King suddenly smiled.","“Discuss what?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“We’re both perfect life-forms, and this exchange has attracted so many experts from the palace to watch. If this battle ends so easily, it’ll be too boring. Why don’t we add some more bets?” Ninth Kalpa King said with a smile.","“Rewards?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and laughed in his heart.","Ninth Kalpa King was really courting death.","He wanted to suppress him in this battle to raise his status, but now he wanted more rewards? Did he want to earn more from him?","“What rewards do you want?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I heard that when you first came to the palace, you met Supreme Giant Axe and he gave you a middle-grade principle divine fruit,” Ninth Kalpa King said with a faint smile.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","The onlookers were also shocked to hear this.","In the Void, among the three towering figures, Supreme Giant Axe king looked a little gloomy."]},{"number":4125,"title":"Chapter 4125 Battle","paragraphs":["4125 Battle","“Humph, the nine tribulations really have a good plan.”","In the void, a flash of anger appeared on Giant Axe Supreme’s face. He had personally given Jian Wushuang the middle-grade principle divine fruit as a welcome gift, and the nine tribulations actually dared to set their sights on his welcome gift.","In the next moment, he was about to say something to decline the request on Jian Wushuang’s behalf when he saw Supreme Gai Fu, who was standing next to him, glance at him, he said indifferently, “Giant Axe, this trial is between the juniors. How would it look if you interfered?”","Giant Axe’s pupils constricted when he heard that. He then remembered that Ninth Kalpa King had been brought back by Supreme Gai Fu.","Although the senior officials of the Life Palace, including Supreme Gai Fu, had been disappointed by Ninth Kalpa King’s failure to break through to the Supreme realm all these years, if he forcefully interfered in this trial...it would be easy for others to talk about him.","“This...”","After pondering for a moment, he was about to speak when he saw Ruler Blood Wave shake his head slightly.","“Fine.”","He sighed and turned to look at Jian Wushuang outside the trial field. He could only hope that Jian Wushuang would not agree to Ninth Kalpa King’s request.","...","Outside the arena in the Cyan Temple.","“Jian Wushuang, if you lose this trial, give me the middle-grade principle divine fruit that Giant Axe emperor gave you. How about it?” Ninth Kalpa King looked at Jian Wushuang with his hands behind his back and said with a fake smile.","As soon as he said this, there was an uproar among the spectators.","“What a ruthless Ninth Kalpa King. He asked for the middle-grade principle divine fruit that Giant Axe emperor gave to Jian Wushuang!”","“Tsk, tsk, I’m afraid Ninth Kalpa King has been coveting that middle-grade principle divine fruit for a long time.”","“Hahaha, in my opinion, this trial is fake. It’s only real if you suppress Jian Wushuang and get the principle divine fruit!”","“Now it’s up to Jian Wushuang to agree or not.”","Many eyes fell on Jian Wushuang, waiting for him to make a decision.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He was not in a hurry to agree with Ninth Kalpa King. Instead, he asked, “Ninth Kalpa King, if you lose, what will be the reward?”","“I lose?” Ninth Kalpa King sneered. Then, he flipped his right hand and took out two scarlet divine fruits, he said, “If I lose, not only will I give you these two low-grade principle divine fruits, but I will also give you an additional 200,000 origin stones. In total, the value is about the same as your middle-grade principle divine fruit. What do you think?”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Indeed, in terms of value alone, two low-grade principle divine fruits and 200,000 origin stones were about the same as his middle-grade principle divine fruit.","In the next moment.","“I agree,” Jian Wushuang said lightly.","“Hahahaha, Jian Wushuang, you really didn’t disappoint me.” Hearing this, a hint of joy suddenly appeared in Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes.","When Jian Wushuang said ‘I agree’ in the crowd, there was an uproar.","“Stupid!”","“Ninth Kalpa King’s intention to cheat him of the middle-grade principle divine fruit is already so obvious. Jian Wushuang should have seen through it, but he still agreed to the fight even though he knew it?","“Does he really think he can defeat Ninth Kalpa King?","“Jian Wushuang may be talented, but he is too arrogant because of his short cultivation.”","The spectators in the crowd shook their heads, either sighing or mocking.","In the mysterious void where the three Supreme-beings stood.","“Arrogant.”","Seeing that Jian Wushuang agreed to Ninth Kalpa King’s challenge, Giant Axe Supreme snorted and thought to himself out loud, “Little guy, if you lose the middle-grade principle divine fruit, I’ll see where you can cry.”","...","“Jian Wushuang, let’s begin.”","As if afraid that Jian Wushuang would go back on his words, Ninth Kalpa King pressed his palm on a statue outside the trial field.","This statue was the opening passage of the trial field. It was extremely precious and could perfectly duplicate all the divine power and will power of the trial object and condense a Divine Body in the trial field, it guaranteed that the two of them would be in the same realm when they sparred in the trial field.","“Okay.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and pressed his hand on the statue in front of him without hesitation.","A burst of golden light flashed and a crack suddenly appeared in the void of the Cyan Temple.","In the next moment.","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King shot their consciousnesses toward the crack.","In the trial field, there was a boundless starry sky.","Ninth Kalpa King’s Divine Body was the first to be condensed. He stepped on the void and his divine power surged.","Then, Jian Wushuang’s Divine Body was also condensed, and waves of sharp sword essence soared into the sky.","“Jian Wushuang, I’m at the same level as you. Don’t say that I’m bullying you.” Ninth Kalpa King smiled coldly. He did not want to say anything more. The divine power in his body suddenly burst out and he took the lead to slap Jian Wushuang.","This palm was made of divine power, and the vast divine power almost crushed the void.","“You want to test the strength of my Divine Power?” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. Then he formed a sword with his fingers and slashed out a sword light made entirely of divine power, directly slamming toward Ninth Kalpa King’s palm.","Rumble!","A burst of sound spread out.","Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang did not use their full strength at the beginning. Jian Wushuang did not take out his divine sword. He just formed a sword with his fingers. It was obvious that he wanted to compete in the strength of divine power.","In terms of the strength of their divine power, both of them were perfect, and they had at least 70 percent of their innate advantages.","The collision...a terrifying power burst out instantly. Then, Ninth Kalpa King’s majestic divine power swept toward Jian Wushuang like a rising tide in the sea.","Facing the surging divine power, Jian Wushuang was like a small boat in a raging sea. No matter how powerful Ninth Kalpa King’s divine power was, he remained unmoving despite looking dangerous.","“Jian Wushuang, are you only good at defense?”","Ninth Kalpa King laughed loudly. The violent divine power was like a storm, slapping Jian Wushuang again and again. Each time, the strength of his divine power was stronger than the last time!","“Ninth Kalpa King, you want to test the strength of my divine power, then I’ll let you have it!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang did not waste any more time. A cold light flashed in his eyes, and he did not hesitate any longer. The powerful divine power in his body also began to erupt!","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and a shocking sword rainbow slashed toward Ninth Kalpa King’s head!","The strength of his divine power, which was 8,000 times stronger, suddenly burst out!","Swish!","This sword attack directly defeated all of Ninth Kalpa King’s attacks. Even Ninth Kalpa King could not help but retreat a few steps back.","This retreat immediately showed the difference in the strength of their divine power.","“Eh?”","The Ninth Kalpa King regained his balance, but his face sank, and a flash of shock appeared in his eyes. “This kid’s divine power is actually 8,000 times stronger than mine?”","..."]},{"number":4126,"title":"Chapter 4126 Fierce Battle","paragraphs":["4126 Fierce Battle","While Jian Wushuang was fighting with Ninth Kalpa King, a huge dark green mirror appeared above the cyan temple outside the arena, the mirror reflected the battle between Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang in the arena.","“The strength of their divine power is so terrifying!”","“After all, they are both perfect life forms. Ninth Kalpa King has developed more than 70% of his innate advantage. His divine power is estimated to be 7,500 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. But Jian Wushuang’s divine power is even stronger than Ninth Kalpa King’s?”","“Jian Wushuang’s divine power is probably 8,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator.”","“It’s 8,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator. Tsk, tsk, how terrifying.”","Watching the battle scene on the Mystic Light Mirror, many people were secretly amazed, but not to the extent of being dumbstruck.","After all, Jian Wushuang was able to awaken his innate divine power, so he must have developed more than 70 percent of his innate advantages. At the very least, he had developed 70 percent. Now that he had developed 80 percent, he could release 8,000 times the strength of his divine power, that was acceptable.","In the surrounding void, Supreme Gai Fu, Ruler Blood Wave, and Supreme Giant Axe stood there.","Although there were still other Supreme-beings present, those Supreme-beings were not qualified to stand on the same level as these three.","“Jian Wushuang’s divine power is not weak,” Supreme Gai Fu said indifferently.","Beside him, Ruler Blood Wave secretly smiled.","He knew Jian Wushuang’s strength. It was 13,500 times stronger than his divine power. Compared to Jian Wushuang, it was nothing?","Even if Jian Wushuang only used 8,000 times the divine power of an ordinary cultivator, it was enough to crush Ninth Kalpa King.","Seeing this, Supreme Giant Axe nodded, but he still snorted and said, “Although his divine power is stronger than Ninth Kalpa King’s, in other aspects, it may not be as strong as Ninth Kalpa King’s. It’s too early to be happy.”","“Then let’s continue watching.” Hearing this, Ruler Blood Wave laughed heartily.","Among the three, there was a special look in the eyes of Ruler Blood Wave and Giant Axe. Only Supreme Gai Fu looked at Jian Wushuang expressionlessly from the beginning to the end. There was no emotion in his turbid eyes, no one could tell what he was thinking.","In the trial ground.","The battle was still going on.","“I’ve developed my innate advantage to 80% , which is 8,000 times the strength of an ordinary cultivator’s divine power. Jian Wushuang, in terms of the strength of my divine power, I’m indeed inferior to you.” Ninth Kalpa King smiled, there was no change in his mood because his divine power was not as strong as Jian Wushuang’s.","He had expected that Jian Wushuang’s divine power was at least as strong as his, but he could accept that Jian Wushuang was only slightly stronger than him.","It was not a big deal for him to admit that his divine power was not as strong as Jian Wushuang’s.","After all, in the universe, the strength of divine power did not determine everything, especially when Jian Wushuang’s divine power was not much stronger than his.","When the difference in the strength of the divine power was not too big, Ninth Kalpa King could rely on his absolute arts and secret skills to make up for the difference and then defeat Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, I heard that you have comprehended a trace of the universe principle?” Ninth Kalpa King looked at Jian Wushuang.","“So what if I have?” Jian Wushuang’s face was cold.","“It’s a coincidence that I have also comprehended some of the universe principle. I just don’t know which one of us has a higher comprehension of the universe principle?” Ninth Kalpa King smiled faintly and then took a heavy step, his body shot out like a cannonball. He quickly crossed his hands and formed a seal. In an instant, he appeared above Jian Wushuang and pressed down on him!","Ninth Kalpa King’s speed was extremely fast. The universe principles in between his palms were extremely rich and terrifying.","“The first Kalpa, the great destruction seal!” Ninth Kalpa King shouted in a low voice.","Rumble!","A terrifying power instantly gathered above Jian Wushuang’s head.","This power directly formed a huge palm print in the sky, crushing down in a mighty and merciless manner.","This huge palm print was not only filled with overwhelming divine power, but most importantly, it contained the power of the universe principle.","This power of the universe principle was extremely rich.","Jian Wushuang had also comprehended the universe principle, and his ability to sense the universe principle was extremely strong. The moment he saw Ninth Kalpa King use this huge palm print, he had already roughly estimated the level of Ninth Kalpa King’s comprehension of the principles of the universe.","“According to the intelligence, Ninth Kalpa King’s comprehension of the principles of the universe is already enough to pass the fourth level of the Principle Sea. But now, it seems that his comprehension of the principles of the universe is not only enough to pass the fourth level of the principle sea, but also not far from the fifth level.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, he nodded secretly.","A Ruler’s comprehension of the universe principle had reached the pinnacle of the fourth level of the principle sea, close to the level of the fifth level of the Principle Sea. This was already very heaven-defying.","With this level of comprehension of the universe principle, the Ninth Kalpa King was able to look down on the universe. It was no wonder that he was so confident and confident that he could definitely defeat Jian Wushuang.","Many experts of the Life Palace also thought that Ninth Kalpa King was stronger than Jian Wushuang. Even if they maintained the same realm, Ninth Kalpa King was stronger because his comprehension of the universe principles was too high.","On the other hand, Jian Wushuang...although Jian Wushuang said that he had comprehended a trace of the universe principles, most people thought that he had only comprehended a trace, it was already very impressive to be able to step into the threshold of the universe principle.","After all, Jian Wushuang had only cultivated for a short period of time, about 300,000 years. In such a short time, he was only a third-level Ruler. How high could his comprehension of the universe principle be?","But it was obvious that everyone had underestimated Jian Wushuang.","Including the Ninth Kalpa King.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang instantly unsheathed his sword and smiled. “Break it.”","As soon as he finished his words, the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand was instantly covered by the surging and majestic universe principles.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang casually waved his sword. It seemed to be a casual move, but with the support of the universe principles, it carried an extremely terrifying and sharp aura. In an instant, it was slashed onto the huge palm print that was crushing down from above.","Bang!","The two collided, and the two universal principles intersected. Jian Wushuang’s sword light shot out in all directions, and countless sharp sword essence soared. It easily broke the Ninth Kalpa King’s ‘great destruction seal’!","Although Jian Wushuang did not use a strong absolute art, under the blessing of the universal principle, this sword attack was still much more powerful and exquisite than the Ninth Kalpa King’s ‘great destruction seal’.","The crushing of this sword was much easier than Jian Wushuang’s crushing of Ninth Kalpa King’s divine power.","It was easy to see who was stronger and who was weaker!"]},{"number":4127,"title":"Chapter 4127 Nine-Volume Secret Skill","paragraphs":["4127 Nine-Volume Secret Skill","“How could it be?!” Ninth Kalpa King retreated and looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","He was no match for Jian Wushuang’s divine power, so he had nothing to say. After all, he had been prepared for it.","But now...","“I didn’t hold back anymore. I used the power of the universe principle with all my strength. I even used one of my ultimate moves, the great destruction seal. How could I be defeated by his casual sword?” Ninth Kalpa King was shocked.","“The universal principle! It’s the universal principle!”","“This kid’s comprehension of the universal principle is very high!”","Ninth Kalpa King stared at Jian Wushuang.","In that instant, he felt that Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was not very strong. At least, it was much weaker than his great destruction seal. However, when they collided...his great destruction seal was directly defeated.","This was not only because Jian Wushuang’s divine power was stronger than his, but more importantly, the universe principle that was integrated into his swordsmanship was too profound.","In other words, Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the universe principle was even higher than his, and it was much higher!","But, why was this so?","It was acceptable for him to lose in the contest of the strength of divine power. After all, it was an innate condition.","But why did he lose in the contest of the comprehension of the universe principles? Why did he lose?","He had comprehended for dozens of chaos cycles!","And Jian Wushuang had only cultivated for more than 300,000 years.","Outside the Cyan Temple.","“How is this possible?!”","“Jian Wushuang defeated the destruction seal of Ninth Kalpa King with one strike. Ninth Kalpa King has fully activated the power of the universe principles.”","“Could it be that Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the universe principles is higher than Ninth Kalpa King’s?”","“It’s certain that he’s higher than Ninth Kalpa King. If I’m not mistaken, Jian Wushuang should be able to pass the fifth level of the principle sea. As for whether he can pass the sixth level, I don’t know.”","Countless people looked at the scene transmitted from the mystic light realm and were shocked.","One had cultivated for dozens of chaos cycles, while the other had only cultivated for more than 300,000 years. Both of them were top geniuses.","However, the genius who had cultivated for more than 300,000 years had a higher comprehension of the universe principles than the genius who had cultivated for dozens of chaos cycles?","The point was, how did he comprehend the universal principle to such an extent in just 300,000 years?","Everyone was filled with doubts and puzzlement.","They did not understand how Jian Wushuang could comprehend the universal principle to such an extent in such a short period of time.","But in fact, they had misunderstood.","Most of them thought that Jian Wushuang had comprehended the universal principle at the Ruler level, but in fact, Jian Wushuang had comprehended a trace of the universal principle when he was a principle Ruler, he was a super genius rarely seen in the billions of Star Worlds in the vast universe.","Such a super genius was not much less rare than a perfect life form.","A principle Ruler could comprehend a trace of the universal principle. After he became a Ruler, his comprehension speed would naturally be much faster than others. Most importantly, Jian Wushuang had also obtained a great opportunity, not only did he possess a level three Star World and control the Heavenly Dao will of that Star World, but he was constantly affected by the Heavenly Dao will, making his comprehension speed much easier than others.","Moreover, when the Divine Beginning Realm was in danger, he had swallowed a spirit treasure pill. In the state of Enlightenment, he had received the guidance of Supreme-being Ling Yun. That was a full 100 years of guidance, which...Jian Wushuang had gained a lot, which made it easier for him to comprehend the universe principles.","Over the years, his comprehension of the universe principles had been improving. When he first went to the Principle Sea, he had already passed the fourth level. In fact, he already had the ability to pass the fifth level, it was just that Lord Xiao was deliberately trying to stop him.","Later, Lord Xiao even received the Purple Blood Secret Manual from Lord Xiao. His perfect combination of the use of the universal principles and sword principle could be said to be improving steadily, and it was getting stronger every day, he had long reached an extremely terrifying level.","100,000 years ago, when Jian Wushuang reached the first level of the Purple Blood Secret Manual, he could easily pass the fifth level of the Sea of principles. As for now, he still had a lot of progress in the universal principles, and the second level of the Purple Blood Secret Manual.., he also began to comprehend it. Until now, even Jian Wushuang did not know what level the universe principles he had comprehended could reach in the principle sea and whether he could pass the sixth level.","But what was certain was that his comprehension of the universe principles was much higher than that of Ninth Kalpa King.","“Ninth Kalpa King, your divine power is not as strong as mine, and your comprehension of the universe principles is far inferior to mine.” Jian Wushuang sneered.","“Arrogant!”","Ninth Kalpa King shouted, but his body was filled with astonishing divine power.","His eyes were cold with a hint of anger.","“The second Kalpa, the great seal of suppression!” Ninth Kalpa King raised his hand again.","In an instant, a brand-new palm print was formed again. Its power was obviously stronger than the previous great seal of destruction.","However, Jian Wushuang was still calm. He casually struck out with his sword and defeated the palm print again.","However, after the second palm print was defeated, a third more powerful palm print was formed immediately.","“The third disaster, the great underworld seal!”","“The fourth disaster, the great firmament seal!”","“The fifth disaster...”","A series of low shouts resounded in the trial field. In the trial field, new towering palm prints were continuously formed. Each palm print was more powerful than the previous one, and they continued to crush Jian Wushuang.","As the palm prints came out, the aura of the Ninth Kalpa King also increased.","“Eh?”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He could feel that the pressure brought by the palm prints of the Ninth Kalpa King was increasing.","If he could easily deal with the first and second palm prints, then he could not deal with the third and fourth palm prints so easily.","Moreover, the power of the palm print was constantly increasing.","“Is this the most powerful ultimate skill that Ninth Kalpa King is famous for?” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","In the information given to him by Ruler Blood Wave about Ninth Kalpa King, it mentioned the most powerful Ultimate skill that Ninth Kalpa King had created.","The name of this most powerful ultimate skill was ninth Kalpa.","In other words, the title of Ninth Kalpa King was actually derived from his ultimate skill.","Nine disasters represented nine shocking palm imprints.","These nine palm imprints were constantly accumulating power, and their power was constantly increasing. In addition, nine disaster emperor had already used the power of the universe principles he had comprehended into his absolute art, making these nine palm imprints even more terrifying and tyrannical.","Once upon a time, nine disaster emperor had used this absolute art to face a Supreme expert head-on!"]},{"number":4128,"title":"Chapter 4128 Disappointed?","paragraphs":["4128 Disappointed?","Outside the trial field.","“Ninth Kalpa King has used his famous secret skill.”","“I heard that this secret skill has nine moves, and the further it goes, the more powerful and terrifying it will be. Back then, he used this secret skill to fight against a Supreme expert head-on. Even the Supreme expert praised this secret skill. But now, Jian Wushuang, who is fighting with him, not only has a stronger divine power than him, but his comprehension of the universe principles is also higher than his. I just don’t know if he can defeat him with this secret skill.”","“You’ll see, I’m looking forward to it now.”","Those who watch the fight, all the strong people are talking.","Before the fight between Jian Wushuang and the Ninth Kalpa King, almost no one thought that Jian Wushuang would lose without a doubt.","But until now, Jian Wushuang had shown that his divine power was stronger than that of the Ninth Kalpa King in the trial field, and even his comprehension of the principles of the universe was higher than that of the Ninth Kalpa King, these people did not dare to think that Jian Wushuang would definitely lose this battle. Instead, there was a little more suspense.","Rumble...","The divine power was like a prison, filling the entire space of the trial field.","The shocking palm prints were so powerful that they brought more and more pressure to Jian Wushuang.","Of course, this pressure was within Jian Wushuang’s tolerance.","In the blink of an eye, nine moves palm print, Ninth Kalpa King had already performed the first Eighth moves.","The first seven moves of the Eighth moves palm print were easily blocked by Jian Wushuang’s Wuqi Divine Sword. Only the Eighth move was blocked by Jian Wushuang, but his body was slightly lowered by the impact, he looked a bit embarrassed.","But soon after, Ninth Kalpa King’s ninth palm print had begun to take shape.","The power of this palm print had reached its peak after the accumulation of the first Eighth palm prints.","The moment it took shape, even Jian Wushuang’s pupils could not help shrinking.","“This palm seems to be several times stronger than the Eighth palm. In terms of Dao comprehension alone, he is probably comparable to a Supreme-being,” Jian Wushuang thought.","Jian Wushuang’s attainments in sword principle were also very high. He had reached the completion of the first stage of the universe origin of sword principle. In addition to his continuous improvement over the past few years, he was probably one of the strongest among the Ultimate Rulers.","However, the Ninth Kalpa King had stayed at the level of an Ultimate Ruler for dozens of chaos cycles. Such a long time had not only allowed his comprehension of the universe principles to reach an extremely high level, but also his comprehension of Dao, he could even rival an ordinary Supreme-being.","Even if the ninth palm, which he had created to become famous, had not reached the Supreme-being level, it was probably not too far off.","However, the more it was like this, the brighter the light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes became.","“This is more interesting.” Jian Wushuang smiled with a hint of excitement on his face. “Well, let this palm of yours test my progress in the sword principle over the years.”","In the space of the trial field, Jian Wushuang looked up at the huge palm print that was slowly pressing down. He felt the shocking power contained in the palm print, but there was a strong power of the universe principles on his body, as a large amount of universe origin of sword principle swept up crazily, and it was obviously two completely different powers, at this moment, they were perfectly combined.","The Universe principle and the universe origin of sword principle were perfectly combined!","Jian Wushuang’s achievements in the Purple Blood Secret Manual were perfectly reflected at this moment. His five well-jointed fingers also held tightly onto the hilt of the Wuqi Divine Sword and slashed down at the Ninth Kalpa King!","This sword attack shocked the world!","No words could describe Jian Wushuang’s sword attack.","The sword spread across thousands of meters like divine lightning tearing through the dark night, splitting the entire starry sky in half. It was as bright as the sun and as if the Milky Way was hanging upside down.","Jian Wushuang had comprehended this sword principle for nearly 300,000 years. It was his most powerful sword move after being baptized by the Life Nirvana Pool!","This sword move merged with his 8,000 times strength of divine power, the first level after he broke through the Purple Blood Bible, and the perfect combination of his use of the universe principles and the sword principle universe origin!","This sword strike did not have a name, but it was Jian Wushuang’s most powerful sword strike apart from his innate divine power!","At this moment, everyone outside the Divine Hall raised their heads and looked at the boundless starry sky in the trial field in horror as if they were looking at a ghost. The astonishing sword rainbow that pierced through heaven and earth and cut across the sun and moon gradually opened its mouth wide.","The stunning sword strike directly collided with the most powerful palm strike of the Ninth Kalpa King without any hindrance.","Bang!","A terrifying explosion sounded, and the entire trial field was instantly plunged into a terrifying divine power storm.","The two terrifying powers collided crazily, destroying everything.","After a while, the dust settled.","Jian Wushuang and the Ninth Kalpa King still stood face to face in the middle of the trial field. Jian Wushuang had a strange smile on his face, but the Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes were abnormally shocked.","“You actually blocked my ninth palm?” Ninth Kalpa King looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","“Your palm is very strong. In terms of absolute art level, my attack just now was not as strong as yours. However, my comprehension of the universe principles and even the use of the universe origin of sword principle are much higher than yours. That’s why you and I are evenly matched in this collision,” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","Yes, the final result of the collision was that Jian Wushuang did not lose and Ninth Kalpa King did not win. The two people’s attacks collided and were eventually annihilated. They were evenly matched.","Jian Wushuang could accept this result, but Ninth Kalpa King could not accept it.","“He has only cultivated for more than 300,000 years, but his comprehension of the universe principles is so much higher than mine. Even my famous absolute art can be countered by his swordsmanship.” Ninth Kalpa King clenched his hands, his heart was trembling.","“Ninth Kalpa King.” Jian Wushuang looked at him again. “You lowered yourself to fight with me so that you could take out two lower-grade and 200,000 origin stones to poison my middle-grade principle divine fruit. You’ve always been so confident, but if your strength is only at this level, you’ll disappoint me.”","“Disappointed you?”","Ninth Kalpa King’s face turned completely ugly, and his eyes were filled with raging anger, “Good, very good. Jian Wushuang, you’ve completely angered me. I didn’t want to use my innate divine power to fight you, a junior who has cultivated for 300,000 years, but now...”","Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes suddenly turned cold, and then he suddenly raised his head and stared at Jian Wushuang with bloodshot eyes.","The next moment!","Boom!","In an instant, an extremely violent aura exploded with Ninth Kalpa King at the center, and his whole body began to expand rapidly!"]},{"number":4129,"title":"Chapter 4129 Surprise","paragraphs":["4129 Surprise","A terrifying aura swept out and directly swept up a void storm. Countless gusts of wind whistled and exploded.","At the center of the storm, Ninth Kalpa King’s skin turned pitch-black, and crisscrossed divine patterns appeared on his body. They were extremely strange, like divine demons from the underworld.","“Jian Wushuang, as a third-level Ruler who has cultivated for less than 300,000 years, you should be proud of yourself for forcing me to use my innate divine power.” Ninth Kalpa King looked at Jian Wushuang with his hands behind his back, he looked indifferent.","A circular storm formed automatically within a radius of 300 feet around him. Violent void storms swept in all directions and swept across the area.","At the same time, waves of profound and profound nomological aura emanated from the mysterious divine patterns on his body. At this moment, his aura had reached its peak.","“Ninth Kalpa King has used his innate divine ability.”","“Ninth Kalpa King’s innate divine ability, demon god evolution, is able to increase his strength by several times or even nearly ten times. It’s definitely a divine ability that can greatly increase his battle strength. Jian Wushuang has also awakened his innate divine ability before. I don’t know if he can still resist Ninth Kalpa King.”","“I don’t think so. However, it’s still impressive that he can force Ninth Kalpa King to use his innate divine ability. Even if Jian Wushuang loses, it’s still impressive.”","The experts watching the battle outside the arena were discussing.","In the space of the arena, Jian Wushuang could not help raising his eyebrows when he saw the huge change in Ninth Kalpa King’s Divine Body and the sudden surge in his aura. “Is this the innate divine ability that Ninth Kalpa King has awakened? It looks pretty good.”","“Jian Wushuang, that’s it.”","Whoosh!","As soon as he finished speaking, a cold light suddenly flashed in Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes. His body turned into a black stream, leaving a series of afterimages in the starry sky as he rushed toward Jian Wushuang!","“This speed...is at least several times faster!” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted when he saw this, and a trace of surprise could not help appearing on his face.","With a long laugh, Ninth Kalpa King quickly formed a seal in the void.","“Great destruction seal!”","In an instant, a terrifying power spread out from Ninth Kalpa King’s body!","Countless storm auras were drawn out from the void, then shot out from all directions. Finally, they gathered together and kept twisting, forming a towering giant hand.","The giant hand was thousands of feet wide and incomparably majestic. A wave of destructive aura spread out, which was extremely terrifying!","The great destruction seal was the Ninth Kalpa King’s famous absolute art, the first of the nine palm techniques. Previously, when the Ninth Kalpa King had used this palm, it had been easily defeated by Jian Wushuang.","But now, the power of the same palm had increased by nearly ten times.","This palm strike gave Jian Wushuang the feeling that it was almost close to the ninth palm print.","“It seems that I have to be a little more serious.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly, then suddenly raised his head and looked at the huge palm print, which was so strong that it was about to change, it pressed down inch by Inch and was invincible. It was getting closer and closer to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s black hair and black robe were fluttering in the wild wind.","Outside the arena, many people were looking at Jian Wushuang through the mystic light mirror.","Everyone was watching how Jian Wushuang was going to deal with the Ninth Kalpa King.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang drew his sword.","It was a casual sword move.","It was like a beginner practicing a simple sword move.","Almost everyone outside the arena could see that Jian Wushuang’s sword move was very ordinary, at least in terms of moves. At most, it contained the universe origin of sword principle and the universe principle.","Such a sword might have been able to withstand the Ninth Kalpa King, who had not used his innate divine power. But now, the Ninth Kalpa King, who had used his innate divine power, had his battle strength increased by nearly ten times, the power of the great destruction seal was also nearly ten times more terrifying.","How could Jian Wushuang block such a simple and casual attack?","“What’s going on with Jian Wushuang?”","“Is he giving up because he knows he can’t defeat him?”","“It shouldn’t be. At least he should use his innate divine power to try and resist it.”","The experts watching the battle outside the trial field were puzzled.","However, the next moment, when Jian Wushuang’s casual attack collided with the huge palm print of the Ninth Kalpa King, everyone’s faces froze.","The huge palm, which was thousands of feet wide, was mercilessly slashed by the sword light. The entire palm collapsed instantly and endless divine power scattered in all directions. Even the power of Jian Wushuang’s sword light was not completely exhausted, it continued to slash at Ninth Kalpa King.","Ninth Kalpa King was shocked. He quickly attacked again to block the residual power of the sword light, but he was forced back several steps.","After regaining his balance, Ninth Kalpa King was stunned.","He was not the only one. The experts watching the battle outside the arena were also shocked.","“How could this be?”","“Ninth Kalpa King has already used his innate divine power, and his strength has increased tenfold. How could Jian Wushuang defeat his absolute art so easily? What’s going on?”","“I don’t understand either. I thought Jian Wushuang had given up.”","Most of the spectators outside the trial arena were baffled. They did not know what had just happened. How could Jian Wushuang defeat Ninth Kalpa King’s Ultimate skill so easily with his casual swordsmanship.","In the isolated void, Supreme Gai Fu, Ruler Blood Wave, and Supreme Giant Axe all looked solemn.","Others might not be able to tell what had just happened, but they were all Supreme-beings, so they could tell at a glance.","“Will power,” Supreme Giant Axe said, “Jian Wushuang has such a powerful will power!”","“Ninth Kalpa King used his innate divine power and his strength increased tenfold, but his absolute art was still easily defeated by his sword. The will power he has mastered is very terrifying. If I’m not mistaken, the will power has definitely increased the power of his swordsmanship by more than tenfold!” Ruler Blood Wave exclaimed.","“The power of his will...” Ruler Gai Fu’s eyes narrowed slightly. “If my guess is correct, this power of his will should have been bestowed upon him by the principles of the universe. In other words, this little fellow once had a unique opportunity to gain the approval of the principles of the universe. He was even personally bestowed with a portion of the power of his will by the principles of the universe.”","“He was personally bestowed by the principles of the universe?” Ruler Blood Wave’s eyes lit up, and a smile appeared on his face. “This kid really gave us a big surprise.”","“...”"]},{"number":4130,"title":"Chapter 4130 One Thought Divine Kingdom","paragraphs":["4130 One Thought Divine Kingdom","It was indeed a great surprise.","The principles of the universe were Supreme. Even Supremes and Supreme-beings could only comprehend and use the principles of the universe to increase their own strength.","However, it was too difficult to obtain the recognition of the principles of the universe.","In the universe, under normal circumstances, only those who had obtained the heaven-defying opportunity could obtain the recognition of the universal principles. Only then could the universal principles bestow the power of the will, and the power of the will bestowed by the universal principles...there were strong and weak ones.","For Jian Wushuang, the power of the will, which directly increased his strength by ten times, was undoubtedly very heaven-defying.","“With such a powerful willpower, it can completely close the gap between Ninth Kalpa King’s innate divine ability and Jian Wushuang’s. Furthermore, Ninth Kalpa King’s innate divine ability has not even increased his strength by ten times, so it can’t be compared to Jian Wushuang’s willpower. This explains why Jian Wushuang was able to defeat his absolute art with a casual strike of his sword,” Supreme Giant Axe said with a smile.","“He wasn’t even able to use his innate divine abilities. The Ninth Kalpa King is going to suffer a major setback this time,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a laugh. As he spoke, he glanced at the nearby Ruler Gai Fu.","The Ninth Kalpa King had been personally escorted by Ruler Gai Fu to the Life Palace. Naturally, Ruler Gai Fu held the Ninth Kalpa King in high regard.","“Fall? It’s a little too early to talk about this,” Supreme Gai Fu looked at him indifferently and replied in a moderate tone.","“Huh?” Ruler Blood Wave was stunned at first, but then he asked in puzzlement, “Supreme Gai Fu, is there something else going on?”","Supreme Gai Fu did not answer him. Instead, he turned his head and looked at Jian Wushuang in the Mystic Light Mirror.","A flash of light suddenly flashed in the depths of his old and muddy eyes!","“He has been recognized by the universal principle and even bestowed with such a powerful willpower. This little guy named Jian Wushuang is indeed very outstanding, but...I’m afraid that’s not enough,” Supreme Gai Fu muttered to himself.","As the person who had personally brought ninth disaster back, he paid the most attention to Ninth Kalpa King. Even though Ninth Kalpa King had not been able to break through to become a Supreme all these years and his status in the Life Palace was not as high as before...Supreme Gai Fu was also slightly disappointed in him.","However, although he was disappointed, Supreme Gai Fu was still quietly watching Ninth Kalpa King’s growth.","In the past 20 chaos cycles, Ninth Kalpa King had rarely made a move. No one knew how strong he had become, but Supreme Gai Fu was an exception.","Supreme Gai Fu knew the most about Ninth Kalpa King. To be exact, every time Ninth Kalpa King made progress, he would report it to Supreme Gai Fu. Therefore, Supreme Gai Fu knew that Ninth Kalpa King, who had even used his innate divine power in the trial field, had a stronger trump card, however, he was still defeated by Jian Wushuang.","“It depends on whether Ninth Kalpa King is willing to reveal his trump card,” Ruler Gai Fu murmured. Then, his expression returned to normal and he did not say another word.","When Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe heard this, they looked at each other in dismay. A hint of surprise appeared in their hearts.","Ninth Kalpa King had a more powerful trump card?","...","In the trial field, countless stars twinkled and formed a brilliant sea of stars.","Ninth Kalpa King had gradually calmed down from his previous shock and disbelief.","His eyes were cold as he stared at Jian Wushuang and said in a low voice, “Jian Wushuang, there should be a special power contained in your sword just now. What is this power?”","“It’s the power of will.” Jian Wushuang did not intend to hide it because he knew that there must be someone among the experts of the Life Palace who could see the power of will.","“This power of will was granted to me by the universal principle by chance. It can increase my attack power tenfold,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“Is that so?” Ninth Kalpa King understood. “No wonder I was crushed by your swordsmanship even though I used my innate divine power.”","But then Ninth Kalpa King immediately laughed, “Jian Wushuang, I have to admit that you’re a real genius. You’re also the most heaven-defying genius I’ve ever met. Even I was far inferior to you when I was in the third level of the Ruler realm, not to mention that you’ve only cultivated for 300,000 years,” Ninth Kalpa King said with admiration, however, his eyes grew colder and colder.","“It’s a pity that you met me.”","“If I give you more time, it won’t be too long. I estimate that in a few million years or even tens of millions of years, if you fight me again, I might really lose to you at the same realm. But now...”","The Ninth Kalpa King smiled coldly.","Boom!","Suddenly, an unprecedentedly powerful aura exploded with Ninth Kalpa King at the center!","This aura was completely different from the previous aura of Ninth Kalpa King. It was filled with the feeling of a profound great dao. As soon as this aura came out, the void of the trial field seemed to be unable to withstand it, it made a cracking sound like glass breaking!","Then Jian Wushuang saw that the surrounding space of the trial field began to change.","With Ninth Kalpa King as the center, a huge and magnificent power spread out.","This power was enough to suffocate any Ruler and make them tremble in fear.","This power even felt that it was not something that a Ruler-level cultivator could have.","“What is it?” Jian Wushuang’s face immediately changed.","This power...was...it gave him a very familiar feeling.","This Supreme power was completely superior to that of a Ruler. He had felt it from Blackhawk, Blood Wave, and Giant Axe...","It was...the power of a Supreme!","“How is this possible?”","Jian Wushuang stared at Ninth Kalpa King with his eyes wide open.","The surrounding trial space had completely changed into a unique world. The world was hazy, but there was a sky, a land, and mountains. It was the structure of a world.","The key was that the power of this world was not something that a Ruler could control.","“Could it be...” Jian Wushuang looked at the time of the structure and had a guess, but his face became ugly.","Outside the arena, the stronger Ultimate Rulers and several Supreme-beings were watching the changes in the arena.","“One-thought divine kingdom!”","“It’s one-thought divine kingdom!”","“Even Supreme-beings can only Ruler one-thought divine kingdom after reaching a certain level. The Ninth Kalpa King has used one-thought divine kingdom!”","Everyone outside the arena was in an uproar."]},{"number":4131,"title":"Chapter 4131 Life Shock","paragraphs":["4131 Life Shock","One thought divine kingdom was one of the heaven-reaching skills that only Supreme-level experts could Ruler.","It could form a huge divine kingdom with one thought. With the divine kingdom as the core, it could suppress the strength of the opponent to the greatest extent and at the same time, increase one’s own strength, the principle of it was actually similar to the innate divine power of the primordial universe, which was given to Jian Wushuang by the universal principles.","Of course, the original universe was most powerful because it could increase one’s strength, but the suppression effect was only average.","The one-thought divine kingdom relied on the power of the divine kingdom, which was not very useful among experts of the same level. For example, if a Supreme-being used the one-thought divine kingdom, it would not be very useful to experts of the same level, the one-thought divine kingdom was only used to pave the way for most Supreme-beings to become a top-tier Supreme-being, so as to lay the foundation for establishing a real divine kingdom in the future.","However, this technique would be extremely useful if used against low-level cultivators.","For example, if an Ruler used a single-thought kingdom against a group of Rulers, there would be very few Rulers who would be able to unleash their full power, no matter how many of them there were.","And now, the person who used a single-thought kingdom was actually a mere Ruler, the Ninth Kalpa King!","“This Tribulation King is incredible!”","“A single thought god-kingdom...even Rulers would have to spend a very long period of time researching this technique before they would be able to Ruler it. He’s only at the Ruler level, but he’s actually mastered this technique?”","“He hasn’t attacked for twenty chaos cycles. This attack is quite terrifying. Although he still hasn’t broken through to become an Ruler, no one can deny the possibility of him becoming an Ruler just by relying on this technique alone.”","“Yes, this move alone is enough to make many higher-ups in the Life Palace look at him in a new light.”","The experts watching the battle were all discussing.","Before this, the higher-ups of the Life Palace had basically given up on Ninth Kalpa King. They thought that Ninth Kalpa King would be an Ultimate Ruler for the rest of his life and that it was almost impossible for him to break through to become an Ruler.","But now, Ninth Kalpa King was able to use the one-thought divine kingdom, which proved his potential. Even if he lost to Jian Wushuang in the end, he still proved himself.","In the eyes of many people present, Ninth Kalpa King had even used the one-thought divine kingdom, so there was basically no suspense in the battle.","In the lonely void.","“One-thought divine kingdom?” Supreme Giant Axe stared at the scene in the mystic light mirror with a strange light in his eyes. After a long while, he nodded secretly. “Yes, although it’s only the basic structure of the one-thought divine kingdom and hasn’t been completely perfected, it’s still barely comprehended. To be able to comprehend this move at the overlord level, Ninth Kalpa King hasn’t wasted the resources of the Life Palace.”","“This Ninth Kalpa King has proven himself. I wonder if Jian Wushuang can still find an opportunity under the one-thought divine kingdom,” said Ruler Blood Wave.","“I don’t think so.” Supreme Giant Axe shook his head.","“That might not be the case. Jian Wushuang has yet to display his innate divine power. If he does, he might be able to fight back,” said Ruler Blood Wave.","While the two were talking, Supreme Gai Fu was still standing there without saying anything. However, his eyes were fixed on the trial field within the mystic light.","The entire trial space was now completely occupied by the illusory divine kingdom.","In the divine kingdom, Jian Wushuang could feel the boundless power surrounding him.","“Jian Wushuang, to be honest, I didn’t want to expose this move, but I didn’t expect you to have such a high comprehension of the universe principles and control such a powerful willpower. I had no choice but to use this move to defeat you!”","“This move is also my biggest trump card. You should feel its power.” Ninth Kalpa King laughed.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils had already constricted. He was feeling the power of the surrounding suppression.","“This feeling of suppression and the hazy shadow of Heaven and earth should be the one-thought divine kingdom,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","He had heard Ruler Ling Yun talk about many things, including the one-thought divine kingdom.","The one-thought divine kingdom was a skill that only Supreme experts were qualified to Ruler. It was difficult for even Supreme experts to Ruler it. As for the Ruler, he did not even dare to imagine that the Ninth Kalpa King could comprehend the one-thought divine kingdom, this alone was worthy of being called a genius.","However, Jian Wushuang could also see that although the Ninth Kalpa King had comprehended the one-thought divine kingdom, he should not have completely mastered it. To be exact, his one-thought divine kingdom was only a structure, but it was not truly perfect, otherwise, the suppression effect of the divine kingdom alone would be enough to make him unable to move. But now, although Jian Wushuang was greatly suppressed, he could still move and fight fiercely.","“Ninth Kalpa King.” Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head.","“Huh?” Ninth Kalpa King looked at Jian Wushuang.","But at this moment.","Boom!","A pressure from the depths of the soul suddenly descended on the world!","“Innate divine power, life shock!”","This was the first time that this innate divine power, which Jian Wushuang had awakened in the Life Nirvana Pool, had appeared in the world!","In an instant, the surging wind in the void, the rotating stars, the twinkling starlight, and the huge divine kingdom condensed around them all stopped!","Time seemed to have stopped at this moment!","The moment the pressure descended, Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes suddenly opened wide, and a look of disbelief appeared on his face.","He stood there without moving, but the surrounding one-thought divine kingdom began to collapse rapidly. In the blink of an eye, the entire divine kingdom had disappeared.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed and arrived in front of Ninth Kalpa King. He stabbed out with his Wuqi Divine Sword and penetrated Ninth Kalpa King’s Divine Body without any hindrance.","Immediately, Ninth Kalpa King’s Divine Body, which had been completely condensed by the trial field, collapsed, and his consciousness returned to his original body.","Ninth Kalpa King, who had been in high spirits because he had revealed his one-thought divine kingdom, was defeated in such a baffling way.","Outside the trial field, there was complete silence!","All the spectators stood there in astonishment and silence.","The eyes of the original body of Ninth Kalpa King had opened, but they were filled with disbelief.","He had lost.","He did not even have the time to show the power of the one-thought divine kingdom. How could he lose to Jian Wushuang so inexplicably?","He did not even know how he had lost?","He was not the only one. Most of the people around also did not understand how he had been defeated by Jian Wushuang.","The Ninth Kalpa King also began to recall the scene just now. At that moment..."]},{"number":4132,"title":"Chapter 4132 The Dust Had Settled","paragraphs":["4132 The Dust Had Settled","At that instant, he felt an incomparably powerful force of intimidation. That force made his entire body tremble, and he could not help but kneel down and worship!","It was a type of innate suppression that came from a high-level life-form against a low-level life-form!","Life shock, this innate divine ability, could intimidate all people with lower life-level for a short period of time.","In other words, as long as the life-level was lower than Jian Wushuang, then no matter what realm it was, it would be suppressed, but the degree of suppression would be different.","It was a high-level life-level looking down on the lower life-level!","The moment of shock caused his consciousness to stagnate and his one-thought divine kingdom to collapse. Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to destroy his Divine Body.","Do not forget, Ninth Kalpa King was also a perfect life form!","“His innate divine power should be the suppression of life level. During the process of being shocked, his consciousness will stagnate temporarily. However, we are both perfect life forms. How can his innate divine power intimidate me?","“Is it because his divine power is stronger than mine?” Ninth Kalpa King could not understand.","He had indeed seen through the nature of Jian Wushuang’s innate divine power, which was the suppression of life level.","However, he did not understand why Jian Wushuang’s innate divine power could suppress him.","He did not know that although they were both perfect lives, Jian Wushuang’s life level was definitely higher than Ninth Kalpa King’s.","After all, Jian Wushuang’s divine power was 13,500 times stronger than his limit. He only displayed 8,000 times the strength of his divine power.","An ordinary perfect life, even if it developed its innate advantage to the extreme, was only 10,000 times stronger than an ordinary cultivator’s divine power.","Even Ruler Blood Wave was sure that Jian Wushuang’s level of life was not as simple as an ordinary perfect life.","Under the same realm, Ninth Kalpa King could not withstand Jian Wushuang’s life shock, which was the key to Jian Wushuang’s victory.","“Jian Wushuang.” Ninth Kalpa King looked up at Jian Wushuang, who had also returned to his original body, with a complicated look in his eyes.","“Ninth Kalpa King, thank you.” Jian Wushuang smiled and cupped his hands toward Ninth Kalpa King.","Ninth Kalpa King snorted coldly and replied, “Jian Wushuang, you’re lucky this time.”","“If you say I’m lucky, then so be it.” Jian Wushuang smiled and did not bother to argue with him. After a pause, Jian Wushuang changed the topic and said, “Ninth Kalpa King, now that the trial is over, it’s time to pay the reward you promised me, right?”","“Humph, do you think I’m worse than you?” A flash of anger appeared on Ninth Kalpa King’s face when he heard that. Without hesitation, he flipped his right hand and two red low-grade principle divine fruits appeared on his palm.","They were the two principle divine fruits that he had used to make the reward.","“Jian Wushuang, these are the two low-grade principle divine fruits that I promised you. As for the 200,000 universe origin stones, I’ll send them to your residence later.","“Don’t worry, although I lost, I’m not a person who can’t afford to lose.” With a wave of his sleeve, the two low-grade principle divine fruits shot toward Jian Wushuang.","“Thank you.” Jian Wushuang smiled and put the two low-grade principle divine fruits into his interspatial ring.","“Yi Nu, let’s go.” Now that he was defeated, he did not have the mood to stay any longer. After saying this to the black-clothed elder in the distance, he left with a gloomy face.","Yi Nu followed him quickly.","After a while, Ninth Kalpa King and the black-clothed elder disappeared in front of everyone.","In the unique void, Supreme Gai Fu took a deep look at Jian Wushuang and left the cyan temple in a flash.","“Take care, Supreme Gai Fu,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a cheerful smile,","At first, as the only one who knew Jian Wushuang’s background, Ruler Blood Wave was very confident in Jian Wushuang’s battle. However, when Ninth Kalpa King unleashed his one-thought divine kingdom, his confidence was shattered, he began to worry for Jian Wushuang.","However, before he could worry for long, Jian Wushuang turned the situation around and won the battle with his innate divine ability.","Even though he was used to big waves, his mood could not help but fluctuate.","“Giant Axe, we’ve been watching for a long time. It’s time for us to meet the little guy,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a smile to Giant Axe.","“That’s right.” Although Giant Axe wanted to keep a straight face, he could not help smiling.","In a flash, they appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Ruler Blood Wave, Supreme Giant Axe.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands respectfully when he saw Supreme Giant Axe and Ruler Blood Wave.","Jian Wushuang was very respectful to these two Supreme-beings.","“You’re welcome.” Ruler Blood Wave waved his hand and glanced at the people of the Life Palace who were watching the battle in the void. He said, “There are too many people here. Let’s talk somewhere else.”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. Then the three of them left the trial ground in a flash.","The people of the Life Palace who were watching the battle looked at Jian Wushuang who had disappeared and could not come back to their senses for a long time.","Slowly, a trace of respect appeared in their eyes.","“He has cultivated for 300,000 years and was able to defeat Ninth Kalpa King, who is considered an invincible universe among Rulers. Jian Wushuang’s talent is so high that I’m afraid there is no other person in the entire vast universe who can match him!”","“I don’t know if there’s a second one in the entire vast universe, but in my Life Palace, there’s really no one at the Ruler level who can compare to him.”","“I can foresee that as long as Jian Wushuang doesn’t die halfway, he’ll definitely become another pillar of my Life Palace in the future. His potential is really limitless.”","The experts who were watching the battle were discussing among themselves, and they were all wearing sincere smiles on their faces.","Jian Wushuang was a member of the Life Palace. The stronger Jian Wushuang was, the stronger the Life Palace would be.","The two complemented each other and relied on each other.","“Let’s go.”","Everyone left one after another, and the battle was settled with Jian Wushuang’s victory.","The news that Ninth Kalpa King had lost to Jian Wushuang in the trial field was thoroughly spread in the Life Palace.","...","In the Life Palace, there were several stone tables in the Supreme temple with the word ‘Blood Wave’ on it. A pot of spiritual tea was burning on the stone table. Before the tea was fully cooked, a refreshing fragrance had spread in all directions.","“Tsk, tsk. Two low-grade principle God fruits and 200,000 universe origin stones. Don’t look at how the nine tribulations are acting as if nothing has happened. In truth, it’s quite painful for him.” Ruler Blood Wave shook his head, he chuckled softly as he spoke."]},{"number":4133,"title":"Chapter 4133 Enlightenment River","paragraphs":["4133 Enlightenment River","Supreme Giant Axe and Jian Wushuang, who were standing next to Ruler Blood Wave, could not help but smile.","The three of them came here after leaving the Cyan Stone Palace.","“You are indeed impressive to defeat Ninth Kalpa King, who can use the one-thought divine kingdom in the trial field. However, don’t be complacent just because you won the trial. Ninth Kalpa King lost because his cultivation was suppressed to the same realm as yours. In reality, you are still far from him.” Supreme Giant Axe suddenly looked at Jian Wushuang, he urged.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded. He knew that if they were fighting in the real world, Ninth Kalpa King was the Ultimate Ruler. With the strength of his divine power, his strength could rival that of an Ruler, his battle strength was definitely at the level of an Ruler. Even if he used all his skills, he would still be nothing in front of an Ruler.","The Giant Axe Supreme was afraid that he would become complacent after winning a match, so he reminded him a little.","“It’s good that you understand.” Seeing this, the Giant Axe Supreme said nothing more and smiled.","A moment later, the spirit tea was ready, and the rich fragrance of the tea spread out completely. The Giant Axe Supreme made a cup of tea for Jian Wushuang and asked, “Jian Wushuang, what are your plans next?”","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment, he replied, “Whether it’s my understanding of sword principle or the comprehension of the universe principles, I’m considered good at the Ruler level. However, my own realm is indeed too low, so I want to break through to the fourth-level Ruler as soon as possible.”","Jian Wushuang knew very well that no matter how good his methods were, his own realm was the foundation.","Now, he was only a third-level Ruler. Although his combat power was comparable to the Ultimate Ruler, and even stronger than ordinary Ultimate Rulers, this level, in the vast universe, still nothing.","It is indeed Jian Wushuang’s top priority to improve his realm and cultivation as soon as possible.","“If I want to break through to the Ruler realm, I’ll need to fuse the principles. I’ve already comprehended the seventh principle a long time ago. What I lack is to fuse the seventh principle. Although I have some ideas, if I continue to fuse the seventh principle step by step, I’ll be able to fuse it. However, my progress will be too slow. It’ll take at least hundreds of thousands of years.”","“Too slow.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Hundreds of thousands of years might only be a blink of an eye for most Rulers.","But for Jian Wushuang, who had only cultivated for more than 300,000 years, hundreds of thousands of years was indeed a long time.","“Ruler’s whereabouts are unknown. I’m afraid that the group of mysterious Supreme experts I met in the Nine Luminaries Galaxy are all targeting Ruler...”","“If I want to figure out everything and find Ruler’s true body, I have to have at least the combat strength of a Supreme expert. That’s the only way to not be afraid of those mysterious Supreme experts.”","“I don’t have much time left.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes sparkled. He had already had some guesses when he was chased by one of the mysterious Supreme experts, a Supreme expert named Devour Nine.","There could only be one reason why the Thunder God Palace was flattened and why he was being pursued by Devour Nine. Even the Nine Luminaries Galaxy was almost wiped out by them.","It was because of his Ruler, Xuan Yi.","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown as he thought of this.","On the other hand, Ruler Blood Wave and Giant Axe saw the distress on Jian Wushuang’s face.","“Jian Wushuang, are you troubled by the merging of the Seventh principle?” Ruler Blood Wave looked over.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “The further you go, the more difficult it becomes. Although I’ve obtained some special opportunities and have a general idea of how to merge the seventh principle, it will take a longer time.”","“That’s not a problem.” Ruler Blood Wave smiled. “There are many unique places within the lifeguard palace, as well as some excellent training grounds. For example, the training grounds where you fought against the Ninth Kalpa King were the places where many of the cultivators of the lifeguard palace used to simulate battles. As for the fusion of principles, the lifeguard palace naturally has several training grounds that can aid in the fusion of principles.”","“However, now that you have a clear train of thought, the only thing you lack is time, which makes it even easier. I can introduce you to a place. In the third mountain range, there is a Enlightenment River. Inside, you are fusing the seventh principle, and your speed is definitely several times or even dozens of times faster than other places. You can go there and take a look.”","“In addition, the Enlightenment River is not only helpful to the principles, but also helpful to the comprehension of the universe principles. Didn’t you get two lower-grade divine fruits from the Ninth Kalpa King?","“You can try to eat one when you get to the Enlightenment River. Maybe you can gain something from the universe principles.”","“Enlightenment River?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Thank you for telling me, senior.” Jian Wushuang expressed his gratitude to Ruler Blood Wave, then left the temple eagerly and headed for the third mountain range.","Looking at Jian Wushuang’s back, Ruler Blood Wave revealed a playful smile.","“Blood Wave, you mentioned the Enlightenment River to this little guy, but you didn’t mention the River Spirit in the Enlightenment River...why is that?” Supreme Giant Axe looked at him with a strange expression.","“I’ll just tell him about the Enlightenment River. As for the River Spirit, it’s not a big problem. He should be able to deal with it himself.” Supreme Giant Axe raised his eyebrows.","The two Supreme Rulers looked at each other with a faint smile on their lips.","...","On the other side, after learning about the existence of the Enlightenment River from Supreme Giant Axe Blood Wave, Jian Wushuang went back to his residence to greet Leng Rushuang. Then he immediately went to the third mountain range.","When he reached the third mountain range, Jian Wushuang found out the location of the Enlightenment River by simply asking someone.","Splash.","Before he got close to the Enlightenment River, Jian Wushuang heard the sound of rushing water. When he got closer, he saw a rolling river that was thousands of feet wide in front of him.","The river was pitch-black. Jian Wushuang subconsciously released his divine sense to check. He could not help but exclaim, “What a rich aura of principles. Not only that, but the aura of the universe principles is also extremely rich.”","He could feel that the aura of principles and the aura of the universe principles in the river was extremely rich. It could be said to be thousands of times more than in the outside world. Whether he was comprehending the principles of Heaven and Earth or the universe principles here..his speed must be much faster than in the outside world.","As for the merging of the seventh principle, the time needed to do so could be greatly shortened."]},{"number":4134,"title":"Chapter 4134 Lord River Spirit","paragraphs":["4134 Lord River Spirit","Looking at the dao-Enlightenment River, which was rich in both heaven and earth principles and universe principles, Jian Wushuang nodded with satisfaction. Seeing that there was no one around, he stepped into the river without thinking too much.","In a few seconds, Jian Wushuang reached the deepest part of the river. In the next moment, Jian Wushuang crossed his legs and closed his eyes, allowing his body to gradually sink.","Gulp.","A bubble appeared on the surface of the river. In just a moment, Jian Wushuang disappeared from the surface of the river and sank to the bottom.","At the bottom of the river, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and took out the lower-grade principle divine fruit he had gotten from Ninth Kalpa King. However, as soon as he took out the principle divine fruit, he frowned. He seemed to have sensed something and could not help narrowing his eyes.","Then, as if nothing had happened, Jian Wushuang put the two low-grade principle divine fruits aside and slowly closed his eyes.","One day...two days...three days...","Jian Wushuang seemed to have sunk into a deep level of cultivation.","At some point in time, in the darkness behind Jian Wushuang, a little old man who was less than five inches tall, slightly hunched, and had two small mustaches slowly walked toward Jian Wushuang.","The little old man stood on his tiptoes with shifty eyes. He came behind Jian Wushuang and carefully looked at him. Seeing that Jian Wushuang had really sunk into a deep level of cultivation, he let out a long breath, he straightened his back and swaggered toward Jian Wushuang.","However, when he reached out his hand and grabbed the two lower-grade divine fruits beside Jian Wushuang, his vision suddenly turned dark.","“Got you.” A cold voice came.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes with a cold gleam and lifted the little old man up.","“Wu wu wa wa wa wa...” The little old man was lifted by Jian Wushuang in the hand, suddenly he waddled up.","“Shut up.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold, and he gently exerted force on the little old man. The little old man suddenly stopped screaming and glared at Jian Wushuang with his small eyes. He gnashed his teeth and said, “Boy, do you know who I am?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, and a hint of surprise flashed across his face.","The little old man’s cultivation was not very high. He was probably at the level of the first Ruler, but there was a strange power in his body.","Although he had just squeezed lightly, with his current strength, even an ordinary second-level Ruler would be crushed by him. It was strange that the little old man was not hurt at all.","“I don’t know,” Jian Wushuang replied calmly, suppressing his thoughts.","“What? Your elders didn’t tell you who I am when you came here?” The little old man was stunned, then he glanced at Jian Wushuang and said, “Let me tell you, I am the River Ruler of the dao-Enlightenment River. Lord River Spirit!”","“River Spirit?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the little old man suspiciously. He had never heard from Ruler Blood Wave that there was a River Spirit in the Enlightenment River.","Could he be a liar?","“Boy, how dare you treat me like this? Do you know that you have already caused a big trouble? If you know what’s good for you, you should let me go. By the way...” River Spirit puffed up his chest, he pointed at the two lower-grade divine fruits beside Jian Wushuang and said with shining eyes, “Give me these two lower-grade divine fruits and I’ll forgive your rudeness. Otherwise, Humph, you’ll bear the consequences!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help laughing out of anger. He narrowed his eyes and said, “You’ve caused a big trouble? You’ll bear the consequences? I’d like to see how you make me bear the consequences!”","After saying this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. He pointed his finger like a sword and shot out a sword light, fiercely slashing toward the River Spirit.","Rumble.","The Enlightenment River was directly split open by 300 meters!","“Damn it!”","Seeing this, the River Spirit immediately cried out in surprise and hurriedly tried to dodge to the side.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s cultivation of sword principle was now so profound that it was impossible for the River Spirit, who was only a first-level Ruler, to dodge it?","Before the River Spirit could dodge to the side, the sword light directly cut the River Spirit into two pieces.","Splash!","The River Spirit was cut into two pieces. The river water twisted and countless principles and universe principles spread out. In just a few breaths, the River Spirit’s body kept regenerating and was ‘resurrected’ again.","Moreover, the universe principles and universe principles that filled the path-understanding river became stronger.","“Boy, how dare you attack me?”","River Spirit widened his eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","It had been a long time since the birth of the Enlightenment River. Since the mysterious Palace Master of the Life Palace had teleported the Enlightenment River to the Life Palace, all the special life forms in the Life Palace had been respectful to him, all of them were respectful to him?","Even Supreme experts were humble to him. They had to prepare gifts for him if they wanted to enter the Enlightenment River to comprehend the fusion principles.","However, this guy had cut him with his sword?","Jian Wushuang did not pay attention to the River Spirit’s angry shout. Instead, he rubbed his chin and looked thoughtful.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s thoughtful look, River Spirit suddenly laughed and said with a crafty look in his eyes, “Boy, do you have no way to deal with me? Hand over the two low-grade principle divine fruits...”","Bang!","Suddenly, a sword light suddenly slashed toward him.","“You bastard!”","Before River Spirit could let out a scream, he was shattered into pieces by the sword light.","After Jian Wushuang struck out with his sword, he looked at the Shattered River Spirit with interest.","He had a guess.","Rumble.","Sure enough, it didn’t take long for River Spirit to regroup again. He was so angry that he stomped his feet and said, “Bastard! How could you attack me one after another? I’m the Honorable River Spirit!”","Jian Wushuang looked at River Spirit, who was cursing from afar, and a strange smile appeared on his face.","As expected.","As the River Spirit’s body was reorganized, the aura of the principle of the dao-Enlightenment River became stronger than before.","If he guessed correctly, the River Spirit was formed by the principle of the will of the dao-Enlightenment River, and it was an immortal existence. As the River Spirit was killed and reorganized by him, the principle of the will in his body was consumed, it was then fed back to the dao-Enlightenment River.","Therefore, every time the River Spirit died, the principle aura in the Enlightenment River became stronger.","“Old man, it seems that you really are the River Spirit of the Enlightenment River.” Jian Wushuang revealed a strange smile.","Seeing the smile on Jian Wushuang’s face, the River Spirit inexplicably shivered.","“You...what are you looking at me like that for?” The River Spirit shrank his neck and rolled his throat.","..."]},{"number":4135,"title":"Chapter 4135 The Fourth-Level Ruler","paragraphs":["4135 The Fourth-Level Ruler","“I just killed you twice. Every time you die, the principles of Heaven and earth and the principles of the universe in the Enlightenment River become stronger. In other words, if I can kill you a few more times, won’t I get more benefits from the Enlightenment River?” Jian Wushuang stared at River Spirit with evil intentions.","River Spirit glared, but Jian Wushuang had already made his move.","“Come here, Heaven Suppression Tablet!” Jian Wushuang laughed. A towering Heaven Suppression Tablet instantly descended and pressed River Spirit under the tablet.","Accompanied by River Spirit’s miserable cry, Jian Wushuang began his thousands of years of seclusion.","...","Spring passed, autumn came, and thousands of years passed.","In the blink of an eye, 3,000 years had passed.","During these 3,000 years, in this vast universe, every day, there would be experts falling, and new stars would be born. The cycle was endless.","To the universe, 3,000 years passed in the blink of an eye. The Life Palace was also peaceful.","In the third mountain range.","A calm, pitch-black river was originally flowing slowly.","Suddenly, the surface of the river began to boil, rumble.","The bubbles burst one by one. In just a few breaths, the surface of the river began to tremble violently like boiling water!","In the next moment.","Swish!","With a long cry, a black-clothed figure broke out of the bottom of the river in an instant.","Jian Wushuang took a step down and stood at the riverside of the Enlightenment River.","His eyes sparkled with divine light. Surrounded by the aura of Great Dao, he was like a divine king who was bathed in a sea of principles.","After 3,000 years, he had finally fused the seventh principle in the dao-comprehension river. His realm had also smoothly broken through from the third-level Ruler to the fourth-level Ruler.","“Is this the power of the fourth-level Ruler?” Jian Wushuang opened his palm and carefully felt the powerful power in his body. A satisfied smile appeared on his face.","He could feel that after breaking through to the fourth-level Ruler, his divine power was at least dozens of times stronger than before!","However, his divine power was 13,500 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator!","It was 13,500 times stronger than that of an ordinary fourth-level Ruler. In terms of divine power, he was stronger than many Ultimate Rulers.","However, this was not his biggest gain.","The most important thing was that his comprehension of the universe principles had reached a higher level than it had been 3,000 years ago!","Of course, the reason why his comprehension of the universe principles had improved greatly was because of the dao-Enlightenment River, in addition to the two lower-grade principle divine fruits that Ninth Kalpa King had lost to him.","No, it was because of the River Spirit.","“River Spirit, I can break through to the fourth-level Ruler in just 3,000 years thanks to your care.” Jian Wushuang looked at the center of the Enlightenment River and said with a faint smile.","There, River Spirit lay weakly on the surface of the river. He turned his head to glance at Jian Wushuang and opened his mouth to say something, but in the end, he shook his head helplessly.","3,899 strikes!","In the past 3,000 years, Jian Wushuang had cut him 3,899 times. He remembered every single strike clearly!","What did that mean?","He had died 3,899 times!","Was this something that a human could do?","What did he take his honorable Lord River Spirit for?","No one could understand his feelings. Under the suppression of the divine devil suppression tablet, he could neither escape nor escape. He could only watch helplessly. Every time Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the universe principles reached a bottleneck, he would reach out his hand with a smile and slash at his body with a bang.","As the embodiment of the will of the dao-Enlightenment River and the origin of the principles, each time he died, the aura of the universal principles and principles in the dao-Enlightenment River would become stronger.","Thus, a large amount of the universal principles and principles collapsed and were fed back into the dao-Enlightenment River. Then, Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the universal principles and the fusion of the universal principles would be accelerated.","“River Spirit, I’ve wronged you for the past 3,000 years. But don’t worry, I, Jian Wushuang, will repay you generously in the future.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands toward River Spirit seriously. In any case, he was very grateful to River Spirit. After all, without River Spirit, he would not have been able to break through to the fourth-level Ruler level in 3,000 years, his comprehension of the universal principles had increased by a large margin.","“You can go. I don’t want to see you again.” River Spirit waved his hand weakly. Now he had nothing else to ask. He only hoped that this bastard would leave as soon as possible.","Jian Wushuang smiled and said no more. He stomped his feet and soared into the sky, leaving the third mountain range.","...","In the manor where Jian Wushuang lived in the sixth mountain range.","A graceful figure was standing by the railing, holding a bag of fish food in her hand. She casually threw it down, causing thousands of koi to flip in the lake. The scene was quite spectacular.","“Shuang ‘er.”","At this moment, a pair of hands gently wrapped around the graceful figure’s waist. Then, a soft voice sounded behind her ear.","Leng Rushuang did not panic at all. Instead, she smiled and said, “Husband, you came out of seclusion so quickly?”","Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile. “Shuang ‘er, I haven’t seen you for 3,000 years. I can see that your aura is about to break through to the fourth level of the Ruler realm, right?”","“Yes, soon.” Leng Rushuang also nodded.","She had already broken through to the third level of the Ruler realm earlier than Jian Wushuang, and because she had absorbed the heart of the Star World, her potential was also enormous.","Now that the seventh principle was about to be fused, she was close to breaking through to the fourth-level Ruler.","It was a pity that Leng Rushuang was not a special life form after all. She could not obtain many resources in the Life Palace. Otherwise, she could have cultivated in the Enlightenment River for thousands of years just like Jian Wushuang.","After returning from the Enlightenment River, Jian Wushuang stayed in his manor with his wife.","Until three years later...","“Jian Wushuang, come to me quickly.” Ruler Blood Wave’s voice suddenly rang in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. Ruler Blood Wave was one of the chief supremacies of the Life Palace. Normally, he would not summon him unless there was something wrong. Now, not only did he summon him personally, but he also used the word ‘come quickly’, he was afraid that something urgent had happened.","“Shuang ‘er, Ruler Blood Wave is looking for me. You stay here for a while.” After greeting Leng Rushuang, Jian Wushuang did not dare to delay and rushed to Ruler Blood Wave.","Under the guidance of Ruler Blood Wave, Jian Wushuang soon arrived at a towering temple.","As soon as he entered the temple, Jian Wushuang’s pupils could not help shrinking.","The atmosphere was too heavy.","In the main hall, an old man with a rotten aura was sitting on the main seat. Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe were sitting on the vice seats of the old man with serious expressions on their faces.","Under the three of them, more than 20 special beings at the level of an Ultimate Ruler were sitting upright with ugly expressions on their faces."]},{"number":4136,"title":"Chapter 4136 Ruins","paragraphs":["4136 Ruins","In the Divine Hall.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re the only one left.” Ruler Blood Wave sized Jian Wushuang up and his eyes lit up. He could naturally tell that Jian Wushuang had reached the fourth-level Ruler realm.","This little guy’s breakthrough was really fast.","After looking away, Ruler Blood Wave knew that it was not the time to reminisce about the past. He suppressed what he wanted to say and introduced the elder sitting in the main seat. “Let me introduce you. This is Ruler Gai Fu.”","“Ruler Gai Fu, Ruler Blood Wave, and Supreme Giant Axe.” Jian Wushuang immediately bowed with respect in his eyes.","Among the three, Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe were the most powerful.","As for Ruler Gai Fu, he had heard that he was the oldest and most powerful Supreme-being among the five lead Rulers in the Life Palace.","“Take a seat.” Ruler Blood Wave waved his hand and glanced at all the special life forms at the Ruler level in the meeting hall, he said calmly, “There are many Ultimate Rulers in the Life Palace, but most of them have the battle strength above that of a Supreme Ultimate Ruler.”","Although Ruler Blood Wave’s words were calm, everyone present felt nervous.","Jian Wushuang was even more excited.","It was obvious that the people gathered by Ruler Gai Fu were all Supreme Ultimate Rulers. More than 20 of them were Supreme Ultimate Rulers, but he was only at the fourth level.","Logically speaking, he should not have been present at this gathering, but Ruler Blood Wave had specially summoned him.","“Since everyone is here, let’s get straight to the point.” Ruler Gai Fu’s eyes turned cloudy. “Ten thousand years ago, an ancient ruin was discovered in the stellar domain. All of you should have heard of it. Hundreds of chaos cycles ago, an unrivalled Ruler perished in that place. There were many fortunes left behind by that unrivalled Ruler.","“At the time, the Life Palace sent out a team to search for fortunes. However, not too long ago, something happened to one of our teams!”","“Something happened?” As soon as Ruler Gai Fu finished speaking, the many Omega Rulers in the meeting hall were all shocked. The entire hall instantly erupted into chaos.","“Didn’t they say that only cultivators below the Ruler level can enter the ancient ruin? And that there’s no danger there?”","“That’s right. The team sent by the Palace of gods to search for good fortune in the ancient ruins was led by Zhufeng King, who is virtually invincible amongst Omega Rulers. In any case, nothing should happen to him unless an Ruler appears.”","The many Omega Rulers present all frowned.","They all knew a thing or two about the ancient ruins. It was said that hundreds of chaos cycles ago, the place where the famous and invincible Ruler Tarot had fallen.","Most of them had heard of Ruler Tarot’s reputation. Back then, he had been quite famous and was one of the most powerful figures in the entire universe. He had personally established the Tarot Divine Kingdom, and it was one of the Rulers of the universe, in terms of power, the Tarot Divine Kingdom was much stronger than the many divine kingdoms in the current universe.","However, for some unknown reason, Ruler Tarot, who had been at the peak of his power, had offended a Supreme figure. Not only had he perished, even his own divine kingdom had been wiped out by someone.","An unrivalled Ruler and a divine kingdom...what sort of treasure was this?!","Even after hundreds of chaos cycles had passed, there had still been people who had not given up on searching for Ruler Tarot’s final resting place in the universe. Just thinking about it, Ruler Tarot’s status as an unrivalled Ruler could be imagined, he definitely had an astonishing amount of wealth. Other than that, he was also the Ruler of a divine kingdom!","Ruler Tarot held all of the resources of the divine kingdom in his hands.","No one knew if the resources of the divine kingdom had been buried alongside Ruler Tarot when the divine kingdom had been wiped out.","It could be said that this was an opportunity that even Rulers would be envious of.","Thus, ten thousand years ago, when the place where Ruler Tarot had perished appeared in the universe, countless people went crazy over it. The entire universe was in an uproar!","Quite a few Rulers and even unrivalled Rulers were alarmed. They all made their moves and rushed toward the ‘Tarot Ruins’.","However, to their disappointment, this ‘Tarot Ruins’ actually had an incomparably powerful restrictive spell planted within it that only cultivators below the Ruler level were allowed to enter. Any Ruler who entered.., would suffer an enormous backlash.","Even unrivalled Rulers were helpless against this restrictive spell. If they were forced to attack, the ancient ruins would be destroyed by itself.","As a result, the top powers of the universe had no choice but to send out their Supreme Rulers to enter the ruins and fight for the opportunity left behind by Ruler Tarot.","As one of the top powers in the universe, the Life Palace naturally wouldn’t fall behind. They sent out a squad that was made up entirely of Omega Rulers, led by the virtually invincible Zhufeng king.","Zhufeng King was a creation-level lifeform, and he had developed nearly 80% of his innate advantages. His divine power was over a thousand times stronger than that of ordinary cultivators, and he had a certain level of comprehension toward the principles of the universe. Without an Ruler coming out.., logically speaking, no one should be able to do anything to him.","“Not too long ago, the palace received a distress call from Zhufeng. However, before the palace could respond, Zhufeng’s message was cut off. Afterwards, the palace attempted to contact the other Rulers of the squad, but none of them responded. It seems that the squad has already met its end. Zhufeng is most likely dead,” Ruler Gai Fu said.","As soon as these words were spoken, the entire meeting hall was in an uproar.","The Ultimate Ruler squad was completely annihilated?","Even the Zhufeng King had fallen?","Huff huff huff huff.","Heavy breathing sounds could be heard from within the Divine Hall. At the start, these Ultimate Rulers had only treated the ruins as a piece of fat cake that they could plunder. But now, they could not help but feel a chill in their hearts.","Zhufeng King had died inside, and not a single one of the Ultimate Rulers present felt confident that they could defeat him.","Furthermore, at the level of an Ultimate Ruler, even if they could defeat him, killing him was a completely different matter.","Ruler Gai Fu took in the expressions of everyone in the meeting hall, but his expression did not change at all, he said calmly, “This matter regarding the Tarot Ruins is of great importance. The treasures and opportunities contained within are enough to attract the attention of any power in the universe. The Life Palace will never give up, which is why I plan to send a squad of Rulers from the palace into the ruins to find out what is going on with Zhufeng King and the others.”"]},{"number":4137,"title":"Chapter 4137 The Leader","paragraphs":["4137 The Leader","“Into the ruins?”","“This...”","As soon as Ruler Gai Fu finished speaking, the omega Rulers present all frowned, a hint of hesitation flashing across their faces.","If it had been before today, when Ruler Gai Fu asked them if they wanted to enter the ruins in search of good fortune, they would have been more than willing. However, the message Ruler Gai Fu had just sent was that even Zhufeng King had died inside, this caused everyone to ponder this question.","After all, how powerful was Zhufeng?","He was one of the most powerful figures amongst the Omega Rulers. He was virtually invincible, and even he had died in the ruins. The Omega Rulers present all knew that if they encountered the same sort of danger, their chances of surviving would be even lower than Zhufeng’s, the chances of surviving would be even lower than Zhufeng’s.","A few of the weaker Omega Rulers immediately lowered their heads, afraid that Ruler Gai Fu would take a fancy to them and send them into the ruins.","“Ruler Blood Wave, I’ll leave the selection of the candidates to you. I have other matters to attend to, so I’ll take my leave.” Ruler Gai Fu glanced at Ruler Blood Wave, whoosh. His body flashed as he left the temple.","“Understood.”","Ruler Blood Wave nodded, then swept his gaze past the other Rulers in the meeting hall. He secretly shook his head.","He naturally knew what these people were thinking. However, he had no intention of choosing the weaker Omega Rulers from the very beginning.","He already had a candidate in mind for those who would enter the Tarot Ruins.","“Ruler Violet Eye.”","“Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves.”","“Marquis Qingfeng.”","...","Ruler Blood Wave called out five names in succession before he came to a halt.","These five people were all extremely powerful amongst the apex Omega Rulers.","The Ruler Violet Eye and Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves had both comprehended a hint of the principles of the universe. They were the most Supreme of the Supreme Rulers, and were not much weaker than Zhufeng.","The other three were all extremely powerful as well.","“Are the five of you willing to go to the Tarot Ruins in search of good fortune and investigate the death of Zhufeng’s squad?” Ruler Blood Wave asked.","The five who had been called by Ruler Blood Wave looked at each other, then frowned.","“Ruler Blood Wave.” The Ruler Violet Eye had a pair of bizarre violet eyes, in a low voice, he said, “It shouldn’t be a problem for us to go to the primordial ruinworld. However, the Zhufeng’s squad met with some mishaps within the ruinworld. Our squad might not be any weaker than the Zhufeng’s squad, but none of us are a match for him in terms of personal strength. It wouldn’t be appropriate for us to go to the ruinworld as a squad.”","“You are right. Even Zhufeng’s squad met with misfortune. If it was just the five of you, it wouldn’t have been enough. That’s why I’ve already chosen a leader for you.”Ruler Blood Wave smiled calmly. “Nine tribulation!”","Whoosh!","A figure suddenly appeared in the center of the temple. It was the white-haired youth, Ninth Kalpa King.","Upon seeing Ninth Kalpa King, the eyes of Ruler Violet Eye and the others, who had been worried for a moment, immediately lit up.","Ninth Kalpa King was the most powerful Ruler of the Life Palace. In fact, it was not an exaggeration to say that he was the most powerful Ruler of the entire universe.","He was capable of fighting against an Ruler head-on. If no Ruler appeared within the ancient ruins, who would be a match for Ninth Kalpa King?","If Ninth Kalpa King was the leader of this squad, the risk would be much lower.","“Ninth Kalpa King.”","Ruler Blood Wave looked down at the Ninth Kalpa King. “You will be the leader of this team.”","“Yes!” The Ninth Kalpa King took a step forward, a look of uncontrollable delight on his face.","Ten thousand years ago, he had wanted to go to the Tarot Ruins as soon as they had emerged. However, he had a heavy burden on his shoulders at the time, which was why he had let Zhufeng take the lead and head to the Tarot Ruins.","Now that Zhufeng King was dead, the Life Palace needed to send another squad to the Tarot Ruins. He had been eyeing the squad for a long time, and even if Ruler Blood Wave hadn’t mentioned it, he would have volunteered to go, they were going to the Tarot Ruins.","Ruler Blood Wave nodded, then turned to look at the other Omega Rulers in the meeting hall.","“We are willing!” Ruler Violet Eye and the others, who had been called by their names, cupped their hands.","Ruler Blood Wave nodded in satisfaction. The weakest of the five, including the Ninth Kalpa King, was at the peak of the Omega Ruler level of power. There were also nearly invincible Omega Rulers like Ruler Violet Eye and Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, as for the Ninth Kalpa King, he was a Ruler with perfect combat power. Even if they were not able to find the treasures within the ancient ruins, they should be able to escape unscathed.","“Well, the six of you go back and get ready. We’ll set off for the Tarot Ruins in three months!” Ruler Blood Wave ordered.","“Yes!” Ninth Kalpa King and the others answered.","“All right, except for Jian Wushuang, the rest of you can leave.” Ruler Blood Wave waved his hand, and the Ultimate Rulers dispersed.","When they walked out of the meeting hall, they could not help but look at Jian Wushuang, who had been specifically named by Ruler Blood Wave, and a strange look appeared on their faces.","As the Ultimate Rulers left, the meeting hall became quiet. Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe, who had been keeping a straight face, could not help smiling when they looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Little guy, you broke through to the fourth level of the Ruler realm in 3,000 years, which is faster than I expected,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a smile.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang immediately cupped his hands and said, “I have to thank Senior Blood Wave for his guidance. If Senior Blood Wave didn’t tell me about the Enlightenment River, I wouldn’t have broken through to the fourth level of the Ruler realm so quickly.”","“Haha, the Enlightenment River is not a secret in the Life Palace. You’ll know about it after you ask around. There’s no need to thank me,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a bright smile.","The three did not say anything more. Jian Wushuang asked, “Ruler Blood Wave, you must have asked me to stay here for the Tarot Ruins, right?”","As soon as he entered the meeting hall, Jian Wushuang had noticed that all the people present were Ultimate Rulers. However, Ruler Blood Wave had specially sent him a message to ask a fourth-level Ruler to come. Then, when the meeting was over...Ruler Blood Wave had specifically asked him to stay. Naturally, it was not just to chat with him, but because it was related to the Tarot Ruins.","“Yes.” Ruler Blood Wave nodded, he said, “It is indeed related to the Tarot Ruins. As you know, the ancient ruins and the one left by an invincible Supreme-being contain countless opportunities and fortunes. Many of them will be incredibly useful to you, who is only at the level of a Ruler.”"]},{"number":4138,"title":"Chapter 4138 Superior-Grade Principle Supreme Treasure Armor","paragraphs":["4138 Superior-Grade Principle Supreme Treasure Armor","“Jian Wushuang, I’ve discussed with Giant Axe. I’ll ask them to take you with them when they go to the ancient ruins. Even if you don’t get too many opportunities there, you’ll still gain a lot of experience.”","“After all, there are a lot of powerful Rulers in the ancient ruins. There are even a lot of superior and invincible Ultimate Rulers,” said Ruler Blood Wave with a smile.","“You want me to go?” Jian Wushuang frowned, then he said, “I’d like to go if I can. But the weakest one in the ancient ruins is a superior Ultimate Ruler, and I’m only a fourth-level Ruler. Will I...”","“Are you worried that you’ll hold them back?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at him with interest. “Jian Wushuang, if I’m not wrong, your current strength is not much weaker than a superior Ultimate Ruler, right?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned, and a strange smile appeared on his face.","“I’ve already discussed it with Giant Axe. You were only a third-level Ruler, but because your divine power is 8,000 times stronger than that of an ordinary cultivator, and because of the power of your will given by the universe principle, your strength is no weaker than that of an ordinary Ultimate Ruler, and your comprehension of the universe principle far exceeds that of a Ruler. In addition to your innate divine power, your battle strength shouldn’t be weaker than that of a superior Ultimate Ruler.”","“Now, you have reached the fourth level. With 8,000 times your divine power, you are comparable to an ordinary Ultimate Ruler. With the power of your will, you are no weaker than a Supreme Ultimate Ruler. With your high comprehension of the principles of the universe, I estimate that you are much stronger than an ordinary Supreme Ultimate Ruler. Perhaps you are no weaker than Ruler purple eye or emperor thousand leaves. Am I right?” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile.","Jian Wushuang could not help but smile bitterly.","As expected, after he fought with Ninth Kalpa King in the trial field and revealed some of his skills, it was easy for Ruler Blood Wave to determine his current strength.","Indeed, although he was only a fourth-level Ruler, as Ruler Blood Wave said, he was much stronger than ordinary Supreme Rulers in terms of real combat strength.","And that was only what he knew. Jian Wushuang still had some tricks that he had not used in the battle in the trial field. For example, he had only used one of his three innate divine abilities.","He had not used the dragon-exterminating secret skill either.","In short, his current combat strength was very strong!","At least at the level of a Ruler, he was very, very strong.","In addition, his 68,000-mile-tall Divine Body could store endless divine power. As long as the Supreme-being did not come out, he was not afraid of anyone.","With such strength, it was naturally impossible for Jian Wushuang to hold back the team of Ninth Kalpa King.","The Tarot Ruins contained great opportunities, and a large number of top Rulers in the universe were gathered there. Jian Wushuang indeed had a trace of desire for the Tarot Ruins.","He did want to explore it and gain experience. It would be even better if he could get some opportunities or good fortune.","“I’d like to go with them, but I don’t know if they will accept me,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“You don’t have to worry about that. After all, you’ll have a chance to fight in the Tarot Ruins. You can prove it to them then,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a smile.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Ruler Blood Wave flipped his right hand, and a dark black armor appeared in it.","The armor exuded an extremely rich aura of principles. It was an upper-grade principle treasure!","“Jian Wushuang, I gave you this armor.” Ruler Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang, he said, “Although this armor is only an upper-grade principle treasure, it’s not very precious. However, I left a divine power mark on the armor. This divine power mark was deliberately left by me according to the restriction of the power of the array in the Tarot Ruins.”","“The Tarot Ruins is filled with many opportunities, but it is also filled with great danger. Even Zhufeng’s team met with some mishaps. This time, the more powerful Ninth Kalpa King will lead the team, but there is no guarantee of success.","“Thus, if you encounter any dangers within the Tarot Ruins, you can immediately activate this mark of divine power. It will allow you to unleash the maximum power you can unleash within the Tarot Ruins.","“This is the Ultimate power of a Ruler. If nothing goes wrong, it should be stronger than the strongest attack of the Ninth Kalpa King. You can use it to save your life or to kill your enemy,”Ruler Blood Wave said.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed when he heard this.","The armor itself was a superior-grade principle Supreme treasure, and it was infused with the divine power mark left by Ruler Blood Wave himself, it could unleash the Ultimate power of the relic in the Tarot Ruins...this armor was of extraordinary value.","“Senior Blood Wave...” Jian Wushuang looked at Ruler Blood Wave.","“Take it. I personally led you to the Life Palace. I even gave you a medium-grade principle divine fruit as a welcome gift with my Giant Axe. Naturally, I can’t be stingy,” Ruler Blood Wave said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and put the armor into his interspatial ring.","“In three months, you will go to the Tarot Ruins with Ninth Kalpa King and the others. During these three months, you can refine the armor first,” Ruler Blood Wave said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and quickly left the temple.","...","In the manor of Jian Wushuang in the sixth mountain range.","Jian Wushuang told Leng Rushuang about his trip to the Tarot vestige in three months.","When Leng Rushuang heard this, a trace of worry immediately rose in her heart. “Husband, the Tarot vestige gathered a group of the top Rulers in the universe. Even a team led by an almost invincible Ruler like Zhufeng King was killed in there, and you are only a fourth-level Ruler...”","Before Leng Rushuang could finish her words, Jian Wushuang waved his hand, he smiled and said, “Don’t worry. With my strength, I may not be the best in the Tarot Ruins, but if it’s just to save my life, I don’t think many people will remember me.”","Jian Wushuang was absolutely confident in his life-saving skills.","The boundless divine power contained in his 68,000-mile-tall Divine Body alone was enough to make any cultivator below the Supreme-being level despair.","Not to mention, he also had a life-saving talent, as well as the superior-grade principle Supreme treasure armor given to him by Ruler Blood Wave.","“In three months, I’ll first refine this principle Supreme treasure armor. Only then will I be able to truly ensure my safety in the Tarot Ruins.” Jian Wushuang immediately began refining the armor."]},{"number":4139,"title":"Chapter 4139 The Seventh Person","paragraphs":["4139 The Seventh Person","Time flew by in a flash.","In the blink of an eye, three months had passed.","In front of a gigantic cosmic passageway in the Life Palace, Ninth Kalpa King, Ruler Violet Eye, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, and the other three were already waiting.","“Ruler Blood Wave sent us a message earlier. He said that apart from the six of us, there will be another person joining our team for this trip to the Tarot Ruins. Can you guess who that person is?” Ruler Violet Eye was dressed in flowing clouds and black clothes, he wore a violet-gold crown, and his eyes flickered with violet light as he smiled in curiosity.","“There are quite a few Supreme overlords who have reached the peak of power within the Life Palace. However, they are quite powerful, and they should be able to spare some of their forces for the time being. As for the seventh person, as long as he doesn’t slow us down, that should be enough.” The handsome Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves said coldly.","“It’s hard to say...” Marquis Qingfeng said.","The Ruler Violet Eye and the others were chatting casually. Clearly, they did not have a good impression of this seventh person who had suddenly cut in.","Of the six, only the white-haired Ninth Kalpa King did not participate in the discussion. He stood there calmly with his hands behind his back. There was not any emotion on his face.","For him, it did not matter if there was one more person in this trial squad or one less person. It would not affect him at all.","He was the only one in his eyes after entering the Tarot Ruins.","As for the others, such as the Ruler Violet Eye and Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, he, Ninth Kalpa King, did not even bother to look at them.","Shoo!","Just as everyone was discussing, a stream of light suddenly swept over from the horizon at an extremely fast speed.","At the beginning, the stream of light was just a tiny black dot on the horizon. A few seconds later, the stream of light continued to enlarge and stood in front of them.","“It’s coming!” Everyone looked up and focused.","The streamer dispersed and revealed a cold-looking black-clothed figure.","“Jian Wushuang?”","“It’s him?”","“The seventh person is Jian Wushuang? Isn’t he a fourth-level Ruler? Why is he here?”","The Ruler Violet Eye and the others looked at each other with a hint of surprise on their faces. However, after they exchanged a glance, they all smiled at Jian Wushuang in a friendly manner.","They were all excellent Ultimate Rulers, so no one was a fool. Jian Wushuang’s talent and potential were right in front of them. He was someone who could fight with Ninth Kalpa King in the trial field and win, compared with Ninth Kalpa King, he was only inferior to him in realm.","Unsurprisingly, Jian Wushuang would be at least at the level of Ninth Kalpa King, an invincible existence among Rulers, even if he was not a Supreme-being.","The Ruler Violet Eye and the others naturally did not want to ridicule such a genius who could be expected in the future.","“Jian Wushuang, I didn’t expect that the seventh person would be you. Why are you here, a fourth-level Ruler?” Ninth Kalpa King, who had not spoken for a long time, narrowed his eyes at Jian Wushuang and sneered.","“Ninth Kalpa King.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold, and his expression was indifferent. “You don’t have to worry about me.”","Hearing this, Ninth Kalpa King raised his eyebrows and sneered even more. “I’m the leader of this team. You’d better listen to my orders during this period of time. Otherwise, if something happens, don’t blame me for not helping you!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang sneered and did not comment.","Seeing this, the other five Rulers could not help shaking their heads with a bitter smile.","They all knew what had happened between Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King. Obviously, both Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang were proud people, so they were not surprised by this scene.","“Gentlemen, we are a small team going to explore the Archean ruins, and there are many dangers hidden in the Archean ruins. I think you should be more amiable.” Ruler Violet Eye tried to smooth things over.","“Humph.” Ninth Kalpa King snorted and did not say much.","“Since everyone is here, let’s go.”","Immediately, the universe passage opened, and the seven people entered the universe passage.","Through the universe passage, although they could not directly reach the great solar Star Field where Tarot Ruins was located, they could still save a lot of time.","In the vast and boundless universe, numerous milky ways stretched across the sky, and stars dotted the sky, forming a brilliant sea of stars. A huge black universe boat was like a shooting star, rapidly gliding through the starry sky, it left behind a long trail of flames.","The place where Tarot Ruins appeared was located in a corner in the depths of the universe. Even though a large amount of time had been saved through the universe passageway and they were riding on a universe boat of a higher grade, they still had to travel through the universe void space, they still had to travel for more than 1,000 years.","“The next star domain is the star Sun Great Star Domain. We only need to travel for another 100 years to reach Tarot Ruins.” In the universe boat, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves looked at the Resplendent Sea of stars in front of him, he said excitedly.","They had spent nearly a thousand years in the universe boat, and they had been facing a desolate universe all day long. They had long become impatient. Now that the Tarot Ruins was right in front of them, they could not help but feel excited.","Ruler Violet Eye said with a smile, “Speaking of which, the star Sun Great Star Domain is located in one of the many great star domains in the depths of the universe. Although it is a little remote, it is still quite prosperous. The Ruler of the star Sun Great Star Domain has already broken through and reached the Ruler level. If this Ruler of the star Sun Great Star Domain knew how to manage things, he would be able to stand firmly in the depths of the universe for at most ten chaos cycles. Unfortunately, the Tarot Ruins was born in the star Sun Great Star Domain.”","“Furthermore, after Ruler eternal Yang discovered the Tarot Ruins, he wanted to take it all for himself. Didn’t he think that he was just an ordinary Ruler? How could he take it all for himself? In the end, he brought him a huge disaster. Not only was he killed, even the various factions and sects in the Star Solar System were wiped out. Now, other than the Tarot Ruins, the entire star solar system is no different from desolate star.”","Everyone was talking among themselves. They were excited about the arrival of the Tarot Ruins.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in a corner and slowly opened his eyes.","In the past thousand years, he had completely refined and mastered the principle armor given to him by Ruler Blood Wave. He had also adjusted all aspects of his body to the peak and completely stabilized himself at the fourth level of the Ruler realm, his strength had more or less improved.","After 100 years, the universe boat that Jian Wushuang and the others were on had arrived in the Star Field and was heading toward the Tarot Ruins.","During the 100 years, universe boats from other places had rushed over and made the starry sky extremely bright."]},{"number":4140,"title":"Chapter 4140 Arrived","paragraphs":["4140 Arrived","“The people in that universe boat are from the Great Sun Godly nation. Are they here as well?”","“That’s the universe boat of the Great Void Godly Palace. Tsk, tsk. I heard that the Great Void Godly sect recently produced an extremely powerful Ultimate Ruler. I wonder if that Ultimate Ruler is here this time.”","“Yes, that belongs to the people of Blood Sky Palace, right? The people of Blood Sky Palace have always been elusive. I have not heard of their traces for so many years. I did not expect that they would send a Ruler to Tarot Ruins this time around.”","“It has only been over 10,000 years since Tarot Ruins was discovered. It is said that less than 10 percent of this ruin has been developed so far. All the powers in the universe, regardless of how strong or weak they are, are extremely eager for this Tarot Ruins. They know that it is dangerous inside, and there are many great beings from the powers participating in it. However, they are still sending people over one after another.”","The Ruler Violet Eye and the others shook their heads and discussed as they watched the starry sky streak past the giant universe boats through the Mystic Light Mirror of the universe boat.","Each of them held a sheepskin scroll in their hands, which recorded the basic information of the Tarot Ruins.","Jian Wushuang also had a sheepskin scroll, which was given to them by Ruler Blood Wave. The contents of the sheepskin scroll were the information that Zhufeng King’s team had sent back when they were exploring the Tarot Ruins.","According to the intelligence, the Tarot Ruins should have been a huge secret realm created by Ruler Blood Wave before his death. It was vast and boundless, and Zhufeng King and the others guessed that there should be more than one level of the secret realm.","However, they did not know how many levels there were in the secret realm.","In any case, he had been circling around the first level for the past 10,000 years.","“More than one level?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","He remembered that when he entered the Red Cloud Secret Land, there were three levels, and he had obtained a great opportunity in the Red Cloud Secret Land.","At the end of the sheepskin scroll, it was mentioned that Zhufeng King and the others seemed to have found the entrance to the second level of the Tarot vestige and were trying to find a way to enter the second level.","However, at this moment, the team of Zhufeng King encountered a crisis and was completely annihilated.","“What happened to Zhufeng King in the Tarot Vestige? Was he killed by the overlords of other forces, or was there a danger or danger in the second floor?” Jian Wushuang closed the scroll and frowned slightly.","If the former could kill Zhufeng King and annihilate the team of Zhufeng King, then the other party must be very powerful.","But if the latter was the case, it meant that not only were there all the opportunities, but there was also a great danger hidden in the Tarot vestige.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and stopped thinking about it.","Soon, the seven of them arrived at the entrance of the Tarot vestige.","The star-sun Star Field was barren, but the entrance of the Tarot vestige was quite prosperous.","The major forces set up camp outside the Tarot vestige. Some restaurants, elixir pavilions, and trade markets were established. Jian Wushuang even saw the Nine Emperor Pavilion outside the Tarot vestige.","“Let’s go.” Ninth Kalpa King led Jian Wushuang and the others out of the universe boat. He waved his hand and put the universe boat away.","The moment Jian Wushuang and the others walked out of the universe boat, countless eyes immediately looked at them.","Most of them were focused on Ninth Kalpa King.","“It’s the Rulers of the Life Palace. The leader is...Ninth Kalpa King?”","“Ninth Kalpa King? He’s actually here!”","“Apparently, this Ninth Kalpa King is a legendary perfect being who has remained at the Omega Ruler level for dozens of chaos cycles. His combat power is comparable to that of Rulers, and there are quite a few omega Rulers in the Life Palace. However, this Ninth Kalpa King is undoubtedly the most powerful of them all. Why would the Life Palace send him out for the sake of the Tarot Ruins?”","Many of the Rulers in the crowd looked at the Ninth Kalpa King with a hint of fear in their eyes.","There was nothing they could do. The Ninth Kalpa King’s fame in the universe was simply too great.","Just his legendary status as a perfect being was enough to draw attention to him.","In addition, he had been an Omega Ruler for dozens of chaos cycles, and even his comprehension of the principles of the universe was extremely high. No one present dared to underestimate an omega Ruler like him.","Compared to the Ninth Kalpa King, the other six were clearly overshadowed by the Ninth Kalpa King.","In fact, the Ruler Violet Eye and Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves were nearly invincible amongst the Ultimate Rulers. They were the best amongst the many Ultimate Rulers present, and they were quite famous as well, unfortunately, the surrounding people only paid attention to the Ninth Kalpa King. Few cared about them.","“Thousand leaves, did you see that? They are all talking about the Ninth Kalpa King,” said the Ruler Violet Eye with a faint smile.","“In terms of strength, the Ninth Kalpa King is indeed much stronger than the two of us. But no matter what, the two of us should not be completely ignored,” said Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves coldly.","“It’s probably because there are too many Ultimate Rulers coming from the Tarot Ruins. Many of the best ones have come as well. The two of us aren’t as eye-catching as the Ninth Kalpa King, right?” Said the Ruler Violet Eye with a smile.","Indeed, the appearance of the Tarot Ruins had attracted too many Ultimate Rulers. Various factions in the universe had sent Ultimate Rulers over, and there was no lack of peak existences among them.","There were many nearly invincible Ultimate Rulers like Ruler Purple Eye and Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves in the Tarot Ruins, so naturally, there were fewer people paying attention to them.","But Ninth Kalpa King was different. He was at least one of the top three Ultimate Rulers in the vast universe.","Naturally, more people paid attention to him.","Suddenly...a figure appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and the others without any warning.","“Ninth Kalpa King, long time no see.” A cold voice sounded.","Everyone looked over and saw a black-robed young man with an aquiline nose staring coldly at the Ninth Kalpa King.","“Silver Roc, it’s you?”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s pupils constricted and he laughed coldly, “Silver Roc, three million years ago, you luckily escaped from me. I was worried that I wouldn’t be able to find you, but now you actually dare to appear in front of me?”","A cold light flashed through the hawk-nosed man called Silver Roc’s eyes, he said coldly, “Ninth Kalpa King, you also know that it was three million years ago?","“Three million years is enough to do many things. Since you’ve come to the Tarot Ruins this time, then the grudge between us should be resolved in the ruins.”","“I’ll accompany you at any time.” The Ninth Kalpa King laughed coldly, not afraid at all.","What a joke. With his strength, who could make him respect a Ruler?","The hawk-nosed man turned his gaze to the Ruler Violet Eye and the others. He swept his gaze past them, his cold gaze causing their hearts to tremble.","Suddenly, his gaze froze."]},{"number":4141,"title":"Chapter 4141 Those Who Seek Death","paragraphs":["4141 Those Who Seek Death","“Am I seeing things? There’s actually a fourth-level Ruler among your people?” The hooked-nosed man raised an eyebrow, then began to laugh, “Haha! Is there no one left in the Life Palace? They actually sent a fourth-level Ruler to join in the fun? Are they here to be cannon fodder?”","His loud laughter attracted the attention of many experts.","“Fourth-level Ruler?”","“Mm, that’s true.”","“The Tarot Ruins are filled with Ultimate Rulers. There are even many peak existences amongst them. Why would a fourth-level Ruler like him come here?”","“A fourth-level Ruler wants to enter the Tarot Ruins? Is he courting death?”","Many experts began to laugh at him.","It was normal that the Tarot vestige attracted too many experts.","Even an ordinary Ultimate Ruler would not be looked at in the Tarot vestige.","As for a fourth-level Ruler, no one would be interested in him.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes when he sensed the strange gazes around him, but he did not say anything.","“Ninth Kalpa King, I sympathize with you. You were not well-liked in the Life Palace because you had not been able to break through to become a Supreme-being. Now that you have the chance to come to the Tarot Ruins, you have to bring a burden with you. Hahaha!” The hooked-nosed man laughed willfully.","“Silver Roc, if you are itching for a fight now, I don’t mind fighting with you here.” Ninth Kalpa King looked at the hooked-nosed man coldly.","“Let’s wait for the battle inside the relic.” The hooked-nosed man laughed dryly. Without further ado, he turned and left.","The Rulers from the various factions around them also looked away.","“Ninth Kalpa King, it looks like we have already been targeted before we even entered the Tarot Relic,” said Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves in a deep voice.","“Hmph, he’s just a defeated opponent. Three hundred years ago, he narrowly escaped death in front of me. This time, if he dares to come knocking on our door again, I’ll just kill him,” said Ninth Kalpa King.","“I hope so,” said Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves with a cold smile.","He knew about the hawk-nosed man, Ruler Silver Roc.","In terms of fame, Ruler Silver Roc was indeed not as famous as Ninth Kalpa King in the universe. However, he was definitely not weak. In particular, his comprehension of the universe principles was said to have reached an extremely high level, with the addition of some special secret techniques, Ruler Silver Roc was definitely ranked in the top 20 among the countless Ultimate Rulers in the vast universe. He was an extremely difficult Ultimate Ruler to deal with.","If it was a one-on-one battle, neither Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves nor Ruler Violet Eye would necessarily be a match for Ruler Silver Roc.","They had yet to enter the Tarot Ruins, but they had already been targeted by such a powerful Ruler. This was naturally not a good thing for their team.","“Alright, cut the crap. Prepare to enter the Tarot Ruins,” Ninth Kalpa King said.","The group of seven had already arrived at the entrance of the Tarot Ruins.","In the void, a vertical bronze door pressed across the starry sky. The huge door had the words ‘Tarot’ engraved on it. Other than that, there were also countless mysterious inscriptions on the side of the huge door, emitting an ancient aura.","This was the entrance of the Tarot Ruins.","One only needed to step through the huge bronze door to enter the Tarot Ruins.","“The six of you stay in the vestige and follow me. Otherwise, if you get into trouble, I won’t have the time to save you. Do you understand?","“Especially you, Jian Wushuang.” Just as they were about to enter the vestige, Ninth Kalpa King, who was walking at the front, put his hands behind his back and said with a cold face, “I’ll go in.”","Jian Wushuang nodded expressionlessly in response to Ninth Kalpa King’s warning. However, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the others did not seem to take it seriously.","“Zi Tong, we are both outstanding experts among the Ultimate Rulers. Is there a need to let Ninth Kalpa King protect us? What has his attitude toward us been all this while?”","“Humph, let’s not talk about whether we will encounter any trouble in the Tarot Ruins. Even if we do, just the two of us working together should be enough to settle it. Why does he need to be Ninth Kalpa King?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves sent a message to Ruler Violet Eye, it was obvious that there was something amiss.","“Thousand leaf, cut it out. Don’t you know about the Ninth Kalpa King?” He had always been arrogant and did not take us seriously in the Life Palace. It was normal for him to speak a little harshly now. After all, he is stronger than us. Just let him be,” said the Ruler Violet Eye with a smile, however, there was a strange feeling in his tone for some reason.","“Haha, you were defeated by a third-level Ruler in the trial ground. How can you not be strong?”","The two looked at each other and smiled in tacit understanding. They did not say anything else.","A moment later, under the lead of the Ninth Kalpa King, a group of seven people stepped through the bronze door of the Tarot Ruins.","The seven people first passed through a pitch-black void before their eyes lit up. Then, they saw that they had landed in a vast plain.","“This is the Tarot Ruins?”","“It is indeed huge. I have clearly released all my soul power and the range of coverage is quite vast. However, there isn’t a single person within the range of my soul coverage,” said Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves.","There should be Rulers everywhere in the Tarot Ruins. Furthermore, the branches should be quite dense.","An Ultimate Ruler’s soul coverage area was naturally very vast. However, no one was found in the soul coverage area of emperor thousand leaves. This meant that the Tarot vestige was indeed very vast.","“Tsk, tsk, the spiritual Qi here is also quite dense. If you cultivate here, one day of cultivation is equivalent to three days of cultivation in the outside world,” the Ruler Violet Eye said with a smile.","The other members of the team were also observing their surroundings.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, raised his eyebrows as soon as he stepped into the Tarot vestige.","“This place...is rich in the universe origin of Sword Principle.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He could sense that the buildings, mountains, and rivers in the Tarot vestige must have been created by Supreme Tarot with a single sword strike. Every mountain in the Tarot vestige was extremely smooth, it was as if it had been cut by someone with one sword strike.","He could not help but exclaim in amazement. Supreme Emperor Tarot was so powerful that he could create his own world with one sword strike.","“Jian Wushuang, among the seven of us, the Tarot vestige should have the greatest opportunity for you,” Divine Marquis Qingfeng, who was walking beside Jian Wushuang, suddenly said with a smile.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows, looked at Divine Marquis Qingfeng and asked, “Divine Marquis, what do you mean?”","“Jian Wushuang, you may not know this, but Supreme Emperor Tarot used to be a Supreme-being at the top level, but there is still a slight gap between him and invincible Supreme-being,” Divine Marquis Qingfeng explained with a smile."]},{"number":4142,"title":"Chapter 4142 Tarot Divine Sword","paragraphs":["4142 Tarot Divine Sword","“The reason why Supreme Tarot became an invincible Supreme-being and became so famous in the vast universe is largely because of the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand!” Divine Marquis Qingfeng said.","“Tarot Divine Sword?”","Jian Wushuang was curious. He did not know much about Ruler Tarot other than that he was an invincible Ruler-level universe overlord.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng nodded, he replied, “No one has been more talented in sword principle than Ruler Tarot. In the universe at that time, there were many Supreme experts who died under his sword.","“Even after hundreds of chaos cycles, countless sword principle experts have emerged in the universe, but under the illumination of Supreme Emperor Tarot, they all seem to be overshadowed. No one can be called the ‘Supreme Ruler of Sword Principle’ anymore.","“And the Divine Sword of Tarot is the help of Supreme Emperor Tarot’s illustrious name in the universe. It can be said that without the divine sword of Tarot, there would be no Supreme Emperor Tarot. Of course, without Supreme Emperor Tarot, there would naturally be no famous divine sword of Tarot. The two have achieved each other.”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded thoughtfully and asked, “Divine Marquis Qingfeng, what about the Tarot Divine Sword?”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng pondered for a moment, he replied, “I don’t know. Some people say that the Tarot Divine Sword was buried in the ruins with Supreme Tarot’s death. Others say that the person who killed Supreme Tarot took it away.","“Anyway, there have been all kinds of theories over the past 10,000 years, but they are basically not believable.”","After saying that, Divine Marquis Qingfeng patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder, he smiled and said, “Jian Wushuang, you don’t have to think about the divine sword. Even if you are really lucky and found the divine sword, it’s not something a fourth-level Ruler like you can have.”","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang smiled at him. It was just as Divine Marquis Qingfeng had said. Even if he got the Tarot Divine Sword, he would be hunted down by the entire universe before he could warm up, by then, he would not only be at the Ruler level, but even the Supreme experts would be tempted and desperately want to get the Tarot Divine Sword.","“Well, let’s go. It’s too far away to talk about this.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng smiled, he said, “Although I haven’t heard of any great danger hidden in the Tarot Ruins yet, the absence of principles is actually the greatest danger.","“As long as you obtain any treasure, you will most likely be attacked by a group of people. I heard that over the past ten thousand years, many powerful Ultimate Rulers have been killed in the ruins.”","“Although Ninth Kalpa King is arrogant, he doesn’t have any bad intentions. Moreover, his battle strength is extremely terrifying. We just need to follow him closely. If we are lucky enough to get lucky in the ruins, we will be able to escape unscathed.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Although he did not have a good impression of Ninth Kalpa King, he had to admit that Ninth Kalpa King was indeed the most powerful among the seven of them.","The seven of them talked as they walked. Although they did not travel on purpose, their speed was not slow. Soon, they passed through the plain and arrived at a group of palaces.","Seeing this, a flash of excitement appeared in the eyes of Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the others. They were about to search for something, Ninth Kalpa King said coldly, “This group of palaces is so conspicuous. People have been coming and going for more than 10,000 years. Needless to say, they have been searched thoroughly. What else can you find apart from wasting time?”","Hearing that, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves was furious. He snorted and said, “Ninth Kalpa King, since you are the leader of our team, what plans do you have?”","Ninth Kalpa King looked at him and said, “This time, we have three purposes.”","“First, we need to find the entrance of the second floor that Zhufeng King mentioned. This is the most important purpose of our trip to the Tarot Ruins. If I am right, it should be a space enchantment, and the place should be extremely hidden. Otherwise, it would be impossible for only Zhufeng King and the others to find it in these ten thousand years. Therefore, we only need to avoid the crowded place and look in a remote direction.”","“The second reason is to investigate the cause of Zhufeng King’s death. Along the way, I have thought about it carefully. There are only two reasons for Zhufeng King’s death. Either there are some terrifying restrictions at the entrance of the second level, which caused Zhufeng King’s entire team to be annihilated in an instant. He didn’t even have time to send out the information. Or...he was targeted by someone and killed to silence him!”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone could not help but feel a chill in their hearts. The strength of the Zhufeng King’s team was obvious. If they wanted their team to be completely annihilated, and they did not even have the time to spread the news, then what kind of person was the one who made the move?","Hence, these two guesses made everyone believe the former one more.","The Ninth Kalpa King ignored everyone’s expressions, he continued, “Furthermore, investigating the cause of death of Zhufeng King and Company does not conflict with the first point. As long as we can find the cause of death of Zhufeng King and Company, we should be able to obtain information on the second level of Tarot Ruins. As for the third point, it is to search for the opportunities in the ruins.”","“However, this Tarot Ruins is vast. Although various factions in the universe have been searching here for more than 10,000 years, they have not found many opportunities. In other words, a large number of opportunities are still buried in the ruins. We do not need to be too anxious. Finding the cause of death of Zhufeng King and company and finding the entrance to the second level of Tarot Ruins is the most urgent matter. Therefore, I advise everyone to give up on the idea of searching for opportunities.”","With that said, Ninth Kalpa King glanced at Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, unintentionally or unintentionally.","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ expression immediately turned ugly.","Ninth Kalpa King had said that in front of everyone in the team, yet he was looking at him with such a gaze. The meaning was too obvious.","It looked like he was trying to persuade everyone, but in fact, he was warning him.","“Ninth Kalpa King, what do you mean?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s voice turned cold.","“You know what I mean.” Ninth Kalpa King glanced at him indifferently.","“You!”","Monarch thousand leaf was about to get angry, but he was stopped by the Ruler Violet Eye. The Ruler Violet Eye shook his head slightly, indicating that he should not act impulsively.","Seeing this, monarch thousand leaf snorted coldly and turned his head away. He did not want to look at Ninth Kalpa King anymore.","Among the seven people, Jian Wushuang was like an old monk meditating. His expression did not change much.","Ninth Kalpa King’s speculation was similar to his.","Although he also wanted to obtain the opportunities in the Tarot Ruins, he did not force it.","After all, opportunities and opportunities were about the word ‘fate’. It was impossible to force it.","Moreover, if an extraordinary treasure really appeared in the Tarot Ruins, it would cause a sensation. There was no need for them to take the initiative to look for it."]},{"number":4143,"title":"Chapter 4143 Conflict!","paragraphs":["4143 Conflict!","Time passed. In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and the other three had been in the Tarot vestige for ten years.","There were many Rulers in the Tarot vestige. Because there were no principles, there were frequent fights. Even if there was no enmity between them, they might fight each other because they coveted the treasures on each other’s bodies.","Jian Wushuang and the others had seen such fights many times in the past ten years. However, during these ten years, no ignorant Rulers dared to provoke them.","After all, their seven-man team was very strong, especially with Ninth Kalpa King in charge. His existence alone was enough to make most of the Rulers’ teams in the Tarot vestige not dare to attack them.","During the past ten years, Jian Wushuang and the others spent most of their time asking around for information about Zhufeng King.","Zhufeng King was an almost invincible existence among the Ultimate Rulers. He was famous and knew many people. It was easy for Jian Wushuang and the others to ask around.","In the past ten years, they had received some information.","However, the news made them look a little strange.","According to the Rulers in the Tarot Ruins, the team led by Zhufeng King had caused a great storm in the Tarot Ruins 3,000 years ago. However, the team had disappeared 3,000 years ago, it was as if they had disappeared from the world.","Disappeared 3,000 years ago?","It would have been fine if only one person had said that. The key was that they had asked many Rulers along the way and received the same answer.","Jian Wushuang and the others could not help but ponder.","Zhufeng King had asked for help from the Life Palace a thousand years ago.","Only three months after he had asked for help, they had set off from the Life Palace and traveled to the Tarot Ruins.","Where did they go in the next 2,000 years?","During those 2,000 years, they kept in contact with the divine Life Palace, but the divine Life Palace did not receive any news from them.","Only the last message for help...what was going on?","Jian Wushuang and the others could not figure it out for the time being.","In addition, during the past ten years, something had happened in the seven-man team. The conflict between Emperor thousand leaves and Ninth Kalpa King had worsened rapidly, and it was starting to smell of gunpowder.","Ninth Kalpa King was proud and arrogant.","He did not think much of many Rulers. Even though emperor thousand leaves and Ruler Purple Eye were almost invincible among Rulers, they were still nothing in the eyes of Ninth Kalpa King.","However, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye were more or less proud to be able to reach the Ruler realm. This was especially so for Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves. He was unwilling to be under anyone. It would be strange if such two people were in a small team, it would be strange if there were no conflicts.","In a towering hall, seven people were sitting cross-legged.","“Hmph, how long will it take to find them like this?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s expression was gloomy, he stared at Ninth Kalpa King and said with a sneer, “What second level? It’s just their guesses. As for Zhufeng King and company, they were probably targeted by someone before they were wiped out. And since those people were prepared to attack, they naturally would not leave any traces behind. We naturally could not find anything.”","Ninth Kalpa King gave Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves an indifferent glance. “What are you trying to say?”","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves narrowed his eyes slightly, he said, “There are many opportunities and treasures in the Tarot vestige. We should try to find them. Even if we can’t find them ourselves, with our team’s strength, we can kill other teams or Rulers in the Tarot vestige. At that time, we can also gain a lot. As for the Zhufeng King team, let’s put it aside for now.”","After saying that, Emperor Thousand Leaves glanced at Jian Wushuang and the others and said with a smile, “What do you think of my suggestion?”","As soon as he said that, everyone could not help feeling a little restless.","After all, the life and death of Zhufeng King did not matter to them at all. They came to the Tarot vestige for the opportunity.","“I think Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s suggestion is feasible,” Ruler Violet Eye immediately agreed with a smile.","“I think...”","“Yes, the second level of the ruins is something that can not be completely confirmed. It’s not that we don’t want to look for the second level’s spatial enchantment, but we should indeed spend more time searching for treasures. As for the Zhufeng King team’s death, we can slowly investigate it,” said the veteran Ultimate Ruler, the Nine Yang Ruler said with his head lowered.","“That’s right. Ninth Kalpa King, it’s not that we are not investigating the cause of Zhufeng King’s death. We are just taking a breather and searching for treasures first. I heard that not long ago, an upper-grade nomological cardinal treasure appeared in the south. Why don’t we go and take a look together?” Said the Qinan Ruler.","Three of the seven agreed with Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ words, and a smile appeared on his face.","He turned his eyes to Jian Wushuang again and said with a smile, “Jian Wushuang, what do you think?”","He believed that everyone would support him, except Divine Marquis Qingfeng, who had never fallen.","At the same time, he was confident that when the five of them worked together to pressure Ninth Kalpa King, even he would have to bow his head.","“Are you asking me?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“Of course.” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves nodded with a smile. In his opinion, there had always been a feud between Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King, so there was no doubt that he would stand on his side.","“There are many opportunities and treasures in Tarot vestige. It would be good if I could get them, but I’m not interested in killing other teams and Rulers,” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently.","“What?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ expression changed slightly.","Even the Ninth Kalpa King raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“Jian Wushuang, do you mean you don’t want to come with us?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s expression was a little gloomy","The other Rulers also narrowed their eyes.","They had seen the feud between Jian Wushuang and the Ninth Kalpa King. In the past ten years, they had barely talked more than three times. Logically speaking, Jian Wushuang should hate the Ninth Kalpa King, it was right for him to stand on their side.","“Yes,” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently.","“Good, good, good. Jian Wushuang, then you should waste your time here with Ninth Kalpa King!” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s face was completely unfriendly to Jian Wushuang. After a cold snort, he said, “Let’s go!”","With that, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, Ruler Purple Eye, Ruler Nine Yang, and Ruler Qinan strode out of the hall.","After the four of them left, the hall suddenly became quiet."]},{"number":4144,"title":"Chapter 4144 Interception","paragraphs":["4144 Interception","After Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three left, only Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and divine Marquis Qingfeng were left in the towering hall.","Ninth Kalpa King narrowed his eyes slightly and first glanced at Divine Marquis Qingfeng.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng was gentle and had some conflicts with Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, so Ninth Kalpa King was not surprised that he chose to stay.","However, Jian Wushuang chose to stay, which surprised Ninth Kalpa King.","“Jian Wushuang, why didn’t you leave with Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the others? Aren’t you afraid that I’ll take your middle-grade principle divine fruit if you stay here? After all, no one in this team can stop me from doing anything.” Ninth Kalpa King looked at Jian Wushuang, he said with a fake smile.","“Oh? Then you can try.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and a cold light flashed in them.","Now that he had broken through to the fourth-level Ruler realm, his strength had greatly increased, and he had the superior-grade principle armor given to him by Ruler Blood Wave. Although he was still no match for Ninth Kalpa King, if he wanted to leave...he was afraid that Ninth Kalpa King would not be able to stay.","Moreover, he knew very well that no matter how much Ninth Kalpa King disliked him, he would never dare to attack him.","After all, they were all members of the Life Palace. Once Ninth Kalpa King attacked him, he only needed to directly send a message to Ruler Blood Wave. The consequences Ninth Kalpa King would face were not something he could bear.","“Forget it. Since I lost to you in the trial field, I won’t think about the middle-grade principle fruit anymore,” Ninth Kalpa King said with a wave of his hand.","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang just smiled faintly.","In fact, the reason why he did not leave with Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the others was not only because he did not want to kill other teams of Rulers and steal treasures for no reason, but also because of an extremely important reason, that was the character of Ninth Kalpa King and Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves.","Although Jian Wushuang and the other two had not been in the same team for a long time, he could more or less see some of their personalities.","Apart from being arrogant and a little arrogant, the Ninth Kalpa King could not be disliked in other aspects.","However, it was different for Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves. Jian Wushuang had seen many of her small actions and thoughts in the team over the years. He could tell that she was very selfish and hypocritical, moreover, her arrogance was no less than that of the Ninth Kalpa King.","In comparison, Jian Wushuang would rather stay with the Ninth Kalpa King.","“Alright, both of you. Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the others have left. There are only three of US left in our team, and our strength has been greatly reduced. You should work together to explore the Tarot Ruins,” Marquis Qingfeng said with a smile.","Like Jian Wushuang, Marquis Qingfeng knew Emperor Qianye’s character. He did not leave with them just now.","“Humph, it’s just that four trash are missing.” Ninth Kalpa King snorted, disagreeing with him.","Jian Wushuang and Marquis Qingfeng looked at each other and smiled helplessly.","Then, the three-man team continued to explore the Tarot Ruins, while at the same time, they kept asking about Zhufeng King’s team.","And on the other side...","In the vast void, two Ruler teams met.","One of the two Ruler teams was a four-man team led by Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye. As for the other team, there were a total of six people. They were also Ultimate Rulers.","There was clearly a large gap in the number of people on both sides. However, when the six-man team saw Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three, their expressions turned extremely gloomy.","The six-man team came from the demonic rain divine kingdom and was led by a Pinnacle Ultimate Ruler, Eighth Cloud Demon Lord.","“Life Palace’s Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, Ruler Violet Eye, nine Yang Ruler, and Qinan Ruler.” Eighth Cloud Demon Lord frowned. “Four of you, why are you blocking our way?”","“Eighth Cloud Ruler, if I remember correctly, your team arrived at the Tarot Ruins more than ten thousand years ago, right?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves wore a strange smile, he looked at Eighth Cloud Demon Lord and Company.","“So what if it is?” Eighth Cloud Demon Lord said in a deep voice.","“Nothing. I just want to know what you have obtained in the Tarot Ruin over the past 10,000 years,” asked Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves.","“Hmph, there are so many Rulers who have ventured into the Tarot Ruin. Our team is not very strong. Even if we encounter an opportunity, we will not be able to snatch it. After more than 10,000 years, our team has obtained nothing,” said Eighth Cloud Demon Lord.","“Nothing?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves shook his head. “I don’t believe it. How about this? The six of you take out your interspatial rings and let us inspect them. If you really do not obtain any decent treasures, I’ll let you leave. How about it?”","“Bastard!” Eighth Cloud Fiend Ruler was instantly enraged.","The other four Ultimate Rulers of the demonic rain divine kingdom also glared angrily.","He wanted them to take out their interspatial rings and let him investigate them?","How was that possible?","“Haha, since you are unwilling to hand over your interspatial rings, then you can not blame us. The three of you, kill!” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s loud laughter spread out.","With that said, a heaven-shaking aura instantly surged out of Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ body. His Divine Body suddenly expanded as he charged out.","The Ruler Violet Eye, Nine Yang Ruler, and Qinan, who stood beside him, gave a sinister laugh as they charged forward.","The battle instantly erupted.","And the intense battle did not last long. It ended in just a few moments.","Although Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s team only had dead people, the demonic rain divine kingdom had a total of six Ultimate Rulers. However, four of the six Ultimate Rulers were only close to the pinnacle level. As for the other two, even the strongest Eighth Cloud Demon Lord...they were only at the Pinnacle Ultimate Ruler level. They were only on par with nine Yang Ruler and Qinan Ruler. They were much weaker than Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye.","With such a lineup, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves alone was enough to kill them all. Furthermore, the four of them had attacked at the same time.","In just a few moments, four of the six Ultimate Rulers of the demonic rain divine kingdom were killed on the spot. One of them was a Pinnacle Ultimate Ruler. The remaining Eighth Cloud Demon Lord and an Ultimate Ruler managed to escape by a fluke.","After the battle, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Company gathered together to share the spoils of war.","“Haha, I knew it. The team from the demonic rain divine kingdom has roamed the Tarot Ruins for more than ten thousand years. It’s impossible that they did not gain anything. Look, we only killed four of them and even let the strongest Eighth cloud fiend Ruler escape. But our gains are still extremely huge.” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ eyes were filled with pleasant surprise.","The other three, too, were delighted."]},{"number":4145,"title":"Chapter 4145 The Elixir is Born","paragraphs":["4145 The Elixir is Born","To cut off other dominators and plunder their treasures.","This is not easy to see in the universe. After all, although there are many great beings in the universe, it is very difficult to gather so many powerful Ultimate Rulers under normal circumstances.","Only now, when the Tarot Ruins appeared and restricted the entry of supreme experts, countless Ultimate Rulers swarmed over.","Because there were too many Rulers gathered, the killing became more frequent, so it became common to kill them halfway.","The reason why Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye chose to part ways with Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang was because of the restrictions of Ninth Kalpa King.","Ninth Kalpa King was arrogant and disdained to kill the weaker Ruler squads. He was mainly investigating the cause of the destruction of Zhufeng King’s squads, but monarch thousand leaf and the others could not help it.","Now, as soon as the four of them were freed from the restriction of Ninth Kalpa King, they immediately began to kill other Ruler squads in the Tarot Ruins.","Moreover, they gained a lot from this attack.","“Hmph, the Demonic Rain Divine Kingdom is considered an ordinary one among the many divine kingdoms in the vast universe. The expert squads they sent over only have six Ultimate Rulers. Furthermore, there are only two pinnacle-level Ultimate Rulers. With such strength, they still dare to wander around the Tarot Ruins,” sneered Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves.","“They were lucky in the past and did not encounter those powerful Ruler squads. Unfortunately, now that they have encountered the four of us, they will immediately be defeated,” said Violet Eye with a laugh.","“Unfortunately, we were unable to keep eight cloud fiend master. He is the leader of the six-man squad of the Fiendrain Divine Kingdom, a Pinnacle Omega Ruler. Over the past ten thousand years, many of the benefits they have gained in the Tarot Ruins have probably been focused on him,” said Ruler Nine Yang.","“There’s nothing we can do. Although Eight Cloud Fiend Master is only a Pinnacle Omega Ruler and his strength is far inferior to Violet Eye and me, his ability to survive is not too weak. Even if I were to join forces with Violet Eye, it would be very difficult to kill him,” said Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves.","“Unfortunately, Divine Marquis Qingfeng is not with us. Otherwise, with his entanglement techniques, there is a chance of keeping Eight Cloud Demon Master here,” said Violet Eye.","“Qingfeng? Hmph!” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves snorted coldly.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng was only at the pinnacle Ultimate Ruler level, but he was best at entanglement techniques. In terms of entanglement, neither Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves nor Violet Eye was a match for Divine Marquis Qingfeng.","If Divine Marquis Qingfeng was with them, they were very confident that they could keep Eight Cloud Demon Master.","“Qingfeng is an idiot. If he is willing to follow Ninth Kalpa King, then let him continue. Jian Wushuang is just a fourth-level Ruler. He is not even a cannon fodder in the Tarot Ruins. If he follows us, we might be able to give him some benefits, but he wants to follow Ninth Kalpa King... Humph, with Ninth Kalpa King’s arrogant and overbearing character, even if he really gets an opportunity, how could he be part of it?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves said with a sneer.","The violet-eyed Ruler and the other two looked at each other and nodded.","Indeed, there was a reason why they had chosen to leave. The reason was because the Ninth Kalpa King was extremely overbearing. If they followed the Ninth Kalpa King, even if they were to obtain some great fortune, they might not be able to reap any benefits, thus, it was better for them to part ways with the Ninth Kalpa King. It would be better for them to go their own ways.","“Ignore them. Let’s continue exploring the Tarot Ruins. With our strength, there’s nothing to be afraid of if we join forces as long as we do not encounter a Ruler team from a top faction in the universe. Furthermore, even if we do encounter such a powerhouse team, the four of us will be able to protect ourselves if we join forces,” said Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves.","Immediately, the four of them continued exploring the Tarot Ruins.","In a flash, 50 years had passed.","During these 50 years, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Company had been raiding other Ruler squads in the ruins. With the four of them working together, many weaker Ruler squads had suffered.","Of course, although the four of them were raiding everywhere, they were also raiding targets. For example, Rulers from large cosmic factions or powerful and famous Ultimate Rulers, they would not easily provoke them.","With the four of them working together, there were few teams of experts in the Tarot Ruins who could really do anything to them. Therefore, the four of them did well in the past 50 years and gained a lot of benefits.","Interestingly, in the past 50 years, Jian Wushuang and the other two had met Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the others once.","Of course, this encounter did not cause much of a stir. After a few words of sarcasm, they went on their own.","...","In a remote corner of the Tarot Ruins.","Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng were inspecting the enchantment point that led to the second floor inch by inch.","Suddenly...","“Huh?”","Jian Wushuang, Qingfeng, and Jian Wushuang looked up at the same time.","They saw streaks of powerful long arcs rushing toward them at an astonishing speed in the surrounding void.","Ninth Kalpa King narrowed his eyes. In the next moment, his figure flashed and he was already in front of the Ruler’s team. The five people of the Ruler’s team immediately stopped.","“Who is it?”","The five people of the Ruler’s team were a little shocked and angry when they were stopped midway.","As the Ninth Kalpa King’s figure gradually condensed in front of the five, the hearts of the originally furious five suddenly trembled.","“Ninth Kalpa King!”","“Ninth Kalpa King of the Life Palace!”","The teeth of the five members of the group were trembling.","This time, the Tarot Ruins had appeared, and it was a large group of powerful Ultimate Rulers in the vast universe. Naturally, some of the more famous and powerful ones were well-known.","As for the Ninth Kalpa King, he was undoubtedly one of the most famous of the many Ultimate Rulers in the universe. The five members of this squad of Rulers were naturally able to recognize him.","At the same time, they all knew the strength of the Ninth Kalpa King.","Without a doubt, just the Ninth Kalpa King alone was enough to wipe out their squad of five. They had no room to struggle at all.","Seeing Ninth Kalpa King standing in front of them, they were naturally terrified.","“Five of you, looking at how anxious you are, where are you going?” Ninth Kalpa King looked over.","Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng also appeared next to Ninth Kalpa King.","Jian Wushuang also noticed that the five-man team of Rulers was moving very fast. They were very anxious, as if they were in a hurry to go somewhere.","The five Rulers looked at each other in dismay when they heard the Ninth Kalpa King’s question, the superior Ultimate Ruler in the lead said seriously, “Ninth Kalpa King, since you’ve met me, I Won’t hide it from you. We’ve just received news that a supreme-grade divine herb has appeared in Fengyang Valley!”"]},{"number":4146,"title":"Chapter 4146 The Ninth Kalpa King’s Desire","paragraphs":["4146 The Ninth Kalpa King’s Desire","“The birth of a divine medicine?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","When this godly medicine appeared, it caused a huge commotion and attracted many experts. Among those experts who rushed over, some of them recognized this godly medicine and said that this Supreme-grade godly medicine can be refined into a divine pill that can increase the chances of breaking through to the Supreme-being realm! The peak-Level Ultimate Ruler said.","“What did you just say?” The Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes suddenly burst out with a bright light.","Both Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng were shocked. They looked at each other in shock.","Supreme-grade divine medicine was rare.","In particular, this kind of divine medicine that could increase the chances of an Ultimate Ruler breaking through to the Supreme-being realm was extremely rare in the universe.","Jian Wushuang was still a Ruler of the fourth level, so he was not in a hurry to use the divine medicine to break through to the Supreme level. However, it was a different story for the Rulers of the ultimate level.","That was breaking through to the Supreme-being realm!","This was something that every Ultimate Ruler dreamed of.","Even if this divine medicine could only slightly increase the chances of one breaking through to a higher level, it would be enough to drive all of the Ultimate Rulers crazy!","Just like the Ninth Kalpa King!","The Ninth Kalpa King had always been recognized as the number one genius in the Divine Life Palace, at least before Jian Wushuang’s arrival.","However, over the years, the Ninth Kalpa King’s status in the Divine Life Palace had been getting lower and lower. It was because he had stayed at the level of an Ultimate Ruler for too long and the Divine Life Palace had given him enough resources and a price, but he had still not broken through to become a Supreme. This had disappointed many higher-ups of the Divine Life Palace.","All these years, the Ninth Kalpa King had been enduring silently. Even though he had comprehended a terrifying killer move like the divine Kingdom of one thought, he had never revealed it. This was because he knew that only by breaking through to the Supreme level would he truly rise to a whole new level. Otherwise, everything else would be useless.","It could be said that among the many Ultimate Rulers in the Divine Life Palace, the Ninth Kalpa King’s desire to break through to the Supreme level was the strongest!","After all, he already had the battle strength of a Supreme and had control of the One Thought Divine Kingdom. Once he broke through to the Supreme-being realm, he would definitely have the battle strength of a top-tier Supreme-being, and his future potential would be boundless.","However, the crucial point was that he had been unable to break through after so many years. Even he himself was somewhat uncertain if it was possible for him to break through and become a Supreme martial artist.","And now, there was a huge opportunity in front of him.","It was the godly medicine that had just appeared!","This was a divine herb that could be refined into a divine pill, a divine herb that could increase the chances of breaking through to the Supreme-being realm!","Even if it only increased the chances of a breakthrough by 10%, it was definitely enough to make the Ninth Kalpa King go crazy.","“Is what you said true?” The Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes were burning as he stared at the five people in front of him.","“Of course it’s true. Now that the news has spread, I reckon that many Rulers have already rushed there. However, it should take some time for that godly medicine to appear. If you rush over now, you might be able to make it in time.” The peak-Level Ultimate Ruler said.","“Let’s go! Let’s hurry over!!” The Ninth Kalpa King growled in a low voice, and his speed instantly burst out.","Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked at each other and followed without hesitation.","The Tarot Ruins were vast and boundless, and many Rulers of the universe had been wandering in the ruins for tens of thousands of years. Many places in the ruins had been named.","For example, the Fengyang Canyon was the place where the Fengyang Divine Fruit had appeared.","The Fengyang Divine Fruit was a rare treasure.","However, he did not expect that an even more precious Supreme-grade divine medicine would appear in the Fengyang Canyon not long after the Fengyang Divine Fruit appeared.","Fengyang Canyon was not far from where the three of them were. With their speed, they arrived at Fengyang Canyon in less than an hour.","The air above the huge Fengyang Canyon was already filled with people. Countless Rulers were confronting each other, their swords drawn and bows bent. The air was filled with the smell of gunpowder.","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King were not in a hurry to show themselves. Instead, they hid in a void and watched the scene from afar.","“There really are many experts.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the countless Rulers that had gathered in front of him. Almost all of them were Ultimate Rulers, and many of them were already at the top of the Ultimate Rulers.","There were more than ten Rulers who were almost invincible like Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the Ruler Violet Eye.","Moreover, they had already shown their faces. Many others were probably like them, hiding in the surrounding void, waiting for an opportunity.","“The godly medicine is still there.”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes shone with unprecedented fierceness as he stared at the void in the middle of the canyon. There was a blood-colored divine medicine that was emitting a unique aura.","The Ninth Kalpa King did not recognize this divine medicine at all. However, there were so many experts present, many of whom had extremely high attainments in natural treasures or some divine medicine. They were all so greedy for this divine medicine.","Clearly, it was true that this godly medicine could increase the chances of Rulers breaking through to the Supreme realm after being refined into a divine pill.","“It seems like we’re not late. However, there are so many Rulers present, including the Ruler teams from the Great Void Divine Hall and Blood Sky Hall. It won’t be easy to get the divine medicine under the eyes of so many people.” The Ninth Kalpa King narrowed his eyes.","Although he was arrogant, he was not blindly conceited or stupid. The Ruler’s teams under the major powers of the universe had many extraordinary strengths. He naturally did not fear them one on one, but if they worked together, he would have a headache.","One had to know that the Rulers sent by the top powers of the universe could not be weak.","“Ninth Kalpa King, your old friend, the Ruler Silver Roc, is also there.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked at the hook-nosed youth standing at the entrance of the valley and joked.","He was rather relaxed. From the start, he knew that it was impossible for this godly medicine to fall into his hands.","Therefore, he did not think about fighting for it.","The Ninth Kalpa King snorted coldly and did not speak.","Jian Wushuang looked at the peak Ultimate Rulers in Fengyang Canyon from afar and sighed. These Ultimate Rulers could wander in the ruins for tens of thousands of years without being plundered or killed, so they were not weak.","For example, if he went all out, his fighting power could rival that of a top ultimate master. He could even fight with Ultimate Masters like Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and purple-eye Ruler who were almost invincible. However, such power was obviously not at the top in Fengyang Canyon.","“Eh? Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the rest didn’t come?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","Suddenly, he was startled.","“If you guys don’t want this godly medicine, then I’ll take it!”","A sharp laugh suddenly sounded in the sky."]},{"number":4147,"title":"Chapter 4147 The Bird That Stands Out","paragraphs":["4147 The Bird That Stands Out","“If you guys don’t want this godly medicine, then I’ll take it!”","Whoosh!","Four streaks of light could be seen flying over from a distance, shooting toward the Fengyang Canyon.","“Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves?”","“It’s them?”","Jian Wushuang and the other two squinted their eyes in surprise.","“Foolish!” When the Ninth Kalpa King saw this scene, his face suddenly sank and he snorted coldly.","Indeed.","Countless experts had gathered in the Fengyang Canyon. They were all eyeing the godly medicine floating in the center of the valley. The reason why there was no fierce battle yet was that everyone knew that whoever dared to make the first move at this critical moment would become the target of all.","Even someone as strong as the Ninth Kalpa King didn’t dare to rush in rashly to snatch the divine medicine after arriving here. Instead, he stood in the void and watched, waiting for an opportunity.","As for Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three, although they weren’t weak, they weren’t the best among the Rulers’ teams present. If the four of them attacked rashly, they might be attacked by a large number of experts.","The bird that takes the lead is shot. Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves should know. “But why are they so afraid?” Jian Wushuang frowned, “Could it be that they have something to rely on?”","Although they were surprised, Jian Wushuang and the other two didn’t move. They continued to watch the scene from afar.","The moment Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three joined forces to dash over, the Rulers of the forces who were originally at a stalemate in the void above Fengyang Canyon suddenly raised their heads and their extremely cold gazes were fixed on Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three.","“You’re looking for death!”","“Kill them!”","“How dare you snatch the godly medicine? Die!”","BOOM!","A series of roars were heard and in an instant, a series of earth-shattering attacks were launched toward Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three.","These attacks were all from the hands of the Ultimate Rulers. There were even many top Ultimate Rulers and even some almost invincible existences among the Ultimate Rulers who attacked.","In the face of the overwhelming attack, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the Ruler Violet Eye’s expressions changed slightly. However, they were not afraid.","After all, the four of them also knew what was going on. Since they dared to attack, they were naturally prepared. This overwhelming attack was also within their expectations.","“Form the formation!”","“Kill!” Ruler Violet Eye let out a low cry, and violet divine power immediately began to surge from his body.","He was not the only one. Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, Ruler Nine Yang, and Ruler South Chasm also released their divine power at the same time. With the Ruler Violet Eye as the core, the four of them instantly formed a massive array.","This array emitted a terrifying aura, causing the four of them to instantly become one.","“A formation?” Jian Wushuang, who was watching the battle from outside the canyon, raised his eyebrows.","I almost forgot. Among the four of them, the Ruler Violet Eye is not only powerful, but he is also very proficient in the Dao of formations. Among the universe Rulers, he is at least in the top 20 in the Dao of formations. The formation they are using now should have been carefully designed by the Ruler Violet Eye for the four of them over the years. Divine Marquis Qingfeng said.","“Innate divine ability, divine manipulation!” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves shouted and the divine power in his body surged. At the same time, traces of universe principles were emitted from his body.","Buzz!","A large amount of divine light suddenly swept up, forming a huge defensive barrier in the surrounding void in the blink of an eye.","This defensive barrier had also perfectly integrated with the array that the four of them had already formed.","In an instant, it was as if an iron wall had been formed.","“Absolute defense!”","“Saber seals the world!”","The remaining Rulers, Nine Yang and South Chasm, also unleashed their divine power and unleashed their defensive techniques to the best of their abilities, which were also perfectly fused with their arrays.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","A series of earth-shaking explosions resounded through the void. The entire Fengyang Canyon was instantly covered and even drowned by endless divine power.","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three shuddered slightly and their faces turned pale. However, the attacks that were performed by the many Rulers were blocked by the four of them.","The four of them were not hindered much. On the contrary, under the influence of these attacks, they were getting closer to the godly medicine in the valley.","“Now, let’s go in!”","There was no dejection on Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ face. Instead, he was ecstatic. After taking a deep breath, he took advantage of the impact of the attack and continued to shoot toward Fengyang Canyon.","“Charge!” The Ruler Violet Eye and the other two exchanged glances, then shot forward in unison.","This scene caused the expressions of the Rulers around the Fengyang Canyon to change.","No one had expected that Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three would be able to block the attacks of so many Ultimate Rulers when they worked together.","“Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the rest managed to block it?”","Even Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng were surprised.","“I’ve underestimated them,” The Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes narrowed. The defensive array was designed by the Ruler Violet Eye and the four of them. In addition to Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s ‘divine defense’ innate ability, the two are perfectly combined to form an absolute defense. In addition, the defensive methods of Ruler Jiuyang and Ruler South Qi are also perfectly integrated with the array. “I’m afraid that even ordinary Supremes would need some tricks to break through the defensive power of this array.”","“No wonder the four of them dared to stand out and be the first to fight for the godly medicine.” The Ninth Kalpa King’s face was a little cold.","Indeed, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three knew that there were many experts present and there were many Rulers’ teams that were more powerful than them. Once a large-scale fight broke out, it would be impossible for them to get the divine medicine with their power.","Thus, the four of them decided to take a gamble and seize the opportunity when no one was willing to be the first to take the lead to snatch the godly medicine.","Previously, they had attacked together in detail. The array that the Ruler Violet Eye had created for the four of them, in addition to Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ innate divine ability, divine defense, was specially used for defense. With the perfect combination of the two, even if they were to encounter an attack from an ordinary Supreme, they should be able to withstand it.","With the help of Ruler Nine Yang and Ruler of the South, they should be able to withstand the first wave of attacks from the surrounding experts. As long as they could withstand this wave of attacks, they would have a high chance of snatching the divine medicine.","Once they had the godly medicine, all they had to do was think of a way to escape from these Rulers. They still had a high chance of success.","So, they made their move.","After they made their move, they managed to withstand the first wave of attacks. Everything was going according to their plan."]},{"number":4148,"title":"Chapter 4148 Qing Xuzi","paragraphs":["4148 Qing Xuzi","One had to say that Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three were very ingenious and they had found the right time.","They were the first to rush toward the godly medicine, so they were naturally closer to it. After enduring the first wave of attacks from the cultivators, they burst out again.","At this moment, it was already extremely difficult for the Rulers to stop them.","“This godly medicine belongs to us now.”","“After we obtain this godly medicine, we’ll immediately leave the Tarot Ruins.”","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three approached the divine medicine at their fastest speed and the divine medicine was very close to them. This made them smile in surprise.","They did not see...","The Rulers around the Fengyang Canyon, who had been extremely anxious when they saw them going to snatch the divine medicine, suddenly turned cold. They even looked at Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three with pity.","Bang!","All of a sudden, an explosion came from the void!","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three seemed to have hit an invisible wall and their figures stopped abruptly!","“What?”","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three’s pupils shrank and they looked forward with rapt attention.","A young man in a white robe with a large cloak embroidered with the word ‘great void’ on the back of the cloak was standing in front of them. He had his hands behind his back and was looking at the four of them indifferently.","The white-robed young man had a slender divine sword at his waist. Just by standing there, he gave off a sharp sword intent that made one’s heart palpitate.","This person’s speed is incredible! Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three were extremely shocked.","One had to know that they were obviously the first to move earlier, and they were also the closest to this stalk of godly medicine. Meanwhile, this person before them was obviously slower than them, yet he was now blocking their way.","It was obvious that the person’s speed was much faster than the four of them.","“This outfit, is it someone from the Great Void Divine Hall?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ face darkened.","“I know him. He’s Qing Xuzi, the current Divine Son of the Great Void Divine Hall.” Ruler Violet Eye’s gaze was extremely solemn.","“Qing Xuzi?”","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, the Ruler Nine Yang, and the Ruler of South Qi were all shocked.","The Great Void Divine Hall was a major power in the universe. Every 1000 chaos cycles, they would choose a godchild, and this godchild would be the leader of the Great Void Divine Hall in this era.","It was very simple to become a Divine Son. In the Great Void Divine Hall, as long as one could sweep through everyone in any cultivation level and become unrivaled, one would be the current Divine Son of the Great Void Divine Hall!","In other words, Qing Xuzi’s status as the Son of God had come from killing thousands of Rulers. He was a Supreme expert at the Ruler level and an invincible existence.","However, although there were many Ultimate Rulers in the vast universe, and some of them were top existences, there were only a few who could be called invincible among the Ultimate Rulers.","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the Ruler Violet Eye were only close to invincibility, which meant that they were still slightly off from being truly invincible.","However, Qing Xuzi was acknowledged by the universe as an unparalleled existence among Rulers.","He was much more powerful than Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye.","“Hmph, so what if he’s Qing Xuzi? He’s only one person, and he dares to block our way. Kill him!” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s eyes were red and there was a surging murderous intent in his eyes.","Now that things had come to this, he couldn’t care less.","The godly medicine was right in front of him. He could not give up just because of Qing Xuzi.","However, before Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves could do anything, Qing Xuzi’s eyes turned cold and the divine sword hanging on his waist was unsheathed!","Buzzzzzz!","In an instant, an extremely dazzling streak of sword-light shot toward the four like a Soaring Dragon, tearing through the sky.","With this strike, a sharp sword essence shot up into the sky and shattered the void.","In an instant, heaven and earth fell into an absolute chill, and the chill grew.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the void far away, saw this scene and his eyes suddenly narrowed.","He could feel that the ‘Wu Qi divine sword’ on his back was actually making a muffled sound!","“What a powerful sword technique...”","Jian Wushuang squinted. He was good at sword principle and had a high comprehension of the universe origin of sword principle. His swordsmanship was also quite good, so he could naturally see how amazing Qing Xuzi’s sword was.","Moreover, the moment Qing Xuzi displayed his swordsmanship, he could feel that the Divine Sword Wu Qi on his back was vaguely excited. It could not wait to be unsheathed and fight with the divine sword in the hands of the Taixu Divine Son.","Qing Xuzi is highly accomplished in sword principle and has a high comprehension of the principles of the universe. There was a hint of excitement in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","Bang!","In the Fengyang Canyon, Son of God Taixu’s sword turned into a white-hot dragon that roared and slashed at Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three.","Although Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three had formed an array earlier on, it had already crumbled after withstanding the first wave of attacks from the Rulers. There was no possibility of it forming again. Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s gifted supernatural power could not be used again in a short period of time.","However, the opponent was only Qing Xuzi alone. Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three did not want to resist passively. Instead, they attacked in an attempt to force Qing Xuzi to retreat.","Therefore, the four of them also launched powerful attacks at the same time, bombarding Qing Xuzi’s sword light head-on.","Bang!","There was an explosion and the entire void trembled. Endless divine power swept out, forming a storm that filled the world.","In the middle of the storm of divine power, a dense mist was rising.","“How is that possible?” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three’s expressions changed drastically.","The four of them had joined forces to deal with one of them. However, the moment Qing Xuzi’s sword slashed down, the four of them felt that they could not resist it.","After the attack, the four of them were forced back. Not only that, the sword light contained a strong power that hit their divine bodies. Under the power, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the Ruler Violet Eye were better off. Other than spitting out blood, they were fine. They did not use up much divine power.","Ruler Nine Yang and Ruler South Qi were in a more miserable state. They were much weaker to begin with, and one of them had his arm cut off by Qing Xuzi’s sword, while the other’s divine body was crushed on the spot.","However, the two of them were aberrants, and their divine power was much stronger than that of ordinary Ultimate Rulers. They were able to withstand this level of damage.","However, Qing Xuzi was able to defeat the four of them with a single sword strike. This also showed how invincible he was among the Rulers.","“Hiss!”","Many of the weaker Rulers around him could not help but gasp at this sight."]},{"number":4149,"title":"Chapter 4149 Help for Help","paragraphs":["4149 Help for Help","“So strong!”","“No wonder you’re Qing Xuzi.”","“He’s too strong.”","The surrounding Rulers were all secretly amazed.","He had defeated four supreme Ultimate Rulers with a single sword strike, two of whom were near-invincible amongst the Ultimate Rulers!","Qing Xuzi’s strength was indeed terrifying.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re also an expert in sword principle. What do you think of Qing Xuzi’s sword?” In the distance, Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s eyes lit up when he saw this sword. He turned his head and asked with a smile.","“Very strong.” Jian Wushuang nodded and replied frankly.","“What if you’re compared to Qing Xuzi?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng asked.","Jian Wushuang frowned and then said seriously, “In terms of understanding of the Dao of the sword, he shouldn’t be much stronger than me, but in terms of understanding of the laws of the universe, I should be slightly better than him. However, he’s still an Omega-level Ruler, and his divine power is quite a bit stronger than mine. If we truly were to fight, he would naturally be stronger than me.”","Jian Wushuang was telling the truth.","In terms of power, Qing Xuzi was already at the invincible level among the Ultimate Rulers. Jian Wushuang was confident that he was not afraid of a top Ultimate Ruler because he had made a breakthrough to the level of a stage four great Ruler and his divine power was much stronger than an ordinary cultivator’s. He was also confident that he could even fight against experts like Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye, but the outcome was still uncertain.","However, Qing Xuzi was much stronger than Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the Ruler Violet Eye.","If he were to fight with Qing Xuzi, he would have to use the dragon-destroying secret skill, burn his divine power, or use his innate divine power to have the ability to fight.","However, Qing Xuzi had only performed one sword move. If Jian Wushuang had a trump card, Qing Xuzi must have one too. That was why Jian Wushuang said Qing Xuzi was stronger.","However, even though he was strong, Jian Wushuang would not be afraid if he were to fight with Qing Xuzi.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was sure that Qing Xuzi would not be able to do anything to him.","After all, Jian Wushuang had a huge divine body and vast divine power. Among the Rulers in the vast universe, except for the Ninth Kalpa King, who had the battle strength of a Supreme, Jian Wushuang didn’t need to care about the other Rulers.","Although Qing Xuzi was strong, he was still much weaker than the Ninth Kalpa King, who was a perfect life form and had mastered the divine Kingdom of one thought.","Of course, Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng were just joking.","“Qing Xuzi is very powerful, but Jian Wushuang, you’ve only cultivated for more than three hundred thousand years and are only a fourth-stage Ruler now. However, your comprehension of sword principle and universe principles is no weaker than his. Once you grow up and reach the level of an Ultimate Ruler, it should be easy for you to defeat Qing Xuzi.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng laughed.","Jian Wushuang also smiled noncommittally.","“Stop talking. We’re ready to attack.” The Ninth Kalpa King looked forward and suddenly said.","Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng quickly looked forward.","In Fengyang Canyon, the situation had changed. After Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three were struck back by Qing Xuzi’s sword, they were attacked by a large number of Rulers.","This time, they did not have any defensive arrays, so they could only rely on their own means to block these attacks.","In the end, they only launched one wave of attacks.","They had only taken a portion of the Ultimate Ruler’s attack, but the terrifying power that hit them had instantly inflicted unprecedented heavy injuries.","Fortunately, the four of them were all special life forms, so their divine power was stronger than that of ordinary cultivators. Otherwise, they would have been killed on the spot by this wave of attacks.","But now, more than half of their divine power had been used up.","Retreat, quickly retreat!!","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, the Ruler Violet Eye and the other two were terrified.","They knew that they had lost the chance to fight for the godly medicine after Qing Xuzi stopped them, let alone now that they were severely injured.","They had to leave immediately, or they would probably lose their lives here.","However, even though the four of them had retreated and had clearly given up on fighting for the divine medicine, many of the Rulers around them still had their eyes on them.","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, the four of you have such a day too!!","“Forty years ago, our team almost died at the hands of the four of them. Now that we have a rare opportunity, we can kill the four of them.”","“Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, the four of you won’t be able to walk out of the canyon today!”","Quite a number of Rulers continued to surround and attack Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three.","There weren’t many Rulers, only about twenty of them. Among them, there were Rulers who had been plundered by Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three and managed to escape with their lives. Eight Cloud Demon Master from the Demonic Rain Divine Kingdom was among them.","There were also some who knew that they did not have the ability to fight for the divine medicine. Hence, they simply targeted Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three.","After all, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three were already severely injured. They had used up more than half of their divine power and their fighting power was not as strong as before. This was definitely a good opportunity to beat them up.","The Rulers who had been exposed by the four of them before naturally would not miss this opportunity. They all attacked, wanting to kill the four of them here.","“Bastard!”","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the Ruler Violet Eye’s faces were dark and their expressions were extremely ugly.","The faces of Ruler Nine Yang and his partner were ashen as well, and their hearts were filled with terror.","If they were at their peak, they naturally would not care about these Rulers. But now, they were all heavily injured and could not use much of their battle strength.","In this situation, the four of them were likely to die.","At such a critical moment, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s eyes were filled with anger and he suddenly let out a hysterical roar, “Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, Divine Marquis Qingfeng! I know you’re nearby. Are you going to just watch us die and not do anything?”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s roar resounded throughout the entire Fengyang Canyon.","“Ninth Kalpa King?”","“What? The Ninth Kalpa King is nearby?”","A person’s name was like the shadow of a tree.","The group of Ultimate Rulers who had surrounded Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves were shocked and looked around. However, they did not see the Ninth Kalpa King for a long time and sneered again.","“Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, give up your futile struggle. Today, this Fengyang Canyon shall be your burial ground!”","“Hahaha! Ruler Violet Eye, I heard that you’ve trained in an extremely powerful eye-type divine ability for your eyes? Hmph, today I’m going to dig out your eyes while you’re still alive!”","Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves, no one can save you today!","The group of Ultimate Rulers sneered as they approached Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves."]},{"number":4150,"title":"Chapter 4150 Showing His Face","paragraphs":["4150 Showing His Face","It had to be said that among the team sent by the Divine Life Palace, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’ status was only second to the Ninth Kalpa King’s. He was indeed quite capable.","As the Ruler Violet Eye and the other two were panicking, Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves’s face darkened and he shouted again, “Ninth Kalpa King, you and I are both from the Divine Life Palace, and you are the leader of this team. If I die here, do you think Supreme Blood Wave and the others won’t blame you?”","After he finished speaking, a part of the void suddenly distorted and Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves was elated as he quickly looked at the void.","With Ninth Kalpa King in the lead, Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng behind him, the three of them formed a triangle and stepped out of the void.","!!","“Ninth Kalpa King, you’re really here!” Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves was overjoyed when he saw this. The eyes of the Ruler Violet Eye and the Ruler Nine Yang also shone with intense joy.","However, before the four of them could speak again, the Ninth Kalpa King’s words made their hearts turn cold, as if they had fallen into an ice cellar.","“I really don’t care about trash like you. If it weren’t for the higher-ups of the Divine Life Palace, I wouldn’t have cared about your lives.” The Ninth Kalpa King’s expression was somewhat unsightly.","In fact, he, Jian Wushuang, and the other two did not want to show up so early, because he knew that once he showed up, he would be the target of public criticism. After all, his strength was there.","The best choice was to hide in the dark and wait for the best opportunity to attack. However, they had no choice but to show themselves because of Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three.","It could not be helped. No matter how much they disliked the four people and how angry they were, they were from the Divine Life Palace after all. Although the Ninth Kalpa King was willing to watch the four people die, he had to consider the blame from the higher-ups of the Divine Life Palace.","The three of them had no choice but to reveal themselves in advance.","After the Ninth Kalpa King glanced at the four of them, his gaze fell on the blood-red divine flower that bloomed on the cliff in the Nanyang Canyon. He said, “As long as the four of them don’t die, I don’t care about anything else. But I want that godly medicine.”","The Ninth Kalpa King is indeed the Ninth Kalpa King. “We have not seen each other for 3000 years, but he’s still so overbearing. He actually asked for the Supreme divine flower the moment he appeared.” The Silver Roc at the entrance of Fengyang Canyon said with a fake smile.","“Oh? You’re not convinced?” The Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes turned to look at the Silver Roc, and his eyes were cold.","“Hmph, Ninth Kalpa King, I will settle the score with you sooner or later for the enmity from three million years ago. But what I want to tell you now is that you can’t be presumptuous in this place!” The Silver Roc’s expression was uncertain.","“You talk too much.” Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King sneered in disdain.","Then, he lowered his head and looked at the other Rulers in the Fengyang Canyon. He said coldly, “I want this godly medicine. Who wants to stop me?”","“Or should I say...who dares to stop me?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the entire place fell silent.","Everyone who was caught by the Ninth Kalpa King’s gaze avoided his eyes and lowered their heads in silence.","The Ninth Kalpa King alone had actually suppressed the entire scene into silence!","“This is strength.” Even Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but exclaim in admiration when he saw this.","The Ninth Kalpa King’s reputation in the universe was too great. As an Ultimate Ruler, no matter if it was an ordinary Ultimate Ruler, a top Ultimate Ruler, or even some of the almost invincible existences among the Ultimate Rulers, they would be a little afraid of the Ninth Kalpa King.","Jian Wushuang was far from being able to compare with such power.","“Pa! Pa! Pa!”","At this moment, a lazy clapping sound came from the crowd in Fengyang Canyon.","Ninth Kalpa King, I’ve long heard of your great name.","A barefoot young man wearing a red robe with his hair tied into pigtails walked out of the void with an evil smile on his face.","Behind him was a team of peak Ultimate Rulers in armor. They followed closely behind him, exuding a murderous aura.","“The people from the Great Sun Divine Kingdom!”","“Those are the divine armor guards of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom. Every single one of them has the power of a peak-Level Ultimate Ruler!”","“That red-robed youth from the great sun must be the Ruler sent by the Great Sun Divine Kingdom!” Zhao Feng muttered.","“I’ve heard that he’s always been unruly, bloodthirsty, and belittling others. He’s hated by countless people in the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, but he’s also extremely powerful. He did not expect...he actually came to the ruins of the zenith!”","“With this person around, I’m afraid it’ll be a little difficult for the Ninth Kalpa King to get the divine medicine smoothly.”","“Ah, no matter who obtained this godly medicine, looking at the current situation, we have no hope.”","The pupils of the various Ultimate Rulers, who had been silent with their heads lowered, shrank when they saw this. They then sighed.","In the outside world, these Ultimate Rulers were the best among the Ultimate Rulers. However, in the starry ruins, where all the geniuses were gathered, they were not enough.","“Eh? You want to stop me?” The Ninth Kalpa King looked at him, his indifferent face extremely cold.","“It’s just a divine herb that can increase the chances of breaking through to the Supreme-being realm. It’s not a great opportunity in these ruins. It’s not like we don’t have it in our Great Sun Divine Kingdom. I’m not very interested in it.” The red-robed young man shook his head. In the next moment, his lips curled into a bloodthirsty smile as he changed the topic, “However, I’ve long heard of your name, Ninth Kalpa King. It’s said that you are a rare perfect life form in the universe. Many people say that you are the number one Ruler of this era in the vast universe. I’m quite interested in this.”","Hualala.","The void twisted again, and five figures wearing long blood-red robes, hoods, and long sickles walked out of the void.","The faces of the five people could not be seen clearly as the wide hoods covered more than half of their faces.","They exuded a strong aura of death, and the long, sharp, and curved sickles in their hands made them look like emissaries from the netherworld rather than living people.","“They’re from the Blood Sky Palace!”","“This is...the five blood messengers of the Blood Sky Palace!”","“This is...the crowd cried out in alarm.” They naturally understood these famous peak-level experts.","“This divine herb is for the Blood Sky Palace.”","“Whoever blocks it will die.”","The five blood nether emissaries spoke at the same time. Their voices were hoarse, like the sound of iron pieces grinding together, and it was hard to tell if they were male or female.","The crowd fell silent again when the five blood nether emissaries from Blood Sky Palace appeared.","“Whoever blocks it will die.”","No one doubted their words. Blood Sky Palace was notorious in the vast universe. Countless Rulers and Supremes had died at their hands. Even some top-tier Supremes were extremely afraid of Blood Sky Palace.","Although these five blood underworld envoys only had the strength of a peak Ultimate Ruler, they might not be comparable to an invincible Ruler like the Ninth Kalpa King. However, when they joined forces, even the Ninth Kalpa King would have to pay some attention to them."]},{"number":4151,"title":"Chapter 4151 Taking Action","paragraphs":["4151 Taking Action","“If you want this godly medicine, you’ll have to ask the sword in my hand first,” The Taixu Son of God, Qing Xuzi, who had sent Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the other three flying with one sword, was handsome and expressionless as he walked over.","The Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the Blood Sky Palace, and the Great Void Divine Hall!","The experts of the three top forces stared at the Ninth Kalpa King at the same time!","As for the valley, although there were still many Ultimate Rulers present, including some of the stronger Ruler teams, these Rulers all retreated to the side in tacit understanding when they saw this scene.","They knew very well that with the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, Blood Sky Palace, Great Void Divine Hall, and the Ninth Kalpa King present, it would be difficult for ordinary Ultimate Rulers like them to snatch the divine medicine.","In this battle, the protagonists were the four major forces that were currently facing each other. To be exact, there were only two parties that were facing each other.","The Divine Life Palace, led by the Ninth Kalpa King, was on one side.","The Great Sun Divine Kingdom, Blood Sky Palace, and Great Void Divine Hall had joined forces.","They had no choice. In front of the Ninth Kalpa King, they had to join forces.","The Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes narrowed slightly, and a grave look appeared on his face.","Although he was conceited, he was not stupid. The three forces had more than ten peak Ultimate Rulers. Lord Zhennan, Qing Xuzi, and the five Blood Nether Emissaries were invincible Rulers when they joined forces. Now that they had joined forces, even he had to take them seriously.","Off in the distance, the Ruler Silver Roc was watching him like a tiger watching its prey. If he had the chance, he would strike like lightning!","“Ninth Kalpa King, what should we do now?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng asked.","The Ninth Kalpa King took a deep breath and replied, “No matter what, I must get this godly medicine!”","Then, he turned over his right hand and a nine-leafed divine herb appeared. He looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Jian Wushuang, I know that although you’re only a stage four great Ruler, your divine power is eight thousand times stronger than an ordinary cultivator’s. In addition to the power of will given by the laws of the universe, your divine power should be comparable to that of a top Ultimate Ruler. In addition to your comprehension of the laws of the universe and your gifted super power, you’re definitely not weaker than Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye.”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. He had to admit that he did have the battle strength to do so.","“You also have a divine body that’s 68000 kilometers tall, and your divine power is nearly limitless. As long as an Supreme doesn’t appear, there’s basically no one who can kill you.” The Ninth Kalpa King said again.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded again.","“This is a Nine-Leaf Sword Grass. It contains an extremely high amount of origin power of the Dao of the sword. I obtained it from a secret realm ten chaos cycles ago. In terms of value, it’s not much inferior to this godly medicine. As long as you help me hold off that Son of God Taixu for a moment, this Nine-Leaf Sword Grass will be yours. How about it?” The Ninth Kalpa King said seriously.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was shocked. He had heard of the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass.","The Nine-Leaf Sword Grass was born from the heaven and earth, growing by absorbing the sword Qi of the world. To a sword cultivator, it was a peerless treasure that could only be found by chance!","If Jian Wushuang had this Nine-Leaf Sword Grass, he was confident that his comprehension of the sword principle universe origin would reach a whole new level. At that time, his strength would enter a whole new world!","“Sure.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","The Ninth Kalpa King smiled indifferently and directly pushed the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass to Jian Wushuang.","“Divine Lord Qingfeng, help me block the five blood underworld messengers for a moment. I’ll give you one million universe origin stones. If you can get through this smoothly and return to the divine Palace, I’ll give you a top-tier law Cardinal treasure. What do you think?” Ninth Kalpa King looked at Divine Marquis Qingfeng and said.","“Five Blood Nether Emissaries?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng frowned and then laughed, “These five blood underworld messengers aren’t that strong individually, but when they work together, their combat power is no weaker than Qing Xuzi’s. However, I may not have any other skills, but I do have some skills in holding people back. I can try my best in a short while.”","Although Divine Marquis Qingfeng was not as famous as Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye, it did not mean that he was weak. As one of the old Ultimate Rulers of the Divine Life Palace, he was stronger than Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and the others, but he rarely fought.","Furthermore, his ability to entrap and trap enemies was also one of a kind.","“Very!”","Upon seeing this, the Ninth Kalpa King’s heroic spirit soared.","He did not expect Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng to defeat Qing Xuzi and the blood Messenger. He only needed them to stall for a while. He was confident that he could defeat the Great Sun Divine Kingdom and kill both of them!","At the level of an Ultimate Ruler, he, the Ninth Kalpa King, was invincible!","“Absorb!”","The next moment, the Ninth Kalpa King’s big hand stretched out and directly turned into a towering giant hand, covering the sky and the sun, and grabbed at the Supreme divine medicine on the edge of the cliff.","“Good!”","The red-robed Prince Zhennan from the Great Sun Divine Kingdom suddenly broke into a battle-thirsty smile. He took the lead and charged into the sky, crashing down on the giant hand!","“Hahaha, let me see if the Ninth Kalpa King, who is rumored to have the battle strength of a Supreme martial artist, is really that amazing!” Behind him, two golden Dharma wheels appeared. They were like blazing suns and shot out a bloodthirsty red light.","“You’re looking for death!”","Killing intent flashed in the Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes, and he pressed his hand down fiercely. In an instant, the towering giant hand that was originally grabbing the Supreme divine medicine changed its attack and slammed down on Lord Zhennan!","“Arrogant.”","On the other side, Qing Xuzi sneered. He grabbed the hilt of his sword with his right hand and unsheathed it.","A white-hot sword light shot out like a roaring dragon and slashed at the Ninth Kalpa King.","After this strike, Qing Xuzi did not give up. He took a heavy step and shot toward the Ninth Kalpa King.","“No one is allowed to take what the Blood Sky Palace wants.” The five Blood Nether Emissaries spoke at the same time, their voices hoarse and strange.","In the next moment, the five Blood Nether Emissaries flashed and disappeared from where they were.","At this moment, the unparalleled Rulers of the three forces charged at the Ninth Kalpa King at the same time!","Bang!","The Ninth Kalpa King’s palm slammed down, directly smacking Prince Zhennan, who was soaring into the sky, to the ground.","Just as Qing Xuzi’s sword was about to hit the Ninth Kalpa King...","Wuwuwuwuwu!","An equally dazzling sword light suddenly streaked across the sky and destroyed Qing Xuzi’s sword.","Then, a cold-looking figure in black stepped out and stood in front of Qing Xuzi.","“Your opponent is me.” The black-robed figure said indifferently.","“Eh? A fourth-stage chief Ruler?” Qing Xuzi’s figure, which was rushing forward, paused. He then squinted his eyes and asked coldly, “Who are you?”","The black-robed figure held the divine sword and replied calmly, “Jian Wushuang.”","Jian Wushuang? “I’ve never heard of it,” Qing Xuzi shook his head.","The next moment!","His eyes flashed with ruthlessness as he drew his sword and slashed forward again.","I don’t care who you are. Whoever blocks me will die!!!"]},{"number":4152,"title":"Chapter 4152 Battling Qing Xuzi","paragraphs":["4152 Battling Qing Xuzi","Whoosh!","The sword light burst forth.","This stroke was much more powerful than the previous one. The sword light, which was about 30 meters wide, seemed to split the heaven and earth as it slashed toward Jian Wushuang’s head.","“Then let’s fight.” Seeing this, Jian Wushuang laughed fearlessly and his eyes were filled with fighting intent.","“Split open the sky!” Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and spat out two words.","In an instant, a shocking sword rainbow was slashed out like an upside-down heavenly river, stunning the world.","Peng peng peng!","The sword-light and the sword-rainbow suddenly collided with each other. It was as if the sun and the moon had collided, and a loud rumble was heard.","On the other side, Divine Marquis Qingfeng took out a heavenly halberd. His body glowed with green light as if he was the God of War from the ancient heavenly court. He blocked the five Blood Nether Emissaries!","“Blood Nether Emissaries, if you want to get the Supreme divine medicine, you’ll have to get past me first!”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng smiled faintly as a towering battle intent exploded.","At this moment, the battle erupted!","Around the Fengyang Canyon, most of the Rulers had already retreated far away. Only a few of the extremely powerful peak Ultimate Rulers still had some greed for the divine medicine and wanted to wait for an opportunity.","In the canyon, an unprecedented battle was taking place.","All kinds of sword light, secret skills, and unique skills gushed out one after another. As if there was an earthquake in the valley, countless mountains were flattened and the ground was blasted into huge pits.","In the void, Jian Wushuang exchanged a blow with Qing Xuzi, the Divine Son of Taixu, and his face instantly flushed red.","“In the attack just now, I could feel that my comprehension of the sword principle should not be too different from his. My comprehension of the principles of the universe is stronger than his, but his divine power is much stronger than mine. Unless I use all my trump cards and stop suppressing the strength of my divine power, I have a chance of truly fighting him. Otherwise, I am definitely not his opponent.” Jian Wushuang understood that with his current strength, he should be considered an expert among the Ultimate Rulers. However, he was still a little weaker than these invincible Rulers.","“I’m still too weak.”","Jian Wushuang sighed. However, he was not depressed because he had never intended to defeat Qing Xuzi. He had only intended to stall him.","Jian Wushuang was lamenting his own weakness, but he did not know how much of a shock his sword had caused to Qing Xuzi.","“He’s only a Ruler of the fourth level. How could he take one of my attacks?” Qing Xuzi was shocked. Even though he had only used 30% of his power, he thought that a stage four great Ruler would not be able to withstand it!","One had to know who he was.","He was the unrivaled figure of the Great Void Divine Hall, the absolute Overlord of the Ultimate Rulers!","Even if a top-tier Ultimate Ruler came, he would at least be heavily injured if he did not die from his sword!","However, the person in front of him was only a fourth stage great Ruler. He was a small character with no reputation in the universe. Usually, he would treat such a person like an ant.","If someone had told him before that a stage four great Ruler could take one of his sword strikes, he would have taken it as a joke. But now, he had seen with his own eyes that a stage four great Ruler had not only taken one of his sword strikes, but had also come out unscathed!","How was this possible?","“You are Jian Wushuang, right? Very good, I’ll remember your name, but it’s over.” Qing Xuzi’s eyes turned cold. He held the hilt of his sword with his right hand and took a step forward.","Boom!","Qing Xuzi instantly turned into a stream of flowing light and struck down at Jian Wushuang like a divine lightning that could tear the dark night!","“Xing an!”","The world suddenly darkened.","Jian Wushuang raised his head to look at the invincible sword. His face was extremely serious. He did not dare to be careless at all and his divine power that was eight thousand times stronger exploded instantly.","That was not all. Jian Wushuang activated the power of will that was given to him by the principles of the universe and his divine power increased again.","“Earth-protecting sword formation!”","Hum...a large amount of sword essence swept out and formed a huge protective sword formation in the blink of an eye, covering Jian Wushuang’s entire body. The flowing light that tore the dark night had arrived and bit Jian Wushuang’s sword formation like a huge dragon.","Bang!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang flew backward and smashed into the ground, creating a bottomless pit.","Smoke and dust filled the air.","“It’s over.”","Qing Xuzi stood in the air where Jian Wushuang had been standing before and spoke expressionlessly.","He could feel that his sword had broken through Jian Wushuang’s sword formation and struck Jian Wushuang’s divine body. If a fourth stage great Ruler were to take his sword head on, he would definitely die.","Qing Xuzi shook his head and looked at the other side of the sky.","That place...it was the battlefield of Ninth Kalpa King and Zhennan.","“Bang bang bang bang!”","A series of deafening sounds rang out. The shockwaves from the battle between Ninth Kalpa King and Lord Zhennan directly set off a chaotic storm. Wherever the storm passed, countless voids trembled. It was enough to destroy ordinary Ultimate Rulers.","In the center of the storm, Ninth Kalpa King and Lord Zhennan were like gods descending to the mortal world. Every time they exchanged blows, the sky collapsed and the earth cracked.","“Lord Zhennan, you dare to stop me with this little strength? What a joke!” The Ninth Kalpa King smacked the Dharma wheel of Lord Zhennan away with one palm. His eyes were full of disdain as he sneered contemptuously.","His nine unique skills were used continuously, like a storm, and slammed down on Lord Zhennan.","Now, he did not suppress his realm. He was more than a thousand times stronger than the Ninth Kalpa King that Jian Wushuang had met in the trial arena.","Lord Zhennan did not say a word, but his face was so dark that it could drip water.","He had not expected that the Ninth Kalpa King would be so terrifying!","Facing the Ninth Kalpa King, he even felt like he was facing a Supreme Being!","“The Lord Zhennan can’t make it.”","Qing Xuzi looked at this scene and could not help shaking his head. He could see that Lord Zhennan had already used all his trump cards, but he was still crushed by the Ninth Kalpa King.","In terms of strength, the Ninth Kalpa King was definitely much stronger than the Lord Zhennan.","“It’s rumored in the universe that the Ninth Kalpa King has the battle strength of a Supreme. Now it seems that it’s true.” Qing Xuzi squinted his eyes and quickly made a decision in his heart. He had to gather the power of himself, the five Blood Nether Emissaries, and Lord Zhennan in order to contend with or even suppress the Ninth Kalpa King. Otherwise, once the Ninth Kalpa King finished off Lord Zhennan, he would probably be the next one to be finished off.","Bang!","He took a step forward and turned into a sword ray, ready to shoot at the Ninth Kalpa King.","However, at this moment.","“I told you, I’m your opponent,”","A clear and cold voice sounded behind his ears.","In the next moment, an extremely sharp sword rainbow shot up into the sky like a sharp moon, cutting off his path!"]},{"number":4153,"title":"Chapter 4153 I Have a Sword, Watch Carefully!","paragraphs":["4153 I Have a Sword, Watch Carefully!","“What?”","Qing Xuzi stopped in his tracks. He looked down and his face darkened.","There, in a huge pit, the smoke and dust gradually dispersed.","Jian Wushuang stood proudly with his black hair flying in the wind. He held the Wuqi Divine Sword in his right hand and pointed the tip of the sword to the ground. His expression was calm.","The corners of his mouth still carried a faint smile.","“Qing Xuzi, as long as I’m here, you’re not allowed to take even half a step in.” Jian Wushuang waved his right hand and a bottomless ditch appeared in front of him and Qing Xuzi.","Draw a line with a sword and teach you not to take half a step in!","“You’re looking for death!” Qing Xuzi was furious. His eyes were filled with killing intent as he swung his sword at Jian Wushuang.","Swordsmanship, dragon’s terror!!!","Boom!","At that moment, Qing Xuzi and the godly sword in his hand disappeared.","In the next moment, a Thunder Dragon with thunderous roars poked its head out of the void. It opened its huge mouth and roared, shaking the world!","Jian Wushuang, this sword is one of the strongest unique skills I’ve created after cultivating for a long time. “It’s enough to kill any Ruler below the supremacy stage. You should be proud to die in the hands of this sword.” Qing Xuzi’s emotionless voice came from the Thunder Dragon.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up and he took a deep breath.","Innate divine power, original universe!","Buzz!","The surrounding void shook slightly.","Then, a large amount of black air currents suddenly swept up and covered the surrounding void in the blink of an eye.","The sky and the earth were completely dark. There was no light at all, and the entire world fell into absolute darkness.","“Secret skill, dragon’s destruction!” There was a flash of light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes and the vast divine power in his body started to burn at a terrifying speed.","His divine power burned madly, and the power that he could unleash instantly reached a whole new level.","The original universe and the Dragon-destroying secret skill were Jian Wushuang’s two trump cards. At that moment, they were both used.","With these two trump cards, Jian Wushuang’s strength suddenly soared. He stared at the domineering thunder dragon and his expression suddenly became calm. He said in a low voice, “Qing Xuzi, I also have a sword. Watch carefully.”","Whoosh!","At this moment, the wind, the clouds, the dust, and the flying dust in the Fengyang Canyon all started to shake.","At that moment, everything in the world seemed to be attracted and all of them rushed toward Jian Wushuang’s hand.","The clouds in the sky, the howling wind, and the floating dust all turned into the purest origin energy in the world. Like the ocean flowing back and thousands of swords returning to their ancestors, they all gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","It was so grand that it covered the sky and the sun!","The Rulers and the few people who were fighting around them could not help but stop what they were doing at this moment. They looked up at this scene with a strong sense of disbelief.","In the end, the pure origin energy gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hand and turned into a silver sword rainbow that was a thousand feet long!","This stroke contained all of Jian Wushuang’s life’s comprehension of sword principle and gathered all of his power.","This sword had once shown its embryonic form in the trial arena. It had broken the nine-path unique skill of the Ninth Kalpa King with one sword, shocking the entire Divine Life Palace.","This sword was nameless, but it was Jian Wushuang’s strongest sword!","For more than 4000 years, Jian Wushuang had never stopped studying it since he comprehended this move in the trial arena of the Divine Life Palace.","After 3,000 years in the Dao Comprehension River and 1000 years in universe boat, Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of this sword move had finally reached its limit.","Although this sword attack was not perfect yet, it had already revealed its edge!","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang wielded the thousand-foot sword rainbow and slashed down. His black hair fluttered in the wind as if he was a peerless sword god.","Bang!","In an instant, the 300-meter-long sword rainbow slashed toward the thunder dragon in the primal universe domain.","The ground was split open with a rumble, and it reached three thousand feet!","The domain formed by the primal universe could suppress the opponent and strengthen itself. After entering the primal universe domain, the sword rainbow’s power increased again!","It destroyed the heavens and the earth, as if a disaster had descended!","“Rumble!”","The 1,000-foot sword rainbow finally collided with Qing Xuzi’s Thunder Dragon!","At this moment, the void twisted, and a huge shock wave spread rapidly from the point of collision, pressing the ground down ten miles!","Under this sword, time seemed to stop and space seemed to be broken. The thunder dragon that roared in the world only lasted for less than a breath of time before it suddenly shattered!","Qing Taixu’s Divine Son, Qing Xuzi, who was wearing a white robe with a large cloak embroidered with the two words ‘Taixu’, suddenly retreated!","Qing Xuzi slashed three times in a row before the sword rainbow was shattered.","“How is this possible?!!” He lowered his head and looked at the thin line of blood on his right hand. He was shocked and angry to the extreme.","This sword had actually broken through his thunder dragon and injured him! Even though it was only a thin line of blood, it had already caused him to be enraged!","It had been countless years since he had become an Ultimate Ruler, and no one had ever hurt him!","But now, he was being wounded by a fourth-level Ruler!","What a disgrace!","To him, to his pride as the divine child, this was a great humiliation!","“Jian Wushuang, I will kill you today!”","In the next moment, Qing Xuzi raised his head and stared at Jian Wushuang. The cold killing intent in his eyes was enough to freeze the nine Serenities!","If this child was not eliminated today, he would definitely become a great disaster in the future!","As for Jian Wushuang, although he had forced Qing Xuzi to retreat, his body had also trembled a little. Although the sword had taken shape, it was not perfect, and he had not controlled it perfectly. As he performed the sword, he was also affected by the sword essence.","“I hope you can do it.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and looked at the Ninth Kalpa King beside him.","The Ninth Kalpa King only needed him to hold on for a moment, but a period of time had already passed. During this time, Lord Zhennan had been completely crippled by the Ninth Kalpa King. Even his seven divine armor guards were only left with two or three miserable ones.","Jian Wushuang, hold on for another ten breaths. In just ten breaths, I will be able to get the Supreme divine medicine! The Ninth Kalpa King glanced at Jian Wushuang and said in a deep voice.","“No problem,” he said. Jian Wushuang nodded.","Bang!","At this moment, Qing Xuzi had already arrived.","“Ten breaths? Jian Wushuang, you are too arrogant!” Qing Xuzi’s eyes were cold as he stabbed at Jian Wushuang with his sword.","At that moment, he no longer regarded Jian Wushuang as an ant at the level of a fourth stage great Ruler. Instead, he regarded Jian Wushuang as an invincible Ruler of the same level as him. He no longer held back any of his strength."]},{"number":4154,"title":"Chapter 4154 Acquired","paragraphs":["4154 Acquired","Whoosh!","Qing Xuzi’s godly sword was like a venomous snake that suddenly slithered out at an unbelievable speed.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank. He raised the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and blocked the sword.","Clang!","The two swords collided, creating a violent storm that swept in all directions.","The void under Jian Wushuang’s feet exploded.","“Get lost!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly let out a roar and the divine sword in his hand swept across the void in a beautiful arc like a peacock spreading its tail.","Swish! Swish! The sword will was unleashed without restraint. With the support of the original universe and the dragon-destroying secret skill, the power of the sword was instantly boosted to its maximum.","Qing Xuzi also unleashed his full power.","However, Jian Wushuang’s understanding of sword principle was not inferior to Qing Xuzi’s. In terms of comprehension of universe principles, Jian Wushuang was even better than Qing Xuzi.","The only thing that Qing Xuzi was stronger than Jian Wushuang was that he was an unparalleled existence among the Ultimate Rulers. After he performed the secret skill, he had extremely powerful divine power.","However, after Jian Wushuang performed the dragon-destroying secret skill and the original universe, the power of the divine power was immediately wiped out.","Jian Wushuang was not much inferior to Qing Xuzi in terms of divine power. Naturally, Jian Wushuang could fight with Qing Xuzi face to face.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Shocking rumbles and collision sounds reverberated in the void of Fengyang Canyon. The many Ultimate Rulers who were watching the battle were stunned when they saw this scene.","“A fourth-stage great Ruler is actually evenly matched with Qing Xuzi?”","“Who is this fourth stage chief Ruler?”","“Where did this person come from? How can his combat strength be so terrifying?”","Everyone was in disbelief at this scene.","A fourth-stage chief Ruler was no different from an ant to these Ultimate Rulers.","Normally, they could easily slaughter a large group of fourth-stage great Rulers with a wave of their hands. But today, a fourth-stage great Ruler had Actually fought with Qing Xuzi, who was an Ultimate Ruler and had invincible combat strength!","They could see that Qing Xuzi had already used all his strength, but he still could not do anything to his opponent. He could not even gain the upper hand in the battle.","Such combat strength had completely exceeded their imagination.","“Impossible!”","“This is impossible!”","Qing Xuzi was also shocked and furious.","To be evenly matched with a stage four great Ruler was definitely the greatest humiliation he had ever experienced in his life!","What he did not know was that Qing Xuzi had already given his all, but Jian Wushuang still had some trump cards that he had not used. For example, he had not used his innate super power, life shock.","However, his only task was to keep Qing Xuzi busy. He did not have to risk his life.","Moreover, the time of ten breaths was almost up.","Suddenly, he was startled.","“Let’s go!”","An explosive roar resounded through the void.","“What?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked over and saw that the Ninth Kalpa King had already put the Supreme divine medicine into his bag. He had also rescued Divine Marquis Qingfeng, whose divine body was on the verge of collapse, from the five Blood Nether Emissaries and was rushing toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. Since the Ninth Kalpa King had already obtained the Supreme divine medicine, there was naturally no need for him to fight to the death with Qing Xuzi.","The next moment.","The Ninth Kalpa King arrived, picked up Jian Wushuang, and rushed into the distance.","With his speed, even if he took both Marquis Qingfeng and Jian Wushuang with him, none of the Ultimate Rulers could catch up to him.","The three of them would be able to escape unscathed.","However, at this moment.","Ninth Kalpa King, die!!","A strange figure appeared in the surrounding void without any warning. It was none other than the Ruler Silver Roc.","The Ruler Silver Roc had a grudge against the Ninth Kalpa King. He had been waiting in the surrounding void for the perfect opportunity to strike a fatal blow on the Ninth Kalpa King.","And now, this perfect opportunity had finally come. A golden spear appeared in his hand. At the tip of the golden spear, drops of purple-black venom dripped down, burning the void into poisonous smoke.","“Go!”","The Ruler Silver Roc’s eyes flashed with ruthlessness. He aimed at the Ninth Kalpa King’s back and threw the halberd!","In an instant, this golden spear actually leaped in the void. With a shuttle, it had already arrived at the back of the Ninth Kalpa King and ruthlessly stabbed in!","Clang!","The golden spear hit the armor on the surface of Ninth Kalpa King’s body and made a sound of metal hitting metal. However, the tip of the Golden spear did penetrate the armor and entered his divine body.","The Ninth Kalpa King’s body trembled, but he did not turn back. Instead, his divine power burst out and he swept forward at an even faster speed.","In the blink of an eye, the Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng had fled a thousand miles away and disappeared from Fengyang Canyon.","...","Inside the Fengyang Canyon.","Prince Zhennan’s red robe was in tatters, and his hair was disheveled. He was in an extremely sorry state. Five of the seven divine armor guards that had followed him had died in battle, and the remaining two were barely hanging on.","Qing Xuzi’s face was livid and gloomy.","Among the three forces, only those from Blood Sky Palace were calm.","Among the five blood messengers, a thin one glanced at Lord Zhennan and Qing Xuzi and said coldly, “One bragged about how powerful he was every day and took the initiative to challenge the Ninth Kalpa King. In the end, he was beaten so badly that he couldn’t even fight back. The other couldn’t even deal with a Ruler of the fourth level. What a waste.”","“You!” Qing Xuzi and Lord Zhennan’s expressions changed drastically.","“What’s wrong? You still want to fight?” The five Blood Nether Emissaries sneered with contempt.","Lord Zhennan took a deep breath. If he was at his peak, he would not be afraid of the five blood nether messengers. However, he was now seriously injured, and it would not be good for him to attack now.","“What about you guys? The five of them couldn’t even kill Divine Marquis Qingfeng, how strong can they be?” The Lord Zhennan sneered and retorted.","“What did you just say?” The five Blood Nether Emissaries narrowed their eyes at the same time and shot out cold lights.","“That’s enough, the three of you. Now is not the time to argue. Are you going to watch as the Supreme divine medicine is taken away?” Right at this moment, the hawk-nosed, black-robed Ruler Silver Roc walked over.","“Eh? They’ve already escaped. Do you still have a way?” Lord Zhennan, Qing Xuzi, and the Blood Nether Emissary all looked at the hook-nosed man.","The Ruler Silver Roc laughed, “That Ninth Kalpa King was hit by my spear. He can’t run far. My spear not only contained poison that could kill a peak-Level Ultimate Ruler, but it also left an origin mark.”"]},{"number":4155,"title":"Chapter 4155 Harvest","paragraphs":["4155 Harvest","“An origin mark?” The Lord Zhennan, Qing Xuzi, and the others were all surprised.","“Because the Ninth Kalpa King was in a hurry to escape, he could not completely remove the poison in the first place. I can find him based on this origin mark. However, if you continue to dawdle, I won’t be able to find him again after the Ninth Kalpa King has removed all the poison and my origin mark.” Ruler Silver Roc said.","Duke Zhennan, Qing Xuzi, and the five blood messengers’ eyes lit up when they heard the Ruler Silver Roc’s words.","“Very good, then let’s kill our way up now! This time, with the combined strength of the four of us, I don’t believe that the Ninth Kalpa King won’t die!” Duke Zhennan’s mouth curled into a sneer as he spoke with hatred.","The five Blood Nether Emissaries looked at each other, nodded, and said in unison, “The Supreme divine medicine is mine, and the Ninth Kalpa King is yours!","“I don’t want the Supreme divine medicine or the Ninth Kalpa King,” Qing Xuzi said, his face livid. “But I want Jian Wushuang dead!”","Qing Xuzi’s original target was the divine medicine. However, the battle with Jian Wushuang had become the shame of his life.","He could not allow this disgrace to continue living in this world. Therefore, compared to the divine medicine, he wanted to kill Jian Wushuang more.","When Ruler Silver Roc saw this, a sinister look of delight appeared in his eyes.","These forces came to an agreement in an instant. Under the lead of the Ruler Silver Roc, they immediately set off to the place where Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng had disappeared.","As for the Rulers around Fengyang Canyon, seeing that the protagonists of this battle had left, they also left one after another.","Of course, they all knew that the fight for the godly medicine was not over yet. After all, Lord Zhennan and the others had already caught up. As for the final result, no one knew.","However, just the battle that had just erupted in Fengyang Canyon was enough for them to talk about with great relish.","First of all, it was naturally the Ninth Kalpa King’s supreme strength.","The fact that the Ninth Kalpa King had such a great reputation in the universe and was considered the number one Ruler by many people had been completely confirmed by this battle.","Lord Zhennan was an invincible master among the Ultimate Rulers, and he had a few divine armor guards with him. They were all top-tier Ultimate Rulers, but they had been defeated by the Ninth Kalpa King alone. This kind of strength had completely exceeded the scope of a Ruler.","The rumors outside that the Ninth Kalpa King had the battle strength of a Supreme martial artist were true.","Moreover, the battle between Qing Xuzi and Jian Wushuang had shocked everyone.","No one had expected that Qing Xuzi, who could be said to be invincible among Rulers, would be able to fight evenly with a fourth-stage great Ruler.","Even though they did not know the name of this fourth stage great Ruler, he had been deeply remembered by everyone present.","...","On a mountain, Jian Wushuang and the other two temporarily stopped.","Among the three of them, Jian Wushuang was the most relaxed. Although he had burned a lot of divine power when he performed the Dragon-destroying secret skill in the battle with Qing Xuzi, he had a divine body that was 68000 miles tall. The amount of divine power he had burned was unbelievable. The amount of divine power he had burned was nothing to him.","It could be said that he had not suffered any losses in the battle with Qing Xuzi.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng, on the other hand, was in a miserable state. He had to face the attacks of the five blood underworld messengers at the same time, But he could only barely hold on. In the end, he used up a lot of divine power and had less than 30% of it left.","As for the Ninth Kalpa King, he had suffered a sneak attack from the Ruler Silver Roc.","“Silver Roc!”","The Ninth Kalpa King gritted his teeth and clenched his fists. His face was extremely gloomy.","In fact, he had tried to find the Ruler Silver Roc before, but the Ruler Silver Roc was very clever and had approached him without a sound. At that time, he had just obtained the godly medicine and was in a hurry to leave. He had not noticed it for a while, so the Silver Roc had gotten it.","The Silver Roc’s move had indeed caused him quite a bit of damage.","“What a terrifying poison!”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s entire body was already drenched in sweat. He had been fleeing all this while and had only relied on his divine power to forcibly resist the corrosion of the poison.","However, now that he had stopped and wanted to figure out the poison, he realized that it was far more terrifying than he had imagined.","“This definitely isn’t Ruler-level poison. If I’m not mistaken, this should have been concocted by an Supreme-level poison master.” The Ninth Kalpa King said in a low voice.","“Supreme-level poison?” Jian Wushuang was also shocked.","He had once relied on that special venom to kill his enemies, so he was well aware of how terrifying it was.","Under normal circumstances, if a Ruler had reached the peak of the art of poison, the poison they concocted would be able to threaten the top and even the invincible Ultimate Rulers.","If it was a poison concocted by a Supreme-being poison master, it would also be able to threaten a Supreme-being of the same rank.","What the Ninth Kalpa King was suffering from now was a poison of this level.","“It’s too terrifying. I’ve used up almost 40% of my divine power, but the poison hasn’t been completely removed.” The Ninth Kalpa King exclaimed.","Jian Wushuang also gasped.","The Ninth Kalpa King was a perfect life form. Although his divine body was not as shocking as his, which was 68000 miles tall, the divine power he possessed was definitely 1000 or even 10000 times more than that of an ordinary ultimate Dominator. Even so, in order to resist the corrosion of the poison, he had used up nearly 40% of his divine power.","And the poison was not completely removed?","It could be seen how powerful the poison was.","“Ninth Kalpa King, is that a problem?” Jian Wushuang looked at Ninth Kalpa King.","“Fortunately, it’s me. My divine power is comparable to a Supreme’s and can resist this venom head-on. Moreover, my divine power is thousands or even tens of thousands of times more vast than ordinary cultivators. Otherwise...” Ninth Kalpa King shook his head gently.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief.","It was obvious that the Ninth Kalpa King was still able to completely remove the poison.","“This time, I’ve really lost half my life.”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng said with a bitter smile. His divine body was on the verge of collapse, but his face was a little rosier. It would take him at least 1000 years to fully recover.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. Ninth Kalpa King and Divine Marquis Qingfeng were more miserable, so they did not suffer much losses.","Moreover, in the battle just now, not only had he fought with Qing Xuzi, a supreme Ultimate Ruler, and tested his strength, but he had also obtained a Nine-Leaf Sword Grass. It was a huge gain."]},{"number":4156,"title":"Chapter 4156 Another Attack","paragraphs":["4156 Another Attack","Although the battle in the Fengyang Canyon was risky, we all got what we wanted. A smile suddenly appeared on the Ninth Kalpa King’s face.","The godly medicine was already in his hands.","With this Shen Yao, he would have more opportunities to break through to the Supreme-being realm.","“Alright, let’s go find a place to hide first. After I’ve cleared all the poison in my body and restored my divine body and divine power to their peak, we’ll continue our adventure.” The Ninth Kalpa King said.","Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng both nodded.","Just as the three of them were about to find a place to hide, a sneer suddenly exploded in the sky.","“Hahaha, Ninth Kalpa King, where do you think you’re going?”","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang’s expressions changed in an instant, and they quickly looked up.","In the sky above them, Lord Zhennan, Qing Xuzi, Ruler Silver Roc, five Blood Nether Emissaries, and eight unrivaled Ultimate Rulers were standing in the void with their hands behind their backs, looking down at them.","“How did they get here so quickly?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s face turned extremely ugly. Logically speaking, the Tarot Ruins was vast and these people shouldn’t have been able to find them so quickly.","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King looked at this scene and could not help but frown.","There was something strange!","After they left the Fengyang Canyon, they had changed their direction dozens of times and deliberately avoided all the experts in the surroundings to come here. By right, no matter how powerful Lord Zhennan and the others were, they should not be able to find their location.","But now, huhu!","“Could it be the poison in my body?”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s face sank and he immediately checked his body carefully. Sure enough, there was an extremely obscure mark in the part of the venom that was still in his body.","The mark had completely fused with the venom. The Ninth Kalpa King had been so focused on resisting the corrosion of the venom that he had not noticed the existence of the mark.","“Silver Roc!”","The Ninth Kalpa King raised his head and fixed his eyes on the Ruler Silver Roc. His eyes were filled with killing intent. At this moment, his killing intent toward the Ruler Silver Roc had reached its peak!","“What’s wrong? Ninth Kalpa King, are you very angry now? Very well, maintain your anger. Next, I’ll make you feel pain in despair, and experience the pain you inflicted on me three million years ago! Hahahaha!” The Ruler Silver Roc looked at the Ninth Kalpa King, and the corners of his mouth slowly opened. He covered his face and laughed in a deep voice. He laughed so hard that his waist bent, and his eyes were full of crazy pleasure.","Three million years ago, his entire clan was exterminated by the Ninth Kalpa King alone. He was the only one left to perform a secret skill and escape from the Ninth Kalpa King’s hands by luck, saving his life.","The hatred of the Tu Clan was absolutely irreconcilable!","It had been three million years!","He had been waiting for this opportunity for three million years!","“You’re looking for death!”","The Ninth Kalpa King was a proud man. How could he tolerate such humiliation from the Ruler Silver Roc? he suddenly wanted to burst out and kill the Silver Roc at all costs.","Just as he was about to soar into the sky, a hand suddenly landed on his shoulder and gently pressed down.","“Don’t fall into his trap. He’s deliberately luring you to kill him.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and spoke indifferently.","The Ninth Kalpa King was so angry that he lost his mind, but Jian Wushuang did not.","In the sky above them, Lord Zhennan and the others had already formed a diamond shape, like a large net, completely sealing off the escape route of the three of them.","Once the Ninth Kalpa King rushed up to fight with them, he would immediately fall into their trap, which was exactly what they wanted.","Although the Ninth Kalpa King was strong, the poison in his body had not been completely eliminated, and his divine power had also been greatly damaged. It would be very difficult for him to fight with these eight invincible Rulers.","“We can’t fight this battle. We can only run.” Jian Wushuang sent a message.","The Ninth Kalpa King took a deep breath. He was not a stupid person. After this impulsive momentum, he naturally calmed down very quickly.","“Jian Wushuang, if we continue to stay together, I naturally won’t be afraid. However, the two of you might become my burden. So, I will use the Divine Kingdom of One Thought to trap these eight people. You and Divine Marquis Qingfeng can take the opportunity to leave.” The Ninth Kalpa King stared at Lord Zhennan, the Blood Nether Emissary, and the others in the sky and replied.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and then nodded.","He had never been a pretentious person, so he could tell that although he was still in his peak condition, he could not perform the original universe anymore. If he fought with Qing Xuzi again, he would definitely be no match for Qing Xuzi. Of course, with his life-saving abilities and his incredible godly body and godly power, these people couldn’t kill him.","However, Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s condition was too bad. He could not be of any help and might even become a burden to the Ninth Kalpa King.","It would be better for the two of them to leave directly.","“Then you must be careful.” Jian Wushuang said.","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King looked at Jian Wushuang with a heroic smile and said resolutely, “Don’t worry. I may not be a match for these eight people when they join forces. However, if I, the Ninth Kalpa King, want to leave, no one can stop me except for the Supreme martial artist!”","This was his pride, as well as the confidence he had as the number one expert in the Ruler realm!","Jian Wushuang looked at Ninth Kalpa King’s smile and was suddenly dumbfounded.","From the battle in Fengyang Canyon until now, although he and the Ninth Kalpa King had not made it clear, the two of them had gone through thick and thin together. One must know that before entering the Tarot Ruins, the two of them had been at loggerheads.","“Jian Wushuang, Divine Marquis Qingfeng, let’s go!”","In the next moment, the Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes narrowed, and a fierce roar rang out between heaven and earth.","“One Thought Divine Kingdom!”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In an instant, an unprecedented powerful aura exploded with the Ninth Kalpa King as the center!","This aura was completely different from the aura of the Ninth Kalpa King. It was filled with a feeling of the great Dao’s mystery. As soon as this aura appeared, the entire Tarot Ruins seemed to be unable to withstand it and emitted a ‘ka ka ka’ sound similar to glass breaking!","Black iron chains shot out from the void, covering the sky and forming a cold boundary that wrapped around the eight of them.","In that world, the sky and earth changed. Many mountains stood tall and rivers ran. It was like a world of its own!","“This is...One Thought Divine Kingdom!”","“How is this possible? The Ninth Kalpa King has yet to break through to the Supreme-being realm, so how could he have comprehended the One Thought Divine Kingdom?”","Even a Supreme martial artist can only control a Divine Kingdom of One Thought after reaching a certain level. How could the Ninth Kalpa King display a divine Kingdom of one thought with the power of a Ruler?!","Duke Zhennan, Qing Xuzi, the five Blood Nether Emissaries, and the Ruler Silver Roc were all dumbfounded at this moment!"]},{"number":4157,"title":"Chapter 4157 Fight to the Death!","paragraphs":["4157 Fight to the Death!","‘One Thought Divine Kingdom’ was a technique that even many Supremes would find difficult to master, and Rulers would find it almost impossible to comprehend.","However, today, the Ninth Kalpa King, who was known as the number one Ruler in the universe, not only had the battle strength of a Supreme, but he had also mastered the One Thought Divine Kingdom.","How far was he from being a true Supreme martial artist?","Under the eight people’s horrified gazes, as if they had seen a ghost, the Ninth Kalpa King laughed wildly and his figure soared into the sky.","“Jian Wushuang, live well. I’ll wait for you to become an Ultimate Ruler before fighting me! At that time, I won’t lose to you again!”","In midair, the Ninth Kalpa King took a deep look at Jian Wushuang, then immediately turned his gaze away. Without any hesitation, he rushed toward the eight people of Lord Zhennan without hesitation!","The cold killing intent in his body started to boil.","“Definitely!” Jian Wushuang nodded heavily. Without further delay, he grabbed Divine Marquis Qingfeng and flew away.","In a flash, Jian Wushuang left the mountain and headed to a place in the ruins that no one had explored yet.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","At the same time, a battle broke out in the Ninth Kalpa King’s divine Kingdom of one thought!","This battle had turned the world upside down, and the sun and moon had lost their color!","...","After the time for one incense stick to burn.","The Divine Kingdom collapsed inch by inch, and the Ninth Kalpa King disappeared.","“The Ninth Kalpa King has been injured by the eight of us. He can’t run far. Chase him!” The five Blood Nether Emissaries’ faces were extremely gloomy. At this moment, their black robes were torn and three of their black moon sickles were broken.","The next moment.","They headed in one direction at high speed.","Duke Zhennan’s injuries had worsened. He took an extremely precious pill, exchanged a glance with the Ruler Silver Roc, and also took a heavy step forward to catch up.","Among the eight of them, only Qing Xuzi remained.","His face was cold as he looked in the direction where Jian Wushuang had gone. He said in a cold voice, “Jian Wushuang, I’m not interested in the Ninth Kalpa King. But you, I’ve said it. I’ll kill you no matter where you go!","“You can’t escape!","“Great void forbidden technique, God guide!”","Pfft!","Qing Xuzi bit the tip of his tongue and spat out blood essence.","In an instant, the mouthful of blood essence twisted and condensed in the air, forming two small blood-colored words, ‘Jian Wushuang’.","“Gather!”","Qing Xuzi lowered his voice and suddenly, the three blood-red characters ‘Jian Wushuang’ collapsed and turned into a small blood-red sword. The tip of the sword was pointing in the southwest direction and it kept trembling.","Qing Xuzi’s face turned pale. He could tell that the secret skill had cost him a lot.","“Southwest? Jian Wushuang, let’s see if you can survive this time!”","Seeing this, Qing Xuzi’s lips curled into a cold smile. He took a heavy step and followed the blood-red sword.","...","In the southwest direction, high up in the sky.","Jian Wushuang carried Divine Marquis Qingfeng and was rushing forward. Suddenly, blood gathered above his head and formed a faint blood-red arrow in the shape of a small sword.","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. Looking at the blood-red arrow, he had a bad feeling.","“Jian Wushuang, run! This is the Great Void Divine Hall’s God attraction forbidden technique!”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng was very knowledgeable. After thinking for a moment, he recognized the blood-red arrow and his expression changed.","“God-guided forbidden technique?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s expression was ugly as he replied, “This God attraction forbidden technique is one of the five great forbidden techniques of the Great Void Divine Hall. Anyone who is cast with this forbidden technique, regardless of whether they are in the sky or on the ground, or even at the very edge of the universe, will be found by the person who cast this forbidden technique. They will either be killed or the person who cast this forbidden technique is dead. Otherwise, the blood-red arrow will continue to exist. Furthermore, as the distance between the two gets closer, the color of the blood-red arrow will become more and more intense.","“In other words, no matter where you run to, Qing Xuzi will find you and fight you to the death!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","He knew that Qing Xuzi would come after him regardless of the Ninth Kalpa King, but he did not expect Qing Xuzi to have such a strong killing intent.","They were actually willing to pay a price to use this forbidden technique, which clearly meant that they would not rest until one of them was dead.","What kind of enmity was this? What resentment?","“Speaking of which, I only blocked him during the fight for the godly medicine. Does Qing Xuzi have to be so persistent?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","What he did not know was that Qing Xuzi, as the number one genius of the current era of the Great Void Divine Hall, was even more arrogant than the Ninth Kalpa King.","He was confident in his outstanding talent. In the entire universe, he did not care about anyone except the Ninth Kalpa King.","In fact, from the bottom of his heart, he did not think much of the Ninth Kalpa King. In his opinion, the Ninth Kalpa King was only so powerful because of his perfect life level. However, in terms of other means, he was confident that he was not much weaker than the Ninth Kalpa King.","But such a proud peerless genius had been stopped by a fourth stage Ruler in front of countless people in the battle of Fengyang Canyon.","Furthermore, he had used all his skills, yet he could not do anything to that fourth stage Ruler.","This was definitely the shame of his life!","And this humiliation could only be washed away with Jian Wushuang’s life.","Because of this, he did not even fight for the divine medicine in the hands of the Ninth Kalpa King. Instead, he directly attacked Jian Wushuang.","As long as Jian Wushuang did not die, he would definitely become Qing Xuzi’s inner demon for the rest of his life.","“Qing Xuzi is too narrow-minded.” Jian Wushuang could not help but ask.","“Jian Wushuang, let’s escape first. According to my guess, Lord Zhennan and the others should be chasing after the Ninth Kalpa King, and only Qing Xuzi will be chasing you. If it’s only Qing Xuzi, when I recover a little, we should be able to compete with him if we join forces.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng said.","“Yeah, that’s the only way now.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","Bang!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang took a heavy step forward and disappeared from where he was like a cannonball.","...","Not long after.","A white-robed figure with a sword on his hand flew over to where Jian Wushuang had been.","“Eh? There’s still a large amount of divine power left in the air, so he shouldn’t have gone far.” Qing Xuzi muttered to himself expressionlessly.","“Jian Wushuang, let’s see where you can escape to this time.”","The next moment, Qing Xuzi flashed and chased in another direction.","...","In a dense forest, Jian Wushuang was moving quickly. Every step he took covered a thousand miles.","“I’m getting closer!” Jian Wushuang’s face was extremely gloomy. The color of the blood-red arrow above his head became thicker.","This meant that the distance between him and Qing Xuzi was getting closer and closer.","He looked down at Divine Marquis Qingfeng and shook his head."]},{"number":4158,"title":"Chapter 4158 Chase After","paragraphs":["4158 Chase After","In order to fight the five blood emissaries, Divine Marquis Qingfeng not only suffered heavy injuries and lost most of his divine power, but he also used some unique secret techniques. The price of these secret techniques was high, so he could not recover his strength in a short time.","Even now, Divine Marquis Qingfeng had only recovered a bit of his divine body. He was still far from his peak strength.","“Jian Wushuang, why don’t you put me down? I’m a burden to you.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked up at him and smiled bitterly.","“We haven’t reached that stage yet.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and continued to rush forward.","However, in less than the time for one incense stick to burn...","Jian Wushuang!","A cold shout exploded in the air.","Jian Wushuang looked back and saw Qing Xuzi approaching him quickly with a sneer on his face.","In front of Qing Xuzi, a small blood-red sword was floating in the air. The tip of the sword was pointed at Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, give up your futile struggle and surrender obediently. I might even spare your life.” Qing Xuzi said with a cold smile.","“You’re noisy.” Jian Wushuang’s face was gloomy as he continued to rush forward.","“It’s no use. You can’t escape from the absolute suppression of cultivation.”","Qing Xuzi shook his head in disdain and sped up again, approaching Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s speed could not be said to be slow. With the support of a large amount of divine power, even an ordinary Ultimate Ruler could not compare to him.","However, compared to Qing Xuzi, who was invincible in the Ultimate Ruler realm, Jian Wushuang’s speed was far inferior.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The two of them, one in front and one behind, turned into a stream of light in the air, leaving a long trail of flames behind them as they streaked across the sky. They gradually left the central area of the Tarot Ruins and headed toward a remote area that no one cared about.","Jian Wushuang, put me down. Otherwise, we will both die. Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked at Jian Wushuang seriously.","Jian Wushuang did not reply. Instead, he took a heavy step and shouted, “Secret skill, dragon’s destruction!”","Boom!","The vast divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body instantly boiled and burned. His speed instantly exploded again and increased by a few levels.","In an instant, the distance between Qing Xuzi and Jian Wushuang, which was gradually closing, widened again after Jian Wushuang used the dragon-destroying secret skill!","“Oh? It can actually be even faster?” Qing Xuzi raised his eyebrows and could not help but be shocked.","Jian Wushuang’s speed was already shocking enough, but he did not expect that Jian Wushuang could be even faster!","While Qing Xuzi was amazed, his killing intent toward Jian Wushuang grew stronger.","This child must not be left alive!","Qing Xuzi shook his head and sneered. “Humph, Jian Wushuang’s speed must have been obtained at the cost of some secret skill, right? I don’t believe that he can keep using this secret technique!”","Qing Xuzi was not in a hurry to catch up with Jian Wushuang after he finished speaking. Instead, he followed Jian Wushuang from a distance.","With the God attraction forbidden skill, he was not afraid that Jian Wushuang could escape.","God attraction forbidden technique, not stopping until death!","As long as Jian Wushuang was not dead, he would not be able to escape!","In front.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned gloomy. Qing Xuzi was right. The dragon-destroying secret skill could indeed allow his power to burst out instantly. However, there was a time limit. Once his divine power was exhausted, Qing Xuzi would still catch up with him.","“Divine Marquis, how’s your recovery?” Jian Wushuang lowered his head and asked.","All he could do now was to buy as much time as possible for Divine Marquis Qingfeng to recover.","Then, they would be able to defeat Qing Xuzi together!","“In such a short time...I don’t think he’ll be able to recover.”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng shook his head with a bitter smile.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered.","“Whoosh!”","Jian Wushuang and Qing Xuzi turned into two flowing lights and streaked across the sky.","As Jian Wushuang used the dragon-destroying secret skill and burned his divine power to increase his speed, the distance between the two of them grew.","Not long after, Qing Xuzi was left behind and disappeared.","However, Jian Wushuang did not look happy at all.","The tip of the blood-red dagger above his head had not disappeared at all.","This meant that no matter where he ran to, Qing Xuzi would be able to find him as long as the arrow was there.","“No, I can’t let this continue!”","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with determination.","It seemed like Divine Marquis Qingfeng would not be able to recover in a short period of time. Although his divine power was vast, he could not burn it without restraint. As soon as he stopped burning the dragon-destroying secret skill, Qing Xuzi would catch up.","It was better to let Divine Marquis Qingfeng leave first since Qing Xuzi’s target was him. Qing Xuzi did not care if Divine Marquis Qingfeng was dead or alive.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang said, “Divine Marquis Qingfeng, we’ll split up.”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng was taken aback and he shook his head. “You’re Qing Xuzi’s target. If we’re together, although I haven’t recovered to my peak strength, I’ll be able to make him fear me at all costs. However, if I leave, Qing Xuzi will have nothing to fear.","“Actually, Divine Marquis Qingfeng could’ve just left.”","Qing Xuzi did not even consider him a target. The reason why Divine Marquis Qingfeng did not want to leave was that he was worried that Jian Wushuang would not be able to fight Qing Xuzi without his help.","However, Jian Wushuang smiled confidently at Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s words and replied, “Divine Marquis, don’t worry. Although I’m not a match for Qing Xuzi now, it won’t be easy for him to kill me.","“This...” Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked at Jian Wushuang with hesitation.","He could tell that Jian Wushuang’s confident smile was not fake.","“Alright, then.”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng nodded. He did not have the time to be a girl at this critical moment. Since Jian Wushuang asked him to leave, he would leave.","“Jian Wushuang, take care of yourself. If we meet again in the future, we will definitely drink and chat merrily!” After saying that, Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked at Jian Wushuang deeply before flying toward a mountain.","“I will.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","After Divine Marquis Qingfeng left, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and a murderous look flashed in his eyes.","Although he was not as powerful as Qing Xuzi, it did not mean that he could not do anything to him.","“Qing Xuzi, since you’re determined to fight me to the death, I’ll have to prepare a surprise for you.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were extremely cold, but he still had a plan in his heart."]},{"number":4159,"title":"Chapter 4159 A Surprise","paragraphs":["4159 A Surprise","Not far behind Jian Wushuang.","Qing Xuzi only glanced at Divine Marquis Qingfeng and Jian Wushuang when he saw them split up. He did not pursue them.","Indeed, Jian Wushuang was his only target. As for Divine Marquis Qingfeng, he didn’t care at all.","However, the smile on Qing Xuzi’s face gradually disappeared as he continued to chase Jian Wushuang. He frowned and said, “How strong is Jian Wushuang’s divine power?”","!!","Qing Xuzi’s expression turned ugly. According to his original guess, Jian Wushuang must have used some unique secret skill to increase his speed so rapidly. It should not have been easy to perform such a secret skill. At the very least, it should have consumed a lot of divine power. There was no doubt about that. Otherwise, Jian Wushuang would not have burst out with such a fast speed from the beginning.","However, he had been chasing after Jian Wushuang for almost four hours and Jian Wushuang’s speed had not slowed down at all!","What kind of concept was this?","“Fine, I’d like to see how long your divine power can keep you up!” Qing Xuzi snorted, and his expression became cold again.","With the God attraction forbidden skill, he was not afraid that Jian Wushuang would escape. Therefore, he was not in a hurry.","...","In the blink of an eye, more than half a day had passed.","For such a long time, Jian Wushuang had been performing the dragon-destroying secret skill and burning his divine power. If it had been before Jian Wushuang had undergone the life baptism, he would not have been able to withstand it for so long.","However, after the life baptism, his divine body had grown to a height of 68000 miles. How vast was the divine power contained in such a huge divine body?","Even though he had been burning the dragon-destroying secret skill for more than half a day, he had used less than ten percent of his divine power.","Jian Wushuang kept moving forward. He did not know when he had arrived at the edge of the Tarot Ruins. Because it was remote, there were few Supreme treasures and opportunities. Therefore, there were almost no experts wandering here.","Just as Jian Wushuang passed by a mountain range, he stopped.","“It’s almost time.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and his body instantly shot down and landed on the mountain range.","Stepping on the ground, Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the blood-red arrow that was hanging above his head.","The color of the blood-red arrow had become very faint. Based on this, Qing Xuzi should still be quite far away from him.","This was also the reason why he did not mind burning his divine power as he flew. He wanted to keep Qing Xuzi as far away from him as possible so that he would have more time to prepare.","On the mountain, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, slowly sat down cross-legged, and closed his eyes.","Immediately after, rays of sword Qi shot out from his body and burrowed into the mountain range like an Earth Dragon.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang no longer suppressed the divine power in his body. When he was fighting with Qing Xuzi earlier, he had been controlling the strength of his divine power to be about eight thousand times that of an ordinary cultivator. However, now, it was equivalent to thirteen thousand and five hundred times that of an ordinary cultivator. He burst out his divine power to the limit.","13,500 times of divine power, along with Jian Wushuang’s understanding of sword principle and the origin of the universe, swept out madly. Then, under Jian Wushuang’s control, the sword Qi was hidden in the majestic mountain range!","After the sword Qi entered the mountain range, it was all contained and not released, as if it was quietly waiting for someone’s arrival.","Ten...a hundred...a thousand...ten thousand...","“Qing Xuzi, I hope you like the surprise I’m giving you.”","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes slightly and a faint smile appeared on his face.","...","After about an hour.","A white-robed figure stepped on the void and approached step by step.","His speed did not seem fast, but every step he took crossed a thousand miles.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re not running anymore?” Qing Xuzi stood on the mountain range with his hands behind his back. He looked down at Jian Wushuang with interest, like a cat toying with a mouse.","He was not worried that Jian Wushuang would escape, so he took his time.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and slowly opened his eyes after hearing Qing Xuzi’s words.","A bright light quickly flashed across his eyes.","“Qing Xuzi, there’s not much hatred between us, right? why do you keep biting me?” Jian Wushuang looked up at him and said indifferently.","“Grudge?” Qing Xuzi burst into laughter as if he had heard a funny joke.","“I, Qing Xuzi, don’t need revenge when I kill people.”","“Whoever I want to die must die.”","Qing Xuzi’s mouth was filled with a trace of pleasure and mockery.","Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change. He nodded and replied, “Alright,” he said.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re just a fourth-level Ruler. You should be proud that you can force me to this extent. If you were given more time, when you break through to the fifth stage or become an Ultimate Ruler, your fighting power might be stronger than that of the Ninth Kalpa King. Even I would have to run away if I met you by then. Unfortunately, you’re just an ant in front of me now.”","Qing Xuzi shook his head. Then, he grabbed the godly sword by his waist with his long fingers.","“Jian Wushuang, remember, this sword is called Jingchan.”","“Die in peace!”","Bang!","Qing Xuzi unsheathed his sword, and a crescent sword light instantly folded the void and slashed toward Jian Wushuang’s head.","Facing the cold sword, Jian Wushuang suddenly lowered his head and sighed.","The next moment.","He suddenly raised his head, and his eyes were filled with killing intent!","“Qing Xuzi, you’re the one who should die!”","“Sword Qi, rise!!!”","Boom!","At this moment, the sky changed color. The entire mountain range was like a landslide, and a loud rumble was heard.","The ground began to crack, the sky began to change color, and traces of cold sword intent rose.","“What?”","Qing Xuzi raised his eyebrows and a look of confusion flashed in his eyes.","“Slash!”","As Jian Wushuang shouted, the majestic mountain exploded!","Three hundred thousand rays of sword Qi shot out, covering the sky!","At this moment, the void seemed to be torn apart, and a storm of sword Qi was formed!","“What?”","Under Qing Xuzi’s shocked and furious gaze, the 300000 rays of sword Qi gathered together like a long Dragon that swallowed the sun. It hovered in the sky and blocked all the light. It roared and bit toward Qing Xuzi!","Bang!","What kind of scene was it when three hundred thousand rays of sword Qi swept across?","They were densely packed and covered the sky like ten thousand swords!","Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the middle of the three hundred thousand sword Qi, was like the sword monarch who held the power to kill!","The 300,000 rays of sword Qi were condensed by Jian Wushuang’s divine power that was 12700 times stronger. The explosion caused by it was enough to kill an Ultimate Ruler in an instant!","This was the big surprise that Jian Wushuang had prepared for Qing Xuzi!"]},{"number":4160,"title":"Chapter 4160 Spatial Rift","paragraphs":["4160 Spatial Rift","Boom! Boom! Boom!","A clap of thunder resounded between heaven and earth!","The 300,000 rays of sword Qi slashed toward Qing Xuzi like a dragon that could destroy the world and a snake that could swallow the sun!","Jian Wushuang! Qing Xuzi’s expression changed drastically for the first time, and he roared!","!!","Bang!","The next moment, the 300000 rays of sword Qi crashed into Qing Xuzi’s body.","Clang, clang, clang, clang.","Qing Xuzi raised his sword to block the attack. The sharp sword Qi collided with the body of his startling cicada divine sword, making a clanging sound of metal and sparks.","However, Qing Xuzi only managed to block less than 100000 sword Qi before the shocking cicada divine sword was knocked out of his hand.","Then, the 200,000 sword Qi crashed into his body without any resistance.","Qing Xuzi’s divine body trembled like a sieve as if thousands of swords were piercing through his heart, making dense muffled sounds.","After three breaths of time, the 300000 rays of sword Qi finally disappeared.","Jian Wushuang stared at the scene until Qing Xuzi’s body fell to the ground like a broken bag. He finally heaved a sigh of relief.","He believed that even Qing Xuzi, who was considered invincible among the Ultimate Rulers, would not be any better off when faced with the 300000 flashes of sword Qi that he had put in so much effort and carefully planned, which was unleashed with 13000 times divine power and the burning divine power of the dragon-destroying secret skill.","Time passed, breath by breath.","The place where Qing Xuzi had landed raised a huge cloud of dust. Jian Wushuang did not dare to let his guard down. After all, Qing Xuzi was not only an invincible Ultimate Ruler, but also the deity of the Great Void Divine Hall, a top power in the universe.","No one knew what kind of trump card the Great Void Divine Hall had prepared for him when they sent him to the Tarot Ruins.","Cough, cough, cough.","Suddenly, the sound of blood being coughed up could be heard from the smoke.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. As expected, the 300000 rays of sword Qi were not enough to kill Qing Xuzi.","The smoke and dust gradually dispersed.","The place where Qing Xuzi had fallen formed a huge pit that was hundreds of meters wide.","Qing Xuzi staggered up from the pit, looking extremely miserable.","The white robe embroidered with the words ‘great void’ on his body was completely torn and hung on his body like a piece of rag. His hair was all disheveled, and his handsome face was full of blood. He no longer looked like the indifferent and noble son of God. He was in an extremely sorry state.","“Sword! Wu! Double!”","Qing Xuzi panted heavily and stared at Jian Wushuang. He squeezed the words ‘Jian Wushuang’ out of his teeth.","Clang!","He bent his waist and slowly moved forward. Then, he grabbed the divine sword Jingchan that was stuck in front of him. Like a demon that had crawled out of hell, a monstrous hatred exploded from his body.","“His aura didn’t weaken much?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the scene expressionlessly, but he sighed in his heart.","He had thought that even if he could not kill Qing Xuzi, he could at least severely injure him with the killing move that he had prepared with so much effort and divine power. However, although Qing Xuzi looked extremely embarrassed, his aura was not weakened much at all.","In the end, it was still because his realm was too low.","If he had not been a stage four great Ruler but a stage five great Ruler, he believed that that move would have been enough to kill Qing Xuzi.","“Almost...just a little bit more...I really did suffer a setback at the hands of a fourth-stage chief Ruler!” Qing Xuzi’s eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang. While he was shocked and angry, he also felt lucky.","If not for the fact that the great void God temple had given him a life-saving jade pendant that could resist the power of a Ruler, he might have really failed miserably.","The killing move just now had a total of 300000 rays of terrifying sword Qi attacking him. If he relied on his own strength, he would definitely be seriously injured even though he could survive.","Once he was seriously injured, it would be difficult for him to recover in a short time, so he could only leave the Tarot Ruins for the time being.","Right now, even though he had protected himself from being severely injured by that killing move, he had used the life-saving jade pendant that the great void godly temple had prepared for him to use in the Tarot Ruins.","Qing Xuzi lowered his head and looked at the diamond-shaped jade pendant that had been broken into eight pieces in his hand. He could no longer suppress the killing intent he had never felt before.","“Jian Wushuang, I’m going to break all the bones in your body inch by inch and extract your soul from your divine body. You’ll have to suffer the pain of being burned by the sword every day!” Qing Xuzi said resentfully.","Jian Wushuang’s face was cold. He did not even look at Qing Xuzi. Instead, he looked at the void around him.","Perhaps it was because of the simultaneous explosion of the 300000 rays of sword Qi, the void had been distorted by the impact.","Gradually, an obscure space crack appeared.","“Spatial Rift?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed.","In the Tarot Ruins, under the impact of the sword Qi, a space crack suddenly appeared?","Where did the Spatial Rift lead to?","“Jian Wushuang, in fifty chaos cycles, you are the first person to force me into such a situation. Good, very good!” Qing Xuzi’s eyes were as cold as a poisonous snake’s. He took a deep breath and seemed to have made a decision. His brows gradually furrowed and he said, “Void forbidden technique, God’s wrath!”","Boom!","All of a sudden, Qing Xuzi’s long hair flew up, and a fierce wind burst out with him as the center.","Meanwhile, Qing Xuzi’s Qi started to surge inch by inch!","In the blink of an eye, it had reached a whole new level.","In an instant, the terrifying power was like a tide that pressed on Jian Wushuang.","After all, Jian Wushuang had fought with Qing Xuzi head-on after he had used the original universe. They were evenly matched. Although Qing Xuzi’s power was strong, it was not enough to scare Jian Wushuang.","However, Jian Wushuang felt suffocated by the power.","“What is this?” Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and for the first time, his eyes revealed a look of disbelief.","If Qing Xuzi’s previous strength was one level lower than the Ninth Kalpa King’s, then the feeling that he gave Jian Wushuang now was definitely no less than the Ninth Kalpa King at his peak.","Qing Xuzi had relied on the forbidden technique to possess the battle strength of a Ninth Kalpa King for a short period of time, which was comparable to that of a Supreme.","Jian Wushuang, you really deserve to die! Qing Xuzi said coldly. Only he knew what price he had to pay to use the ‘great void forbidden technique, God’s wrath’.","In order to kill Jian Wushuang, Qing Xuzi was willing to do anything!","Whoosh!","Before Qing Xuzi could finish his sentence, he had already disappeared."]},{"number":4161,"title":"Chapter 4161 The Second Level of the Tarot Ruins","paragraphs":["4161 The Second Level of the Tarot Ruins","“Run! I’m definitely not his match right now!” Jian Wushuang thought quickly. He was never an arrogant person. He did not think that he, who was only a fourth stage great Ruler, could compete with Qing Xuzi.","“Do you think you can escape?”","Zi zi zi.","At this moment, a shadow condensed in front of Jian Wushuang. Then, Jian Wushuang saw that Qing Xuzi had already raised the divine sword Jingchan and was about to stab his head!","!!","It was too fast! The sword was so fast that Jian Wushuang couldn’t react in time to defend.","At this critical moment, Jian Wushuang finally used his trump card.","“Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”","In an instant, a Supreme pressure from the level of life descended.","This pressure that came from the difference in life’s natural order disregarded cultivation realms.","Even though Qing Xuzi could now rival a Ninth Kalpa King, he was still affected by the shock of life.","At that moment, it was as if time had frozen. Qing Xuzi’s body, which was charging forward, froze instantly.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to retreat. Without any hesitation, he turned around and plunged into the void crack.","Ka ka ka.","The domain of intimidation of life only lasted for less than half a breath’s time before it shattered.","Qing Xuzi’s eyes were cold. He looked at the void crack that Jian Wushuang had entered and said coldly, “Jian Wushuang, do you think I can’t do anything to you just because you escaped into the crack in the void?”","Bang!","Qing Xuzi took a step forward and shot into the crack in the void.","...","Jian Wushuang seemed to have passed through a dark and bottomless tunnel. When his eyes brightened, he was stunned.","A spire-shaped Black Palace appeared in front of him.","On the palace, one large word was carved in a flamboyant manner, ‘Tarot!’","This word seemed to have been drawn with a golden hook and a sharp brush. An extremely overbearing sword intent was emitted!","‘This is...!’ Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and his eyes revealed a look of surprise.","If his guess was correct, this was most likely the second level of the Tarot Ruins that King Zhufeng had mentioned, where the true Tarot treasures were hidden!","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to enter the palace, he suddenly turned his head back as if he had sensed something.","Zi zi zi.","The void twisted, and a white-robed figure fell from the sky.","“Qing Xuzi?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. This person was really persistent.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ve said it. You can’t escape.” Qing Xuzi sneered.","“Die!” The next moment, when Qing Xuzi was about to use all his divine power to kill Jian Wushuang, his face suddenly turned ugly.","He found that all the divine power in his body seemed to be suppressed by an extremely strong power. He could not use even ten percent of it!","“What’s going on?” Qing Xuzi finally noticed the existence of the palace, and he was stunned.","“Qing Xuzi, if I’m not wrong, this is where the real treasures of the Tarot Ruins are. Why don’t we stop here and look for opportunities here? When we get out of here, we’ll settle our grudges and grievances together. What do you think?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“The real treasure of the Tarot Ruins?” Qing Xuzi’s expression changed. After a while, he snorted and said, “Jian Wushuang, I’ll let you live for a while. Then, I’ll take your life.”","In fact, he wanted to kill Jian Wushuang first. However, the problem was that his strength was greatly suppressed once he came here and he could not use ten percent of his strength. Under such circumstances, he could not kill Jian Wushuang at all.","Naturally, he could only stop temporarily.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and no longer said anything. He walked into the Black Palace, step by step.","The palace was huge and had a total of five floors. There was a long winding corridor that kept winding up.","Pa da, pa da.","Pa da, pa da.","The sound of Jian Wushuang’s footsteps reverberated in the quiet Palace, sounding a little dull.","“The universe origin stone! A huge amount of universe origin stones!”","At this moment, Qing Xuzi’s ecstatic voice was heard from the other side of the long corridor.","Jian Wushuang focused his eyes and looked over. In a corner of the first level, countless universe origin stones were piled together, forming ten magnificent mountains!","Each mountain had at least 10 million universe origin stones!","Even Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned red as he looked at the small mountain of ten universe origin stones.","Qing Xuzi immediately grabbed a universe source stone.","Jian Wushuang did not want to be outdone. He stretched out his hand and grabbed another universe origin stone.","Bang!","However, before they could touch the universe origin stone, a light blue halo suddenly spread out from the small mountain of universe origin stones and bounced off Jian Wushuang and Qing Xuzi’s huge hands.","“I can’t take it?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and his eyes flickered.","He pondered for a moment. This palace was filled with the power of restrictions. If he wanted to get the things in this palace, he would probably have to first control this palace and remove the power of the restrictions.","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes revealed a touch of enlightenment. He immediately quickened his pace and walked to a higher place in the palace.","Qing Xuzi, on the other hand, seemed to be in disbelief. He grabbed at the 10 universe source stones crazily, making loud banging sounds.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head. He did not stop and continued to walk along the winding corridor.","The second level...","The third level...","The fourth level...","Jian Wushuang walked faster and faster. On the second floor, there were a large number of Supreme treasures of principles. On the third floor, there were all kinds of divine herbs. The higher he went, the more items he found on the fourth floor. There was an ancient book floating quietly.","The Tarot sword manual!","A domineering and sharp aura was emitted from the ancient book. Jian Wushuang looked at the ancient book and could not help but feel a sense of worship.","This was the aura left behind by the Supreme Tarot!","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang reached out his hand and tried to take the Tarot sword manual.","Bang!","An even stronger restrictive force bounced back.","Jian Wushuang took a few steps back to suppress his boiling blood.","As expected, the items in this palace could only be seen, not taken. If he wanted to truly obtain these treasures, he had to first think of a way to gain control of this Palace.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and continued to walk up.","Half an hour later.","Jian Wushuang walked to the fifth floor.","It was a tightly shut door, and there were two huge statues holding swords standing in front of the door. One of them had a solemn look, while the other had a ferocious look.","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang reached out and pushed the door open.","Boom! Boom!","A cloud of dust rose up, and an ancient, foul air rushed out of the door.","The door that had been sealed for hundreds of chaos cycles had been pushed open by Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was solemn. His right hand held the hilt of the Wuqi Divine Sword that was hanging diagonally from his waist and he strode in."]},{"number":4162,"title":"Chapter 4162 King Zhufeng?","paragraphs":["4162 King Zhufeng?","On the fifth floor, there was a huge palace, just like the Royal Palace of a dynasty. It was solemn and dignified. Beads of blue light hung above the palace, illuminating it with a mysterious and hazy light.","Jian Wushuang looked straight into the depths of the hall and his eyes flashed with a touch of fear.","There was a huge throne there!","A figure in a dark golden black robe was sitting quietly on the throne.","This figure had his head lowered, and his black hair, which reached his legs, was scattered on the ground, making it impossible to see his face clearly.","Under the throne, there were six mummified corpses with their mouths wide open and their faces filled with fear.","“This is?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank. He flipped his right hand and an ancient sheepskin scroll appeared.","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at the sheepskin scroll. On the first page of the sheepskin scroll were seven human faces. They were the portraits of King Zhufeng’s team from ten thousand years ago.","Jian Wushuang put away the sheepskin scroll and looked at the six mummies under the throne again. He was shocked.","These six mummies were the six members who had followed King Zhufeng to the Tarot Ruins 10000 years ago!","Looking at this scene, Jian Wushuang did not know why, but he felt a strong chill.","Jian Wushuang instinctively planned to retreat.","Ka ka ka.","However, at this moment, the purple-gold Black-robed figure sitting on the throne slowly raised his head.","All of a sudden, Jian Wushuang’s hair stood on end and he felt a terrible fear. It was as if there was a knife on his back and he was facing death.","The figure on the throne slowly raised his head, revealing an old face.","Seeing this face, Jian Wushuang’s pupils suddenly shrank,","He was extremely familiar with this face. It was one of the targets of their visit to the Tarot Ruins, King Zhufeng!","“King Zhufeng, you’re not dead?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise.","“Yeah, how can I die?” King Zhufeng’s voice was hoarse as he laughed.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. For some reason, King Zhufeng gave him an extremely strange feeling.","He took a few steps back and prepared to send a message back to the Divine Life Palace to tell them that King Zhufeng was still alive.","However, the result of the message made Jian Wushuang’s expression change slightly.","The transmission was cut off!","It was as if there was an invisible force here that had completely cut off his communication with the Divine Life Palace.","“My child, are you afraid? Why are you retreating?” King Zhufeng looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange expression.","“A child?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","This was obviously not how King Zhufeng should address him.","He also found that when King Zhufeng spoke, an invisible power enveloped him. This power was extremely gentle and made him yearn for it. It was as if it really came from his father.","“Something’s wrong!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and tried to calm himself down. He was now absolutely sure that something had happened to King Zhufeng!","“King Zhufeng, what’s going on with them?” Jian Wushuang raised his head slightly and pointed at the six mummies with his chin.","“They? Who knows?” King Zhufeng shook his head, then looked straight at Jian Wushuang and said in a low voice, “My child, come over quickly. I don’t like to talk from so far away.”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless, but he could not help but sneer.","Just as he was about to walk out of the palace, a cold snort suddenly sounded from outside the door.","Then, Jian Wushuang saw Qing Xuzi stride in.","“Eh? Is there anyone else here?” Qing Xuzi raised his eyebrows when he saw King Zhufeng sitting on the throne.","“Another one.” On the throne, King Zhufeng saw Qing Xuzi stepping in and immediately laughed in a low voice.","Vaguely, Jian Wushuang, who was paying close attention to King Zhufeng, seemed to see some ferocity and greed hidden in his smile.","“Old man, what are you laughing at?” Seeing this, Qing Xuzi’s face turned cold. He snorted and changed the topic. “Old man, let me ask you, do you know how to take the things in the hall?”","“You want it?” King Zhufeng smiled.","“Nonsense. If I don’t want it, why would I ask you?” Qing Xuzi replied with a sneer.","“Alright, child. Come over here and I’ll tell you.” King Zhufeng’s smile became more and more kind.","However, the uneasiness in Jian Wushuang’s heart grew stronger.","“You’re just pretending.” Qing Xuzi was also on his guard. He took a closer look at King Zhufeng. Although King Zhufeng gave him a strange feeling, he could tell that King Zhufeng did not seem to have much strength at the moment.","After a moment’s silence, Qing Xuzi raised his head again. “I don’t think you can do anything.”","Qing Xuzi slowly walked toward King Zhufeng.","“Right...that’s it, child, you just walk over like this...I’ll tell you how to get the treasure.” King Zhufeng’s voice was filled with desire, and his lips were trembling with excitement.","Pa da.","Qing Xuzi stepped in front of King Zhufeng and looked down at him. “Tell me, how can I get the treasure here?”","“Alright, alright, alright. Lower your head and come closer. I’ll tell you immediately.” King Zhufeng’s voice had a strange magic power.","Qing Xuzi’s expression changed, but before he could do anything, King Zhufeng raised his hand and pressed it toward his head.","Qing Xuzi wanted to dodge, but he was shocked to find that his movements were blocked by an invisible force. In the end, he could not avoid King Zhufeng’s palm, which was still on his head.","In an instant, blood and divine power were sucked out to King Zhufeng’s arm and into his body.","Qing Xuzi’s body shriveled up at a speed visible to the naked eye, and he let out an extremely miserable scream.","Clang!","Qing Xuzi trembled as he held the Jingchan divine sword at his waist and slashed it upward.","Bang!","However, this divine sword that could cut through the sky was caught by King Zhufeng with just a gentle grab.","Then, under Qing Xuzi’s horrified gaze, King Zhufeng opened his mouth and swallowed the sword inch by inch.","Kacha kacha kacha.","In just a few seconds, the sword disappeared from King Zhufeng’s mouth.","Pa da.","Qing Xuzi fell to the ground and turned into a dried corpse. His face was still filled with fear.","A Divine Son, an unparalleled existence among the Ultimate Rulers, had died just like that!","“Hehehehe!”","King Zhufeng let go of his hand and let out a low and eerie laugh."]},{"number":4163,"title":"Chapter 4163 Drastic Changes","paragraphs":["4163 Drastic Changes","The sudden change shocked Jian Wushuang.","Run!!!","Jian Wushuang was alarmed. Without any hesitation, he quickly retreated.","Qing Xuzi’s body turned into a dried corpse in an instant. Coupled with the six other dried corpses on the ground, Jian Wushuang realized that there was definitely something wrong with King Zhufeng.","Bang!","However, just as Jian Wushuang was about to escape from the hall, the heavy door closed automatically with a bang.","Then, King Zhufeng’s hair, which had been hanging on the ground, rose up and shot toward Jian Wushuang like sharp swords.","The color on King Zhufeng’s old face seemed to fade, and in a short moment, it turned into a greenish-gray rotten face.","His eyeballs shattered with a loud bang, and the inside of his eye sockets became pitch-black, as if there was a strange fire jumping inside.","Clang!","A strand of hair shot toward Jian Wushuang like a big snake. Jian Wushuang quickly jumped to avoid it, but the strand of hair hit the ground where he had been, creating a small pit.","“Something’s wrong! You’re not King Zhufeng!” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically.","“King Zhufeng? So, this body is called King Zhufeng.” King Zhufeng slowly stood up from the throne, and a piercing sound that was completely inhuman came out of his throat.","At the same time, an extremely evil and overbearing sword intent burst out from his body, setting off a terrifying spatial storm.","“You can call me the Tarot sword demon, or you can call me the Tarot divine sword.”","‘King Zhufeng’ approached Jian Wushuang step by step. His hair floated up, his face was rotten, and his eyes were hollow and deep, like a messenger from hell.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The strands of hair shot toward Jian Wushuang. When Jian Wushuang’s Wu Qi divine sword hit the hair, it only caused a series of sparks but could not cut it.","After dodging hundreds of strands of hair, Jian Wushuang finally could not avoid it in time and was directly hit by a strand of hair. It immediately swept up and tied Jian Wushuang up like a rice dumpling.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power surged and he struggled madly. However, no matter how he struggled, he could not break free from the restraint of the hair.","At this moment, ‘King Zhufeng’ had already walked in front of Jian Wushuang. He stretched out his five fingers and pressed them on Jian Wushuang’s head.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang was facing a dead end.","“This is bad.” Jian Wushuang’s face was filled with fear.","Hehe...King Zhufeng smiled eerily and pressed his palm on Jian Wushuang’s head.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang felt all his divine power and vitality being sucked away by King Zhufeng.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s three gifted super powers and various unique skills seemed to be sealed and he could not use any power.","King Zhufeng’s palm was like a black hole that could swallow everything, constantly devouring Jian Wushuang’s life force and divine power.","“Eh?”","Suddenly, King Zhufeng’s hands stopped moving, as if he had discovered something, and he let out an interested sound.","‘This junior’s divine power is so vast. It’s unbelievable. He’s only a fourth stage great Ruler, but his comprehension of the universe’s principles is comparable to ordinary Supremes. Tsk, tsk. With such talent, he must be a top genius in the outside world.’","“It’s a pity to die here.”","King Zhufeng clicked his tongue and shook his head. Although he was full of praise, the cold and greedy look on his face did not decrease at all.","He was absorbing Jian Wushuang’s divine power and life-force, so he could naturally see the density of Jian Wushuang’s divine power. As for Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the universe principles, he had no idea how King Zhufeng could see it.","King Zhufeng did not stop. He continued to devour Jian Wushuang’s life force and divine power.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes gradually turned black and then slowly closed under the tremendous devouring power.","Bang!","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s armor suddenly glowed and a shadow with a cold expression suddenly appeared in front of him. It was the protective seal that Blood Wave Supreme had left on his armor.","“How audacious! Which demon dares to hurt the disciples of our divine Palace? Die!” The Blood Wave Ruler extended a finger and pointed it at King Zhufeng with the power to destroy the stars.","“Eh? The power of a Supreme Being?” King Zhufeng narrowed his eyes and sneered.","“If your true body was here, I would be a little afraid. It’s just a protective seal, how dare you be so presumptuous? Get lost!” King Zhufeng’s face turned serious as a bunch of black hair rose from the back of his head. Like a javelin, it instantly pierced through the protective seal of Blood Wave Supreme!","Rumble!","The apparition of the Blood Wave Ruler crumbled into pieces.","“Hmph, when I was still alive, a Supreme like you didn’t even have the qualifications for me to make a move, and now you dare to stop me?”","King Zhufeng sneered, his rotten face looked a little ferocious.","He continued to press his palm on Jian Wushuang’s head and he devoured the life force and divine power.","King Zhufeng felt the endless vitality and divine power coming from his arm, and a look of joy appeared on his face.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to turn into a dried corpse, King Zhufeng’s hands stopped and a look of surprise flashed across his face.","“How is that possible? This...the strength of this junior’s divine power was actually more than ten thousand times? Even the legendary perfect lifeform, who had developed his innate advantages to the extreme, couldn’t have godly power that was ten thousand times stronger. Could it be...?”","As a remnant of the Tarot Supreme’s violent aura before his death, or rather, as the current sword spirit of the Tarot divine sword, he had seen many things.","He knew a lot about special life forms.","At the same time, he also knew that in terms of divine power, the strongest perfect life form, when they fully developed their innate advantages, would only have divine power that was 10000 times stronger than ordinary cultivators.","But now, as he was absorbing Jian Wushuang’s divine power, he could clearly feel that Jian Wushuang’s divine power was much stronger than an ordinary fourth stage Ruler’s. It was definitely more than ten thousand times stronger.","If his divine power was more than ten thousand times stronger, then wouldn’t the life level of this junior in front of him be higher than that of a perfect life form?","“Hahahahaha, the heavens did not give me, Tarot, but gave me such a great fortune!” The ugly and rotten faces of King Zhufeng and the sword spirit of Tarot were instantly filled with ecstasy.","At that moment, he changed his mind.","He no longer wanted to kill Jian Wushuang. Instead, he wanted to possess Jian Wushuang!","He was going to inherit this body that was extremely talented and had a life level that far exceeded perfection!","Spirit devouring!!","“Die!” King Zhufeng shouted. Then, a terrifying scene appeared."]},{"number":4164,"title":"Chapter 4164 Taken Over?","paragraphs":["4164 Taken Over?","From the center of King Zhufeng’s eyebrows, his flesh was torn apart, and a dark golden sword tip slowly extended out.","The sword tip, the sword body, the sword hilt...","In just a few breaths, a dark golden sword with countless mysterious Dao patterns on the blade and a bloody vertical eye on the hilt came out of King Zhufeng’s body.","This was none other than the Tarot sword that had struck fear into the hearts of all the races of the universe millions of chaos cycles ago!","The Tarot sword was filled with a demonic and evil aura. It had been nourished by the baleful energy left behind by the Tarot supremacy of millions of chaos cycles, and it had completely transformed into a demonic sword!","Whoosh.","The tip of the Tarot divine sword rotated slightly and then slowly stabbed toward the space between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","King Zhufeng’s body shriveled up at a visible speed, turning into a dry corpse and finally melting into a pool of blood.","Ka ka ka.","The Tarot divine sword entered Jian Wushuang’s forehead inch by inch. After a while, the Tarot divine sword had completely entered Jian Wushuang’s body.","The strange thing was that there was no wound or blood between his eyebrows.","Bang!","The next moment, Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes!","The pupils in his eyes disappeared and were replaced by a deep void.","“Jian Wushuang? Very good, from today on, I am the sword demon, Jian Wushuang!”","‘Jian Wushuang’ opened the corners of his mouth and let out a low and strange laugh. The laughter echoed in the huge Hall and seemed extremely eerie.","His body was floating in the void. With a pull of his right hand, the countless javelins-like hair suddenly turned into countless black lines and returned to Jian Wushuang’s hand.","Then, he stepped down from the void and carefully felt the body. A satisfied smile appeared on his face.","“With this body, I’ll be able to reach the peak of the universe once again, and I’ll be even stronger than I was in my last life. But...this body is still too weak. I have to think of a way to make this body stronger, or it’ll be a waste.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and then pulled out the Wuqi Divine Sword. He looked at it and shook his head. “Then, let’s start by strengthening this sword.”","‘Jian Wushuang’ stepped into the third level of the hall, where countless principles cardinal treasures and divine materials for refining weapons were piled up.","“Hmm, evil dragon’s venomous fangs, chaotic cold iron, the core of the universe, star essence...”","One by one, Supreme-grade blacksmithing materials that were enough to cause a sensation in the outside world shot into ‘Jian Wushuang’s’ hands. After a closer look, there were at least 100 of them.","‘Jian Wushuang’ nodded and sat down with his legs crossed. He pulled out the Wuqi Divine Sword and said in a low voice, “Refine!”","In an instant, a black divine flame condensed in front of him and burned the void.","The greatest fortune that belonged to Jian Wushuang in his entire life had begun!","...","In the Great Hall on the second level of the Tarot Ruins.","‘Jian Wushuang’ sat cross-legged, and in front of him, a cluster of black divine fire burned the void. In the divine fire, the Wuqi Divine Sword was melting and reforming continuously.","Although Jian Wushuang and Qing Xuzi could see the Supreme-grade divine materials before, they could not take them away. Now, ‘Jian Wushuang’ grabbed them from the second level of the hall and threw them into the black divine fire. Then, they were refined into the Wuqi Divine Sword to improve its grade.","Time flew by.","In a flash, a hundred years had passed.","“It’s done!”","‘Jian Wushuang’ spread his fingers. The Wuqi Divine Sword, which was floating in the air, suddenly let out a clear sound and flew back into his hand.","Clang!","Jian Wushuang stretched out his finger and flicked the blade. In an instant, the Wuqi Divine Sword trembled hundreds of millions of times. The void seemed to be trembling.","Hehehehe...although this sword has not broken through to the level of a supreme weapon, it has already reached the limit of a nomological Supreme treasure. In terms of power, it’s a thousand times stronger than before. A satisfied smile appeared on Jian Wushuang’s pale and strange face. He waved his hand and immediately put the Wuqi Divine Sword into his Interspatial Ring.","‘Next, I’ll improve this body.’","‘Jian Wushuang’s’ eyes flashed with a slight look of contemplation. He casually flipped through the Interspatial Ring and a look of surprise suddenly flashed across his face.","“Mid-grade nomological Dao fruit? Wait...this is a Nine-Leaf Sword Grass?” Jian Wushuang’s face was filled with joy.","To him, a mid-grade Dao fruit of law was nothing. There was more than one mid-grade Dao fruit of law on the third level of the palace. However, the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass was different!","The Nine-Leaf Sword Grass was a godly medicine that countless swordsmen dreamed of!","It contained the comprehension of the origin of the way of the sword. It was the most primitive principles of the way of the sword at the beginning of the universe. It had incredible uses for any sword cultivator.","‘I didn’t expect this junior to have such an opportunity. Fine, I’ll improve my sword Dao universe origin first.’ Jian Wushuang swallowed the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass and the mid-grade Dao fruit of laws in one gulp and started a new round of improvement.","...","At the same time, in the Divine Life Palace.","In the Supreme shrine where Supreme Blood Wave was located.","“Impudent!” The Blood Wave Supreme, who had been resting with his eyes closed, suddenly opened them, and a look of anger flashed across his face.","“Blood Wave, what happened?” Supreme Giant Axe, who was standing beside him, could not help but frown and ask.","He and the Blood Wave Ruler had been friends for dozens of chaos cycles, and he had rarely seen the Blood Wave Ruler so enraged. He could not help but feel a sense of confusion.","“Jian Wushuang, something has happened.” Supreme Blood Wave said slowly.","“What did you just say?” Giant Axe Supreme was shocked. He knew how much the Blood Wave Supreme valued and looked forward to seeing Jian Wushuang. He felt the same way.","A perfect being with such great talent and incredible potential had never been seen since the Divine Life Palace was established.","“The protective mark I left on Jian Wushuang’s armor has been erased.” The Blood Wave Ruler’s face was dark, and his eyes were filled with cold killing intent.","Giant Axe Supreme’s eyes flickered when he heard this. He knew about the protective mark that Blood Wave Supreme had left in Jian Wushuang’s armor. It could be said that with the mark, no one in the world could hurt Jian Wushuang except a Supreme.","This was also the reason why the Blood Wave Ruler dared to let Jian Wushuang go to the Tarot Ruins as a fourth-level Ruler.","However, the Blood Wave Supreme was now telling him that the protective seal had been forcefully erased!","What kind of concept was that?","Could it be that a Supreme martial artist had appeared in the Tarot Ruins?","Taking a deep breath, Supreme Giant Axe said in a deep voice, “Blood Wave, the protection mark being erased doesn’t mean that Jian Wushuang is dead. Why don’t we go to the Life Palace to see if Jian Wushuang’s life lamp has been extinguished?”"]},{"number":4165,"title":"Chapter 4165 Dormant","paragraphs":["4165 Dormant","The Divine Lamp of Life Hall was the place where every cultivator of the Divine Life Palace left their life imprint.","As long as a cultivator of the Divine Life Palace died, the Lamp of Life he left in the hall of the divine Lamp of Life would be extinguished.","“Yes.” The Blood Wave Ruler nodded with an unsightly expression.","He had already made up his mind. If Jian Wushuang really died in the Tarot Ruins, then no matter who killed Jian Wushuang, no matter what his background was, he would kill him!","After a while, they arrived at the Life Palace and saw Jian Wushuang’s Lamp of Life.","It was an ancient bronze lamp, and the flame burning on it was much weaker than the other ancient lamps. However, when the Blood Wave Supreme and the Giant Axe Supreme saw this, they both heaved a sigh of relief.","“It’s good. Although Jian Wushuang’s Lamp of Life is weak, it hasn’t been completely extinguished. At least, it means that he’s still alive.” Said Giant Axe Ruler.","The Blood Wave Ruler’s originally gloomy face relaxed upon seeing this. He snorted coldly and said, “It’s a good thing he didn’t die, or else ...”","The Blood Wave Ruler paused.","“Alright, alright. Since Jian Wushuang is not dead, we’ll leave everything to him. I believe that he has his own good fortune and there’s no need for us to interfere.” Supreme Giant Axe consoled him with a smile.","The Blood Wave Ruler nodded, and the two of them gradually disappeared from the Temple of the Divine Lamp of Life.","...","Tarot Ruins, second level.","‘Jian Wushuang’ was sitting cross-legged, constantly refining the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass and the middle-grade Dao fruit of laws.","Waves of sword Dao origin and universe law energy wrapped around him like a ball.","At the same time, in the depths of Jian Wushuang’s soul realm, a real consciousness that belonged to Jian Wushuang slowly awakened.","“As expected, the best choice is to go into hiding.”","The consciousness that belonged to Jian Wushuang woke up instantly. Memories flooded into his mind and he understood everything in an instant.","“Eh? The grade of the Wu Qi divine sword has already been raised to the level of a Supreme treasure of principles?” The consciousness body formed by Jian Wushuang’s consciousness squinted. He suppressed the idea of repossessing the body.","He could feel that the person who had taken his body away was actually trying every possible way to improve his body. The level of effort made him feel a little ashamed of his inferiority.","“Since that’s the case, there’s no need to rush.” Jian Wushuang’s consciousness form’s eyes flickered and he instantly made a decision to wait and see.","The sword spirit of the Tarot divine sword contained the remnant will of Tarot Supreme. It had followed Tarot Supreme to the north and south, and had seen many things.","However, although the sword spirit was knowledgeable, Jian Wushuang, who he was facing, was a perfect life form that was rare to see in an era of the universe. The sword spirit knew a little about perfect life forms. For example, he knew that perfect life forms could develop their innate advantages to the extreme and their divine power could be ten thousand times stronger than that of ordinary cultivators.","However, there were some extremely secretive things that the sword spirit did not know.","For example, the unique immortal body possessed by a perfect life form was to completely integrate one’s Soul Origin into divine power. As long as the divine power was not completely destroyed, one would not die.","It was because of this that Jian Wushuang was unrivaled in the soul aspect!","Devil Flame had once tried to possess Jian Wushuang, and his soul power was far stronger than Jian Wushuang’s.","In the end, Devil Flame became Jian Wushuang’s slave.","No one could attack a perfect life form from the soul. The sword spirit performed the same possession technique on Jian Wushuang. It seemed that he had occupied Jian Wushuang’s divine body, Jian Wushuang’s entire body.","In actual fact, Jian Wushuang had intentionally allowed him to control his divine body while his consciousness had already gone dormant.","He had no choice but to do this.","If the Tarot divine sword’s sword spirit knew that possession was useless against him, it might directly absorb all of his divine power and vitality. At that time, he would really die.","Now, the sword spirit of the Tarot divine sword had not only possessed him, but it was also trying to improve his strength after thinking that it had successfully possessed him. Jian Wushuang naturally enjoyed it.","“I’d like to see how much he can improve my strength.” Jian Wushuang’s consciousness form muttered to himself. Then, the consciousness completely merged with his divine power. No matter how brilliant the Tarot divine sword’s sword spirit was, it would definitely not be able to discover the existence of his consciousness.","...","With a single thought, thousands of rivers and mountains could be seen.","With a single thought, the world would change.","The vast universe would never stop moving forward just because someone was missing.","The killing in the universe was constantly happening, and the battle in the Tarot Ruins had never stopped.","In the blink of an eye, a thousand years had passed.","In a crack in the void, on the second level of the Tarot Ruins.","‘Jian Wushuang’ slowly opened his eyes. In his deep, whirlpool-like eyes, there was a ball of coquettish ghost fire jumping.","“Hahahaha, the heavens have blessed me. I didn’t expect this junior’s talent in sword principle to be so high. In just a short thousand years, my comprehension of the sword principle of the universe origin has reached the third realm!” Jian Wushuang stretched out his five fingers, covered his face, and laughed in a low voice.","He was just a sword spirit and did not have any comprehension of sword principle before. However, after controlling Jian Wushuang’s body, he naturally grasped everything Jian Wushuang had comprehended. Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the sword principle of the universe origin had already reached the point of near completion.","In the past one thousand years, thanks to the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass, he had not only reconstructed Supreme Tarot’s Tarot sword principle from his previous life, but he had also pushed it to the third level of sword principle origin!","In addition, the mid-grade nomological Dao fruit was also very useful. It greatly improved his comprehension of the principles of the universe and even benefited him greatly in the principles of the heaven and earth. The eighth law of the heaven and earth had already begun to show signs of fusion.","“It seems like it’s only a matter of time before we return to the peak. This universe is destined to be the era of my Tarot.”","‘Jian Wushuang’ smiled eerily. He had already started to imagine the beautiful blueprint of his future in the universe after he had completely mastered this body and taken in everything it had.","“I think that at that time...it must be very exciting, right?” Jian Wushuang pinched his chin and appeared to be very confident.","With this body, why would he worry about not being able to move unhindered in the universe? Looking down on all four directions?","At that moment, he did not know whether his future would be wonderful or not. However, in the depths of his soul realm, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness body had an extremely wonderful expression."]},{"number":4166,"title":"Chapter 4166 He’s Out","paragraphs":["4166 He’s Out","“This guy...are you serious?” Jian Wushuang felt strange.","For a thousand years, he had been looking at the remnant soul of zenith heaven, like a diligent old cow that had been plowing the land. He had been controlling his body, trying every possible way to increase his strength.","Jian Wushuang’s consciousness form was even more certain that it was the right decision to stay dormant. Without this guy, how long would it take for his strength to improve so quickly?","This remnant soul of zenith heaven was simply a gift from the heavens to help him increase his strength!","Of course, the premise of all this was that he was a perfect life form that was as rare as Phoenix Feathers and Qilin horns in the universe. It was also because the Tarot sword spirit did not have a complete understanding of perfect life forms.","In this soul realm, as a perfect life form, he only needed to think and he could directly start to fight back against the remnant soul of the sword spirit of Tarot, or even kill it. Once the remnant soul was killed, everything that Jian Wushuang comprehended from the remnant soul of Tarot would be taken over by Jian Wushuang without any hindrance, without any discomfort.","This was because it was something that he had comprehended from his own body.","Outside the soul realm.","“Yes, I’ve almost reached the peak of this body in all aspects. I just need to make the next breakthrough when the conditions are right.” Jian Wushuang held his chin and thought for a while, then said to himself, “Hehe, it’s about time to go out. But before that, we can’t leave these things behind.","Thinking of this, ‘Jian Wushuang’ went straight to the fourth floor and put the Tarot sword manual into his Interspatial Ring.","Then, he went to the third and second floor again, and put countless divine medicines, divine materials, and treasures into his Interspatial Ring.","However, at the first level, Tarot’s remnant soul had only collected five universe origin stones, which was about 50 million pieces. This made Jian Wushuang’s consciousness body in his soul realm sigh in pity.","At the same time, he had already made preparations. As soon as the soul fragment left the Spatial Rift, he would immediately kill it and regain control of his body.","Three days later.","Tarot’s remnant soul drove Jian Wushuang’s body to the two statues on the fifth level.","“I’ve been here for hundreds of chaos cycles. I’ve finally found a suitable body and left this damned place!” Jian Wushuang laughed and pressed his palm on the head of the statue on the left.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In an instant, a huge vortex that looked like a black hole appeared in the void.","‘Jian Wushuang’ took a heavy step forward and shot toward the huge Whirlpool while laughing wildly.","...","Inside the Tarot Ruins.","On the bank of a river, two forces were in a confrontation.","Rather than a confrontation, it would be more appropriate to call it a hunt.","On one side was a hunting team formed by six Ultimate Rulers. They specialized in hunting down lone or weak Ultimate Rulers in the Tarot Ruins, similar to Divine Emperor Thousand Leaves and Ruler Violet Eye.","On the other side, there were two Ultimate Rulers who were alone. Their divine bodies were riddled with holes, and they seemed to be on the verge of collapse. If the six Ultimate Rulers who were surrounding them didn’t seem to be afraid, they would have swarmed forward and killed the two Ultimate Rulers.","“Star Ruler, Heavenly Ruler, hand over the divine cold iron stone and we can guarantee that we’ll let you two go!” A big man with two hammers in his hands and a small braid on the back of his head said.","When the two people who were being hunted heard this, it was as if they had heard a funny joke, and they could not help but laugh loudly.","“Hahahaha, Agalor, you’re better off using these words to deceive ghosts!” The Star Ruler spoke disdainfully. He understood that if the hunting team had not been worried that he would destroy the divine cold iron stone before he died, they would have killed the two of them long ago. Why would they waste so much time talking to them?","If they really did as they were told and obediently handed over the divine cold iron stone, they would immediately face a storm of attacks.","“Hmph, you don’t know what’s good for you!”","Immediately, the big man with the pigtails ‘face darkened, and he said with killing intent, “Since that’s the case, Star Ruler, Heavenly Ruler, don’t blame us for being ruthless!”","Kill!!!","In an instant, this hunting team of six Ultimate Rulers turned into six divine beams of light and shot toward the two!","Rumble!","At this moment, the sky and earth suddenly changed color. It was as if the void had been torn apart. At first, it was a small black dot. Then, the black dot gradually expanded and turned into a huge vortex full of black clouds and lightning!","“Hehehehe, I’ve finally come out!” A maniacal laugh suddenly rang out.","The hunting team that had turned into six divine rays and was charging toward the Star Ruler and the Heavenly Constellation Ruler stopped in their tracks. They raised their heads and looked at the vortex in shock.","The Star Ruler and the Constellation Ruler could not help but raise their heads to look at the sky.","Whoosh!","A black stream of light shot out from the black vortex and stopped in front of them with a loud laugh.","“This...who is this?” The hunting squad, Star Ruler, and Heavenly Constellation were all shocked.","They had never heard of anyone who could tear open space in the Tarot Ruins, let alone walk out of it.","The black light gradually dissipated, revealing a black-robed young man with a cold expression.","“Who is he? The fluctuations of divine power on his body seemed to be...he seems to only be a fourth-stage chief Ruler?”","The eight of them were all puzzled.","They had been shocked, but when they realized that this young man only had the cultivation of a fourth-level Ruler, they began to calm down.","“Kekekekeke...it’s been hundreds of chaos cycles! I finally get to breathe some fresh air!” The black-clothed young man stretched his back lazily, then stuck out his tongue and greedily licked the corner of his mouth.","He was Jian Wushuang, who was being controlled by the Tarot divine sword.","“Kid, who are you?” A cold snort suddenly sounded.","‘Jian Wushuang’ turned his head and saw a big man with two giant hammers in his hands. He had a small braid on the back of his head and was looking at him with an unfriendly expression.","Seeing this, ‘Jian Wushuang’s’ face turned cold and he said, “Ant, are you talking to this lord?”","The man with the pigtails immediately began to laugh in anger, and the other Rulers all had strange expressions on their faces.","“You, a trifling chief Ruler of the fourth level, dare to call me an ant?” The big man with the plaited beard’s eyes flickered with a ferocious light.","Although he did not know where the black-robed young man had come from, he knew that he had a solid cultivation base. A mere fourth-level Ruler was not even worth his time.","“Oh? From the looks of it, you want to make a move on me? Do you know whose territory this is?” Jian Wushuang laughed sinisterly as a strange fire danced in his eyes."]},{"number":4167,"title":"Chapter 4167 Recapturing","paragraphs":["4167 Recapturing","“You’re just pretending.”","The big man with pigtails snorted coldly, raised the giant hammer with both hands, and smashed it down on Jian Wushuang’s head, “Die!!”","The Heavenly Ruler and the Star Ruler could not help but sigh in their hearts when they saw this. The two of them were supposed to die without a doubt, but they did not expect that someone would die before them.","“How would a firefly dare to compete with the bright moon?”","The corners of ‘Jian Wushuang’s’ mouth curved into a cruel arc, and he laughed in a low voice, “That’s good. I’ll use your blood to bear witness to my name, Wushuang Sword Demon!”","Clang!","In an instant, ‘Jian Wushuang’ drew his sword and a sword essence that did not belong to Jian Wushuang burst out!","A demonic blood-like red light slashed out from the divine sword Wu Qi and struck the big man with pigtails.","At this moment, the eight people present seemed to hear the cries of a God and the mourning of the Heavenly Dao.","It was not Jian Wushuang’s power, but the power of the Tarot Divine Sword itself!","“This power! How is that possible?”","The big man with the pigtails roared in disbelief and raised his hammers to block. However, before he could finish his sentence, the red light suddenly cut through his body!","A strange scene happened. The big man with pigtails was not cut in two by the sword. Instead, his majestic body quickly shriveled at a speed visible to the naked eye.","In just a few breaths, the man with the pigtails had all his divine power sucked dry by the sword and turned into a dried corpse.","A gust of cold wind blew past, and the big man’s divine body turned into countless pieces of dust, flying away with the wind.","With a single sword strike, the Ultimate Ruler was completely annihilated in body and soul!","“Hiss!”","When the seven people present saw this, they all sucked in a breath of cold air, their faces full of horror as if they had seen a ghost.","They looked at ‘Jian Wushuang’ in shock and saw that after ‘Jian Wushuang’ had sucked the divine power of the man with pigtails dry, his pale face suddenly turned red.","“What...what kind of monster is this?” The five members of the hunting team looked at each other and could see the raging waves in each other’s eyes.","They knew the strength of the big man with the pigtails very well. He was not an invincible Ultimate Ruler, but he was a genuine peak Ultimate Ruler!","But in the end, he had been killed by a Ruler of the fourth level with a single sword strike?","“Hehehehe, the taste of divine power is really delicious.”","‘Jian Wushuang’ let out a deep and grim smile. then, he looked at the remaining five Rulers of the hunting team again, and a touch of greed flashed in his eyes. “Come on, let’s be souls under my sword and witness the power of my name, Wushuang Sword Demon!”","Boom!","With a loud bang, the battle broke out!","If Jian Wushuang’s original body faced the five Ultimate Rulers at the same time, it would not be so easy to win. Unfortunately, they were now facing the Tarot Divine Sword that had intimidated the starry sky ten thousand years ago!","Even King Zhufeng’s team and the Taixu Divine Son, Qing Xuzi, had fallen at the hands of the Tarot Divine Sword. From this, one could see how powerful the Tarot Divine Sword was!","Waves of evil and overbearing power flowed out. The five Ultimate Rulers did not have much capital to fight back. They did not even have the chance to escape. In just a moment, the five Ultimate Rulers were all killed by ‘Jian Wushuang’.","‘Jian Wushuang’s’ face turned red, looking even more evil.","“There are still two little bugs.” Jian Wushuang bent his waist and slowly turned his head to look at the Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler. He stuck out his Scarlet tongue and licked the corners of his mouth greedily.","“Before...senior, we have no intention of offending you!”","When the Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler saw this, a chill ran up their spines and up to their heads. Even their teeth were chattering in fear.","How could this be a Ruler of the fourth level?","Could a fourth-level chief Ruler kill an ultimate chief Ruler as easily as slaughtering pigs and dogs?","“Unintentionally offended?”","‘Jian Wushuang’ sneered and walked toward the two of them.","A demonic and overbearing sword intent enveloped the area under their feet. The Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler could not even move their feet under this demonic and overbearing sword intent.","Just as ‘Jian Wushuang’ was about to stretch out his big hand and press on their heads...","All of a sudden!","Ah ah ah ah!!!!","‘Jian Wushuang’ suddenly covered his head. His facial features were extremely distorted and he roared in pain, “Impossible, how can you not be dead!!!”","In the depths of Jian Wushuang’s soul realm, his real consciousness slowly opened his eyes and said calmly, “Tarot, it’s time to return my body.”","At this moment, the Tarot sword’s spirit was aghast to find that he was gradually losing control of this body!","All the divine power in his body seemed to have betrayed him and he couldn’t use any of it!","Ah ah ah!!!!","‘Jian Wushuang’ clutched his head. His expression was twisted because of the pain, and his mouth emitted a terrifying sound wave that did not seem human.","“What’s going on?” The Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler shuddered upon seeing this, and they exchanged glances.","“Something must have happened to this monster. Don’t worry about him, let’s run!”","The two of them made a decision in an instant. Seeing that the demonic sword intent that was suppressing them was gradually weakening, they immediately took a heavy step forward and broke free from the restrictions. They quickly shot into the distance without looking back.","The sword spirit of Tarot, who was controlling ‘Jian Wushuang’s’ body, didn’t have the time to care about this. He knelt on the ground, scratched his face, and kept howling in pain, ” “No! i am the Tarot sword’s spirit! Jian Wushuang, you can’t kill me!”","‘Jian Wushuang’s’ face was filled with fear. He realized that his body was gradually losing control, and his consciousness was fading away at an extremely fast speed!","Jian Wushuang’s soul realm was like a battlefield where two armies were facing each other. on one side was Jian Wushuang’s consciousness, and on the other side was the Tarot sword spirit.","The sword spirit of Tarot, which had originally corroded more than half of Jian Wushuang’s soul, was quickly annihilated at the speed of the receding tide.","in his soul realm, the consciousness body that was condensed by Jian Wushuang’s consciousness said, “Sword spirit, you’re just a remnant of Supreme Tarot’s will that was attached to the Tarot sword after his death. Even if the real Supreme Tarot were here, it would be impossible for him to possess me.”","“I’ve already possessed you, and I’ve completely destroyed your soul. Why? Why didn’t you die?” In Jian Wushuang’s soul realm, there was a dark golden Demon Sword that was making a terrifying sound.","This was the Tarot sword’s spirit.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm. He naturally would not explain the unique immortal body of a perfect creature to him. He said indifferently, “Sword spirit, you should never have chosen to possess me. If you had completely absorbed my divine power back then, you might have really succeeded.","“Unfortunately, there are no ‘what ifs’ in this world, so...annihilate.”"]},{"number":4168,"title":"Chapter 4168 The Divine Sword","paragraphs":["4168 The Divine Sword","As Jian Wushuang pressed down with his right hand, in an instant, countless divine power surged towards the dark golden Demon Sword in his soul realm.","“No!” The sword spirit was horrified.","If someone saw Jian Wushuang at that moment, they would definitely be dumbfounded.","Jian Wushuang was half-kneeling on the ground with both hands supporting him. His face seemed to be changing. At one moment, his expression became twisted and crazy, and at the next moment, it became calm and cold. The two expressions switched quickly, as if there were two different personalities fighting for his body.","It was as if there were two people conversing in his throat. At times, he would emit a terrifying sound wave that did not seem human. At other times, he would be calm and composed, as if he was talking about something that was logical.","After the time for one incense stick to burn.","Jian Wushuang’s expression calmed down completely. He sat down cross-legged and slowly closed his eyes.","The next moment, “I’m Jian Wushuang!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes. The emptiness and strange fire in his eyes had disappeared. In their place was a calm as the deep sea.","The Tarot sword’s spirit only lasted for a moment before it was completely destroyed by his soul consciousness.","Jian Wushuang had also absorbed all the memories of the sword spirit of Tarot.","Jian Wushuang also completely understood what kind of existence the Tarot sword spirit was.","The spirit of the Tarot sword had been formed from a strand of baleful remnant will left behind by Ruler Tarot after his death hundreds of chaos cycles ago.","As time slowly passed, ten thousand years ago, the evil spirit gradually gained its own consciousness. It took control of the Tarot Divine Sword on the fifth floor and became the Tarot sword’s spirit!","The Tarot Divine Sword, under the nourishment of this evil energy, slowly became a complete demonic sword!","With the birth of self-consciousness, ambition was like a seed buried in the soil, gradually taking root and sprouting.","The Tarot sword spirit was no longer willing to live in the Tarot Ruins. He wanted to reach the peak of the universe again and take back the glory that belonged to him.","Thus, ten thousand years ago, the Tarot Ruins appeared.","Rather than saying that the Tarot Ruins had been discovered by someone, it was more appropriate to say that the Tarot sword spirit had intentionally controlled its appearance.","For a time, the entire universe was in turmoil. All the major powers sent their top experts over. The spirit of the Tarot sword was afraid that a Supreme would discover his existence. He also knew that if a Supreme entered the ruins, he would not be able to take over or control it. Thus, he set the threshold to the Ruler level.","Thus, all the top Rulers entered, and he chose King Zhufeng.","As a result, he had taken over King Zhufeng’s body and used the power of the Tarot Divine Sword to devour and kill King Zhufeng’s team.","Unfortunately, although King Zhufeng was one of the best among the Ultimate Rulers, his talent did not satisfy him at all. He knew that with King Zhufeng’s talent, it was impossible for him to reach the top of the universe.","Therefore, he continued to wait until the battle between Jian Wushuang and Qing Xuzi. The explosion of 300000 rays of sword Qi had completely attracted him.","Jian Wushuang and Qing Xuzi had entered the second level of the Tarot Ruins as he had guessed and walked to his side.","He had calculated every step accurately, but he had not calculated the secret of Jian Wushuang being a perfect creature!","In the end, everything he had done had been in vain. He had helped Jian Wushuang in vain.","“I was just lucky this time.” Jian Wushuang raised his head and laughed bitterly. Even he could not help but feel lucky.","If he had not made the decision to go into hiding when he was being possessed and pretended to be completely possessed by the sword spirit, then his divine power would have been completely sucked dry by the sword spirit and he would have died in the second layer of the Tarot Ruins.","However, even though it was dangerous this time, the harvest was equally huge.","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang could not hold back the joy in his eyes.","It could be said that this encounter was no different from a great fortune for him!","He could clearly feel that his comprehension of the origin of sword principle had greatly improved. he had already reached the third level, which was comparable to the supreme experts who were good at sword principle.","Moreover, the origin of sword principle contained in the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass had not completely disappeared. With the origin of sword principle contained in the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass, Jian Wushuang could make further progress!","As for his comprehension of the laws of the universe, as well as the increase in the grade of the weeping Wu divine sword, there was no need to mention it.","Although Jian Wushuang had not broken through to the fifth level of Ruler, his strength had greatly improved.","With the help of the sword spirit of Tarot, his strength had made a huge leap. If he were to meet Qing Xuzi again, Jian Wushuang was sure that he would not need to run anymore. He only needed to perform the dragon-destroying secret skill and he could easily compete with Qing Xuzi. It was even hard to say who would win.","In other words, with Jian Wushuang’s current fighting power, he was almost invincible without exposing his trump cards. Once he used some of his trump cards, such as the Dragon-destroying secret skill and his gifted divine power, he would definitely be an invincible expert among the Ultimate Rulers.","Among the Rulers, the only one who could be stronger than him was probably a heaven-defying monster like the nine tribulations King.","Besides, compared to the increase in power, what really made Jian Wushuang ecstatic was the Tarot Divine Sword in his divine body!","Jian Wushuang looked inside his body and saw a dark golden divine sword floating in his divine body. The blade was covered with mysterious runes and there was a vertical eye on the hilt.","This was the great killing weapon that had shocked the universe, the Tarot Divine Sword!","This is a universe treasure that can make even an Ruler go crazy! Jian Wushuang sighed slightly. He had not expected that the greatest opportunity of the Tarot Ruins would fall into his hands by chance.","“Xian!”","Jian Wushuang growled and the divine power in his body surged. He immediately forced the Tarot Divine Sword out of his body.","Waves of destructive pressure that could destroy the stars were released from the Tarot Divine Sword, and the space around it twisted and shattered.","The sword’s power was too terrifying. Jian Wushuang estimated that if he could fully activate the sword’s power, it would be enough to kill an ordinary Supreme.","Jian Wushuang could not imagine how powerful Tarot Supreme had been when he had held this divine sword!","It was a pity that Jian Wushuang could not activate the Tarot Divine Sword at all.","His vast divine power, after entering the Tarot Divine Sword, was like a clay ox entering the sea, unable to even cause a ripple.","He would probably only be able to use one-ten-thousandth of the Tarot sword’s power when he reached the fifth level of the Ruler realm or the Ultimate Ruler realm.","Jian Wushuang could not help but feel disappointed."]},{"number":4169,"title":"Chapter 4169 Fear!","paragraphs":["4169 Fear!","“Fine. If I can control the power of the Tarot sword now, it’ll make me dependent on it, which will be bad for my future growth.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. Although he was disappointed, he was not too dejected.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to put the Tarot Divine Sword into his Interspatial Ring, he was stunned.","“Eh? You can’t put it in?”","He discovered that the Interspatial Ring could not contain the Tarot sword at all. If he tried to melt it by force, the Interspatial Ring would only be torn apart by the destructive sword intent of the Tarot sword.","“This is a little troublesome.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. The Tarot Divine Sword was famous and it was inevitable that people in the universe would know about it. If he were to wander around with the Tarot Divine Sword, it would be no different from lighting a lantern in the toilet. He would be courting death.","Jian Wushuang understood the principle that a man’s wealth would make him guilty.","‘I remember that there is a God-sealing vine on the second level of the Tarot Ruins. It was placed in the Interspatial Ring by the sword spirit of the Tarot sword. That God-sealing vine can seal all the aura of a Supreme treasure.’","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and his eyes suddenly lit up. Sure enough, he found an ancient and vast vine in the Interspatial Ring.","Speaking of which, Jian Wushuang’s Interspatial Ring could be said to be filled with all kinds of treasures. in addition to the five small mountains of universe origin stones, there were also countless top divine medicines and divine materials.","Although the God-sealing vine was a rare treasure in the outside world and could be used to refine a top grade cardinal treasure of principles, it was just an ordinary divine material in Jian Wushuang’s Interspatial Ring.","“Seal!”","Jian Wushuang shouted. in a split second, the ancient vine expanded and wrapped around the Tarot Divine Sword, leaving only the hilt exposed.","The sharp and destructive aura of the Tarot Divine Sword instantly disappeared. from a distance, it looked like an ordinary, ancient sword.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help nodding in satisfaction and carried it on his back.","“Next, I should comprehend the Tarot sword manual. But before that, there are some things I have to deal with.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. Then, he looked in a certain direction in the distance and a murderous intent flashed in his eyes.","The Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler must die!","Otherwise, he would not be at ease.","Even though he knew that the Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler did not know much about him and only knew that he had come from a crack in the void, if the two of them leaked this information, it was inevitable that some people would be able to speculate.","At that time, Jian Wushuang might be in great danger.","Although it was just Jian Wushuang’s speculation, he wanted to kill the possibility of it being one in ten thousand.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot heavily and his entire body soared into the sky immediately. He chased after the Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler in the direction where they had escaped.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang stepped on the sky, one step faster than the other. Finally, his whole body suddenly turned into a thunderbolt between heaven and earth!","...","High up in the sky, the strong wind was intense.","The Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler were rushing forward. They only heaved a sigh of relief when they were several thousand kilometers away from the river bank.","“Something must have happened to that monster. It probably won’t be able to catch up for a while.”","The Star Ruler rejoiced.","“Star Ruler, there’s always a way out. we thought that we would die without a doubt, but we didn’t expect that we would be lucky enough to survive. people often say that one is bound for good fortune after surviving a great disaster. I think our opportunity will soon arrive,” Heavenly Ruler replied with a smile.","Having escaped death, his mood could not help but improve, and he even had the mood to joke.","The Star Ruler nodded before shaking her head again. A wisp of worry surged in her eyes. “It’s best that we don’t celebrate too early. That monster is a little strange. It might chase after us.”","“Oh?” Upon hearing this, Heavenly Ruler recalled the scene when Jian Wushuang had slaughtered the hunting team. His eyes turned grave as he said, “Star Ruler, what should we do next?”","The Star Ruler thought for a moment and took a deep breath. A glint of determination flashed through their eyes. “Heavenly Ruler, let’s spread the news about the monster. After all, the monster tore open space in the ruins, which means that there might be another entrance to the Tarot Ruins. I believe that there will be people in the ruins who will be interested in it.","“At that time, I’m sure that the monster will be busy with its own affairs. How will it have the time to care about us?”","The Heavenly Ruler immediately nodded in agreement.","“Let’s go,” The Star Ruler continued, “I remember that the Lord Zhennan is in the south. We can tell him this news first. With his personality, I’m sure he’ll be interested.”","The Star Ruler said as she made her way to the south of the Tarot Ruins.","A hint of retreat had already appeared in his eyes. He had already made up his mind to leave the Tarot Ruins after this.","There were fewer and fewer treasures appearing in the Tarot ruins, and the competition was getting more and more intense. An Ultimate Ruler with ordinary strength like him had no place to stand, so he might as well leave.","At this moment, someone suddenly patted his shoulder.","“Heavenly Ruler, what are you doing?”","The Star Ruler thought that it was the Heavenly Ruler who had slapped him and turned around.","However, when he turned around, his entire body froze as if he had been struck by lightning!","Behind him, a cold figure in black was staring at him expressionlessly.","“Where are you guys planning to go?”","A ghostly voice sounded.","“It’s you!”","The Star Ruler’s body turned cold and her eyes almost fell out of their sockets.","“W-why did this monster come so quickly?”","“Where were you planning to go when you ran away so quickly?” Jian Wushuang, who was a head taller than him, looked down at him and said with a faint smile.","The Star Ruler took a deep breath and thought of something. She rolled her eyes and laughed drily. “Before...senior, I’m just going to walk around and then leave the Tarot Ruins. I don’t plan on going anywhere.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and said noncommittally.","“Of course. There are many Ultimate Rulers in the Tarot Ruins, and I’m just one of the most insignificant ones. I know my own limits and won’t continue to get involved.” The Star Ruler cowered and laughed drily.","He had long been frightened out of his wits by the scene of Jian Wushuang, who was controlled by the sword spirit of Tarot, killing six Ultimate Rulers by himself. Now that he saw Jian Wushuang, he did not dare to resist at all.","“Star Ruler, let’s go. I’ve already sent a message to Lord Zhennan.” The Heavenly Ruler’s voice suddenly drifted over from the front.","..."]},{"number":4170,"title":"Chapter 4170 Killing","paragraphs":["4170 Killing","“The Lord Zhennan has never been patient. Let’s not waste any more time. what if the monster comes after us?” The Heavenly Ruler’s voice continued.","In an instant, Star Ruler’s mouth opened wide. He stretched out a trembling finger and pointed at Heavenly Ruler’s back while shaking his head at Jian Wushuang.","“Before...senior! Let me explain, what Lord Zhennan and King of the North? I don’t even understand what he’s saying!” The Star Ruler’s forehead was covered in cold sweat as he explained to Jian Wushuang in a panic.","However, before he could finish...","The Heavenly Ruler, who was walking in front and did not get a response, continued to speak in confusion, “Star Ruler, what’s the matter with you? you were the one who suggested going out to find Lord Zhennan and tell him about the monster. Why are you stopping now?”","The Star Ruler’s body went limp upon hearing this.","In the next moment, he noticed that Jian Wushuang was frowning slightly and there was killing intent in his eyes. he was so angry that the veins on his forehead bulged. he looked at the back of the Heavenly Ruler fiercely and shouted, “Heavenly Ruler! When did I say such a thing? I don’t even know who that Lord Zhennan is, and I’m still going to find him? Don’t you talk nonsense and make slanderous accusations!”","The Star Ruler’s words were so awe-inspiring and powerful that even Jian Wushuang almost believed it.","The Heavenly Ruler, who was walking in front, was startled by this thunderous roar and immediately quivered. Then, a trace of anger appeared on his face. He turned his head and angrily said, “Star Ruler, have you been possessed? you don’t even remember what you said, you, you...”","Before he could finish his sentence, his eyes widened and he was dumbstruck. The words in his mouth became unconsciously repeated.","A black-robed, black-haired youth stood next to the Star Ruler. His hands were clasped behind his back as he looked at the Star Ruler from a distance.","When did this monster come?","The next moment.","The Heavenly Ruler suddenly came back to her senses, and her lips trembled as she said, “S-senior, this has nothing to do with me. It was that Star Ruler guy who incited me to find Lord Zhennan, saying that he wanted to make your matter public.”","Before Jian Wushuang could say anything, the Star Ruler’s vision turned black and he almost fainted from anger.","“Heavenly Ruler, you should die!”","The Star Ruler’s divine power surged as he bristled with rage.","Jian Wushuang finally spoke.","It does not matter whether you went to find Lord Zhennan or not, and it does not matter which one of you suggested it, because the result will be the same...","Clang!","The sound of a sword rang through the sky!","The divine sword Wu Qi appeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand in an instant, and a cold light flashed in his eyes.","“Stop fighting, you two. Die together!!!”","Boom!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang pulled out his sword and a dazzling red light, like a Galaxy, slashed toward the Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler!","“Heavenly Ruler, do it!!!”","The Star Ruler roared as he watched the sword that was sweeping toward him.","Rip!","He did not dare to hold back. With a flip of his hand, a Star River Map appeared in front of him.","The star river map expanded in the wind and in just a few breaths, it had reached the point where it could cover the sky and the sun.","The 18 stars in the star River Map were connected together, forming an extremely strong defense. Even an invincible Ultimate Ruler would not be able to break it in a short time.","In the chaos cycles which he had been in possession of the Galaxy map, it had saved his life countless times during critical moments.","It could be said that it was precisely because of the star River Map that the Star Ruler, who was only an ordinary Ultimate Ruler, dared to venture into the Tarot remains.","However, the star chart was already riddled with holes and could shatter at any moment. Even the Star Ruler was not sure how much defensive power was left.","The star River Map had saved the Star Ruler too many times. It was already beyond its limits.","The Star Ruler clenched his fists as he looked at the blood-red sword radiance that was like a Galaxy. He turned his head to look at the star chart in front of him and muttered to himself,”Old friend, please help me one last time! You have to get through this!”","“Whoosh!!!”","In an instant, the blood-red sword radiance struck the star River Map at an extremely fast speed.","Ka ka ka!","In an instant, the sword light was slightly blocked and was in a stalemate with the star River Map.","The star River Map, on the other hand, let out an unpleasant cracking sound.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he raised his eyebrows.","He was carrying two divine swords on his back at the same time. Although he had only pulled out the weeping Wu divine sword, it had already been upgraded to the limit of a principles cardinal treasure. His sword Dao universe origin had also entered the third realm, and the laws of the universe had also increased greatly. Although Jian Wushuang was still a Ruler of the fourth level, his strength was no longer what it used to be.","According to common sense, an ordinary Ultimate Ruler would be killed in an instant when facing Jian Wushuang.","He did not expect that the Star Ruler could block his sword with the star River Map in his hand.","This star-river Map seems to be a Supreme-grade defensive treasure. However, the internal structure of this star-river Map has been severely damaged. It would not last more than a few strikes.","Jian Wushuang shook his head slightly. He looked at the Star Ruler and swung his sword again.","“It’s a pointless struggle!”","Boom!","The weeping Wu divine sword trembled hundreds of billions of times in an instant, and a voice similar to the weeping of gods and the chanting of Buddhas and demons came from the weeping Wu divine sword.","A blood-red sword light that was a hundred times stronger than before slashed out again!","This sword seemed to tear a hole in the sky. The huge Star River Map, which covered the sky, cracked like a spider web under this sword!","Kachakachaa.","Cracks began to spread on the star River Map as if it was going to be torn apart.","Bang bang bang!","The 18 connected stars on the star chart exploded one after another!","In the end, under the Star Ruler’s horrified gaze, the star River Map collapsed and exploded into countless pieces.","On the other hand, the blood-colored sword’s radiance that was like a lightning that could tear apart the night sky slashed toward the Star Ruler once again!","“No!”","The sword shattered the Star Ruler’s divine body with a furious roar and destroyed his body and soul!","The current Jian Wushuang might not be able to compete with the nine tribulations King, but he could definitely be considered as one of the giant arms of the Ultimate Rulers!","“There’s still one more.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change at all after killing Star Ruler. He looked indifferently at Heavenly Ruler in the distance.","Run!!!","In terms of power, the Heavenly Ruler was not as strong as the Star Ruler. When he saw that the Star Ruler was killed by Jian Wushuang with only two slashes, he did not dare to fight anymore.","In an instant, he shot off into the distance.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm. With a light tap of his toes, he instantly crossed a thousand miles and appeared behind the Heavenly Ruler. He used his fingers as a sword and slashed at the Heavenly Ruler’s head.","Lord Zhennan, come and save me! I have a big secret to tell you!","“Die!” The Heavenly Ruler used all his strength to shout."]},{"number":4171,"title":"Chapter 4171 The Eternal Night","paragraphs":["4171 The Eternal Night","“You’re looking for death!”","A cold light flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. His two fingers were like swords as he ruthlessly hacked at Heavenly Ruler’s head!","Buzzzzzz!","There was no resistance at all. A blood line appeared between the eyebrows of Heavenly Ruler. Then, Heavenly Ruler’s divine body broke from the middle and was directly split into two by Jian Wushuang’s finger!","!!","This was not the end. Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and an extremely sharp and overbearing sword essence burst out from his hand. Once again, it crushed every part of Heavenly Ruler’s divine power into ashes!","The Heavenly Ruler had been completely annihilated!","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back and his expression was uncertain. He did not expect that in the end, this person would still leak the news.","“Forget it. I don’t think the Lord Zhennan would be able to guess anything based on what he said. Even if he did notice something, it doesn’t matter. At most, we’ll just fight.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and stopped thinking about it. Anyway, with his current strength, even if he were to face the Lord Zhennan, he might not be able to defeat him, but he was sure that he was definitely not weaker than the Lord Zhennan.","“The most important thing right now is to improve my strength. As long as I’m strong enough, so what if everyone knows that I have a big secret?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. Then, he took a step forward and went far away.","...","At the same time, in a Palace not far away.","Lord Zhennan was dressed in a blood-red robe, his hair tied into a small braid hanging loosely on his back. His eyes were slightly closed, and he was sitting on the main seat with his bare feet.","A spear-wielding guard in heavy armor stood respectfully below him.","This divine armor guard was the last remaining divine armor guard who had besieged the nine-tribulation King a thousand years ago.","“Your Highness, I just heard the voice of the Heavenly Ruler saying that he has a great secret to tell you.” The guard said.","Lord Zhennan slowly opened his eyes and said, “This king heard it as well, and this king can also sense that Heavenly Ruler and Star Ruler’s auras have already disappeared. They must have been killed to silence them.”","The divine armor guard raised his head in confusion, “Your Highness, could it be that Heavenly Ruler’s message about the secret he wanted to tell us was true? But with his strength, what big secret could he possibly know?”","“Ah, don’t underestimate anyone. There are many opportunities in the Tarot Ruins. Who knows what Heavenly Ruler and Star Ruler have found?” Lord Zhennan smiled and shook his head. He then stood up and said, “Let’s go and see Heavenly Ruler.”","“Yes!”","The godly armor guard respectfully acknowledged.","A moment later, the two of them arrived at the void where the Heavenly Ruler had fallen.","“Your Highness, the Heavenly Ruler has indeed fallen here!” The divine armor guard could not help but tremble as he sensed the remnant energy of the Heavenly Ruler.","The Lord Zhennan did not reply. He squinted his eyes and muttered to himself in surprise, “What a powerful aura of the Dao of the sword. I don’t think there’s a Ruler of the Dao of the sword who is as powerful as this in these ruins.”","Lord Zhennan’s eyes flashed with a hint of thought. He could not help but think, ‘Could it be that Qing Xuzi has returned?’","As soon as this idea came out, he shook his head and denied it.","Qing Xuzi’s reputation was no less than his. Even though he had disappeared for more than a thousand years, it was not to the extent that the two of them did not know him.","If it was Qing Xuzi who was after them, they would have told him their names.","Presumably, the person who had killed the Star Ruler and Heavenly Rulers was not famous.","“Your Highness, what should we do now?” The guard asked.","Lord Zhennan muttered to himself, “Let’s go back first. With such a powerful sword aura and the fact that he could easily kill Star Ruler and Heavenly Ruler, this person can’t be weak. The fight for the opportunities in the Tarot Ruins has just begun. I will have to deal with this kind of person sooner or later.”","“Yes!”","The two of them gradually left.","...","At the same time, in a remote corner far away from the central area of the Tarot Ruins.","Jian Wushuang was sitting cross-legged, and in front of his knees was the ‘Tarot sword manual’!","This Tarot sword manual had a faint divine power fluctuation. Like a halo, it wrapped around the Tarot sword manual.","These ripples of divine power had been left behind by Ruler Tarot all those years ago, and it was precisely because of these ripples of divine power that the Tarot sword manual had been able to remain undamaged even after hundreds of chaos cycles had passed.","“There are only five pages in total?”","Jian Wushuang frowned. The Tarot sword manual was not as thick and complicated as he had thought. There were only five pages in total, and each of the five pages corresponded to a sword principle super power!","In other words, this Tarot sword manual recorded a total of five sword Dao divine abilities!","Jian Wushuang used his divine power, stretched out his right hand, and flipped to the first page.","An extremely strong resistance came from the sword code. Although this resistance was strong, it was not harmful. It was like a test to see if the reader had the strength to inherit his sword code.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang snorted coldly. Divine power surged from his hand and he immediately suppressed the resistance. He then turned to the first page.","On the first page of the gold-stamped paper, there was a passage written with a sharp pen. It introduced the first divine ability of the Tarot sword manual.","Light will be devoured by darkness, living beings will walk towards the cold of Midwinter, and the sun will eventually fall into the arms of the dark night. The world will then fall into the deepest darkness.","“This darkness...”","“Its name is...”","“Eternal night!”","In an instant, the world in front of Jian Wushuang changed.","Time seemed to accelerate, and everything around them was fading. Flowers and trees began to wither, and the vitality of all living creatures in the world was slowly fading away.","The stars dimmed, and the world seemed to have become a thick gray.","A moment later, the entire universe fell into an eternal night. A deathly, cold, lonely, and rigid aura filled the air.","There was no longer any light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","The root of all this was because a figure with an unclear face and figure suddenly appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind and wielded a sword.","All the darkness was the power of this sword!","This strike could strip all life and bring eternal darkness to the world!","The name of this sword was eternal night!","...","In the blink of an eye, a year had passed.","Jian Wushuang just looked at the Tarot sword manual and did not move at all, as if he had fallen into the deepest level of comprehension.","In a 100-foot radius around him, streaks of pitch-black sword light rose up. Then, like a huge net, they intertwined together and formed a huge black ball that wrapped around Jian Wushuang, who sat cross-legged.","Spring went and autumn came. The second year had passed.","The black ball’s color became darker and darker. Darkness even began to spread out, robbing everything around it of its vitality.","Then, it was the third year.","Jian Wushuang had closed his eyes and the area within a hundred miles of him had turned into a cold dead land covered in darkness!","He was completely immersed in the deepest level of comprehension. In the center of his divine body, the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass with seven leaves was melting and consuming at an extremely fast speed. Then, it turned into comprehension of sword principle and was completely absorbed by Jian Wushuang.","The fourth year...the fifth year...the sixth year...","At the end of the seventh year, Jian Wushuang finally opened his eyes!"]},{"number":4172,"title":"Chapter 4172 One Sword to Form a Country","paragraphs":["4172 One Sword to Form a Country","The moment Jian Wushuang opened his eyes, the darkness that covered hundreds of miles shattered with a bang!","“One sword to form a country! The kingdom of eternal night!”","A black light flashed across Jian Wushuang’s eyes!","After seven years, with the help of the remaining energy of the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass, he finally comprehended the first sword super power of the Tarot sword codex, eternal night!","!!","The stroke had far surpassed the level of a super power and even subverted Jian Wushuang’s understanding of sword principle!","Jian Wushuang had never imagined that sword principle could be used in such a way.","How was this sword a Divine Art? It was clearly the use and improvement of the divine kingdom of one thought, which could only be comprehended by Supreme martial artists, on the sword dao!","It was the most profound, obscure, and esoteric stroke that Jian Wushuang had ever seen. Even with his amazing talent in sword principle, he had only comprehended a little bit of it in the past seven years.","It could be said that with Jian Wushuang’s current achievements in sword principle, there was no way for him to fully comprehend the sword principle super power!","Jian Wushuang could not help but be amazed and admit that Tarot supreme was indeed an invincible supreme who could dominate the starry sky and illuminate the ancient times!","Jian Wushuang could not imagine how terrifying Supreme Tarot’s comprehension of sword principle had been to be able to comprehend such a terrifying sword move.","No wonder Tarot supremacy had been crowned as the unrivaled sword supremacy since ancient times. Even now, no one had been able to take away this title.","For the first time, Jian Wushuang felt a sense of respect for Tarot supremacy, who dominated the universe with his sword.","“Such a powerful Tarot supremacy, coupled with the Tarot Divine Sword that can destroy stars, how heroic must he have been in the universe back then? but even so, he was still killed in the eternal Sun Star area. Even his Holy Kingdom was wiped out,” Jian Wushuang sighed in disbelief.","In the past seven years, the more he comprehended the ‘eternal night’, the more he could feel how powerful Tarot supremacy was.","He was definitely an invincible master who could crush the primordial era and make the starry sky submit to him!","However, such an expert had actually been killed?","Jian Wushuang could not help but feel how small he was and how vast the universe was.","“There is still a long way to go on the path of cultivation.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and stopped thinking about these things that were far from related to him.","“In total, from the time we entered the second level of the Tarot Ruins to the time we came out, plus these seven years, more than 1000 years have passed. I wonder how Divine Marquis Qingfeng and Ninth Kalpa King are doing.”","Thinking of Divine Marquis Qingfeng and Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang smiled.","Back then, the three of them were hunted by Lord Zhennan, the five Blood Nether Emissaries, and the Ruler Silver Roc in the Fengyang Canyon in order to fight for the divine medicine that could increase the chances of breaking through to the Supreme level. In the end, they were forced to escape on their own.","Now, he had returned alive, but he did not know how the two of them were.","he should be fine. Even if he can’t defeat Blood Hades Envoy, Ruler Silver Roc, and Lord Zhennan, he should be fine. As for Divine Marquis Qingfeng, no one went after him after I left. Unless something unexpected happens, he should be fine.","“Forget it, I’ll find someone to inquire about it.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a thoughtful look. Now that he had obtained all the biggest opportunities in the Tarot Ruins and his strength had also improved greatly, there was no need for him to stay any longer.","However, before he left, he had to say hello to these two old friends who came with him.","While Jian Wushuang was thinking, suddenly, a few golden lights flashed across the sky.","“An Ultimate Ruler and three peak fifth-stage Rulers?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","As the time it took for the Tarot Ruins to appear grew longer and longer, the opportunities within the ruins were no longer limited to the Ultimate Rulers. Even some fifth-stage Rulers had come here.","However, there were Ultimate Rulers everywhere in the Tarot Ruins, and the lineup of this team was not enough to look at in the Tarot Ruins. However, he could use this opportunity to inquire about the Ninth Kalpa King and Divine Marquis Qingfeng.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang turned over his right hand and changed into a loose black robe. The hood of the black robe covered half of his face, revealing only his chin. Then, he swept forward and came behind the three people in the sky.","“Everyone, where are you going in such a hurry?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Among the four, the leader was an old man with a mole between his eyebrows and a strong divine power. The other two were fifth-level Rulers, a young man and a young woman. They looked reserved, but there was excitement and curiosity in their eyes. They seemed to be juniors who had followed this Ultimate Ruler to the Tarot Ruins and had just gained more experience.","“Who is it?”","The wizardry elder was shocked and looked back. Seeing that Jian Wushuang’s aura was only at level four, he could not help but let down his guard.","Then, he asked in confusion, “Young friend, may I ask why you’ve stopped us?”","“Your Excellency, do you know about the Ninth Kalpa King in the ruins?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Before the wizardry elder could say anything, the girl behind him replied with excitement, “What a coincidence. Could it be that you’re also going to look for the Ninth Kalpa King?”","“What?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and replied with a smile, “What’s the matter? are you also going to look for the Ninth Kalpa King?”","“That’s right. I heard that the Ninth Kalpa King is one of the most powerful beings in the ruins. We’re planning to go and join him...the girl was quite playful. When she was halfway through her sentence, the wizened old man glared at her and scolded, “Little Qing, didn’t I tell you to be careful in the remains?”","“Junior Sister, how can you just say whatever you want?” The young man beside the young girl said with a bitter smile.","The young girl immediately shrank her head and replied in a low voice, “I understand, master.”","The wizened elder snorted and nodded. He turned to Jian Wushuang and said, “Young friend, to be honest, there are too many experts in the Tarot Ruins, and it’s a habit to kill and plunder. It’s difficult for us to gain a foothold here with our strength, so we’re indeed planning to find an expert to rely on. I see that you’re only a fourth-level Ruler, and it’ll be difficult for you to survive in the Tarot Ruins.”","If you also want to join the Ninth Kalpa King, you can go with us.","Jian Wushuang smiled and replied, “That’s what I was thinking, so I’ll have to trouble you.”","“It’s fine.”","The wizened old man waved his hand without a care.","Then, Jian Wushuang, the elder with eyes, and the other two flew away."]},{"number":4173,"title":"Chapter 4173 Five Camps","paragraphs":["4173 Five Camps","They did not move very fast along the way. Perhaps it was because Jian Wushuang was only a Ruler of the fourth level, the three of them did not guard against him too much. Therefore, they became familiar with each other after a while.","From their conversation, Jian Wushuang gradually came to know the identities of the three people. the wizardry elder was known as the Water Sorcerer Ruler. he was a veteran Ultimate Ruler who had lived through dozens of chaos cycles. in terms of power, he was also a peak Ultimate Ruler. he was much stronger than the Star Ruler and the Heavenly Ruler.","The boy and girl were his disciples. The boy’s name was Ran Gu, and the girl’s name was Qingxi.","The three of them came from a remote Starfield, which could be considered an Overlord in that Starfield. However, it was obviously not enough to be placed in the Tarot Ruins. To them, it would be good if they could obtain some good fortune in the Tarot Ruins, but even if they could not, the Water Sorcerer Ruler could bring his disciples to see the world.","!!","Water Sorcerer Ruler had originally brought a total of three disciples with him. However, a hundred years ago, his eldest disciple had been killed by a team of Ultimate Rulers from a top force in the ruins. It was also this turn of events that made Water Sorcerer Ruler realize his own shortcomings, which was why he had decided to rely on the famous Ninth Kalpa King in the ruins.","However, based on Jian Wushuang’s understanding of the Ninth Kalpa King, these people’s thoughts would probably be in vain.","“Blood Sword, now that there are various forces in the ruins, Rulers like you and me with no background have no place to stand. If we don’t join any forces, it will only become more and more difficult to survive.” The young man named Ran Gu lowered his head and sighed.","Perhaps it was because they saw that Jian Wushuang was also alone and his cultivation was not high, the young man named Ran Gu could not help but feel a bit of sympathy for him.","Jian Wushuang smiled and did not refute. He agreed, “Ruler Ran Gu is right.”","After a short pause, Jian Wushuang changed the topic and asked, “Ruler Ran Gu, I have just arrived at the Tarot Ruins. May I ask what the situation is like inside?”","After some thought, Ruler Ran Gu replied, “As the heavenly treasures in the ruins become less and less, the fight for them has become more and more intense. Those solitary experts, because they are all alone, have a hard time exploring the ruins, unless they are extremely powerful. Now, most of these solitary experts have joined forces and formed many camps.","“There are quite a few of these camps, and all of them have at least an almost invincible Ultimate Ruler. But in general, the five camps are still the leaders of the primordial ruin.”","“Five major camps?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He did not expect that in the thousand years that he had disappeared, the Tarot Ruins would change so quickly. The fight for the opportunities had reached the point where all parties had to join forces and form a camp.","What Jian Wushuang did not know was that all of this was related to him killing the sword spirit of Tarot. The appearance of the natural treasures in the ruins seemed to be random, but it was actually the deliberate arrangement of the sword spirit of Tarot. Its purpose was to find the perfect target to possess.","Now that the Tarot sword spirit had been killed by him, naturally, there would be no new natural treasures.","“These five camps are all extremely powerful. The camp that is currently ranked first is the one led by Blood Sky Palace. Since the battle in Fengyang Canyon 1000 years ago, Blood Sky Palace has sent another four Blood Nether Emissaries to the Tarot Ruins. With the previous five, there are a total of nine Blood Nether Emissaries. It can be said that no one in the ruins is a match for these nine Blood Nether Emissaries.”","“In second place is the camp of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, which only came to the Tarot Ruins several hundred years ago. Their leader is the Third Prince! The Ultimate Ruler’s undefeatable Supreme expert!”","At the mention of Da Feng Divine Kingdom, a look of unforgettable hatred appeared in Ruler Ran Gu’s eyes. When the cheeky girl, Qingxi, heard this, her face turned gloomy and she said with a slightly choked voice, “Eldest Senior Brother was killed by the Third Prince’s men because he had accidentally blocked the path of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was silent. The road of cultivation was cruel, especially in the Tarot Ruins, where there were no rules and restrictions. Death was common.","Water Sorcerer Ruler did not say anything, but his fists were tightly clenched.","The reason why he wanted to seek refuge with the Ninth Kalpa King and stay in the ruins was that he still had the thought of revenge, even though the hope seemed very slim.","Ruler Ran Gu took a deep breath and continued, “The third is the camp led by the Ninth Kalpa King, who is recognized as the strongest Ruler in the ruins. By right, he could have become the number one camp in the ruins. Unfortunately, the Ninth Kalpa King is too proud and disdains to be in the same camp as others. He has not accepted anyone except for the Ultimate Ruler, Divine Marquis Qingfeng, who is under him.","“However, I’ve recently heard that the Ninth Kalpa King has plans to expand his power. It’s also because of this that my master, Junior Sister, and I plan to try to rely on him.","“The remaining two forces are the Ruler Silver Roc and Lord Zhennan from the Da Feng Divine Kingdom. the Ruler Silver Roc is slightly weaker than the Ninth Kalpa King and the Third Prince of dafeng. however, because his strength is not too heaven-defying and he does not have a strong background, many solitary experts in the Tarot Ruins are more willing to join his side.","“After all, the leaders of the previous camps were too powerful. If a heaven-defying opportunity was obtained, there was an 80% chance that it would be taken by the leaders. However, the Ruler Silver Roc was different. His battle strength was not the strongest among the Ultimate Rulers. If you joined his camp and obtained a great opportunity, the Ruler Silver Roc would not be able to monopolize it. He would have to share it with everyone.","“That’s why the Ruler Silver Roc has so many Rulers under his command. At first, the few of us wanted to join him, but he had so many Rulers under his command that he didn’t even care about our power.","“As for Lord Zhennan, it is said that his power suffered a great setback in the battle at Fengyang Canyon a thousand years ago. He has been enduring for a long time, so there is no need to mention him.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Hearing that Divine Marquis Qingfeng was with Ninth Kalpa King, he heaved a sigh of relief.","After chatting for a while more, Qingxi’s mood also recovered. She smiled and said jokingly, “You’re quite bold, Blood Sword. You’re only a fourth-level Ruler, and yet you’ve dared to come to the Tarot Ruins.”","Jian Wushuang replied with a smile, “I didn’t expect the ruins to be so dangerous before I came here.”"]},{"number":4174,"title":"Chapter 4174 Mockery","paragraphs":["4174 Mockery","“Blood Sword, since you’re with us now, we’ll definitely protect you,” The young girl, Qingxi, patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and snorted loudly, “however, with your strength, don’t even think about joining the Ninth Kalpa King. He’s the number one Ultimate Ruler in the entire universe. Even if he wants to expand his power and take in Rulers, he’ll be an Ultimate Ruler like my master. You’re only a fourth-level Ruler, so he’ll definitely look down on you.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but laugh. However, he knew that the girl did not mean to belittle him, so he replied noncommittally, “What you said makes sense.”","“Of course.” Hearing this, Qingxi snorted complacently. then, as if she was afraid that Jian Wushuang would be depressed, she quickly comforted him, “You don’t have to worry. As long as you follow us obediently, when my master enters the camp of the Ninth Kalpa King, he will naturally protect us. My master is the kindest.”","Jian Wushuang found it interesting and nodded with a smile.","Water Sorcerer Ruler, who was walking in front, noticed this scene and could not help but turn back to glare at Qingxi. “Little Qing, be careful with your words and actions. Be careful with your words and actions!”","After saying that, Water Sorcerer Ruler looked at Jian Wushuang and said with a faint smile, “However, it’s a good fate for you to know us, young friend. If I can really enter the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp, it’s not impossible for me to protect you.”","“I’ll have to trouble you then, Water Sorcerer Ruler.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but he sighed in his heart.","From his observation, these three people were all kind-hearted people. This was naturally not a good thing, but in the Tarot Ruins, where killing and plundering had become a habit, it might not be a good thing.","A few hours later, Jian Wushuang, Water Sorcerer Ruler, and the others arrived at the central area of the Tarot Ruins.","“Little friend, that’s where the Ninth Kalpa King is.” Water Sorcerer Ruler pointed off into the distance at an endless mountain range, on top of which was an enormous palace.","Jian Wushuang looked up and saw many Rulers waiting outside the palace. They looked nervous. Most of them were Ultimate Rulers.","“Those Rulers, are they all Ninth Kalpa King’s men?” Jian Wushuang withdrew his gaze and asked in confusion.","Water Sorcerer Ruler shook his head and replied, “No, I think they’re all like us. They heard the news and came here to seek refuge with the Ninth Kalpa King. After all, the killing in the Tarot Ruins is too crazy. If you’re not strong enough and don’t have a backer, you can’t stand on your own.”","“Let’s go, we’ll head over too.” With that, Water Sorcerer Ruler led Jian Wushuang, Ruler Ran Gu, and Qingxi toward the palace.","“Blood Sword, when the time comes, we just need to stand behind my master and not say anything. Everything will be handled by my master.” Ran Gu walked beside Jian Wushuang and reminded him in a low voice.","“Alright,” he said. Jian Wushuang nodded to show that he understood.","A moment later, the four of them landed outside the palace.","As soon as they landed, they could hear the discussion of the Ultimate Rulers.","“What do you think the Ninth Kalpa King’s sudden expansion of power and recruitment of the Rulers of the ruins means?”","“I don’t know. Maybe the Ninth Kalpa King saw that the Third Prince and the Ruler Silver Roc were both expanding their forces and felt a sense of crisis?”","“The Ninth Kalpa King has always been arrogant. I’m afraid he won’t be interested in ordinary Ultimate Rulers this time.”","“Let’s try. If we can’t join the Ninth Kalpa King’s forces, we can only rely on the Ruler Silver Roc. But I heard that the Ruler Silver Roc is narrow-minded. If we rely on him, I’m afraid we won’t have a good time. Sigh.”","Many Ultimate Rulers were discussing in low voices. Then, they saw the Sorcery God bring Jian Wushuang and the other two over and they let out a soft gasp.","“Eh? Two fifth-level chief Rulers, and even a fourth-level chief Ruler? With your strength, you’re here to join in the fun. Are you asking to be humiliated?”","“Hahahaha, what a joke. With such strength, he should have left the Tarot Ruins. Staying here is just asking for death.”","“At first, I was still a little uncertain and uncertain about joining the Ninth Kalpa King’s force. But with the help of these buggers, I suddenly became confident.”","Low sneers could be heard.","The people present were all Ultimate Rulers, and they were mocking him without the slightest bit of fear.","Qingxi and Ruler Ran Gu were instantly enraged, and even the Water Sorcerer’s expression turned unsightly.","“Master, they’ve gone too far...” Qingxi clenched her fists and said in a low voice.","Water Sorcerer Ruler took a deep breath upon hearing this, then said in a calm voice, “Let them say whatever they want, we just need to take care of ourselves.”","“But...” Qingxi was about to say something else when the Water Sorcerer interrupted her with a firm voice. “No buts.”","Qingxi could only lower her head.","Water Sorcerer Ruler could not help but let out a soft sigh upon seeing this. After some thought, he said, “Qing ‘er, only by joining the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp can we have a place to protect ourselves in the Tarot Ruins. with this place, we can have a chance to avenge your Eldest Senior Brother. So, let it be, as long as it doesn’t affect our entry into the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp.”","“I understand, master.” Hearing this, Qingxi still pulled a long face.","Water Sorcerer Ruler did not say anything more. He glanced at Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the back with his head lowered, and shook his head.","....","At the same time, in the palace.","The Ninth Kalpa King stood in the middle of the hall with his hands behind his back. Divine Marquis Qingfeng was half a body’s length behind him.","The huge Palace seemed a little empty.","“Ninth Kalpa, do you really plan to call upon the Rulers to fight to the death with the Ruler Silver Roc before you leave the ruins?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng asked.","“A life-and-death battle? Is he even worthy?” Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King sneered expressionlessly. Then, his eyes flickered with a cold light and he said, “If it wasn’t for the fact that he has so many rotten fish and shrimps around him, I would have killed him long ago. Why would I have kept him alive until now?”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng smiled bitterly and shook his head. “If only you had been willing to recruit the Ultimate Ruler in these ruins earlier, the Silver Roc wouldn’t have been here.”","“Don’t you know that I’ve kept the Ruler Silver Roc alive until now to wait for Jian Wushuang to come out so that we can take revenge together? If the Silver Roc hadn’t ambushed me in Fengyang Canyon, how could Jian Wushuang have been chased by Qing Xuzi?”","After a pause, the Ninth Kalpa King said with an indifferent expression, “Although we know that Jian Wushuang is still alive, there is no news from him. Let’s take revenge for him together.”"]},{"number":4175,"title":"Chapter 4175 A Palm Strike","paragraphs":["4175 A Palm Strike","Jian Wushuang was not dead. It was the Ruler Blood Wave who had sent them the news.","After all, the magic lamp that Jian Wushuang had left in the divine Palace of life was still lit. Although he was not dead, he had lost contact with them all these years. There was no news at all. It was obvious that he was not in a good situation.","In fact, after Jian Wushuang’s great change in the second level, his body was controlled by the sword spirit of the Tarot Divine Sword. For thousands of years, he naturally could not contact the outside world. And now, Jian Wushuang had just come out.","“Let’s go. Most of the Omega Rulers who wish to join us have already arrived. All we need to do is select a few of the most elite of them, and then have you personally lead them. I imagine that should be enough to defeat Ruler Silver Roc’s side.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng said.","The Ninth Kalpa King nodded, and a hint of coldness flashed in his eyes.","There were not many opportunities left in the Tarot Ruins, and he still had not heard anything about the second level that King Zhufeng had mentioned. It was probably only King Zhufeng’s guess.","Now that things had come to this, there was no longer a need to stay in the Tarot Ruins.","But...","Before he left, it was time to settle some grudges!","The Blood Nether Emissaries, Lord Zhennan, and the Ruler Silver Roc will not be able to escape!","Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes glinted coldly. Divine Marquis Qingfeng followed closely behind him and strode out of the palace.","...","A moment later, the two of them walked out of the palace, and the crowd immediately burst into a commotion.","“It’s the Ninth Kalpa King! the Ninth Kalpa King has come out!”","“The Ninth Kalpa King is really strong! The divine power aura around his body is not on the same level as mine!”","The eyes of the Ultimate Rulers flashed with a hint of fervour.","An expert would be respected and worshipped wherever he went, and the Ninth Kalpa King was the well-deserved expert among the Ultimate Rulers!","The Ninth Kalpa King’s expression did not change at all when he heard these exclamations. He glanced at the Ultimate Ruler outside the palace and said indifferently, “If you want to join my camp, you can. I only have one request, and that is to be able to take one of my palm strikes!”","“Come, let me see your strength.”","After saying that, the Ninth Kalpa King took a step forward. He stepped into the void and looked down at the Rulers.","“This...”","When the many Ultimate Rulers heard this, they looked at each other, uncertain.","They did not expect that the requirement to join the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp was to take a palm from him!","This was far beyond their expectations.","Among the Ultimate Rulers, the Ninth Kalpa King’s strength was comparable to that of the Supremes. Although they were also Ultimate Rulers, many of whom were top Ultimate Rulers, they were not sure if they could withstand one move from the Ninth Kalpa King.","The originally noisy crowd had become unusually quiet at this moment.","For a moment, no one actually dared to take a move from the Ninth Kalpa King.","At the outermost part of the crowd, Jian Wushuang, who was dressed in a loose black robe with a hood covering most of his face, could not help but smile.","The Ninth Kalpa King was still as conceited as ever.","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and then he smiled.","“What’s wrong? There are so many of you here, yet none of you have the courage to take a single move from me?” The Ninth Kalpa King stepped into the void, looked down at the crowd, and said indifferently.","As soon as he finished speaking, there was a commotion in the crowd.","And then, a muscular Ultimate Ruler with a sledgehammer in his hand soared into the sky.","“Ninth Kalpa King, I, the Golden Ape, am here to experience it!” This Ultimate Ruler’s body was like an iron tower, and he gave off an extremely oppressive feeling. He raised his head and said with an arrogant expression, everyone says that the Ninth Kalpa King is the strongest Ruler, even comparable to a Supreme. “Today, I’ll see if you, the Ninth Kalpa King, are really that strong!”","“You talk too much.” The Ninth Kalpa King was expressionless. He directly raised his palm and slapped down at the Golden Ape!","“Rumble!”","In an instant, countless divine powers surged and formed a giant palm that covered the sky!","This palm covered the entire sky. In the face of this palm, the Golden Ape Ruler was as small as an ant.","“Take this palm and I’ll allow you to join my camp.” The Ninth Kalpa King retracted his hand and stood with his hands behind his back, his expression indifferent.","The giant palm was surging with power as it slammed down on the Golden Ape.","Break!!!","“Die!” The Golden Ape God bellowed in rage as it saw this palm strike that seemed as if the heavens were about to collapse. It raised its giant hammer and smashed it down!","Waves of divine power gathered in his arms. The muscles on his arms twisted and twisted, emitting a terrifying power.","Bang!","This hammer and the Ninth Kalpa King’s palm collided together!","A surge of divine power burst forth, causing the entire mountain range to shake.","Ruler Golden Ape spat out a mouthful of blood as he was sent flying back. He crashed into the ground, creating a small crater in the mountain range.","The light from the palm did not dim in the slightest. It was as if it had been stung by an ant as it continued to strike down at the Golden Ape.","“No!”","“This...!” The Golden Ape was stunned.","At this moment, he truly understood how great the difference in strength was between the Ninth Kalpa King and an ordinary Ultimate Ruler like him!","“He’s too weak.”","The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head and waved his hand. The huge palm in the sky gradually dissipated.","“Carry it away, next one.” The Ninth Kalpa King retracted his gaze and looked at the others again.","The entire place was silent, leaving only the sound of heavy breathing.","They were simply scared out of their wits by the Ninth Kalpa King’s palm. It was too strong! Although the Golden Ape was not one of the top-tier Ultimate Rulers, it was still extremely powerful. Yet, it could not even take a single palm.","This Ninth Kalpa King’s strength was on a completely different level from them!","They could tell that if the Ninth Kalpa King had not held back at the end, this palm would have been enough to kill the Golden Ape Ruler.","“No one else?” The Ninth Kalpa King said indifferently.","No one in the crowd replied for a long time. After a long time, a middle-aged man wearing cloth clothes and straw shoes and holding a divine spear walked out of the crowd.","“Ruler Spear River, I’m here to ask Ninth Kalpa King for advice.” The middle-aged man’s expression was solemn. the divine spear in his hand was as white as a rainbow. he was extremely nervous.","“Take my palm!” The Ninth Kalpa King did not say much. Just like before, he continued to slap down at Ruler Spear River.","“Swish!”","Ruler Spear River raised his head to look at the palm. He first took a deep breath, then let out an explosive roar and charged into the sky!","“Bang bang bang bang bang bang bang bang bang!!!”","“Die!” A cold light exploded from Ruler Spear River’s divine spear, and then he thrust it out like a dragon, striking out 789 times in succession!","The spear shadows intertwined and stacked on top of each other like an impenetrable curtain of rain. They smashed onto the giant palm.","A moment later, the power of the giant palm gradually dissipated, and the sky returned to its clear state."]},{"number":4176,"title":"Chapter 4176 Water Sorcerer Ruler","paragraphs":["4176 Water Sorcerer Ruler","“I’ve embarrassed myself.”","Ruler Spear River landed on the ground, panting heavily, his forehead covered in sweat.","The surrounding Rulers who were watching the battle cast envious gazes at him. This person had taken the palm of the Ninth Kalpa King, which meant that he could follow the Ninth Kalpa King. In the future, he should be able to do whatever he wanted in the Tarot Ruins.","However, there was not much joy on spear river’s face, only lingering fear.","It was too difficult for him to receive the palm strike just now. It was an explosion that exhausted all the divine power in his body!","But even so, he could only barely offset the power of this palm.","One must know that this was just a casual palm strike from the Ninth Kalpa King. He was not serious at all.","The Ninth Kalpa King was too terrifying.","In the void, the Ninth Kalpa King lowered his head and looked at him with a hint of approval in his eyes. He said indifferently, “It’s not bad to be able to withstand this palm.”","...","Time passed slowly, and gradually, many people came to challenge the Ninth Kalpa King.","However, most of them did not manage to withstand the palm of the Ninth Kalpa King and had to leave in disappointment. Only a few of the more famous experts among the Ultimate Rulers were able to withstand the palm of the Ninth Kalpa King.","“Ran Gu, take good care of little Qing. Master will be back soon.” Water Sorcerer Ruler warned before taking a deep breath. With a determined look in his eyes, he strode toward the Ninth Kalpa King.","He knew that it was his turn!","“Be careful, master!”","Ran Gu and Qingxi shouted worriedly from behind.","When Water Sorcerer Ruler heard this, he stopped in his tracks. However, he did not turn back and continued walking toward the Ninth Kalpa King.","He knew that so many Ultimate Rulers, including some weaker peak Ultimate Rulers, could not withstand the palm of the Ninth Kalpa King. Although he was also at the level of a peak Ultimate Ruler, he was not very strong. It would be very difficult for him to withstand the palm of the Ninth Kalpa King.","But...","For the sake of his eldest disciple, he had to give it a try!","A moment later, he walked to the feet of the Ninth Kalpa King, cupped his hands, and said, “Ninth Kalpa King, I’m Water Sorcerer. Please enlighten me.”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s expression did not change. He nodded and said, “Come on.”","Boom!","With a loud explosion, the Ninth Kalpa King raised his palm and slammed it down at Water Sorcerer Ruler!","The surging godly power condensed and formed a giant palm that could cover the sky. Every palm print was clearly visible and filled with profound universe principles.","This palm then came crashing down on Water Sorcerer Ruler!","Water Sorcerer Ruler did not dare to relax in the slightest upon seeing this. He quickly formed seals with his hands and bellowed, “Water dragon, rise!”","Bang!","In an instant, a powerful gust of wind exploded with him at the center. Water Sorcerer Ruler’s hair and beard all flew up in the air as his eyes widened in rage!","Roar!","A dragon’s roar was heard. then, a dark blue water dragon rushed out of his divine body and bit at the giant palm that looked like a dark cloud!","Pa.","Like glass shattering, the Water Dragon formed from the Water Sorcerer God’s divine power only lasted for ten seconds before shattering.","“He’s too weak,” The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head.","Water Sorcerer Ruler completely ignored them. He did not even spare them a glance as he used all his strength to shout, “Gather for this old man!”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","In an instant, the thousands of water droplets formed by the collapse of the Water Dragon seemed to be pulled by something. They gathered from all directions at the same time, twisted and fused, and finally formed a huge, thick wave of water.","Immediately after, this wave of water once again pressed toward the Ninth Kalpa King’s giant palm!","Bang!","Accompanied by a loud noise, the water wave actually passed through the Ninth Kalpa King’s giant palm and then wrapped the giant palm in it. Like a millstone, it began to grind away the divine power on the giant palm.","“Oh?” When the Ninth Kalpa King saw this, he raised his head and looked at the Water Sorcerer Ruler for the first time. His eyes revealed a hint of surprise.","“His use of the principles of heaven and earth is rather intriguing,” he said with a faint smile.","At the outermost area of the crowd, Ran Gu and Qingxi were extremely excited when they saw this scene.","Even Jian Wushuang could not help but raise his eyebrows.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The water wave wrapped around the Ninth Kalpa King’s giant palm layer by layer, constantly crushing and erasing the divine power on the giant palm. This water wave was also rapidly annihilated at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Water Sorcerer Ruler stared at this sight, a voice roaring in his mind. Destroy! Destroy!","Time slowly passed, and after a short while, more than half of the Ninth Kalpa King’s giant palm’s power had been worn down, while only a thin layer remained of Water Sorcerer Ruler’s water wave.","Water Sorcerer Ruler’s expression was extremely grim. A thin layer of sweat had even appeared on his forehead due to his extreme nervousness.","Just as the Ninth Kalpa King’s huge palm was about to be completely obliterated by the Water Sorcerer Ruler’s water wave, the Ninth Kalpa King seemed to know the outcome. He retracted his gaze and said indifferently, “Your usage of the rules is not bad. It’s a pity that you’re still a little lacking in terms of your own strength.”","Water Sorcerer Ruler was taken aback. He did not understand what they were saying. “What...what?”","Before he could finish.","Bang!","The water wave, which was already as thin as a cicada’s wing, was actually annihilated and shattered before the Ninth Kalpa King’s huge palm that was about to be annihilated!","“No!”","Water Sorcerer Ruler’s face twisted, and a look of unwillingness flashed through his eyes.","However, the outcome was already decided.","“You may leave.”","The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head. From what he could see, the Water Sorcerer Ruler’s use of divine power was quite good, but it was only good. It would not make him look at it in a new light.","“This...!” Water Sorcerer Ruler felt as if all his energy had been sucked out of his body, and he fell into a daze.","Not being able to join the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp meant that he would not even have a place to stand in the Tarot Ruins, let alone avenge his innocent eldest disciple who had died tragically.","“Yes, thank you for your guidance, Ninth Kalpa King.” Water Sorcerer Ruler forced a smile on his face and cupped his hands at the Ninth Kalpa King. He then turned around and walked out of the crowd.","No one knew how heavy his steps were at this moment.","To him, if he missed this opportunity, he might never have the chance to avenge his disciple in this life.","The crowd gradually parted to form a path.","All of the Ultimate Rulers present were looking at Water Sorcerer Ruler with rather complicated gazes.","Even though he did not manage to withstand the palm strike of the Ninth Kalpa King in the end, anyone with a discerning eye could tell that the palm strike of the Ninth Kalpa King had already reached its limit. Perhaps, as long as the water wave of the Water Sorcerer Ruler could last for another three breaths, the outcome would be completely different.","Water Sorcerer Ruler had proven his power.","In this world, the strong were always respected."]},{"number":4177,"title":"Chapter 4177 Covering the Aura","paragraphs":["4177 Covering the Aura","“Little Qing, Little Gu, I...I’ve tried my best.” Water Sorcerer Ruler let out a long sigh after returning.","He did not need to think to know how disappointed and dejected Ran Gu and Qingxi, who had always been close to his eldest disciple, would be.","“Master, you’ve already done very well.”","Suddenly, he heard Ran Gu’s gentle voice.","Water Sorcerer Ruler raised his head and saw Ran Gu smiling at him with a warm smile.","“That’s right, master. You’re amazing today. You know, that’s the Ninth Kalpa King, the most powerful Ruler recognized in the universe. You were on par with him just now. If it weren’t for the slight difference in the end, you would have defeated him. You’re already very strong!”","Qingxi raised her head and laughed with a proud look.","Water Sorcerer Ruler could not help but feel a little touched upon seeing this, and his heavy mood brightened up a little.","“Don’t talk nonsense. The Ninth Kalpa King only used a casual palm strike, but I went all out. How can we be compared?” Water Sorcerer Ruler glared at Qingxi as she chided with a smile.","“Aiya, it’s almost the same.” Qingxi said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang felt warm in his heart as he watched this scene.","In the hundreds of thousands of years he had cultivated, he was used to seeing killing and plundering, used to seeing the coldness of human relationships, used to seeing the indifference of the world, but he had rarely seen people as pure and simple as the master and disciple before him.","A moment later, Water Sorcerer Ruler turned to look at Jian Wushuang and said apologetically, “Little friend Blood Sword, we’re planning to leave the Tarot Ruins, so we can’t protect you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Water Sorcerer Ruler, where are you planning to go next?”","“Let’s go back to our own star area. Although it’s a bit remote, it’s safe there. There aren’t many experts there, so it might be more suitable for us.” Water Sorcerer Ruler growled.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and then nodded. For them, perhaps returning to the star area that belonged to them was the best choice.","Therefore, he did not try to stop them.","Even though Jian Wushuang believed that he would have no problem protecting the three of them with his current strength, it might not be a good thing for them to force them to stay.","He respected the choice of these three people.","“Little friend Blood Sword, we’ll meet again if there’s a chance.”","“Goodbye, Blood Sword. We are in the Mountain Sun astral of the void wind Starfield. If you have time, you can come and find us.”","“Blood Sword, you’re not strong either. It’s best if you leave this place as well. I don’t want to see you die here like my eldest senior. Oh, I don’t mean to say that you’re going to die. In short, take good care of yourself.”","Water Sorcerer Ruler, Ran Gu, and Qingxi bade farewell to Jian Wushuang.","“I will.”","Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile.","After that, the three of them left the place step by step and walked into the distance.","As for Jian Wushuang, he pulled down his hood and lowered his head as he walked toward the Ninth Kalpa King step by step. He was wearing a wide black robe and had pulled down his hood, so his face was completely hidden. Only his chin could be vaguely seen.","“What is this little fourth-stage great Ruler doing?”","“Eh? Could it be that this fourth stage Ruler also wants to test his moves against the Ninth Kalpa King?”","“A fourth-stage chief Ruler? What a joke.”","In the midst of the discussion, Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm and he stood in front of Ninth Kalpa King.","“You want to try too?” the Ninth Kalpa King looked down at Jian Wushuang, and his eyes suddenly narrowed.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng also frowned.","In the Tarot Ruins, there were many Ultimate Rulers, and the number of fifth-stage Rulers was much less. As for fourth-stage Rulers, they were even rarer.","Now, a fourth stage Ruler had appeared in front of him with a divine sword on his back. He was clearly a sword cultivator.","This made Ninth Kalpa King instantly think of Jian Wushuang.","But very quickly, the Ninth Kalpa King denied this judgment. The reason was that the aura emitted by the black sect person in front of him was very different from Jian Wushuang’s.","In the Ninth Kalpa King’s impression, Jian Wushuang’s aura was calm and restrained, like a peerless divine sword hidden in a scabbard.","However, the black-robed man in front of him gave people the feeling that he was extremely dark, extremely cold, and emotionless.","The difference in aura was so great that neither Ninth Kalpa King nor Divine Marquis Qingfeng recognized Jian Wushuang.","The reason for this was that after Jian Wushuang controlled the Tarot Divine Sword, his soul aura could be completely covered by the Tarot Divine Sword. The extremely cold and dark aura that he was emitting now was the aura that the Tarot Divine Sword had.","Under such circumstances, unless the Ninth Kalpa King saw Jian Wushuang’s appearance, or someone like Leng Rushuang, who could recognize Jian Wushuang from his figure or simple actions, the Ninth Kalpa King and Divine Marquis Qingfeng would naturally not be able to recognize him.","They had assumed that this black-robed man was also a fourth stage Ruler who had ventured into the Tarot Ruins, and one who had overestimated his own abilities.","Even a weaker peak Ultimate Ruler could not take a palm from the Ninth Kalpa King. Many people thought that a fourth-stage Ruler was overestimating his own ability.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was covered in a black robe. After hearing Ninth Kalpa King’s words, he did not answer. Instead, he directly reached out and pulled out the divine sword behind him, using his own actions as a reply.","Jian Wushuang carried two divine swords on his back. The divine swords that he had pulled out were red and had a faint sense of sharpness that could cut through the sky. It was the Wu Qi divine sword that had changed greatly after being modified by the sword spirit of Tarot.","As for the other sword, it was wrapped by ancient vines, and its aura was ordinary.","“Make your move.” A hoarse voice came from under the black robe.","“Hiding your head and showing your tail, pretending to be mysterious, not knowing the immensity of the heavens and earth.” The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head expressionlessly. Then, he raised his right hand and pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","Boom!","In an instant, the giant palm that had defeated countless enemies gathered in the void, covered the sky, and pressed down on Jian Wushuang with a terrifying power.","As for Jian Wushuang, he looked as if he had been scared silly. He kept his head down and did not have any intention to resist.","Instantly, the countless spectating Ultimate Rulers, upon seeing this, couldn’t help but gloat.","“This little guy has probably never seen such a terrifying palm before, right?”","“Hahaha, look, he’s scared silly.”","“The juniors nowadays are really overestimating themselves.”","The omega Rulers all chuckled and shook their heads.","To them, Jian Wushuang’s voluntary act was like a funny interlude in the solemn atmosphere.","“Watch carefully. This little guy will definitely be frightened by the Ninth Kalpa King’s palm and leave a psychological shadow.”","..."]},{"number":4178,"title":"Chapter 4178 Jian Wushuang?","paragraphs":["4178 Jian Wushuang?","In the void not far away, Water Sorcerer Ruler and the other two, who had already walked far away, could not help but turn back to take a look when they sensed the huge commotion.","As a result, the three of them were stunned by what they saw!","“Eh? Master, that...was it the Blood Sword that was receiving the Ninth Kalpa King’s palm?” Ruler Ran Gu rubbed his eyes in disbelief.","Water Sorcerer Ruler had a look of surprise on his face as well. he nodded and said in surprise, “It’s indeed our young friend, Blood Sword.”","“This guy...what do you want to do?” When Qingxi saw this, she couldn’t help but stomp her feet in worry and blame him.","Water Sorcerer Ruler shook his head with a wry smile. “Little friend Blood Sword, I think you’re unwilling to accept the fact that I’ve been defeated and can’t join the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp. You want to try it yourself.”","The three of them did not know whether they should say that Jian Wushuang was overestimating himself or that a newborn calf was not afraid of a tiger.","The three of them stopped in their tracks and decided to take a look. If Jian Wushuang was injured by the palm, they could save him.","...","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The giant palm pressed down inch by inch, twisting the void and shaking the entire mountain range.","As for Jian Wushuang, he still had no intention of making a move.","Three thousand feet...five hundred feet...","The giant palm was getting closer and closer to Jian Wushuang. The strong wind caused his black robe to flutter.","“What’s going on? Is this person here to play with this seat?” The Ninth Kalpa King frowned, and a touch of displeasure flashed in his eyes.","If this continued, Jian Wushuang would be crushed to death by the power of the palm.","200 feet...","The giant palm completely suppressed all the light above Jian Wushuang, as if a mass of thick and huge dark clouds had shrouded him.","“Is this little fellow here to seek death on purpose?”","“What is he doing?”","Some of the spectating Ultimate Rulers couldn’t help but shake their heads.","Water Sorcerer Ruler and the other two felt their hearts tighten.","“My young friend, what is he trying to do?” Water Sorcerer Ruler could not understand Jian Wushuang at all.","“Blood Sword, you bastard, run!” Qingxi said with an anxious expression.","Just as the giant palm was about to press down on Jian Wushuang’s head, the Ninth Kalpa King raised his arm and intended to disperse the power of the giant palm.","Jian Wushuang’s five well-defined fingers finally clenched slowly.","“It’s time to see how much I’ve improved in the past thousand years.” A faint smile appeared on Jian Wushuang’s face, which was covered by the huge hood.","The next moment!","He suddenly swung his sword!","Chi!","In an instant, a blood-red sword light shot out from the weeping Wu divine sword and soared into the sky!","This sword was fast to the extreme. Everyone did not even have time to see how this sword was slashed out. They only felt a blur before their eyes, and they saw that this blood-colored sword light had shockingly already cleaved onto that huge palm that covered the sky and the sun!","At this moment, with the wailing of gods and the chanting of Buddhas and demons, the blood-red sword light split the huge palm into two like a bolt of lightning that tore the dark night!","There was no resistance at all. like a knife cutting through tofu, the huge palm that covered the sky directly collapsed!","Chi chi chi.","The sky regained its light.","As for Jian Wushuang, he had already put away the divine sword Wu Qi.","What?!","This, how is this possible!!!","“He actually...one sword had destroyed the Ninth Kalpa King’s giant palm? I’m not seeing things, right?”","“What just happened?”","The spectating Ultimate Rulers were stunned at first, as if their brains had crashed. They could not react.","Then, they looked at Jian Wushuang with horror on their faces.","The palm strike that countless Ultimate Rulers had been unable to withstand despite using all their might had been defeated by a fourth-level Ruler with a single sword strike?","Countless people were dumbfounded. They were so shocked that their eyeballs were about to fall out.","Water Sorcerer Ruler and the other two spectating from off in the distance all had extremely interesting expressions on their faces.","“Senior, Senior Brother Ran Gu, pinch me to see if I’m hallucinating. The young girl Qingxi’s mouth was wide open, and her pretty face was full of disbelief.”","Ran Gu was not doing any better. His entire body was trembling as he muttered unconsciously, “How is that possible? He’s just a Ruler of the fourth level! Even master wasn’t able to take this blow, so how could he possibly?”","Water Sorcerer Ruler was completely stunned, and he stood there in a daze.","Was this still the humble little friend who smiled and said that he would let him take them along?","He could not help but smile bitterly.","He had previously said that he would let the Blood Sword join the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp by relying on him, but unexpectedly...","Water Sorcerer Ruler shook his head and let out a long sigh from the bottom of his heart. “The future generations are formidable.”","...","At the same time, the Ninth Kalpa King, who was standing in the void, had a divine light in his eyes that suddenly grew three inches.","He was all too familiar with this sword essence!","It was this sword essence that had defeated him in the trial arena!","However, if the black-robed man in front of him was really that person, that person should not be so strong, right?","And the aura that this black-robed man was giving off was completely different.","Thoughts flashed through the Ninth Kalpa King’s mind like lightning. He lowered his head and looked over with a complicated expression.","Under everyone’s gaze, Jian Wushuang raised his head and pushed down the wide hood on his head, gradually revealing a fair and delicate face.","“Ninth Kalpa King, long time no see.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Jian Wushuang, it’s you!” The Ninth Kalpa King’s body trembled, and a touch of disbelief gushed out of his eyes.","Then, he took a heavy step forward and stood in front of Jian Wushuang. He sized up Jian Wushuang and asked in surprise, “Jian Wushuang, where have you been in the past thousand years? And your aura, why did it completely change?”","“We’ll talk about this later.” Jian Wushuang smiled and shook his head. Then, he looked behind him and saw a figure rushing over.","Jian Wushuang!","Divine Marquis Qingfeng strode over and hugged Jian Wushuang. He laughed heartily and said, “Hahahaha, Jian Wushuang, I’m finally relieved to see that you’re fine.”","At this moment, the divine power in his body had recovered completely and it even seemed to have improved a little.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile, “Jian Wushuang, do you still remember the promise we made a thousand years ago?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied with a smile, “How could I not remember?”","A thousand years ago, they were chased by Qing Xuzi. When they separated and escaped, they made a promise that if they could survive this time, they would drink and chat merrily when they met again."]},{"number":4179,"title":"Chapter 4179 An Explanation","paragraphs":["4179 An Explanation","“Let’s go, Jian Wushuang. Tell us where you’ve been for the past thousand years. Even I can’t see through you now.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng pulled Jian Wushuang and prepared to enter the palace.","For the past 1000 years, Divine Marquis Qingfeng had been filled with guilt over Jian Wushuang’s finger. He thought that it was him who had dragged Jian Wushuang down and caused him to be unable to escape Qing Xuzi’s pursuit.","Even though the Ruler Blood Wave had sent them a message later to inform them that Jian Wushuang was not dead, the guilt in his heart had not lessened at all.","Now, he finally saw that Jian Wushuang had returned safely and seemed to be stronger than before. The guilt in his heart that was hanging in his throat finally settled.","“Aren’t you going to continue to select experts?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng did not reply, but Ninth Kalpa King shook his head and snorted in disdain. “If they have the strength to take my palm, they would have come out long ago. Those who are still here and don’t dare to try are just some stinky fish and rotten shrimp. Even if there are people who can take my palm, they are just cowards. What’s the use of them?”","“You’re quite clear on this.” Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement.","Soon, the three of them entered the palace.","Ruler Spear River and the others who had passed the Ninth Kalpa King’s test followed closely behind in awe.","The palace gate slowly closed.","“What?” The many Ultimate Rulers present could not help but look at each other in shock.","“What is this? Aren’t we competing?”","“From the looks of it, we probably won’t be able to enter the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp.”","The Ultimate Rulers who had not tried shook their heads with bitter smiles.","However, they had already expected this outcome, and it was their own choice. Therefore, they were not too depressed.","Compared to this, they were more concerned about the identity of the fourth-level Ruler who had appeared last and cut through the Ninth Kalpa King’s giant palm with one sword.","“Everyone, from what I saw just now, this fourth-level Ruler with extremely terrifying strength seems to know the Ninth Kalpa King and the others?”","“You’re talking nonsense. When did you see the expressions of the Ninth Kalpa King and Divine Marquis Qingfeng? When have they ever been so friendly to us?”","“Given his power as a fourth-level chief Ruler, he should be extremely famous throughout the universe. How come I’ve never heard of someone like him before?”","Just as everyone was in doubt and whispering to each other, an Ultimate Ruler suddenly thought of something and exclaimed, “I know who that person was!”","“Eh? Who is he?”","Everyone turned to look at the Ultimate Ruler.","The Ultimate Ruler took a deep breath, then said in a low voice, “I’m sure you’re all familiar with the battle in Fengyang Canyon 1000 years ago?”","Everyone nodded. A thousand years ago, in the Fengyang Canyon, all the top forces had fought each other for a divine medicine that could increase the chance of breaking through to the Supreme level. Naturally, they were familiar with that.","“Do you still remember that there was a fourth-level Ruler in the Ninth Kalpa King’s team?” The final Ruler continued.","“Hmm...I remember, there was such a person back then.”","“That’s right. I remember that he fought with Qing Xuzi for a while and was not at a disadvantage at all. I was there at the time, and I was surprised for a while.”","“The black-robed swordsman was the one who fought with Qing Xuzi a thousand years ago?”","1,000 years ago, Jian Wushuang had fought with Qing Xuzi head-on as a fourth stage Ruler. The battle was dazzling and the news had spread. Now that it was pointed out, everyone immediately remembered it.","At the same time, everyone remembered that after the battle in Fengyang Canyon, Qing Xuzi had gone after this man at all costs.","“Then this person is in big trouble. A thousand years ago, Son of God Qing Xu chased after this person, but his whereabouts were unknown. The people of the Great Void Temple have been searching for Son of God Qing Xu all this time.”","“That’s right. Back then, Son of God Qing Xu disappeared because he was chasing after this person. Now that this person has returned safely, the people from the Great Void Temple will definitely come to find him.”","“Tsk, tsk. That Qing Xuzi is the current divine son of the Great Void Temple. he can be said to be the most outstanding genius in the past hundreds, if not thousands of chaos cycles. In the end, he disappeared in the Tarot Ruins because he was chasing after this person. That’s not all. however, this person has returned safely. It’s obvious that the people of the Great Void Temple will be furious and vent all their anger on this person.”","“Let’s wait and see. Once the people from the Great Void Temple hear about this, they will come to find this person soon.”","Many Ultimate Rulers shook their heads and discussed. They did not think Jian Wushuang’s future would be promising.","Even though Jian Wushuang’s performance just now was very strong, one must know that the Great Void Temple was a great undying force that shook the entire universe!","...","In the hall, Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng sat cross-legged. In front of them were three low tea tables with a few pots of spirit wine on them.","“Jian Wushuang, can you tell me where you have been for the past thousand years?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng asked with a smile.","The Ninth Kalpa King remained silent at the side, but his eyes inadvertently glanced at Jian Wushuang. It could be seen that he was also very curious about where Jian Wushuang had been in the past one thousand years and why his aura had changed so much after he returned.","Jian Wushuang picked up his wine cup and took a sip. Then he said, “It’s a long story. When Qing Xuzi was chasing me, I had no choice but to keep running. In the end, I ran to a special place at the edge of the Tarot Ruins. There, I got rid of Qing Xuzi and obtained some special opportunities, which improved my strength. As for my aura, I just concealed it with some means.”","Jian Wushuang only gave a simple explanation.","He did not plan to tell anyone about the second level of the Tarot Ruins. After all, it was a matter of great importance. The things inside were enough to make a Supreme Master jealous. Speaking of which, Divine Marquis Qingfeng and Ninth Kalpa King had gone through life and death with him. However, it was hard to predict a person’s heart. No one knew if the two of them would have any evil intentions after knowing that Jian Wushuang had obtained the greatest opportunity in the second level of the Tarot Ruins.","Even if the two of them did not do anything, once the news was leaked, Jian Wushuang knew without a doubt that the entire universe would come after him. Even the divine Palace of life would not be able to protect him.","After all, it was the inheritance of Ruler Tarot!","Just the various treasures and universe origin stones inside were enough to make many experts in the universe boil, not to mention the Tarot sword manual, which was an unrivaled super power that shocked the ancient times, as well as the famous Tarot Divine Sword."]},{"number":4180,"title":"Chapter 4180 The Final Battle","paragraphs":["4180 The Final Battle","After hearing Jian Wushuang’s explanation, Ninth Kalpa King and Divine Marquis Qingfeng exchanged a look and smiled.","They could tell that Jian Wushuang’s explanation was perfunctory, but they did not blame him. After all, everyone had secrets.","They were curious about Jian Wushuang’s experience over the past thousand years, but since he was unwilling to say too much, they naturally would not ask.","“Jian Wushuang, it’s good that you’ve returned safely. With you here, we have more confidence in the final battle.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng said with a smile.","!!","“The final battle?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and a hint of doubt flashed in his eyes.","The Ninth Kalpa King nodded and said indifferently, “It’s time for us to leave the Tarot Ruins, but before we leave...”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s words paused, and a fierce look flashed in his eyes.","“...I have to settle the accounts first!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang understood and a cold light flashed in his eyes.","“What do you plan to do?” Jian Wushuang said.","“What do we do? Of course,” the Ninth Kalpa King said with a cold smile. “We’ll go straight to his door and crush the Silver Roc’s divine body inch by inch. We’ll burn his soul to ashes.”","“What time?” Jian Wushuang nodded and asked.","“Anytime,” The Ninth Kalpa King replied.","“Three days later,” Jian Wushuang replied after some thought.","At this point, the time was set.","Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng chatted for a while more before they left.","....","In a sealed bedroom.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged with the Tarot sword manual floating in front of his knees.","Jian Wushuang turned to the first page. Slowly, the world in front of him turned into a dead darkness again. He continued to sink into the comprehension of the sword move ‘eternal night’.","Although he had only comprehended a little bit of this move, its power had already become the most lethal move in Jian Wushuang’s hands!","It could be said that ‘eternal night’ had already become one of Jian Wushuang’s trump cards!","Once it was used, it would definitely shock the heavens!","Three days passed by in a flash.","On the morning of the third day, Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, Divine Marquis Qingfeng, and the other Ultimate Rulers who had submitted to Ninth Kalpa King gathered in the hall.","“I won’t hide it from you. Our first battle is to kill the Ruler Silver Roc. If anyone wants to leave, I won’t stop them.” The Ninth Kalpa King stood in the main seat of the hall and said with his hands behind his back.","As soon as he finished speaking, the hall instantly became noisy, and the faces of the many Ultimate Rulers changed slightly.","“You’re going to kill Ruler Silver Roc?”","“The Ruler Silver Roc has many experts under his command. He has dozens of Ultimate Rulers. Although they aren’t strong individually, if they work together, I’m afraid it’ll be...”","“Isn’t this a little too dangerous?”","A few of the Ultimate Rulers immediately shrank back, their eyes flashing with the intention to retreat.","They followed the Ninth Kalpa King to find a backer, but not to fight to the death.","“After this battle is over, I’m willing to give up everything you’ve acquired from killing the Silver Roc. You can have it all.” The Ninth Kalpa King continued to speak indifferently.","After he said this, the Ultimate Rulers, who had originally intended to retreat, were shocked.","“The Ninth Kalpa King doesn’t want any of them?”","“As the leader of a faction, the Ruler Silver Roc has collected countless divine medicines and divine materials over the years. If we really kill him...”","“Wealth is found in danger!”","The hearts of the many Ultimate Rulers jumped, and hesitation appeared on their faces.","“I’ll give you the time it takes for an incense stick to burn to consider. After that, give me your answer.”","After the time it takes for an incense stick to burn.","All the Ultimate Rulers present took a deep breath and seemed to have made a decision. They said in unison, “Ninth Kalpa King, we...I’m willing to follow you in battle!”","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King’s always indifferent face could not help but smile slightly. He nodded and replied, “Good.”","...","At the same time, in the central area of the Tarot Ruins, on another plain.","This place was much more lively than the other places in the Tarot Ruins. Many Ultimate Rulers had set up camp here, forming a lively scene.","In the largest hall, the Ruler Silver Roc was chatting with a group of people with a warm smile on his face.","There were two people sitting beside him.","The one on the left was wearing a purple gold crown and a nine-clawed dragon robe. He had a dignified look and a light golden flame mark between his eyebrows.","If the Water Sorcerer Ruler was here, he would recognize that this person was the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, which was ranked second in the Tarot Ruins!","The other person was wearing a red robe, his figure tall and sturdy, his hair tied into a ponytail that hung loosely on his back, and he was sitting barefooted. It was Lord Zhennan!","“Ruler Silver Roc, why have you suddenly called me over?” Lord Zhennan frowned and said impatiently.","The Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom was also the Ruler Silver Roc, and he had an ugly expression on his face.","Not too long ago, the two of them had suddenly received a message from the Ruler Silver Roc. He had asked them to gather here and discuss some important matters.","“As expected, the Blood Sky Palace didn’t come.” Ruler Silver Roc muttered to himself as he looked at the empty seat of the three he had prepared.","Then, he turned his head to look at Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince. He smiled and said, “Have you heard about the Ninth Kalpa King recruiting experts recently?”","“What?”","Lord Zhennan raised his eyebrows when he heard this. He naturally knew that the Ninth Kalpa King had not deliberately concealed the fact that he was recruiting strong practitioners.","“I know. This isn’t a secret, right? Silver Roc, just say what you want to say. You know that this king hates keeping people in suspense the most.”","“Your Highness, please calm down. There’s something strange about this. Listen to me in detail.”","The Ruler Silver Roc’s expression was calm. He cleared his throat and slowly said, “I know the Ninth Kalpa King the best. He has always been arrogant and conceited, and he looks down on others. Therefore, he rarely goes with others, let alone recruit people. Thus, once he recruits people, he can be certain that something big is about to happen.”","“Something big?” Lord Zhennan’s pupils shrank when he heard this.","The Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom also looked interested.","“Yes.” Ruler Silver Roc nodded, then continued, “The Ninth Kalpa King has been in the Ultimate Ruler realm for dozens of chaos cycles, causing his status in the divine Palace of life to plummet. We don’t have to think to know that he must be very anxious to break through to the supremacy stage.”","“A thousand years ago, in the Fengyang Canyon, the Ninth Kalpa King broke through our encirclement and obtained the divine medicine that could increase the chances of breaking through to the supreme realm. Now, it’s time for him to return and break through to the supreme realm.”","“So? If he’s going back, then he’s going back. What does that have to do with us? Don’t tell me that you’re still thinking of taking back the Supreme divine medicine in his hands?” Lord Zhennan asked indifferently.","..."]},{"number":4181,"title":"Chapter 4181 Alliance","paragraphs":["4181 Alliance","“Take back the godly medicine?”","The Ruler Silver Roc’s lips curled into a mocking smile as he shook his head. “Lord Zhennan, it’s not a matter of us taking back the godly medicine in his hands. It’s time for him to settle the score with us.”","Lord Zhennan squinted his eyes. He was not a stupid person. He immediately understood what the Ruler Silver Roc meant.","“What should we do now?” Lord Zhennan asked.","!!","A cold light flashed through Ruler Silver Roc’s eyes, and his voice turned cold. “My idea is that we should join forces and directly fight him! Otherwise, with our individual forces, we are definitely not the Ninth Kalpa King’s opponent. We will only be killed by him one by one and defeated one by one!”","Lord Zhennan’s eyes flashed with a thoughtful look before he nodded and replied, “Sure.”","The Lord Zhennan still understood the principle of mutual dependence.","In the face of the problem of the Ninth Kalpa King, the Lord Zhennan and the Ruler Silver Roc were like grasshoppers on a rope.","There was no need to think about it. If the Ninth Kalpa King really intended to fight, he would definitely not let them go.","As for the two of them, as long as one of them was defeated, it meant that the other side was not having a good time.","“The Ninth Kalpa King has a grudge with the two of you, but not with me. Silver Roc, why did you call me here?” The Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, who had been silent all this time, finally spoke up.","The Ruler Silver Roc did not feel embarrassed at all. “Your Highness, you’re right. You do have no enmity with the Ninth Kalpa King. However, as the number one Ruler of the universe, no one knows how many treasures he has in his Interspatial Ring. I think Your Highness must be interested in this, right?”","“I can promise here that if the three of us join forces to kill the Ninth Kalpa King, when we divide his treasures, we won’t take my share and will give it all to Your Highness. What do you think?”","When the Third Prince heard this, he suddenly burst out laughing as if he had heard a funny joke.","He looked at the Silver Roc with a mocking expression. “Silver Roc, Oh, Silver Roc. As the Third Prince of Da Feng Divine Kingdom, do you think I’d lack the treasures of a mere Ninth Kalpa King?”","After he finished speaking, he got up and planned to leave.","Ruler Silver Roc nodded. He was not disappointed in the least. It was as if he’d expected the Third Prince’s refusal.","“Your Highness, please wait.” Ruler Silver Roc called out.","The Third Prince stopped in his tracks and turned around. “Oh? What else do you want to say?”","“Your Highness...the Ruler Silver Roc said with. “Smile, I know you’re not interested in the Ninth Kalpa King’s treasures, but... Aren’t you interested in his title as the number one Ruler of the universe? I’ve recently heard that the Supreme Emperor God of Da Feng Divine Kingdom is planning to choose one of his nine princes to be the next Ruler of Da Feng Divine Kingdom and ascend to the throne. If your Highness can kill the number one Ruler of the universe, your power in Da Feng Divine Kingdom will reach a whole new level, right?”","“In addition, I think that if your Highness can help this time, as the southern Garrison liege lord of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, he will be more or less grateful to Your Highness.”","The Ruler Silver Roc turned to look at the Lord Zhennan.","The Lord Zhennan continued with a smile, “Your Highness, if you can help me this time, I’ll definitely help you ascend the throne on behalf of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom.”","The Ruler Silver Roc and Lord Zhennan both smiled at the Third Prince.","“Your highness, believe me. If we gather the power of the three sides, it will definitely be easy to suppress a Ninth Kalpa King.” Ruler Silver Roc said.","When the Third Prince heard this, his eyes flickered with uncertainty.","After a long time.","The Third Prince looked at the smiling Ruler Silver Roc and Lord Zhennan with an expressionless face. “Ninth Kalpa King, I can go with you to kill him, but I want half of the things in his Interspatial Ring after his death. If our Da Feng Divine Kingdom really starts the fight for the throne, I hope that you can persuade the Supreme Emperor God of your Da Feng Divine Kingdom to support me to the throne. How about it?”","The Da Feng Divine Kingdom and the Da Feng Divine Kingdom were not far from each other, and they were both top powers in the universe. If he could form a good relationship with the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, it would be a great help to the Third Prince.","The Ruler Silver Roc and Lord Zhennan exchanged a smile and nodded without hesitation. “Your Highness, it’s an honor for you to join us.”","The Third Prince made a sound of acknowledgment and said, “Tell me about your plan to deal with the Ninth Kalpa King.”","Lord Zhennan also looked at the Ruler Silver Roc with curiosity. He believed that the Ruler Silver Roc must have had a plan in mind when he called them over.","Ruler Silver Roc smiled. “It’s very simple. In the Ninth Kalpa King’s camp, the only one who can be brought out is him. As for the other Divine Marquis Qingfeng and the Ultimate Ruler, they are nothing to be afraid of.","“Therefore, when the time comes, the three of us only need to restrain and suppress the Ninth Kalpa King. As for the nearly 100 Ultimate Rulers under the three of us, it’s enough to crush the Rulers under the Ninth Kalpa King. Once the Ultimate Ruler under our command completely defeats the forces under the Ninth Kalpa King and turns around to kill him, no matter how powerful the Ninth Kalpa King is, he will inevitably be defeated. If he’s lucky, he may even be able to completely kill the number one Ruler of the universe!”","The Silver Roc’s eyes glowed with a sinister light and seethed with killing intent.","The Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince looked at the Ruler Silver Roc, and for some reason, their hearts could not help but shiver.","...","In the central area of the Tarot Ruins, on the mountain where the Ninth Kalpa King was located.","“Let’s go!”","“I’m only going to trample the Silver Roc!”","The Ninth Kalpa King stood at the head of the group. After he finished speaking in a deep voice, he took a step forward, turned into a stream of light, and took the lead to soar into the sky!","immediately after.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The other Ultimate Rulers followed closely behind, transforming into a dozen or so streaks of light that shot toward the Ruler Silver Roc.","At this moment, the sky was extremely bright. Led by the Ninth Kalpa King, the streamer, which was accompanied by more than ten peak Ultimate Rulers, exuded a powerful and terrifying aura. It had no intention of hiding its aura at all as it streaked across the sky.","Jian Wushuang was wearing a wide hood, a black robe, and a sword case on his back. He was among the Ultimate Rulers, and they also flew toward the Silver Roc.","“Jian Wushuang, I’m afraid this battle won’t be easy. If you can’t handle it, you should leave first. Do you understand?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng held a heavenly halberd in his hand as he warned.","“Alright,” he said. Jian Wushuang replied with a smile."]},{"number":4182,"title":"Chapter 4182 A Trap?","paragraphs":["4182 A Trap?","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The Ninth Kalpa King and the others had a great momentum. They quickly streaked across the sky, leaving a long trail of flames behind them. When the countless Ultimate Rulers in the Tarot Ruins saw this scene, their faces could not help changing slightly.","“Let’s go, let’s go. Something big is probably going to happen in the ruins!”","“Looking at this direction...could it be that the Ninth Kalpa King is going to find trouble with the Silver Roc?”","!!","“The heavens of the Tarot Ruins...I’m afraid it’s going to change.”","...","Two hours later, the Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and the others arrived at the desolate blood plain where the Ruler Silver Roc was.","Dozens of Ultimate Rulers had set up camp here, making it a lively scene. After the Ninth Kalpa King arrived, the dozens of Ultimate Rulers under the command of the Ruler Silver Roc all looked up at him nervously.","The Ninth Kalpa King looked down at them and shook his head disdainfully. It seemed that they had the advantage in numbers, but they were just a pile of loose sand.","Then, he raised his head and looked at the most magnificent palace in the center of the plain. his cold voice exploded like thunder.","“Silver Roc, come out and face your death!”","Boom!","In an instant, the Ninth Kalpa King’s voice fell like Rolling Thunder, shaking the entire desolate blood plain.","However, it was quiet in the palace, and no one responded.","When the Ninth Kalpa King saw this, he could not help but sneer. He directly raised his palm and slammed it down on the palace!","Bang!","A huge palm as white as jade condensed in the void. Waves of destructive aura seeped out from the gaps between the fingers of the hand and directly stirred up the white waves in the void.","This palm was far more terrifying than it had been in the recruitment test for the Ultimate Rulers. It was as if the world itself had changed colors, and it was capable of plucking the stars and summoning the moon. Even the sun and the stars seemed to be nothing more than cannonballs in this palm.","This was the true strength of the Ninth Kalpa King!","At that moment, the countless Ultimate Rulers present were all shocked.","The Ultimate Rulers who came with Ninth Kalpa King were still fine. After all, they had already seen the power of Ninth Kalpa King’s attack. This time, the terrifying power caused by Ninth Kalpa King’s real attack was also within their expectations.","As for the Silver Roc’s subordinate, Omega Ruler, he had never seen such power before. His face turned cold, and his eyes filled with shock.","Just as the palm was about to hit the palace, a gloomy voice sounded.","“Ninth Kalpa King, you’re the one who’s going to die!”","Chi!","First, a golden spear shot out from the palace and struck the giant palm, neutralizing its power. Then, the Ruler Silver Roc shot out of the palace and grabbed the golden spear.","“Hmph, I thought you wouldn’t dare to come out.” The Ninth Kalpa King stood with his hands behind his back and slightly sneered, “In that case, die in peace!”","He did not waste any more time. He took a step forward and charged toward the Silver Roc.","The Ninth Kalpa King is indeed the Ninth Kalpa King. “He’s still so overbearing. There was no hint of panic on Ruler Silver Roc’s face.” He chuckled, shook his head, and then began to flee.","“Escape? Silver Roc, you were lucky enough to escape from me three million years ago. Do you think you can escape this time?”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s face was expressionless. He took a heavy step, and his body suddenly shot out like a cannonball, sweeping toward the Ruler Silver Roc.","The two of them, one in front and one behind, quickly disappeared from everyone’s sight.","“Looks like we’ll be able to avoid a life-and-death battle.” Ruler Spear River and the others could not help but let out a sigh of relief.","However, at this moment!","A sudden change occurred!","“Kill!!!”","“Little brats under the command of the Ninth Kalpa King, go to hell!!!”","“Hahahaha, without the Ninth Kalpa King, it’s equivalent to a group of Dragons without a leader. Kill them!”","Sneers and angry roars suddenly sounded from all directions.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s expression changed drastically as he saw nearly a hundred Ultimate Rulers rushing over from all directions!","On the plain, the final Rulers under the Silver Roc’s command, who had been nervous and solemn, revealed bloodthirsty and cruel smiles.","“How...how can there be so many people?!”","“W-where did all these people come from?”","“Not good! These Ultimate Rulers are from Da Feng Divine Kingdom and Lord Zhennan’s people!”","“Guys, look! They are the divine armor guards under Lord Zhennan!”","“And that person is the number one general of the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, Ruler Horned Flame!”","“We’ve fallen into a trap!”","“What?” Ruler Spear River and the others paled as they spoke in shock.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s heart sank. He knew that he had fallen into a trap!","He raised his head and looked in the direction where the Ninth Kalpa King had chased after the Ruler Silver Roc. He took a deep breath. Now, the people of Da Feng Divine Kingdom and Lord Zhennan had appeared here, but the Third Prince and Lord Zhennan had not appeared. He was afraid...","Peng peng peng!","In the distance, four vast waves of divine power suddenly exploded.","One of the waves of divine power was the Ninth Kalpa King.","“As expected, Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and the Ruler Silver Roc have joined forces.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s face was filled with bitterness.","Ruler Spear River and the others were in complete despair.","At this moment, the morale was at its lowest.","Pa da.","At this moment, someone suddenly patted his shoulder.","“What?” He turned his head and saw Jian Wushuang looking at him with a calm smile, “What are you still doing here? Are you just waiting to be killed?”","Jian Wushuang said, “Divine Marquis Qingfeng said with a wry smile. Don’t you see the current situation?” That was nearly a hundred Ultimate Rulers. Although they were not strong, they were all true Ultimate Rulers. If the Ninth Kalpa King was still here, we could barely fight him, but now the Ninth Kalpa King is entangled with them, with just us...how are we going to fight?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help sighing, shaking his head and asking, “You don’t know how to fight, do you?”","“Yes.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng nodded with a bitter smile.","“Then watch carefully...”","Jian Wushuang suddenly turned his head and looked at an Ultimate Ruler from the Da Feng Divine Kingdom’s camp.","The Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang slashed down with his sword!","Bang!","In an instant, a blood-colored half-moon sword light slashed down, and the sky was split three thousand feet apart!","“How should I fight...”","As for the Ultimate Ruler who had charged forward first, he was directly turned into dust by this slash, his body and soul destroyed!","Jian Wushuang turned back to look at the shocked Divine Marquis Qingfeng, Ruler Spear River, and the others. He said indifferently, “Now, do you understand?”","“...”","At this moment, the entire place fell into a deathly silence.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng, Ruler Spear River, and the others all widened their eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","When the hundred or so Ultimate Rulers who were rushing over from all directions with cruel smiles on their faces saw this, their expressions changed rapidly. It was as if they had stepped on the brakes. They stopped at the same time and stared at Jian Wushuang.","..."]},{"number":4183,"title":"Chapter 4183 One Against a Hundred (Part One)","paragraphs":["4183 One Against a Hundred (Part One)","“One...he killed an Omega Ruler with a single sword strike?”","“Who is this kid? How can it be so terrifying!”","“The most important thing is that this person’s divine power ripples show that he’s only a fourth-stage chief Ruler!”","The Ultimate Rulers, who were united by Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and the Ruler Silver Roc, looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","!!","In the eyes of the many Ultimate Rulers present, a fourth-stage Ruler was like an ant. However, such a person had killed an Ultimate Ruler with just one sword.","Jian Wushuang’s expression remained calm. He glanced at Divine Marquis Qingfeng, Ruler Spear River, and the others without saying anything.","In the next moment, he turned to face the nearly one hundred Ultimate Rulers that filled the sky. Holding the Wuqi Divine Sword, he calmly said, “Whoever comes will die!”","“Whoever comes will die!”","The words that came out of Jian Wushuang’s mouth seemed ridiculous and ridiculous.","A trifling fourth-stage chief Ruler was actually telling nearly a hundred Ultimate Rulers that whoever came would die?","However, the entire place fell into a strange silence.","None of the hundred Ultimate Rulers showed any disbelief. They hesitated when they saw Jian Wushuang and his sword.","Just now, they had seen with their own eyes that a fourth-stage Ruler had killed an Ultimate Ruler with a casual strike!","What kind of terrifying technique was this?","No one was willing to test the sword with their own lives.","Behind Jian Wushuang, Divine Marquis Qingfeng, Ruler Spear River, and the others exchanged looks of shock.","Nearly a hundred Ultimate Rulers...what a terrifyingly powerful force this was! However, they had been suppressed by Jian Wushuang until they were as silent as cicadas in winter?","Half a beat later!","“He’s only a fourth-stage chief Ruler. How strong can he be? He must have used some secret technique that cost a lot to create that terrifying sword attack just now. now, he’s an arrow at the end of its flight, and he’s just bluffing!”","“Hmph!” A spear-wielding, golden-armored Ultimate Ruler suddenly snorted.","This man was the only divine armor guard left under Lord Zhennan’s command. He was also an expert of the Ultimate Rulers.","Follow me and kill!!","Immediately, the divine armor guard shouted and took the lead to charge at Jian Wushuang!","“The divine armor guard is right. He’s only a fourth-stage Ruler. How strong can he be? Can it be heaven-defying?”","“There are so many of us Ultimate Rulers, yet we’re scared by a mere fourth-stage great Ruler. Wouldn’t we become a joke if word got out?”","Two more Ultimate Rulers snorted coldly from the crowd.","Decisiveness flashed in the eyes of the hundred Ultimate Rulers and they swarmed toward Jian Wushuang.","They did not believe that a mere fourth stage Ruler could fight against a hundred people and stop so many of them!","Whoosh! Whoosh!","A series of shocking divine powers with terrifying power rushed toward Jian Wushuang!","For a time, the heavens and the earth shook. Even the top-tier experts of the Ultimate Rulers had to avoid these powerful attacks!","“Good!”","A deep voice came from under the wide black hood of Jian Wushuang’s cloak.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head and his eyes were filled with fighting intent!","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and his sword-wielding figure instantly turned into an afterimage as he charged toward the hundred Ultimate Rulers!","After he came out of the second level of the Tarot Ruins, he had not used his full strength, whether it was killing the two Rulers, Star Ruler or Heavenly Ruler, or defeating the Ninth Kalpa King’s giant palm with one sword strike.","Even he himself was not sure what the limit of his current combat strength was!","It just so happened that he could use this battle to test his strength and see how far he had reached!","“Split open the sky!”","Jian Wushuang slashed out with his sword. In an instant, the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand shone with a blood-red light. A blazing sword light as bright as the sun slashed out from the Wuqi Divine Sword and fiercely hacked at the dozens of attacks that were pressing down on him!","Clang!","The Wuqi Divine Sword trembled thousands of times in an instant, and the cries of gods and the low groans of Buddhas and demons came from the sword.","The current Wuqi Divine Sword had long since changed its appearance. It could be said that apart from the sword embryo, everything else was completely different.","Back then, the sword spirit of the Tarot sword had controlled Jian Wushuang’s body. In order to improve his strength, he had put in a lot of effort and racked his brains to merge the top divine materials in the second level of the Tarot Ruins into the Wuqi Divine Sword.","As for the Wuqi Divine Sword, it had risen from the appearance of a high-grade nomological Cardinal treasure to the limit of a nomological cardinal treasure!","It did not seem like there was much of an increase, but in fact, the difference in power between the two was like heaven and earth!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","As the sword slashed out, it was as if a Galaxy was pressing down from the sky, directly crushing the dozens of attacks as if they were dried weeds!","“What?”","“This is impossible!”","The countless Ultimate Rulers called out in shock.","As for Jian Wushuang, he was like a wolf in a flock of sheep and started to kill.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang no longer held back his divine power. He used all his might to increase his divine power by 13500 times. Along with his extremely high comprehension of the laws of the universe, his sword skill was not only exquisite and abstruse, but its power was also shockingly strong. Every move he made was filled with the aura of the great Dao.","Long before he had entered the second level of the Tarot Ruins, Jian Wushuang’s power had been on par with the top experts of the Ultimate Rulers. Even when compared to the almost invincible Ultimate Rulers like Divine Son Qing Xuzi, he was only a step away.","Now, Jian Wushuang’s strength had improved greatly again. In terms of battle strength, he was definitely stronger than Qing Xuzi.","Moreover, he was different from Qing Xuzi. Qing Xuzi was just an ordinary life form and had limited divine power. When facing the siege of nearly 100 Ultimate Rulers, Qing Xuzi could only retreat.","However, Jian Wushuang’s divine power was vast and boundless. He was not afraid of using it up at all. Hence, even though there were close to a hundred Ultimate Rulers in front of him, some of which were peak Ultimate Rulers, Jian Wushuang was not afraid at all.","Even if he fought one against a hundred, these Ultimate Rulers could not pose much of a threat to him. they could only be slaughtered by him one by one.","The Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand exuded a monstrous sword essence. Every slash could severely injure an Ultimate Ruler, and only the top Ultimate Rulers could barely withstand it.","But even if he could take it, the top-tier Ultimate Ruler’s divine body would still be in shock.","“I said, whoever comes up will die. I remember you were the first one to rush up, right?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he looked at the divine armor guards hidden among the many Ultimate Rulers.","The divine armor guards were terrified by the sight of Jian Wushuang killing people. They had to answer, “It’s me, so what?”","“Then you can go to hell.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glinted coldly and he instantly used the Dragon-killing secret skill. The power of his divine power increased again, and his speed increased tenfold. He dodged the saber light that an Ultimate Ruler was slashing at him and attacked the divine armor guard.","..."]},{"number":4184,"title":"Chapter 4184 One Against a Hundred (Part 2)","paragraphs":["4184 One Against a Hundred (Part 2)","In the surrounding void.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng, Ruler Spear River, and the other Omega Rulers all stared at the scene in front of them in shock.","“I...what did i just see? A single fourth-stage chief Ruler is suppressing a group of ultimate chief Rulers?”","“This...isn’t this a little too fierce?”","!!","“My God, what kind of terrifying battle strength is this? I’ve never heard of anyone in the entire universe who can suppress a group of Ultimate Rulers as a fourth-stage great Ruler!”","“Heaven-defying! His combat strength is simply heaven-defying.”","Divine Marquis Qingfeng and the others rubbed their eyes and gulped in disbelief.","Originally, when they saw the sudden appearance of nearly a hundred Ultimate Rulers, they had been in despair and had almost given up.","However, Jian Wushuang’s attack instantly caused a storm in their hearts!","Jian Wushuang was like a peerless sword God who had descended to the world. With an invincible posture, he had destroyed nearly a hundred Ultimate Rulers!","“Divine Marquis, we...should we go up and help Jian Wushuang?” An Ultimate Ruler swallowed and whispered.","“Do you think he needs to?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng shook his head with a bitter smile. “All we need to do is keep an eye on our surroundings and make sure the Omega Rulers don’t escape.”","After saying that, he raised his head again and looked at Jian Wushuang, who was fighting against the hundred Ultimate Rulers. A complicated look flashed in his eyes.","When they first arrived at the Tarot Ruins, Divine Marquis Qingfeng had acted as a senior and guided Jian Wushuang. He knew that Jian Wushuang was strong, but he thought that Jian Wushuang’s strength came from his talent and potential, not his current strength.","Even after Jian Wushuang and Qing Xuzi were evenly matched, Divine Marquis Qingfeng did not think that Jian Wushuang’s strength had surpassed his.","But now, he had no choice but to admit that he...he was definitely not Jian Wushuang’s match!","He even thought that Jian Wushuang was already an invincible existence among the Ultimate Rulers in terms of power!","In the whole world, as long as the Supreme martial artist did not appear, only the Ninth Kalpa King could suppress Jian Wushuang.","“This is a shockingly talented demon.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng sighed.","He looked at Jian Wushuang with envy.","He was a veteran Ultimate Ruler who had cultivated for longer than the Ninth Kalpa King.","However, in terms of cultivation base, he was not even a match for the almost invincible existences among the Ultimate Rulers, let alone the Ninth Kalpa King.","Jian Wushuang will definitely become a top-notch giant arm in the universe in the future! Divine Marquis Qingfeng mumbled to himself, his tone confident.","...","On the other side, the battle was still ongoing.","“Satisfying!”","Jian Wushuang fought in the crowd. He activated the Dragon-destroying secret skill and activated the Wuqi Divine Sword to the extreme. No one could block his sword.","It had been a long time since Jian Wushuang had such an enjoyable battle. He felt so carefree that he could not help but laugh out loud.","The surrounding Ultimate Rulers, seeing this, could not help but feel terrified.","A monster!","This person was simply a monster. Whether it was his boundless and vigorous divine power or his comprehension of the principles of the universe, they had all reached a level that they could not reach!","Bang!","With a loud explosion, the spear in the divine armor Guard’s hand was cut in half by Jian Wushuang’s Wuqi Divine Sword!","The divine armor guards were forced back 2000 feet by Jian Wushuang’s sword again. They were extremely frightened.","At that moment, his high-grade divine armor was on the verge of breaking and the vast divine power in his body was almost depleted. He knew that he was on the verge of collapse and he could not take another sword from Jian Wushuang.","How can a stage four great Ruler be so strong?!","The divine armor guard’s fighting spirit was replaced by fear. Jian Wushuang’s power had far exceeded his expectations. He could not help but think that even if his master, Lord Zhennan, came, he might not be able to defeat this fourth stage Ruler.","“The person I want to kill can’t escape.” Jian Wushuang looked at the divine armor guards. He took another step and rushed toward them.","“Damn it!”","Seeing this, the divine armor guards’ expressions changed drastically. They immediately turned to a burly man in an iron skirt and shouted, “Horned Flame! Don’t forget, we’re on the same side now. If I die, how good will you be?”","This muscular man was none other than the number one general under the Third Prince, Ruler Horned Flame!","Ruler Horned Flame’s expression wavered upon hearing this.","The divine armor guards were right. The moment the Third Prince agreed to work with the Ruler Silver Roc and the Lord Zhennan, they were already in the same boat. If the divine armor guards died, their camp would not have an easy time.","“They’re here!”","Ruler Horned Flame took a deep breath, and a determined look appeared in his eyes. He flipped his right hand over, and a massive black saber instantly appeared in it!","Chi!","The next moment, a terrifying flame shot out from the black blade, burning the air.","Then, divine power burst forth from the Ruler Horned Flame’s body. He took a step forward, roared, and jumped toward Jian Wushuang.","“Go to hell!”","The divine armor guards also performed a powerful secret skill that burned their divine power and blood essence. They changed their dejected state and stabbed at Jian Wushuang with their broken spears!","“What?” Jian Wushuang looked at Ruler Horned Flame and raised his eyebrows.","He could sense that this Ruler Horned Flame was far from ordinary.","“Now this is interesting.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. He unleashed his thirteen thousand five hundred times divine power and charged toward Ruler Horned Flame.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s Wuqi Divine Sword collided with Ruler Horned Flame’s flaming divine saber.","A loud explosion rang out, and the shockwaves from their clash created a terrifying white wave of air that forced the surrounding Ultimate Rulers back several hundred yards.","Then, Jian Wushuang felt a burning force coming from the hilt of the flaming divine saber.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was surprised. This Ruler was much stronger than the divine armor guards. He was probably the strongest expert among the hundred Ultimate Rulers. Although he was not invincible among Rulers, he was at least very close to that level.","Then, he waved his hand and the heat was immediately suppressed.","Jian Wushuang was surprised, but he did not know how shocked Ruler Horned Flame, who had retreated three steps, was.","“What a terrifying power!”","Ruler Horned Flame lowered his head to look at the saber in his right hand, which was trembling from the numbness, and his heart filled with shock.","One should know that he was an Ultimate Ruler who had proven his Dao with his strength. His strength was enough to grab a hundred mountains and crush the Earth Star. However, he was forced to take three steps back by Jian Wushuang’s sword!","..."]},{"number":4185,"title":"Chapter 4185 Killing Ruler Horned Flame","paragraphs":["4185 Killing Ruler Horned Flame","“Again! Die!” Ruler Horned Flame raised his head and roared before charging toward Jian Wushuang again!","“Great blazing tyrannical saber technique!!”","Fire snakes slithered out of the giant saber in his hand and followed the saber Light to slash at Jian Wushuang.","On the other side, the divine armor guards, who had returned to their peak strength at the cost of a forbidden technique, stabbed at him with their Broken Spears. This stab was enough to collapse a mountain!","!!","“Hahahaha, good!”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang laughed fearlessly. The battle intent in his eyes surged to the extreme and he also burst toward the three people!","The three of them seemed to have turned into three shock waves as they collided together!","“Bang bang bang bang!”","In the blink of an eye, the three of them had exchanged hundreds of moves, causing the void to crack. The aftershocks of their battle created thousands of giant pits on the desolate blood plain.","Under the joint attack of Ruler Horned Flame and the divine armor guards, their battle strength soared instantly. Waves of attacks surged toward Jian Wushuang like the rising tide of the sea.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. He did not use any super power, but the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand seemed to turn into a storm. Not only did it suppress the attacks of the Ruler Horned Flame and the divine armor guards, but it also had some spare power to bombard them.","The place where the three of them fought formed an isolation zone that was nearly a thousand feet wide. Destructive energies kept intertwining and colliding, and the other Ultimate Rulers could not even get close.","“Kill!”","On the other side, Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked at the remaining dozens of Ultimate Rulers who were ready to escape, and a cold light flashed in his eyes. He raised his halberd and charged forward.","Bang!","Immediately, Divine Marquis Qingfeng turned into a streak of light and stabbed forward like a sharp knife.","Ruler Spear River and the other ten-plus powerful Rulers followed closely behind, charging at the thirty-plus Ultimate Rulers.","The thirty-odd Ultimate Rulers had already lost all their courage from Jian Wushuang’s killing. They had no intention of fighting at all, so Divine Marquis Qingfeng and the others immediately chased after them and killed them.","But at this moment...","In the direction where the Ninth Kalpa King had disappeared, a deafening wild laughter suddenly came from.","“Haha...Blood Nether Emissary, I thought you wouldn’t come. But it’s good that you’ve come at the right time. The Ninth Kalpa King can’t escape now. We can totally suppress him with our combined strength!”","His voice was deafening, and he laughed madly.","The voice came from none other than the Ruler Silver Roc.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the middle of a fierce battle, heard the laughter and his eyes suddenly lit up.","“The people from Blood Sky Palace are here too?” The Ninth Kalpa King mocked Jian Wushuang and he frowned.","Jian Wushuang naturally did not doubt the strength of the Ninth Kalpa King. He was able to compete with an ordinary Supreme.","However, among the people who were fighting with Ninth Kalpa King, the Third Prince and Lord Zhennan were invincible among the Ultimate Rulers. Even in a one-on-one battle, they were only slightly weaker than Ninth Kalpa King. The Ruler Silver Roc was barely invincible among the Ultimate Rulers. The three of them were already difficult to deal with when they joined forces.","But now, the people from Blood Sky Palace had intervened.","When the five blood messengers of Blood Sky Palace joined forces, they would be unrivaled among the Ultimate Rulers. However, there were nine blood messengers in the Tarot Ruins, and they had all arrived.","When the nine Blood Nether Emissaries joined forces, their combat strength would be even more terrifying.","Jian Wushuang could clearly feel that at the place where the Ninth Kalpa King was, after the nine tyrannical divine power Auras barged in, the divine power fluctuation belonging to the Ninth Kalpa King immediately weakened quickly.","Obviously, with the arrival of the nine Blood Nether Emissaries, the Ninth Kalpa King had begun to be suppressed.","“I can’t waste any more time here.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and turned to look at Ruler Horned Flame and the divine armor guards with a cold glint in his eyes.","“Haha...the Royal Highness and the others are about to defeat the Ninth Kalpa King. When they are free, I’ll see if you’re dead or not!” The divine armor guards noticed the change in the situation of the Ninth Kalpa King’s battlefield in the distance. They could not help but show a look of ecstasy and laugh.","“I don’t know if I’ll die or not, but the two of you won’t be able to live.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and sent the divine armor guard flying with his broken spear. At the same time, his eyes turned cold.","Innate divine power, original universe.","“Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”","In an instant, the two great innate abilities appeared at the same time. First, a profound aura of the laws of the universe descended, and the world instantly darkened.","It was pitch-black and there was no light.","The divine armor guards and Ruler Horned Flame’s power were both affected to a certain extent by the boundless darkness.","Immediately after, the life intimidation effect was triggered, and a suppressing force from a Supreme life form instantly descended. It was a pressure from the depths of the soul that came from a high-level creature to a low-level creature!","Time seemed to have frozen at that moment. The divine armor guards and the Ruler Horned Flame froze. Under the effect of life intimidation, they looked at Jian Wushuang and had the urge to worship him.","What...what kind of method is this?!!","The two of them were like water buffaloes that had fallen into a swamp. They turned their heads with difficulty to look at each other, and they could see the shock on each other’s faces!","As for Jian Wushuang, he had already charged forward with his sword.","“Die!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold as he stabbed his sword into the Ruler Horned Flame’s chest. Then, a sharp and terrifying sword essence burst forth from the Wuqi Divine Sword. The sword essence also contained an unprecedented killing power.","Crash! Ruler Horned Flame was also wearing true treasure armor, but it was not of a very high level. Although it was a top-tier mid-grade law true treasure, it wasn’t at the level of an upper-grade law true treasure.","Jian Wushuang’s Wuqi Divine Sword, on the other hand, had already surpassed the category of an upper-grade law true treasure and reached the extreme of a law true treasure. In terms of level, it was much higher than the true treasure armor of Ruler Horned Flame.","Thus, the moment the sword-intent within Wu Qi exploded forth, the true treasure armor on the surface of Ruler Horned Flame’s body was instantly torn apart. The terrifying sword-intent continued to attack Ruler Horned Flame’s divine body.","In an instant, Ruler Horned Flame’s divine body was ground to dust, and his divine power was completely obliterated.","Bang!","With an explosion, the first general under the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, Ruler Horned Flame, died!","An ordinary life form has limited divine power. Once a true treasure armor is forcefully torn apart, the power of my sword principle will be enough to kill him instantly. Even if he’s a top-tier Ultimate Ruler, he’ll still die. Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he looked at the supreme treasures left behind by Ruler Horned Flame. He could not help but smile coldly."]},{"number":4186,"title":"Chapter 4186 Besieging and Killing the Ninth Kalpa King","paragraphs":["4186 Besieging and Killing the Ninth Kalpa King","Jian Wushuang knew very well that the reason he had been able to kill Ruler Horned Flame was not only because his power was far above that of Ruler Horned Flame after he had used the original universe. Most importantly, his Wuqi Divine Sword had instantly destroyed Ruler Horned Flame’s body defense, rendering his true treasure armor useless.","Without the protection of a true treasure armor, Jian Wushuang could naturally kill him with his divine power.","Run!!!","At that moment, the effect of life intimidation disappeared. The divine armored guards seemed to have found a life-saving straw, and they immediately shot back in fear.","!!","The divine armor guard instantly moved ten thousand feet and let out a sigh of relief.","Just as he turned his head to see if Jian Wushuang had caught up with him, he suddenly saw from the corner of his eye that a blood-red sword light as bright as the moon was slashing at him with the power of thousands of thunderbolts!","The blood-red sword gleam that was as bright as the moon grew larger and larger in his eyes. Then, it grew larger and larger, and finally...","“No!”","“Arghh!” The guard howled as the blood-colored sword light streaked through him. In terms of power, he was inferior to even the Ruler Horned Flame, and his defensive abilities were even weaker. The guard was instantly slain, and the blood-colored sword light continued for another 1500 meters before finally weakening and disappearing.","In the distance, Jian Wushuang withdrew his gaze with an indifferent expression. With a step, his body turned into a black flowing light and rushed toward the Ninth Kalpa King’s battlefield.","In the Tarot Ruins, above the nine-layered clouds.","“Ninth Kalpa King, surrender obediently!”","“Ninth Kalpa King, if you give up resisting and swear a tribulation oath to be my slave, we can spare your life!”","“Ninth Kalpa King, three million years ago, when you exterminated my entire clan, did you ever think of this day?”","“Ninth Kalpa King, hand over that Supreme divine medicine, and we, the Blood Sky Palace, promise you that we will never interfere in your affairs!”","A series of cold sneers kept coming. The Ninth Kalpa King stepped in the void, his expression gloomy to the extreme.","Lord Zhennan, the Ruler Silver Roc, the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, and the nine blood messengers of the Blood Sky Palace.","A total of twelve Supreme existences among the Ultimate Rulers had formed an encirclement and trapped him.","Not only that, but the Ruler Silver Roc and the others were obviously prepared. they had also set up a powerful array around them, which greatly suppressed the Ninth Kalpa King’s strength.","Even though the Ninth Kalpa King’s combat strength was heaven-defying, he could only ward off the attacks of these twelve super experts and not fight back.","If this continued, the Ninth Kalpa King understood that even if he was a perfect life form with boundless divine power, he might still be exhausted to death here.","“If you want me to die, sure. But I’d like to see who will be the first one to die with me!” The Ninth Kalpa King’s gaze slowly swept across the faces of Lord Zhennan and the others, and a cold sneer appeared on his face.","He did not show any fear in the face of these threats. On the contrary, he could feel the blood that had been frozen for dozens of chaos cycles begin to boil.","It had been many years since the Ninth Kalpa King had stepped into the Ultimate Ruler realm. No one had ever posed any threat to him, not to mention this life-and-death crisis in front of him!","“You’re putting up a stubborn resistance.”","“It’s a pointless struggle.”","The twelve other Ultimate Rulers laughed coldly, but none of them were in a hurry to attack.","They knew that with the Ninth Kalpa King’s heaven-defying combat strength, at this final juncture, if he really fought to the death regardless of everything, at least half of the twelve of them present would fall in the hands of the Ninth Kalpa King and be buried with him!","No one wanted to be a scapegoat.","“Oh? Why, just now you all said that you wanted to kill me, but now you don’t dare to?” When the Ninth Kalpa King saw this, he suddenly laughed out loud. His laughter was extremely arrogant, contemptuous, and unbridled!","As soon as he finished speaking, the Lord Zhennan and the others could not help but look a little unsightly. Which of the twelve of them was not a top-tier heaven’s favorite in the outside world? Who would not be afraid and respectful when they saw them?","“Fine, since you guys aren’t going to make a move, I’ll make a move!” After the Ninth Kalpa King finished laughing, his eyes suddenly turned cold and he stared at the Ruler Silver Roc.","The Ninth Kalpa King hated the Silver Roc to the core!","“Die!”","In the next moment, the Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes flashed with a cold light and he attacked the Ruler Silver Roc!","As for the Ruler Silver Roc, he seemed to have sensed it long ago. He took out a golden spear and shot it at the Ninth Kalpa King!","At the same time, the Ruler Silver Roc stepped back slightly. Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince rushed out from both sides to block the Ninth Kalpa King!","Two huge divine wheels appeared behind Lord Zhennan. These Divine Wheels were engraved with nine-legged golden crows. Immediately, like a blazing sun, they smashed toward Ninth Kalpa King!","As for the Third Prince, who was wearing a nine-clawed Python robe and a purple gold crown, he flipped his right hand, and a pale Golden Dragon-patterned Jade seal appeared. It carried an overbearing and unparalleled suppressing force and pressed down on the Ninth Kalpa King!","“Get lost!”","The Ninth Kalpa King frowned, and a touch of anger flashed across his face. He sent out two palms, one toward the divine wheel of Lord Zhennan and the other toward the Dragon-patterned Jade seal of the Third Prince.","“Great destruction seal!”","“Great yellow spring seal!”","“Rumble, rumble, rumble!”","In an instant, the Ninth Kalpa King used his ultimate technique, and a violent aura burst out with him as the center!","Two thick and terrifying palms, along with the Ninth Kalpa King’s palm strike, ruthlessly smashed toward Lord Zhennan’s two huge divine wheels and the Third Prince’s Dragon-patterned jade seal!","Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince were both of noble status, so the divine wheel and the Dragon-patterned jade seal were naturally not ordinary items. One was refined from the core of the sun, and the other was a replica of the Imperial Jade seal of the Supreme Emperor God from the Da Feng Divine Kingdom. Both of them had reached the level of high-grade Supreme treasures of principles.","Bang!","However, these two high-grade nomological supreme treasures were directly sent flying by the Ninth Kalpa King’s two terrifying palms!","As for the Ninth Kalpa King, other than pausing for a moment, his qi and blood were slightly turbulent. He once again stretched out his five fingers and grabbed at the head of the Ruler Silver Roc.","Even the confident Silver Roc Ruler was taken aback by this.","The golden axe could not even stop the Ninth Kalpa King for a breath’s time. It was directly turned into powder by the Ninth Kalpa King’s violent divine power. Just as the Ninth Kalpa King’s five fingers were about to hit the head of the Ruler Silver Roc, nine ghostly figures appeared behind him in an instant.","“Die!”","A cold voice was heard. Then, the nine Blood Nether Emissaries hacked down at the Ninth Kalpa King’s back with black evil Sickles in their hands.","..."]},{"number":4187,"title":"Chapter 4187 The Third Prince","paragraphs":["4187 The Third Prince","“Damn it!”","A look of anger flashed in the Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes. The nine sickles carried an extremely terrifying poison. If he did not avoid them, even if he killed the Ruler Silver Roc, he would die under the nine sickles first.","The Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes flickered quickly, and a hint of hesitation flashed across his face. In the end, he still decided to avoid the sharp edge and find another opportunity.","Bang!","!!","The Ninth Kalpa King’s figure flashed and dodged to the side.","Pfff!","However, it was still too late.","A sickle hit his back hard. Although it could not tear his true treasure armor, the poison contained in the sickle had already invaded his divine body. Ninth Kalpa King staggered and was almost cut down from the nine-layer cloud Ridge.","Taking a deep breath, the Ninth Kalpa King stabilized his body and looked back at the nine expressionless Blood Nether Emissaries. His expression was extremely gloomy.","Individually, these nine Blood Nether Emissaries were weaker than any of the people present. however, when they joined forces, they formed a flawless formation. in addition, they had nine evil sickles with terrifying poison, which gave the Ninth Kalpa King a headache.","It was the appearance of these nine Blood Nether Emissaries that instantly changed the situation, causing the Ninth Kalpa King to be firmly suppressed despite his heaven-defying combat strength.","“The Ninth Kalpa King has been poisoned by the poison on our sickles. Let’s take this opportunity to kill him.” One of the blood messengers said coldly. His voice was emotionless and as cold as the cold wind from the nine Blood Nether Emissaries.","In the next moment, the nine Blood Nether Emissaries turned into nine ghostly black shadows and attacked the Ninth Kalpa King.","Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and the Ruler Silver Roc looked at each other and nodded in unison. They also burst out all their divine power and charged at the Ninth Kalpa King!","“Ninth Kalpa King, you will die today!” The Ruler Silver Roc laughed fiercely. He actually used 36 golden spears at the same time, spinning them toward the Ninth Kalpa King.","Each of the 36 golden spears was more powerful than before, and purple-black venom dripped from their tips.","Even the Ninth Kalpa King’s face turned extremely grave when he saw the twelve people attacking him at the same time, and his heart sank.","However, at this moment, a blood-red sword rainbow that pierced through the heavens and earth, cut off the sun and moon, suddenly swept over from the West at an extreme speed!","On this sword rainbow, a domineering and sharp sword essence shot up into the sky, dragging a long flame tail, as if it had split the sky in half. It was extremely brilliant.","The blood-red sword rainbow broke through the clouds above the nine-layer cloud summit and arrived in an instant!","In an instant, whether it was the Ninth Kalpa King or the people who were rushing over, all of them stopped what they were doing and narrowed their eyes to look at the sword rainbow.","“Eh? Who is this person?”","“I’ve never seen this sword Dao aura in the ruins.”","“What does this person want to do? Could it be that the Ninth Kalpa King’s enemy wants to take advantage of the situation and take a share of the loot?”","Ruler Silver Roc and the others exchanged glances.","In the next moment, the sword rainbow stopped and the dazzling light gradually dissipated, revealing a black-haired young man.","The young man’s eyes were cold. He was wearing a wide hood and his black clothes were fluttering. He held a blood-red sword in his hand and carried an ancient sword case on his back.","“It’s him?”","“Eh? A fourth-stage chief Ruler?”","The Ruler Silver Roc, Lord Zhennan, and the others exchanged a glance and frowned.","“Who is this person?” The Third Prince had never seen Jian Wushuang before, so he asked.","The Silver Roc Ruler replied, “Third Prince, you may not know this, but a thousand years ago, when we fought the Ninth Kalpa King in the Fengyang Canyon, it was this man who stopped Qing Xuzi. In the end, Qing Xuzi chased after him. Unexpectedly, he returned safely, but Qing Xuzi’s whereabouts are still unknown. I saw him on the plain just now, but I didn’t pay much attention to him. I didn’t expect this man to come here.”","A look of displeasure flashed across the Ruler Silver Roc’s eyes. In his opinion, Jian Wushuang should not have appeared here.","“What are the divine armor guards doing? They can’t even stop a fourth-stage chief Ruler?” The Ruler Silver Roc shook his head, but he did not mind. In his opinion, Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was good, but it was difficult for him to change anything in the current situation.","The Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang stood side by side. One of them had white hair, while the other had black hair.","“Jian Wushuang, what are you doing here?” The Ninth Kalpa King looked sideways at Jian Wushuang and asked with a blank expression.","Jian Wushuang curled his lips and sneered, “If I don’t come, do you think I’ll just watch you die?”","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King felt warm in his heart and sighed with emotion. He had not expected that the one who would come to save him in the end would be Jian Wushuang, who had been his enemy in the Divine Life Palace.","However, the Ninth Kalpa King snorted heavily and said, “Hmph, who am I, the Ninth Kalpa King? Do you think I need you to save me?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang laughed. Ninth Kalpa King had always been proud and aloof. In other words, he would suffer for his pride. Naturally, Jian Wushuang would not argue with Ninth Kalpa King.","“Ninth Kalpa King, let’s cut to the chase. There are twelve of them in total. You kill six, and I kill six. How about it?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King laughed heartily, feeling the heroic spirit in his heart soaring to the sky. He laughed heartily and said, “Jian Wushuang, are you sure you can do it?”","“Will it work?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and sneered, “Then you just wait and see.”","As soon as he finished speaking, a cold light flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. He immediately rushed toward the Third Prince with his sword, “Ninth Kalpa King, leave this person to me.”","“Alright!”","The Ninth Kalpa King nodded. He took a step forward and rushed toward the Blood Nether Emissaries. These nine Blood Nether Emissaries had long annoyed him. Now, he only wanted to kill them.","The Third Prince looked at Jian Wushuang, who was rushing toward him, and let out a soft groan.","“This little fellow actually wants to kill me?”","The Third Prince chuckled. Although he did not know why Jian Wushuang’s first target was him, he did not care at all. He was just a fourth stage great Ruler. How strong could he be?","“You don’t know what’s good for you.”","The Third Prince shook his head. He did not even bother to use the Dragon-patterned jade seal. He simply slapped at Jian Wushuang.","Boom!","He had only used 30% of his power, but it was enough to kill an ordinary Ultimate Ruler, not to mention a fourth-stage Ruler like Jian Wushuang.","In his opinion, this palm was enough to kill Jian Wushuang completely!","“Idiot.”","Jian Wushuang sneered and flicked the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand. A cold sword light immediately broke the palm. Then, Jian Wushuang jumped and appeared above the Third Prince’s head in an instant. He said coldly, “Die!”","“Whoosh!”","A blood moon sword light suddenly slashed out along the Wuqi Divine Sword. This sword strike was enough to destroy the hundred thousand mountains!","“What?”","The Third Prince was shocked. He had no time to dodge and could only raise the Dragon imperial seal to block it."]},{"number":4188,"title":"Chapter 4188 Sundering Stars","paragraphs":["4188 Sundering Stars","Clang!","The crisp sound of metal clashing rang out, creating a long trail of golden sparks. Then, the Dragon Imperial Jade seal and the Third Prince were sent flying. They crashed onto the ground and created a huge pit.","A cold light flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. Without any hesitation, his body shot out like a cannonball and continued to kill the Third Prince on the ground.","How is this possible?!!","!!","The Third Prince staggered to his feet and lowered his head to look at the Dragon-patterned Jade seal. He saw that on the Dragon-patterned Jade seal, where the Wuqi Divine Sword had hacked out, a faint black hole had appeared.","“How can that sword’s offensive power be so strong? How high is its grade?”","The Third Prince was shocked. The Dragon-patterned Jade seal was an upper-grade nomological Supreme treasure, but it had been cut by the Wuqi Divine Sword!","This meant that the Wuqi Divine Sword was of a higher grade than this dragon pattern jade seal!","Bang!","Before he could think further, Jian Wushuang had already charged at him again with his sword!","The Third Prince’s expression was serious. He no longer had any contempt in his heart. He shouted in a low voice, “Great divine bestowment technique, seal of mountains and rivers!!!”","Boom!","In an instant, an extremely overbearing aura exploded with the Third Prince as the center.","A huge throne appeared under the Third Prince. Sitting on the throne, the Third Prince looked like an emperor who controlled the mountains and rivers. Boundless domineering aura surged out.","The Dragon-patterned Jade seal rose up and expanded with the wind. In a few breaths, it turned into a majestic mountain and pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the majestic mountain. His eyes flashed with fighting intent.","The Third Prince was the strongest opponent he had ever faced in his entire life. Even though his strength had improved by leaps and bounds, he still did not dare to underestimate him.","“Sword, rise!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice. In an instant, his black hair under his hood flew up, and the wind, clouds, and dust in the air all turned into the purest energy in the world. Like a hundred rivers flowing back, it came from all directions and finally gathered in his hand, turning into a silver sword rainbow that was five thousand feet long.","Jian Wushuang had comprehended this move in the trial arena when he was fighting with the Ninth Kalpa King. It had taken shape in the Dao Comprehension River and forced Qing Xuzi to retreat in the Tarot Ruins.","This sword was nameless, but it was Jian Wushuang’s first killing sword skill!","The sword move was not perfect. However, after Jian Wushuang had consumed the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass in the second level of the Tarot Ruins, his sword principle cultivation had skyrocketed. After breaking through to the third level of sword principle origin, it was finally approaching maturity.","This sword had a name today.","It was called Sundering Stars!","Whether it was the Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand that had been greatly improved in grade or his deeper comprehension of the origin of sword principle, the power of Jian Wushuang’s ‘star slashing’ had undergone a tremendous change!","Jian Wushuang stood in the void, holding a 1500-meter-long silver sword rainbow. He looked up at the Dragon-patterned Jade seal that had turned into a mountain, took a deep breath, and spat out two words, “Sundering Stars!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang raised his arm and infused the Wuqi Divine Sword with dense and mysterious universe laws and boundless divine power. Then, he slashed down at the mountain!","At this moment, waves of unparalleled cold sword essence shot up into the sky and directly shattered the thick clouds within a hundred feet!","Then, the Wuqi Divine Sword trembled hundreds of millions of times. A sound similar to the weeping of gods and the low chanting of Buddhas and demons came from Wu Qi.","The silver sword rainbow finally hacked down on the mountain formed by the Dragon pattern Jade armor!","“Ding ding ding ding ding ding ding!”","In an instant, the silver sword rainbow and the Dragon-patterned Jade seal collided over a thousand times in a row, letting out a series of unpleasant metal-colliding sounds.","The mountain formed by the Dragon pattern Jade and the silver sword rainbow did not give way to each other. They were constantly separated and collided with each other!","The Third Prince raised his head and stared at the scene as if he was facing a great enemy. Jian Wushuang also squinted his eyes and did not dare to relax his expression.","Kacha kacha kacha!","Gradually, the sword light of the 1500-meter-long silver sword rainbow dimmed, and the mountain formed by the Dragon pattern Jade hairpin was covered with cobweb-like cracks.","Bang!","With a loud explosion, the power of the ‘Sundering Stars’ sword was completely obliterated. The mountain let out a wail and shot back into the Third Prince’s hand. The Third Prince was pushed back a thousand feet, his legs leaving two deep trenches on the ground. He looked down at the Dragon-patterned Jade seal in his hand, and his eyes were filled with horror as if he had seen a ghost!","The dragon-patterned jade seal was covered with no less than a hundred fine cracks!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but sigh. The power of this sword could even kill dozens of Ultimate Rulers in front of it. However, it could not kill the Third Prince in one stroke.","“The Third Prince is truly an invincible existence amongst the Ultimate Rulers. he also has the backing of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, so he’s truly powerful.","“I’m not his match!” At this moment, the Third Prince had a thought that even he himself found absurd.","He was the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, an unparalleled existence among the Ultimate Rulers. How could he not be a match for a fourth-stage Ruler?","The Third Prince could not believe it, but when he looked at Jian Wushuang, who had not taken a step back from the beginning to the end, he had to admit this fact.","“Who are you?” The Third Prince said with a dark expression.","“Jian Wushuang.” Jian Wushuang glanced at him and replied indifferently.","The Third Prince’s eyes flickered as he said, “Jian Wushuang? Very good, why don’t we make a deal?”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said with a faint smile, “What deal?”","The Third Prince took a deep breath and seemed to have made a decision. He replied, “Jian Wushuang, I can withdraw from the matter of the Ninth Kalpa King and we will stop here. How is it?”","The Third Prince already had the intention to retreat. In his opinion, it was easy for them to kill the Ninth Kalpa King before, so he did not mind stepping on him and taking a share of the loot. But in front of him, Jian Wushuang’s strength was heaven-defying and it was very likely that he could keep him here. So, how could he be willing to give up his noble life here for a mere Ninth Kalpa King?","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang suddenly laughed.","The Third Prince’s suggestion was indeed good. He had no enmity with the Ninth Kalpa King or even Jian Wushuang. If he could withdraw now, it would indeed be a good thing for the Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang.","But it was a pity..."]},{"number":4189,"title":"Chapter 4189 Sword Technique, Eternal Night!","paragraphs":["4189 Sword Technique, Eternal Night!","“No,” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","The Third Prince frowned and asked, “Why?”","“Third Prince,” Jian Wushuang replied with a faint smile. “It seems that you still don’t understand why I came to you first.”","“What?” The Third Prince squinted his eyes. He did not expect to go so quickly. He did not know why Jian Wushuang would look for him first. Speaking of which, this was the first time they had met. Even if Jian Wushuang wanted to find an opponent, he should not have looked for him.","!!","Jian Wushuang also revealed the answer to him.","“Do you still remember Water Sorcerer Ruler?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“Water Sorcerer Ruler?” The Third Prince frowned. He had seen too many Rulers, but he did not have much of an impression of the others, except for a few famous and unparalleled Rulers.","After a long time, he seemed to remember that not long after he had arrived at the Tarot Ruins, a fifth stage Ruler had accidentally blocked his way and been killed by him with a single palm.","Before this person died, he seemed to have mentioned that his master was the Water Sorcerer Ruler.","Afterward, he seemed to have heard that the Water Sorcerer had come to find him, demanding an explanation. As the Third Prince of the great Feng Divine Empire, how could he possibly receive someone like that?","As a result, he had Ruler Horned Flame and the others under his command throw Ruler water and his two disciples out.","“Are you here for Water Sorcerer Ruler?” The Third Prince narrowed his eyes.","“Not bad.” Jian Wushuang nodded calmly.","“Hahahahaha, what a joke, what a joke. Jian Wushuang, you want to kill me for an ant?” The Third Prince suddenly laughed out loud, laughing so hard that his back was bent.","He felt that this was the biggest joke in his life!","What sort of status did Water Sorcerer Ruler have? A useless Ruler from who knows which remote corner of the universe!","And who was he?","He was the Third Prince of the great God nation, a top-tier God nation in the universe! he had a distinguished status and was respected by tens of thousands of people!","Jian Wushuang wanted to kill him just because he had killed a disciple of Water Sorcerer Ruler?","Jian Wushuang calmly looked at the Third Prince, who was laughing like a madman, and slowly said, “You see them as ants, but do I not see you as one?”","“What did you just say? You dare to treat me like an ant?” The Third Prince suddenly lowered his head and stared at Jian Wushuang with a cold expression.","Jian Wushuang did not answer him. Instead, he slowly let go of the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and said, “The light vanished into the deepest darkness, the power that could strip away everything.","“Its name is...”","“Eternal night!”","Weng.","There was no earth-shaking explosion, nor was there an explosion that made the world pale. When Jian Wushuang finished speaking, it was like a small stone was thrown into the calm water, causing circles of ripples.","Starting from the tip of the sword, the Wuqi Divine Sword began to disappear inch by inch.","Jian Wushuang slowly closed his eyes.","The Wuqi Divine Sword floated in front of Jian Wushuang. Starting from the tip of the sword, it turned into nothingness inch by inch.","It did not shatter. Instead, it seemed to transform into the energy of the world until the entire sword disappeared completely without a sound.","The Third Prince did not know why, but he suddenly felt a terrifying sense of threat.","This threat was far stronger than any of his previous encounters!","His forehead began to break out in a cold sweat, and a trace of uneasiness rose in his heart. He could not help but look in the direction of the Ninth Kalpa King, Lord Zhennan, and the others, and shouted, “Silver Roc, quickly come and help me!!”","On the Ninth Kalpa King’s battlefield.","The Silver Roc could not help but frown. The Third Prince was a well-known, invincible Ultimate Ruler in the universe. How could he not be able to deal with a mere fourth-stage great Ruler? Even to the point where he needed help?","“Trash.” The Ruler Silver Roc cursed in his heart, but he still turned to the Lord Zhennan and said, “Your Highness, the Third Prince seems to be in trouble. Please help him.”","Lord Zhennan nodded and looked at Jian Wushuang in the distance with a cruel smile.","Well, he did not want to face the Ninth Kalpa King anyway, so he might as well start with this fourth-stage Ruler kid.","“Your Highness, this King has come to help you!” Lord Zhennan shouted at the Third Prince. He took a step forward and turned into a beam of divine light, appearing beside the Third Prince in an instant.","“Your Highness, are you alright?” The Lord Zhennan glanced at him.","“I’m fine.” The Third Prince replied. His expression did not soften with the arrival of Lord Zhennan.","“Your Highness, there’s something strange about this kid.”","The Third Prince took a deep breath. He could feel that the threat and uneasiness he felt had not decreased even after the arrival of Lord Zhennan.","“Strange?”","Lord Zhennan was stunned for a moment before he laughed and said, “Your highness, how strange can a mere fourth-stage chief Ruler be? You’re overthinking, aren’t you?”","After saying that, Lord Zhennan looked at Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the void in the distance with his eyes closed. Suddenly, as if he felt something, he said in surprise, “Eh? I didn’t notice it before, but the sword Dao aura on this kid’s body is the same as the aura that the people who killed Star Ruler and Heavenly Ruler saw. Could it be that the person with the big secret that Star Ruler and Heavenly Ruler mentioned is this guy?”","“Fine. I’d like to see what’s so special about this strange man who has a big secret.”","With that, Lord Zhennan sneered and stretched out his giant hand to grab Jian Wushuang. “You’re just pretending to be a ghost. Come over here!!”","Boom!","Before Lord Zhennan could catch Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes!","There were no pupils or whites in his eyes, only a void of darkness.","Wisps of black fog as thick as ink began to spread from under Jian Wushuang’s feet, dyeing the entire void black. Then, they slowly surged toward Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang said softly, “Strip me of my power.”","Weng.","Like a stone falling into the water, it created ripples. The world in front of Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince suddenly changed.","It was as if they were the only two people left in the world. In their eyes, time began to accelerate, and everything around them gradually faded. The world seemed to be covered in a thick haze.","And this was only the beginning.","The color of the world continued to deepen. Gradually, it turned from gray to black. The black continued to deepen until it was as dark as ink. There was no light in their eyes.","The Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince felt like they had fallen into an eternal dark Kingdom. In this kingdom, there was no light, no vitality, and no hope.","Only the oppressive, dull, dead, cold, and stiff auras began to entangle them.","The Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince suddenly felt a strong sense of uneasiness in their hearts under this complicated aura."]},{"number":4190,"title":"Chapter 4190 Deprivation","paragraphs":["4190 Deprivation","“You’re acting mysterious!”","Lord Zhennan’s face turned ugly as he coldly snorted and shouted, “Divine Sun Wheel, break for this king!!!”","Whoosh!","The two sun-like Divine Wheels behind him suddenly shot up like two balls of fire and smashed into the darkness!","!!","However, this Divine Sun Wheel, which was usually majestic, was like a tiny spark that fell into the vast ocean. It did not even cause a wave before it was gradually extinguished.","An invisible force deprived the divine sun wheel of its power. Then, under Lord Zhennan’s furious gaze, the two Divine Wheels, which were top grade Supreme treasures of laws, began to decline in grade.","High grade...middle-grade...low-grade...","In just a few seconds, the two Divine Wheels turned from high-grade nomological supreme treasures to dull ordinary weapons. in the end, they broke down and turned into nothingness.","“This!”","The Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince looked at each other, their eyes filled with disbelief!","They had never heard of such a strange power that could make a nomological Supreme treasure fall into an ordinary weapon without a sound!","Before they could think further, what happened next made them cry out in horror!","The surging divine power in their bodies disappeared at an extremely fast speed!","It was as if a pair of invisible hands were taking away everything from them!","“No!”","The Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince’s expressions changed drastically, and they no longer dared to hide their trump cards.","“Forbidden technique, Blood Sun!”","Great bestowment secret technique, Emperor’s seal!","A huge scarlet fireball, like the sun, exuded a terrifyingly hot aura as it rose up from the void.","In the void, a huge throne that could suppress the starry sky appeared. On the huge throne, there was a blurry figure wearing a nine-clawed golden dragon king robe and a dragon crown on his head. His face could not be seen clearly, and he was extremely majestic.","This was the Prince of the South and the Third Prince’s strongest trump card!","However, it was all useless.","In this absolute darkness, all light would be lost.","The blood-red sun only lasted for less than ten breaths before its flames were extinguished. It turned into the purest divine power energy and was devoured by the darkness.","The tall and majestic emperor’s figure was even more vulnerable. After the darkness attached itself to it, it silently crumbled and disappeared.","Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince’s divine power gradually dried up. Their tall and burly bodies quickly shriveled up as if their flesh and blood had been sucked dry.","From the outside, one would see a huge black ball in the sky. The black sword qi, which was as black as ink, interwove together like a big net and wrapped Jian Wushuang, Lord Zhennan, and the Third Prince in it.","...","Time passed slowly. On the Ninth Kalpa King’s side, as the Third Prince and Lord Zhennan were lured away by Jian Wushuang, the pressure on the Ninth Kalpa King suddenly disappeared. Not only did he not show any signs of being suppressed, but he was also like a world-destroying mad dragon. After activating his innate divine ability ‘Demon God evolution’, his battle strength increased tenfold. He struck out his palms like a storm and suppressed the nine blood underworld messengers and the Ruler Silver Roc with his own power.","“Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and the divine armor guards, what the hell are they doing?!” The Ruler Silver Roc’s face turned extremely pale. He had expected that they would be responsible for holding back the Ninth Kalpa King. After the divine armor guards had finished dealing with the forces under the Ninth Kalpa King, they would turn around and kill him together!","But now, there was no news from the divine armor guards, the Third Prince, who was fighting against Jian Wushuang, and Lord Zhennan, who had gone to help the Third Prince.","The Ruler Silver Roc’s eyes flickered. He looked at Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and Jian Wushuang as he fought against the Ninth Kalpa King with the nine blood messengers.","In the void, Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and Jian Wushuang had all disappeared. What was left was a huge round black ball.","The three of them were inside the black ball, but there was no aura coming from them.","“The situation has changed. I might have to leave first again...” The Ruler Silver Roc’s thoughts raced. He had always been a cautious person. Otherwise, he would not have been the only one in his clan who had escaped from the Ninth Kalpa King.","The situation in front of him had completely deviated from his expected trajectory, so he had a hint of retreat in his heart.","As for the Ninth Kalpa King, he was also paying attention to Jian Wushuang’s movements. He turned his head to look at the huge black ball that was like a spider web where Jian Wushuang was. He could not help but raise his eyebrows.","“This...could this be a divine Kingdom of one thought?” The Ninth Kalpa King muttered to himself in confusion.","Others might not be able to see anything, but as someone who was half a step into the Supreme-being realm, he could naturally see that Jian Wushuang’s black ball had clearly created a world that belonged to Jian Wushuang.","“That’s not right. Although it’s similar to One Thought Divine Kingdom, it’s not One Thought Divine Kingdom. The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head. As the one who comprehended the One Thought Divine Kingdom, he naturally had a deep understanding of it. The One Thought Divine Kingdom was an independent world with heaven, earth, mountains, rivers, and mountains. however, Jian Wushuang’s black ball space was filled with cold, dead, and lifeless aura.”","This aura made even him feel a little apprehensive.","“In a short thousand years, this guy has grown to this extent.” The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head, and a smile appeared on his face, “I...how can we let him win?”","The next moment!","“One Thought Divine Kingdom!”","“Rise!”","“Rumble!”","All of a sudden, heaven and earth lost their color. An unprecedented powerful aura suddenly exploded with the Ninth Kalpa King as the center!","This aura was completely different from the aura of the Ninth Kalpa King. It was filled with a feeling of the mysterious great dao. The void in the Tarot Ruins seemed to be unable to withstand this aura, and it made a ‘ka ka’ sound similar to glass breaking!","Immediately, the surrounding space of the trial arena began to change.","With the Ninth Kalpa King as the center, a huge and magnificent power directly extended out.","This power was enough to suffocate any resident and make them tremble in fear!","This...this is the One Thought Divine Kingdom that only Supreme martial artists can comprehend?!","“Not good! Quickly run!”","Ruler Silver Roc’s face instantly fell.","At this moment, even the emissaries, who had been expressionless the whole time, were shocked. they said in a deep voice, “Ninth Kalpa King, let us go, and Blood Sky Palace will not look for you again. We will not pursue the past anymore.”","They could already see that it was absolutely impossible to take down the Ninth Kalpa King today, unless the Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince could kill Jian Wushuang to help."]},{"number":4191,"title":"Chapter 4191 Kill All","paragraphs":["4191 Kill All","“Leave? Does your Blood Sky Palace not care about the past?”","“Hahahaha, who do you think I, the Ninth Kalpa King, am? A piece of trash that you can do whatever you want? What a joke!”","After saying that, the Ninth Kalpa King’s expression turned into one of ridicule as he said, “Blood Nether Emissary, I’m telling you, none of you are going to leave today. I’ll flatten the Blood Sky Palace one day!”","“How audacious!”","!!","“Impudent!”","In an instant, the nine Blood Nether Emissaries flew into a rage and shouted.","“All of you, come in!”","The Ninth Kalpa King sneered and put his hands together. In an instant, more than ten black chains shot out from the One Thought Divine Kingdom, rolling up the nine blood underworld envoys and the Ruler Silver Roc, and pulling them into the realm of the One Thought Divine Kingdom.","...","As time slowly passed, the most intense and spectacular battle in the Tarot Ruins suddenly became extremely quiet.","After about half an incense’s time.","Kacha kacha kacha.","The Ninth Kalpa King’s divine Kingdom shattered into pieces. Immediately after, six figures shot out from the boundary of the divine kingdom.","These six people were the Ninth Kalpa King, the Ruler Silver Roc, and the four Blood Nether Emissaries!","In the time it took for half an incense stick to burn, the Ninth Kalpa King had killed five Blood Nether Emissaries in succession under the suppression of the One Thought Divine Kingdom!","The remaining Ruler Silver Roc and the five blood messengers were in a sorry state. The Ruler Silver Roc only had 12 of his 36 golden spears left, while the five blood messengers’ black robes were torn apart, revealing five ugly and bloody faces.","“Run!”","The Ruler Silver Roc’s expression was extremely ugly. Just now, he had almost died at the hands of the Ninth Kalpa King. If he had not made a prompt decision to destroy the 24 golden spears, he would have died at the hands of the Ninth Kalpa King, just like the five unlucky blood underworld envoys.","This caused him to completely lose the courage to continue fighting.","With a wave of his hand, he released a red poisonous mist, and his figure quickly swept toward a place.","“You want to escape again this time?”","The Ninth Kalpa King had long hated the Ruler Silver Roc to the core. He was someone he wanted to kill, so how could he let him escape?","The Ninth Kalpa King took a step forward and was about to chase after the Ruler Silver Roc when he saw the four Blood Nether Emissaries charge at him with venomous eyes, blocking his way!","“You don’t know your place!”","The Ninth Kalpa King was furious. These Blood Nether Emissaries were like dog-skin plaster. They did not know life and death and did not know fear, which made him extremely disgusted.","Ruler Silver Roc turned his head around to take note of what was happening, and he could not help but gloat.","“Hmph, as expected, the heavens didn’t want to kill me, the Silver Roc!” He laughed proudly.","However, he did not notice that the direction he was rushing in was where Jian Wushuang was!","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes.","As Jian Wushuang opened his eyes, the darkness in his eyes gradually faded and he regained his clarity.","The huge black ball crumbled into pieces and turned into the black fog sword Qi, which rushed toward Jian Wushuang from all directions.","The Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince had already become two dried corpses!","Their eyes were wide open and their mouths were wide open. Their faces were filled with fear as if they had experienced something extremely terrifying before they died.","With ‘eternal night’, Jian Wushuang had killed two Ultimate Rulers at the unrivaled level!","Once this news spread, it would be enough to cause an uproar in the entire universe!","Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi!","The snake-like black mist gathered in front of Jian Wushuang and finally turned into the blood-red Wuqi Divine Sword!","Jian Wushuang’s face was a little pale. He grabbed the pancake of divine weeping sword and panted slightly.","Instantly, his originally pale face seemed to have received some kind of replenishment, and a demonic flush surged up.","it was still too difficult for me to use this sword. However, its power is truly extraordinary. Jian Wushuang could not help but smile. He had only comprehended a little bit of ‘eternal night’, but he had already killed Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince. If he really comprehended ‘eternal night’ completely, how powerful would he be?","As Jian Wushuang was thinking, he slowly turned around and looked at the Ninth Kalpa King.","He saw a figure running toward him with all his might, his head lowered.","“Eh? Silver Roc?”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile sarcastically.","...","“Hmph, the Ninth Kalpa King is really terrifying. It seems that if I want to take revenge, I’ll have to wait until I break through to the Supreme martial artist level. the Ruler Silver Roc lowered his head and continued to fly forward as he pondered his next step.","“He definitely couldn’t stay in the Tarot Ruins anymore. the first thing he had to do was to leave the Tarot Ruins, find a remote corner in the universe, and stay there for 80000 to 100000 years. After this storm had passed, he would come out and look for a chance to take revenge.","“Victory was already in my grasp. If it weren’t for the Third Prince and Lord Zhennan, those two idiots, who couldn’t even take care of a fourth stage great Ruler, I wouldn’t have to run away now. A flash of hatred appeared in the Silver Roc’s eyes.”","Originally, he had already felt that victory was in his hands. according to his plan, even if the Ninth Kalpa King did not die, he would probably only be left with one breath. In the end, the guy who dominated the fourth stage came out of nowhere and reversed the entire battle situation with his own power.","Just as he lowered his head and was thinking about putting Jian Wushuang on his must-kill list the next time he came out to seek revenge, he suddenly staggered and stopped.","“What?” He looked up in confusion.","“Hello, Ruler Silver Roc.”","Before he could raise his head, a cold voice suddenly sounded in his ear.","Jian Wushuang looked expressionlessly at the Ruler Silver Roc, who had taken the initiative to come to him. The corners of his mouth pulled up into an indifferent arc.","“It’s you?”","The Ruler Silver Roc was shocked. He turned around to look at the Ninth Kalpa King, who was being pestered by the four blood messengers. Then, he turned to Jian Wushuang and sneered, “Good, I didn’t expect to see you again before I leave! Go to hell!”","Boom!","The Ruler Silver Roc took out a golden spear and shot it at Jian Wushuang’s head.","“Idiot.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. he did not even bother to use the Wuqi Divine Sword. Instead, he reached out to grab the Ruler Silver Roc.","The Ruler Silver Roc’s power was weaker than Lord Zhennan and the others. in addition, his divine power was almost exhausted after fighting with the Ninth Kalpa King. How could he be Jian Wushuang’s opponent?","In just a short while, Jian Wushuang grabbed the Ruler Silver Roc by the neck as if he was a little chick. The Ruler Silver Roc’s hands and feet were flailing wildly in the air as he roared in anger."]},{"number":4192,"title":"Chapter 4192 The Dust Settles","paragraphs":["4192 The Dust Settles","“You let me go! Kid, I told you to let me go!” Ruler Silver Roc roared, his face red.","What a disgrace!","He was an Ultimate Ruler, but Jian Wushuang was carrying him like a little chick. It was a great humiliation for him!","Bang!","!!","Jian Wushuang gave him a slap in response.","“Be quiet.”","“Kid, let me go, and I’ll give you all the treasures I’ve collected in the Tarot Ruins. What do you think?” Ruler Silver Roc forced out a laugh as he tried to give in.","Bang!","It was still a slap.","“I told you to be quiet. If you dare to make any more noise, do you believe that i will send you to your subordinates and the Lord Zhennan?”","Jian Wushuang glanced at him and said coldly.","“What...what?”","Ruler Silver Roc was stunned for a moment.","Immediately after, he suddenly reacted. As if his body had fallen into an ice cellar, a chill ran from his spine to the top of his head!","Could it be that the divine armor guards who had not come to help for a long time had already died in his hands?","Could it be that the Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince...","He suddenly turned his head and saw two mummies lying not far from where Jian Wushuang had been standing!","The two dried corpses were the Third Prince and Lord Zhennan!","Wuwuwuwuwu!","The blood drained from the Silver Roc’s face in an instant, and his face turned pale. Indescribable shock filled his eyes.","Nearly a hundred Ultimate Rulers, as well as unparalleled Ultimate Rulers like Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince, had all been killed by this man?","Ruler Silver Roc was completely terrified.","Only then did he realize that he had been wrong from the very beginning, ridiculously wrong!","Because of his preconceived notion, he had never taken Jian Wushuang seriously from beginning to end.","In the beginning, he had thought that Jian Wushuang had been lucky enough to escape the divine armor guards and come here.","Later on, when Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince fought against Jian Wushuang and did not move for a long time, he only thought that Jian Wushuang had Some Kind of Heaven-defying ability to trap people and temporarily trapped Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince.","He had never thought that the divine armor guards, the hundred Ultimate Rulers, Lord Zhennan, and the Third Prince would die at the hands of Jian Wushuang!","This was too shocking and too unbelievable. If this news were to spread, the entire universe would be shaken!","Therefore, it was not that he did not think of this, but he did not dare to think in this direction at all!","He had never heard of a fourth-stage Ruler killing two invincible Ultimate Rulers!","Even the most famous supreme beings in the universe, including the owner of the Tarot Ruins, Tarot Supreme, had never achieved such a glorious and valiant battle record when he had been a fourth-level Ruler!","All of this subverted his understanding!","“Freak! This is a monster!”","The Ruler Silver Roc looked up at Jian Wushuang in fear. At that moment, he was even more afraid of Jian Wushuang than he was of the Ninth Kalpa King!","He believed that even the Ninth Kalpa King, who was known as the invincible Ruler now, could not be compared with Jian Wushuang when he was a Ruler at the fourth level!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In the distance, the battle between the Ninth Kalpa King and the four Blood Nether Emissaries was almost over.","If the nine Blood Nether Emissaries were still here, they could still deal with the Ninth Kalpa King for a while. Now that there were only four of them left, how could they be his opponent?","in just a few minutes, the four Blood Nether Emissaries had fallen one by one, unable to even escape.","“Hmph, a bunch of disgusting guys.” After the Ninth Kalpa King’s final palm strike turned a Blood Nether Emissary and his sickle into dust, he snorted with an unsightly expression and turned to look in the direction where the Ruler Silver Roc had escaped.","“Jian Wushuang?” When the Ninth Kalpa King saw the Ruler Silver Roc in Jian Wushuang’s hand, he was stunned.","“How are you going to thank me?”","Jian Wushuang lifted up the Ruler Silver Roc and shook it in front of Ninth Kalpa King with a smile.","The Ninth Kalpa King snorted and did not reply. However, a smile appeared on his expressionless face.","Jian Wushuang carried the Ruler Silver Roc and walked toward the Ninth Kalpa King. The Ruler Silver Roc’s face turned ashen.","“Here, I’ll leave him to you.”","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and handed over the Ruler Silver Roc to the Ninth Kalpa King. All of a sudden, the Ninth Kalpa King looked down at the Ruler Silver Roc, and the corners of his mouth curled up into a cold arc. “Silver Roc, run! Why aren’t you running anymore?”","Ruler Silver Roc’s face was drained of all color. He knew that he would not be able to escape today.","When it came to begging for mercy, he could beg for mercy from anyone but the Ninth Kalpa King. This was his last dignity. Therefore, he took a deep breath and said lightly, “Ninth Kalpa King, I can only say that I’m unlucky to die in your hands this time. I don’t have a good helper like you. Do it!”","The Ninth Kalpa King had never been a sloppy person. After shaking his head with a sneer, he suddenly slapped the head of the Ruler Silver Roc.","Boom, boom, boom!","Vast amounts of divine power exploded forth, instantly obliterating the Ruler Silver Roc into dust.","With the death of the Ruler Silver Roc, the battle finally came to an end.","A moment later, the sky returned to its clear and quiet state. The Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang were fighting side by side. The slight breeze blew their black and white hair.","Jian Wushuang, I owe you a favor this time. the Ninth Kalpa King put his hands behind his back, stepped into the void, and said in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang smiled but did not reply.","Upon seeing this, the Ninth Kalpa King no longer said anything. Only he himself knew how heavy the ‘favor’ he was talking about was!","This meant that no matter what kind of life-and-death enemy Jian Wushuang faced in the future, he, the Ninth Kalpa King, would do his best to stand behind Jian Wushuang. Even if he had to be the enemy of the entire universe, he would not hesitate to do so.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","It did not take long for Divine Marquis Qingfeng to rush over with more than ten ultimate gods.","Only now did they manage to wipe out the Ruler Silver Roc, Lord Zhennan, and the Third Prince, all of the Ultimate Rulers under their command.","“Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, are you alright?” Divine Marquis Qingfeng stood in front of Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King and asked with concern.","“Do we look like we’re in trouble?” Jian Wushuang joked with a smile.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng heaved a sigh of relief and his eyes lit up. He was not sure but he asked with anticipation, “T-then what about the Silver Roc? He ...he’s dead?”","“He’s dead,” The Ninth Kalpa King nodded.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s expression turned excited as he asked, “Then, then what about Lord Zhennan and the others?”","“They’re all dead,” The Ninth Kalpa King continued to reply.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s body trembled at first, but then he burst out laughing!","..."]},{"number":4193,"title":"Chapter 4193 Leaving","paragraphs":["4193 Leaving","The next day.","As promised, the Ninth Kalpa King divided all the treasures of the Ruler Silver Roc and his subordinates, the Ultimate Rulers, to the spear River Ruler and the others. Immediately, the spear River Ruler and the other Ultimate Rulers were overjoyed and celebrated.","Not long after, the Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng all decided to leave the Tarot Ruins.","For Ninth Kalpa King, it was the right way to go back and use the Supreme divine medicine to break through to the Supreme level. For Jian Wushuang, the biggest opportunity in the Tarot Ruins had been obtained by him, so there was naturally no need to stay. It did not matter whether Divine Marquis Qingfeng stayed or not.","Three days later, the three of them stepped out of the Tarot Ruins.","Outside the Tarot Ruins, it was still a lively scene. Some restaurants, elixir dispensaries, and trading markets were crowded with people. All the major forces had set up camp here, and the Nine Emperor Pavilion was the most conspicuous.","Jian Wushuang and the other two had deliberately concealed their auras, so no one recognized them.","“Let’s go,” he said.","Just as Ninth Kalpa King was about to release universe boat and leave...","“Wait,” Jian Wushuang shook his head and looked at the Nine Emperor Pavilion, “I still have something to deal with. Give me a moment.”","“alright,” he said.","Ninth Kalpa King nodded. He naturally agreed to Jian Wushuang’s request.","Mixed in with the crowd, Jian Wushuang slightly lowered his hood and walked into the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","“Sir, what do you need to buy? We have all kinds of treasures from the ruins, including all kinds of special divine medicine...”","The person in charge of the reception was a beautiful fifth stage great emperor woman. Although she saw that Jian Wushuang was only a fourth stage Ruler, she did not look down on him.","Before she could finish, she saw Jian Wushuang take out a token with the words ‘Ninth Emperor’ on it, and her face suddenly changed.","“An expert on the Nine Emperor List? This way, please!”","The beautiful lady’s tone immediately became respectful. She quickly brought Jian Wushuang to the top floor of the Nine Emperor Pavilion and said respectfully, “Sir, I’ve already informed the supervisor. He’ll be here soon.”","Jian Wushuang sat on a futon and nodded.","A short and fat old man hurried over after a while.","He first checked Jian Wushuang’s token of the Nine Emperor List, then carefully returned the token to Jian Wushuang and said, “Mr. Blood Sword, what can we do for you?”","Jian Wushuang took out a broken purple gold crown from his Interspatial Ring and said, “I’ll have to trouble you to help me deliver something.”","“Eh? The crown...it seems to be worn by the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom?”","The fat old man was shocked. As the manager of the Nine Emperor Pavilion branch in the Tarot Ruins, he naturally had good eyesight. He recognized the broken purple gold crown at a glance. It was once worn by the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom.","How did this crown end up in this person’s hands?","The fat old man was suspicious, but he did not dare to ask, “Your Excellency, may I ask where you are sending it?”","“Send this purple-gold crown to the mountain sun astral in the Void Wind Starfield. It’ll be enough if you send it to a Ruler called the Water Sorcerer.” Jian Wushuang said.","“Void Wind Star area? Your Excellency, the Void Wind Star area is at the edge of the universe. It’s very far from here. If you...” The fat old man said with embarrassment.","“Can’t you send it over?” Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“This...” The fat old man hesitated for a moment before he took a deep breath. “Sir, it is possible to send it over. However, the price will be extremely expensive. It will require 200000 Universe Origin Stones!”","After saying that, the fat elder lowered his head and no longer looked at Jian Wushuang.","It was not that he looked down on Jian Wushuang, but 200000 Universe Origin Stones was an astronomical figure to most of the Ultimate Rulers. Jian Wushuang was only a fourth-stage great Ruler. He did not think that Jian Wushuang had any means to possess so many Universe Origin Stones!","“When can you ship it out?” Jian Wushuang took out an Interspatial Ring.","The fat old man was stunned. He took the Interspatial Ring and started to check it. The next moment, he was shocked.","“I can make the arrangements immediately.” The fat old man said.","“Yes, as soon as possible.” Jian Wushuang nodded. Then, he pulled down his hat and walked out of the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","To him, the number of Universe Origin Stones he had was just a number.","In the second level of the Tarot Ruins, he had obtained at least a hundred million Universe Origin Stones, and this did not include the divine medicines and materials!","If all of them were added together and exchanged for Universe Origin Stones, it would be an astronomical figure!","Jian Wushuang did not care about 200000 Universe Origin Stones at all.","“I hope they will like this gift.” A smile appeared on Jian Wushuang’s face that was hidden under the hood.","After a while, Jian Wushuang came to the side of Ninth Kalpa King and Ninth Kalpa King.","“Have you finished your business?” The Ninth Kalpa King said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Alright, let’s go then.”","Ninth Kalpa King waved his hand, and suddenly, a pitch-black universe boat appeared in front of the three of them. It then expanded with the wind and became a behemoth that could suppress the starry sky in the blink of an eye.","Ninth Kalpa King, Divine Marquis Qingfeng, and Jian Wushuang took a step forward and flew into the sky, entering universe boat.","“Rumble!”","Immediately, universe boat rumbled and accelerated.","In a few seconds, the universe turned into a small black dot and completely disappeared from the starry sky.","...","Time passed by slowly, and in the blink of an eye, three hundred years had passed.","One day, at the entrance of the Tarot Ruins, a super fleet with the flag of ‘Taixu’ swept across the starry sky and suddenly drove into the entrance of the Tarot Ruins. It did not make any sense at all and crushed over.","Immediately, the entrance to the Tarot Ruins was in chaos, and the countless Ultimate Rulers who had set up their stalls hurriedly moved out of the way.","However, before they could roar, they kept quiet as if their throats were grabbed by an invisible hand.","A line of top-tier Ultimate Rulers filed out of the fleet and stood respectfully under the huge universe boat with the flag of ‘great void’.","Then, the cabin door of the largest universe boat opened slowly. An old man with white hair and a white beard walked down from the cabin door. He was wearing a white cloak with the words ‘great void’ sewn on his back with fine gold thread.","This elder’s attire was exactly the same as Divine Son Qing Xuzi’s. the only difference was that there was a golden wisteria flower embroidered on the left side of his chest.","As soon as the old man walked out of universe boat, an extremely powerful aura instantly descended on the entire place. The countless Ultimate Rulers present all felt a chill run down their spines, as if their blood had been frozen!","“This, this is the Vice Hall Master of the seventh Hall of the Great Void Temple, Ruler Whitefloat!”","“What?” Some of the Ultimate Rulers in the crowd immediately paled and cried out in alarm."]},{"number":4194,"title":"Chapter 4194 The Supreme Martial Artist Arrives","paragraphs":["4194 The Supreme Martial Artist Arrives","A supreme martial artist had arrived!","This was the arrival of a Supreme martial artist!","The hearts of the many Ultimate Rulers present were filled with shock.","Ruler Whitefloat was expressionless as he swept his gaze across the Omega Rulers. He said in a calm voice, “I’m looking.”","In an instant, the Rulers of the Great Void Temple standing respectfully in front of him responded with a loud ‘yes’. A large portion of them split off and shot toward the Tarot Ruins.","A small portion of them headed toward the nearby Ultimate Rulers.","“Have you seen this person?”","The Great Void Temple master’s expression was cold. He held a palm-sized profound light mirror in his hand as he continuously questioned the Ultimate Rulers present.","The figure in the mirror was none other than Jian Wushuang!","“I’ve never seen him.”","“I don’t.”","The other Ultimate Rulers all shook their heads.","However, those who had seen Jian Wushuang before recognized him immediately.","“Eh, isn’t this the little guy who came here with the Ninth Kalpa King and the others a thousand years ago?”","“That’s right. I remember this person too. I have a deep impression of him. When they came, I even mocked him by the side, saying that he was a mere fourth stage Ruler and that he had come to the Tarot Ruins to seek death.”","“Didn’t this person enter the Tarot Ruins a long time ago?”","As soon as these words were spoken, the many peak-Level Ultimate Rulers of the Great Void Temple narrowed their eyes.","A moment later, the Rulers of the Great Void Temple who had entered the Tarot Ruins emerged and stood in front of the Ruler Whitefloat.","“My Lord, we didn’t find that person’s figure.”","“My Lord, I heard that the Ninth Kalpa King has left the Tarot Ruins, and the person who is hunting down the Divine Son must have left with him.”","Ruler Whitefloat nodded his head indifferently. He looked at the people who had said that they had seen Jian Wushuang before and said, “Take him away.”","“Yes!”","In an instant, those who said that they knew Jian Wushuang were forcefully taken away by the peak Ultimate Rulers of the Great Void Temple.","Not long after, the Great Void Temple fleet that was pressing down on the starry sky slowly turned around and headed in a certain direction!","The direction of the voice was the Divine Life Palace!","It was only after the fleet of the Great Void Temple had left that everyone heaved a sigh of relief.","On the top floor of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, that fat elder stood in front of the railing. He looked at the Great Void Temple’s fleet leaving with a complicated expression.","They were well-informed and naturally knew that the Divine Son of the Great Void Temple had pursued a stage four great Ruler in the Tarot Ruins, but his whereabouts were unknown.","The whereabouts of the Divine Son of the Great Void Temple were unknown...","The broken crown of the Third Prince of Da Feng...","When he connected the two together, the fat old man’s heart skipped a beat.","“This person is a heaven’s favorite on the Nine Emperor List of the Nine Emperor Pavilion. If he is in trouble...no, I must report this to that Lord.”","The fat old man made a decision in his heart and hurriedly went downstairs.","....","In the vast universe, a pitch-black universe boat was flying at high speed.","“The bone sea star area is in front of us. After we go through the universe passage in the bone sea star area, we will be closer to the divine Palace.”","In the cabin of universe boat, the Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng were looking at the void space through the dark light mirror of universe boat.","It had been nearly 800 years since they left the Tarot Ruins. They had been traveling through the universe passages and were getting closer and closer to the Divine Life Palace.","“Come to think of it, the source of all the trouble on this trip to the Tarot Ruins was divine Lord qianye and the others. If they hadn’t left the team on their own accord, causing our strength to drop sharply in the Fengyang Canyon, then we wouldn’t have been chased down. If they had worked together with us back then, we could’ve used our strength to get the Supreme divine herb back in the Fengyang Canyon.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng sighed.","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang smiled and did not speak.","For Jian Wushuang, if Qing Xuzi had not chased after him, he would not have entered the second level of the Tarot Ruins by accident and obtained the Tarot sword, the Tarot sword Codex, and other universe treasures.","“Ninth Kalpa King, if we are to talk about the harvest this time, among the three of us, you have obtained the most since you obtained the Supreme divine medicine. When we return, you have to repay Jian Wushuang and me well.” Divine Marquis Qingfeng joked in a sour tone.","“Hahaha, when have I, the Ninth Kalpa King, ever been a stingy person? Don’t worry, I’ll definitely reward you handsomely when we return.” Seeing that the Divine Life Palace was getting closer and closer, the Ninth Kalpa King was in a good mood and made a rare joke.","As he spoke, he turned his head and gave Jian Wushuang a meaningful look.","If he had not seen the battle between Jian Wushuang, Lord Zhennan, and the Third Prince, he would have thought that he was the biggest winner of this trip. However, from that battle, he could see that Jian Wushuang, who didn’t show his strength, had definitely gained more than him!","Just the divine power similar to the ‘One Thought Divine Kingdom’ alone had surpassed everything he had gained from this trip to the Tarot Ruins!","However, he and Jian Wushuang had a tacit understanding not to say anything about this. Even when Divine Marquis Qingfeng asked about the details of the battle, the two of them would give a vague answer.","The Ninth Kalpa King understood that everyone in the world had their own secrets. Since Jian Wushuang did not take the initiative to tell him, he naturally would not ask.","In any case, to him, that Supreme divine medicine was the most suitable opportunity for him!","As for what opportunities Jian Wushuang had obtained, it had nothing to do with him.","The three of them chatted casually and closed their eyes to rest. Time passed quickly. In the blink of an eye, another 100 years had passed. The surrounding universe void finally became bustling and lively. From time to time, they could see all kinds of universe boats passing by.","The Divine Life Palace was finally right in front of him.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes. From where they were, they could already see the divine Kingdom controlled by the Divine Life Palace in the distance through the mystic Light realm of the universe boat.","“I haven’t seen you for such a long time, I wonder how Shuang ‘er is doing now.” Thinking of Leng Rushuang, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but smile and muttered to himself.","After returning to the Divine Life Palace, my next step will be to break through to the fifth stage Ruler realm. Jian Wushuang thought about it again.","His cultivation level was no longer important. Whether it was the strength of his divine power or his comprehension of the principles of the universe, he had already reached the peak of the Ruler realm.","It was not difficult for Jian Wushuang to break through to the fifth stage Ruler. He just had to integrate the eighth principle.","Although the integration of principles of order became more and more difficult, Jian Wushuang had absolute confidence in himself."]},{"number":4195,"title":"Chapter 4195 An Honored Guest Visits","paragraphs":["4195 An Honored Guest Visits","The reason why Jian Wushuang wanted to go back and break through to become a fifth stage Ruler was that once he broke through, not only would his divine power increase again, but more importantly, he might be able to use one-ten-millionth of the Tarot Divine Sword’s power!","At that time, even if he were to face the Ninth Kalpa King, who was a level higher than him in the Ruler realm, he was confident that he would be able to fight with all his might!","“Hmm...when I break through, I might need to borrow the power of the river of enlightenment.”","Jian Wushuang thought about the river spirit in the river of enlightenment and could not help but smile.","“I’m sure that Lord River Spirit’s expression will be very interesting when he sees me again.”","At this moment, Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng did not say a word. They were all eager to return home.","Rumble!","After sixty years, the three of them finally arrived at the universe passage that led to the Divine Life Palace.","“Who are you?” The two Rulers in charge of guarding the gate saw the approaching universe boat and immediately became tense.","“It’s me.” The Ninth Kalpa King replied indifferently.","The three of them walked down from universe boat.","“Greetings, Ninth Kalpa King!”","The two Rulers relaxed when they saw this. They cupped their hands and said, “Ninth Kalpa King, Ruler Blood Wave, Supreme Giant Axe, and Supreme Gai Fu have received your message and asked us to wait here. They asked me to take you to supreme palace as soon as you arrived.”","“Oh? Why are you in such a hurry?”","Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng could not help but look at each other in confusion.","Logically speaking, even if they were asked to report the remains’ situation, they would not be in such a hurry.","“Did something happen?” The Ninth Kalpa King said with a frown.","A hint of hesitation flashed through the eyes of the two Rulers guarding the door, but they still said softly in the end, “Your Excellency, Ninth Kalpa King, a hundred years ago, an honored guest came to the supreme shrine and is waiting for you.”","“What distinguished guest?” The Ninth Kalpa King’s face was filled with a touch of displeasure as he asked again.","The two Rulers took a deep breath and replied with grave expressions, “It’s the people from the Great Void Temple!”","“Great Void Temple?!”","In an instant, Ninth Kalpa King and Divine Marquis Qingfeng’s expressions changed slightly and they looked at Jian Wushuang in unison.","Jian Wushuang remained expressionless and asked, “They’re coming for me, right?”","The two Rulers could not help but bitterly smile and nod. “Yes.”","“Then let’s go and see what they want.” Jian Wushuang sneered in his heart.","He had already expected that the people from the Great Void Temple would come to find him.","He did not expect that the people from the Great Void Temple had not only come to find him, but had even come to the Divine Life Palace.","However, Jian Wushuang did not panic. This was the Divine Life Palace. The people from the Great Void Temple would not dare to do anything out of line.","“My Lords, shall we send a message now and take you to the supreme shrine?” The two Rulers asked.","The Ninth Kalpa King and the other two nodded upon hearing this. They even revealed a determined smile at Jian Wushuang, as if to say, ‘Don’t worry, we’ll take care of everything.’","A short while later, the three of them arrived at the Supreme shrine under the guidance of the two Rulers.","Within the temple.","Supreme Master Gai Fu sat at the head of the table, while Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe sat on either side of him.","Under the three of them, an old man with white hair and a white beard in a Taixu cloak sat cross-legged and sipped his tea.","This person was the seventh Hall Master of the Great Void Temple, the Vice Hall Master, Ruler Whitefloat!","“Speaking of which, I would like to thank the three of you for your hospitality in the Divine Life Palace.” Ruler Whitefloat put down his teacup and smiled.","“Whitefloat, you’ve finished your tea. Shouldn’t you be leaving?” Ruler Blood Wave said with an unsightly expression.","“There’s no hurry. The person I’ve been waiting for hasn’t arrived yet. Ruler Whitefloat glanced at the Ruler Blood Wave and shook his head.","Pausing for a moment, the White floating Supreme martial artist continued, “Don’t worry. Once i’ve investigated the matter, I’ll naturally leave. I won’t stay for long. How can the Divine Life Palace be better than our Great Void Temple?”","“You!”","Ruler Blood Wave was enraged upon hearing this. ‘What kind of place did this Ruler Whitefloat think their Divine Life Palace was? Come and go as you please? Leave as he pleased?’","Just as he was about to flare up, Supreme martial artist Gai Fu, who was sitting at the head of the table, said, “Blood Wave, you are a guest. Don’t be rude.”","Supreme Giant Axe shook his head at him.","The Ruler Blood Wave expression wavered upon seeing this. In the end, he snorted coldly and fell silent.","Upon seeing this, the corners of Ruler Whitefloat’s mouth curled up slightly as he revealed a fearless expression.","Even though he was far weaker than Ruler Blood Wave, he was representing the Great Void Temple this time. He believed that the blood wave Ruler would not dare to do anything to him.","Pa da, pa da.","At this moment, hurried footsteps could be heard from outside. Soon after, the Ruler responsible for guarding the hall hurried in and clasped his hands. Supreme Master Gai Fu, Supreme Master Blood Wave, and Supreme Master Giant Axe, the Ninth Kalpa King has returned and are waiting outside the hall for announcement.","The pupils of the Ruler Blood Wave and the Supreme Giant Axe both shrank. As for the Ruler Whitefloat, he immediately stood up and laughed.","“Hahaha, the person I’ve been waiting for a hundred years has finally arrived!”","“Let them in,” Supreme martial artist Gai Fu nodded his head with a calm expression.","“Yes!”","The Ruler acknowledged and retreated.","Not long after, Jian Wushuang and the other two slowly walked in.","The Ninth Kalpa King stood in the middle, while Jian Wushuang and Divine Marquis Qingfeng walked on both sides. The three of them were expressionless.","“Supreme Master Gai Fu, Supreme Master Blood Wave, and Supreme Master Giant Axe.” The three of them cupped their hands.","“Yes, Ninth Kalpa King, Divine Marquis Qingfeng, please sit down.” Supreme martial artist Gai Fu nodded his head.","Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Jian Wushuang, this is the Vice Hall Master of the seventh Hall of the Great Void Temple, Ruler Whitefloat. I called you over because Ruler Whitefloat has something to ask you. When Ruler Whitefloat asks you about it later, you must not hide anything. Do you understand?”","“Understood.” Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at Ruler Whitefloat. He cupped his hands and said, “Jian Wushuang greets Ruler Whitefloat.”","“You are Jian Wushuang? Hmph, let me ask you, in the Tarot Ruins, did you have a conflict with Qing Xuzi of the Great Void Temple?” Ruler Whitefloat squinted his eyes. He did not hold back and directly cut to the chase.","“I guess so.” Jian Wushuang nodded his head calmly.","The matter between him and Qing Xuzi was not a secret. Back in the Tarot Ruins, many people had seen Qing Xuzi chasing after him. Therefore, he had no intention of denying it."]},{"number":4196,"title":"Chapter 4196 An Inquiry","paragraphs":["4196 An Inquiry","“Hmph, it’s good that you admit it.” Upon hearing these words, a cold glint flashed across the eyes of Ruler Whitefloat as he sneered, “Jian Wushuang, let me ask you again. How did you escape from our Divine Son Qing Xuzi’s pursuit? Where is Divine Son Qing Xuzi now?”","As he said that, Ruler Whitefloat looked at Jian Wushuang with an oppressive gaze. It was as if he would be furious if Jian Wushuang gave a wrong answer!","“Back then, when Divine Son Qing Xuzi chased after me, I was forced to escape to a special place in the Tarot Ruins. There, I got rid of Divine Son Qing Xuzi. As for where he is now, I don’t know...” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“What a load of nonsense!”","Ruler Whitefloat did not wait for Jian Wushuang to finish his sentence. His voice suddenly became stern as he rebuked, “Jian Wushuang, I advise you to be more honest. Don’t try to be petty in front of me!”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","From the moment he stepped into the Supreme shrine, Ruler Whitefloat had not given him a good look. His words were full of scolding and oppression. Did he really think that he, Jian Wushuang, could be bullied?","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said calmly, “Ruler Whitefloat, you can go and find out for yourself whether I’m telling the truth or not.”","“Still not being honest?” Ruler Whitefloat laughed out of anger as he mocked, “Jian Wushuang, since you said that you were in a secret place and escaped from our Divine Son Qing Xu’s pursuit, tell me, where is the secret place in the Tarot Ruins?”","After saying that, Ruler Whitefloat stared at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was silent for a moment and then said slowly, “I’ve forgotten.”","“You forgot? Hahahaha, what a good ‘forgot’!” Upon hearing these words, the corners of Ruler Whitefloat’s mouth curled up into an exaggerated sneer as he burst out laughing.","Everyone’s expressions turned ugly when they saw this. Even Supreme Gai Fu, who had been resting with his eyes closed, frowned slightly.","“Whitefloat, you’ve asked all your questions. Shouldn’t you be leaving now?” Ruler Blood Wave said, suppressing his anger.","Originally, he had allowed Ruler Whitefloat to enter the Divine Life Palace. It could be said that he had given great face to the Great Void Temple. In the end, Ruler Whitefloat did not know what was good for him and did what he did in the Supreme shrine. Did he have any scruples?","Jian Wushuang was the junior he had the most faith in, yet Ruler Whitefloat had threatened and berated him. This was no different from slapping the Blood Wave Ruler in the face!","“No rush.”","Ruler Whitefloat shook his head and sneered, “Jian Wushuang, since you refuse a toast only to drink a forfeit, then don’t blame me for bringing you back to the Great Void Temple and slowly interrogating you.”","After saying that, Ruler Whitefloat turned to look at the Ruler Blood Wave and the other two before saying in a clear voice, “The three of you, it seems that this disciple of the divine palace does not intend to explain things to me. Since that’s the case, let me bring him back to the Great Void Temple and slowly interrogate him. What do you think?”","Shua shua shua.","As soon as these words were spoken, Ninth Kalpa King and Divine Marquis Qingfeng instantly stood up and glared at Ruler Whitefloat.","“You dare?” The Ninth Kalpa King said coldly, his eyes extremely cold.","“You must be the Ninth Kalpa King, right? What, just because the outside world says that you’re comparable to a Supreme martial artist, you really think you’re a Supreme martial artist? Do you think you’re qualified to be impudent in front of this old man?” Ruler Whitefloat looked at the Ninth Kalpa King in disdain and said. He did not notice that Supreme Gai Fu, who was sitting at the head of the table, had already opened his eyes. Ruler Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe had extremely cold expressions on their faces.","However, even if he did notice it, he probably would not think much of it. The Divine Life Palace was the base camp of special life forms in the vast universe, so its strength was naturally not bad. However, the great void godly Palace was not bad either, and might even be stronger.","The Great Void Temple was founded by Divine Emperor Tai Xu and there were a total of seven Hall Masters. Each of these seven Hall Masters was a Supreme expert. Under the seven Hall Masters, there were seven Deputy Hall Masters and all of them were at the Supreme cultivation level.","He, Ruler Whitefloat, was the Deputy Hall Master of the seventh Hall of the Great Void Temple!","he was confident that even though Supreme Gai Fu, Ruler Blood Wave, and the others were stronger than him, they would not dare to offend him. after all, they would have to be wary of the Great Void Temple behind him.","But at this moment...","“How audacious! Who do you think you are? How dare you ask for someone from my Divine Life Palace?” Ruler Blood Wave’s eyes were filled with anger. “Whitefloat, I’m already giving you and the Great Void Temple face by letting you enter the Divine Life Palace to question Jian Wushuang. Now, you’re pushing your luck and want to take someone from my Divine Palace? What do you think this place is?","“Let me tell you, even if your Divine Son Qing Xu dies at the hands of my divine Palace’s disciples, he can only blame himself for not being strong enough. He brought this upon himself, understand?”","Upon hearing these words, Ruler Whitefloat’s face could not help but change slightly.","However, he did not reply. Instead, he looked at Supreme Gai Fu. He knew that Supreme Gai Fu was the one who could make the final decision here, not the Ruler Blood Wave or the Supreme Giant Axe.","He first cupped his hands toward Supreme Gai Fu, then said respectfully, “Supreme Gai Fu, you’re the head of the five lead Supremes of the Divine Life Palace, and you’re in charge of leading the Divine Life Palace on behalf of the palace Master. I don’t think you’re as impulsive as Ruler Blood Wave, right? That Jian Wushuang is merely a fourth stage Ruler. To us, he is no different from an ant. I believe you won’t become enemies with the Great Void Temple because of him, right?”","After that, he smiled and added, “Oh, that’s right. Divine Son Qing Xu is the beloved disciple of our first Hall Master. He’s above the Supreme martial artist. You have to think carefully about the implications of this.”","Supreme Gai Fu’s expression did not change at all when he heard this. He raised his eyelids and said indifferently, “Are you threatening this Lord?”","Ruler Whitefloat’s pupils contracted upon hearing this. For some reason, his heart suddenly thumped as a bad premonition welled up in his heart.","He braced himself and said, “Supreme Gai Fu, how would I dare to threaten you? I’m just explaining the implications of this matter to you. After all, he’s just a fourth-stage great Ruler. Why should we affect the relationship between the divine palace and the Great Void Temple for him? Supreme Gai Fu, I advise you to reconsider.”","After hearing the word ‘reconsider’, a faint smile appeared on Supreme Gai Fu’s aged face.","He looked at Ruler Whitefloat with a playful expression and said, “Do you know that even your first Palace Master, Bing Ye, has never dared to ask me to ‘think twice’ in front of me? You are just an insignificant Deputy Palace Master, and you dare to ask me to think twice?”","Ruler Whitefloat’s expression changed when he heard this. It was only then that he suddenly recalled that Supreme Gai Fu, who was sitting in front of him, was the most senior supreme in the universe. His strength had long since reached an unfathomable level.","“Supreme Gai Fu, I didn’t mean it that way...” He hurriedly explained.","Before he could finish, Supreme Gai Fu waved his hand."]},{"number":4197,"title":"Chapter 4197 Blast It Out","paragraphs":["4197 Blast It Out","“Whitefloat, I asked you to enter the divine Palace to ask my disciples. This is a courtesy. Since you don’t want to be polite, I don’t need to be polite either.” After saying this, Supreme Gai Fu’s voice turned cold. “I’ll give you three seconds to get out of here!”","“Supreme Gai Fu, you...” Ruler Whitefloat’s expression finally changed upon seeing this, and he wanted to say something.","“Blood Wave, you should know what to do next, right?” How could Supreme Gai Fu possibly listen to him? he looked indifferently at Ruler Blood Wave. Ruler Whitefloat was merely an ordinary Supreme martial artist. It was not to the point where he had to make a move.","“Understood!” The Blood Wave Ruler grinned, and his face was filled with endless coldness.","He had had enough of Ruler Whitefloat. If it was not for the fact that Ruler Whitefloat did not ask him to make a move, he would have sent Ruler Whitefloat flying with a single slap.","And now, the opportunity had finally arrived.","He stood up and walked toward Ruler Whitefloat...","“Blood Wave! What are you trying to do? In 100,000 years, it will be the Grand ceremony of all races in the universe. The Divine Life Palace and the Great Void Temple will all be there...” A look of fear appeared on Ruler Whitefloat’s face. The Ruler Blood Wave was a top-notch Supreme martial artist, and his strength was far beyond his own.","Before he could finish.","“Get lost!”","The Blood Wave Ruler’s eyes widened as he roared.","The next moment!","He raised his hand and slapped the face of Ruler Whitefloat!","Bang!","In an instant, an extremely majestic and terrifying supreme divine power gushed out from his hand like an avalanche. With a single slap, Ruler Whitefloat was sent flying out of the Divine Life Palace!","“Hmph, what Deputy Hall Master? He’s just an idiot. How dare he come to my Divine Life Palace to ask for someone?” The Blood Wave Ruler retracted his hand and shook his head in disdain.","Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang and his expression softened. In its place was a gentle smile.","“Good job, little one,” he said, pleased.","Jian Wushuang returned the smile. In fact, ever since he had stepped into the Supreme shrine, he had never worried about his own safety. This was his trust in the Ruler Blood Wave and the Divine Life Palace.","“Alright, you three, tell me about your trip to the Tarot Ruins.” The Ruler Blood Wave sat back in his seat and clapped his hands.","“Yes.”","The Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng looked at each other and began to slowly explain.","A few hours later, Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, and Divine Marquis Qingfeng walked out of the Supreme shrine.","“Jian Wushuang, where do you plan to go next?” The Ninth Kalpa King stopped and asked.","“I think he’s trying to break through to the fifth stage.” Jian Wushuang replied.","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King nodded and said with emotion, “It’s time for me to break through to become an Ruler. I was planning to wait until you became an Ultimate Ruler and then have a good fight with you, but it seems I won’t have that chance.”","The Ninth Kalpa King had benefited a lot from this trip to the Tarot Ruins. He had a hunch that he would be able to break through to the supremacy stage this time.","He had been an Ultimate Ruler for far, far too long, and had been lacking the opportunity to break through to the Ruler level.","And now, this opportunity had finally arrived.","“We’ll talk about it after you break through to the Supreme-being level.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Haha, Jian Wushuang, just you wait. The day we meet again will be the day I become a Supreme!” The Ninth Kalpa King laughed heartily, containing an endless heroic spirit.","“The two of you, I’ll be taking my leave first.”","The next moment, the Ninth Kalpa King soared into the sky and disappeared into the horizon.","“Divine Marquis Qingfeng, we’ll meet again in the future.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at Qing Feng, took a step forward, turned into a divine light, and quickly flew away.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng remained where he was and sighed.","It seemed that the Ninth Kalpa King was going to break through to the Supreme realm, and Jian Wushuang’s future was promising. Only he himself had reached the end of his talent. He would probably be at the Ultimate Ruler realm in this life.","“Forget it, I’m content.”","Shaking his head, Divine Marquis Qingfeng also left.","...","At the same time, not far from the gate of the Divine Life Palace.","An old man with white hair and a white beard crawled up from the ground in a sorry state.","“Dammit! The people of the Divine Life Palace should all die!”","His expression was extremely gloomy. However, there was a handprint on the right side of his face that was formed by divine power. It made his gloomy expression look somewhat comical.","Hmph, the myriad tribes ceremony will be held in 100000 years. At that time, the Ruler Blood Wave, Overlord Supreme, and Jian Wushuang will suffer the wrath of the Great Void Temple!","Ruler Whitefloat turned his head and shot a venomous look at the Divine Life Palace. With a flip of his right hand, a universe boat appeared. He steered the universe boat and shot off into the distance.","...","The Divine Life Palace. The sixth mountain range. Next to a small lake.","A beautiful woman in plain clothes was cultivating by the lake with her eyes closed.","She furrowed her brows, divine power radiating from her body, and the aura she exuded was that of a fourth stage Ruler.","Suddenly, a pair of hands gently wrapped around her waist from behind and hugged her. Immediately after, a slightly teasing and magnetic voice sounded in her ears.","“Shuang ‘er, I haven’t seen you for a long time. Your cultivation has improved again.” Leng Rushuang slowly opened her eyes. She did not turn around and replied gently, “Husband, did your trip to the ruins go smoothly?”","“Naturally, it’s smooth.” Jian Wushuang smiled and turned Leng Rushuang around. He looked at Leng Rushuang’s worried and beautiful face. Even though he had always been calm, he could not help but feel a little touched.","“Before I left, I promised you that I would return safely. See, I didn’t lie to you, right?” Jian Wushuang reached out his hand and touched Leng Rushuang’s nose with a smile.","“My husband, next time you have something to do, bring me along.” Leng Rushuang called out to him softly. She reached out and hugged Jian Wushuang gently, burying her head in his arms.","Jian Wushuang nodded and reached out his hand to stroke Leng Rushuang’s head gently. He felt warm inside.","...","In the blink of an eye, ten years had passed.","in Jian Wushuang’s manor in the sixth mountain range, Divine Life Palace.","“Now it’s time to give it a try.” Jian Wushuang opened his eyes slowly and a sharp light flashed across his eyes,","In the past ten years, Jian Wushuang had finally reached the peak of his condition.","It could be said that he was already half a step into the threshold of a fifth stage great Ruler. The only thing he lacked was the fusion of the eighth principle.","It was not too difficult for Jian Wushuang to integrate the eighth principle.","This was the fastest breakthrough he had ever made since becoming a god.","However, this was also the most solid foundation Jian Wushuang had ever had!"]},{"number":4198,"title":"Chapter 4198 Meeting the River Spirit Again","paragraphs":["4198 Meeting the River Spirit Again","In the second level of the Tarot Ruins, the opportunities he had obtained were too great. After the Tarot sword spirit had possessed him, in order to improve his strength, the divine herbs had been stuffed into Jian Wushuang’s stomach as if they were free. Even now, Jian Wushuang’s divine body still contained a large amount of medicinal power.","Some of the divine herbs could improve Jian Wushuang’s divine power and some could improve his comprehension of the universe principle. However, most of the divine herbs were for Jian Wushuang’s integration of the eighth principle!","“As long as I digest the divine medicine in my body and use the power of the river of enlightenment, I should be able to break through to the fifth stage.”","Jian Wushuang made up his mind. Then, he said goodbye to Leng Rushuang and walked toward the river of enlightenment.","!!","...","At the riverbank of the river of enlightenment.","A short old man with two long beards by his mouth was lying on a soft bed. Beside him, a female disciple of the Divine Life Palace was massaging his shoulders and back with a flattering smile.","“Lord River Spirit, do you like the blood jade coral I gave you?” The female disciple of the Divine Life Palace said with a sneer.","“Hmm...it’s barely passable, I guess.” The River Spirit waved his hand and said.","At this moment, he was lying down with his eyes slightly closed and his expression was one of enjoyment. There was no trace of the miserable look he had when he was bullied by Jian Wushuang.","“Then...then, Lord River Spirit, can i enter the river of enlightenment and study the principles?” The female disciple asked excitedly after receiving the River Spirit’s approval.","“Seeing that you’re so well-behaved and sensible, you can help me massage for three more days. Once you serve me well, you can naturally enter.” Lord River Spirit said in a relaxed manner.","“Yes!” The female disciple of the Divine Life Palace started to massage even more diligently.","“So comfortable!”","The River Spirit sighed in his heart. This was the right way to open it. What the hell was that guy called Jian Wushuang doing a thousand years ago?","The time when he was suppressed by Jian Wushuang was unbearable. It was the greatest humiliation in his long life.","“It’s alright. I heard that Jian Wushuang has been sent out. I don’t think he’ll be back for a while.”","Thinking of this, River Spirit chuckled. If he could, he really did not want to see Jian Wushuang again in his life!","At this moment.","“Eh...River Spirit, you really know how to enjoy life.”","A strange yet familiar voice suddenly sounded in the River Spirit’s ears.","In that instant, the River Spirit’s body froze!","He turned his head back in a daze, only to see a figure he never wanted to see again in his life, looking at him with a smile.","Jian Wushuang!!!","Plop!","Immediately, the River Spirit climbed up from the soft bed with both its hands and feet. After letting out a frightened cry, it jumped into the river of enlightenment.","“W-what’s going on?” The female disciple of the Divine Life Palace was dumbfounded.","Lord River Spirit, who was highly respected in the Divine Life Palace, had actually fled in fear?","She turned around and saw a black-haired young man in black standing by the river with a smile.","“Jian Wushuang?” The female disciple raised her eyebrows.","Jian Wushuang was quite famous in the Divine Life Palace. His battle with the Ninth Kalpa King in the trial arena back then could be said to have shaken the divine palace. Most of the disciples of the Divine Life Palace knew Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang nodded at her and then stepped into the river of enlightenment.","In the deepest part of the river of enlightenment.","The River Spirit bent its waist and hid behind a huge rock. It stuck out its head slightly and looked around with its pair of triangular eyes.","Pa, pa.","Suddenly, someone patted his shoulder.","Then, the nightmarish voice rang in his ears again with a teasing tone. “Lord River Spirit, what are you looking at?”","The River Spirit’s body stiffened, and it shivered. It turned its head back stiffly.","As expected, that figure was standing quietly behind him.","“Jian Wushuang, are you done? what do you want to do this time?” The River Spirit’s expression changed. He stretched out his short hand and pushed Jian Wushuang’s hand away from his shoulder. He could no longer hold back his anger and roared.","Jian Wushuang did not mind. He smiled and replied, “I’m here to trouble Lord River Spirit to help me break through again.”","“What? A breakthrough? Didn’t you just make a breakthrough? Why are you making another breakthrough?”","River Spirit’s eyes widened and he looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief. Then, he took a step forward.","“No, no, this guy is going to squeeze me again. I have to leave this place and lie low for a while.” The River Spirit’s mind whirred, and he instantly made up his mind to avoid the limelight.","As he ran, he suddenly realized that he seemed to be retreating.","“Eh? What’s going on?” The River Spirit was puzzled. then, he felt a large hand grab his shoulder.","“Come on! Lord River Spirit!”","A burst of laughter came from behind him. The next moment, he heard Jian Wushuang say with a smile, “Suppress!”","Bang!","In an instant, a stone tablet with a suppressive force fell from the sky and pressed him down.","“Ah! Damn you, Jian Wushuang!”","The River Spirit cried out miserably and turned to look at Jian Wushuang. He trembled with anger and said, “Jian Wushuang, you...are you a devil?”","“Lord River Spirit, I promise this will be the last time.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at him with a smile. Then, he slowly sat down cross-legged and closed his eyes.","Clang!","A ray of sword light slashed across, instantly cutting the River Spirit into two.","A dense aura of laws spread out.","Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough had begun.","...","In the depths of the universe, the stars were shining brightly. The top forces stood there, forming a scene of heroes.","The great void Star area was located in the center of the universe. As the name suggested, the great void Star area was under the jurisdiction of the Great Void Temple.","At this moment, in a separate space in the great void Star field, there were seven white divine halls.","Each of the seven white temples was extremely solemn and Holy, and they had their own badges.","The seventh shrine was a golden wisteria flower.","The seventh shrine was extremely tall. There was a long stone staircase that led straight up. The stone staircase was not wide. On the contrary, it was very narrow and cramped. It was filled with an oppressive feeling.","“Greetings, Deputy Hall Master!” The two Ultimate Rulers in charge of guarding the stone stairs, sword and shield in hand, respectfully bowed to an old man with white hair and a beard.","“Is the palace Master in the main hall?” Ruler Whitefloat asked gloomily as he clutched his right cheek.","The Blood Wave Ruler’s palm had been condensed from Ruler divine power, so it was not easy to get rid of it.","“Deputy Hall Master, the hall Master has returned from the ancient starry sky path and is waiting for you in the main hall.” The two Ultimate Rulers replied."]},{"number":4199,"title":"Chapter 4199 The Undercurrent Surges","paragraphs":["4199 The Undercurrent Surges","“Yes.”","Ruler Whitefloat nodded his head. He did not use any divine power and instead walked up the stone stairs step by step.","A moment later, Ruler Whitefloat walked to the top of the stone stairs. There was a strange pavilion that was completely red.","He pushed open the door of the pavilion. Inside the spacious pavilion, there was no light. A thin old man was sitting cross-legged on the head seat of the pavilion, half of his face hidden in the darkness.","!!","“Hall Master.” Ruler Whitefloat respectfully bowed.","“Eh? Whitefloat, what’s wrong with your face?” A hoarse voice came from the skinny old man.","When Ruler Whitefloat heard this, a look of humiliation flashed across his eyes. Gritting his teeth, he replied, “Palace Master, this is all thanks to Ruler Blood Wave of the Divine Life Palace.”","“Blood Wave?” The scrawny old man was surprised and asked, “I know Blood Wave. He’s an easy person to get along with among the Supreme martial artists. Why would he attack you? Are you the one who offended him?”","Upon hearing these words, a venomous look appeared on Ruler Whitefloat’s face as he said, “Hall Master, you don’t know this. The people from the Divine Life Palace are really arrogant. They don’t even respect the Great Void Temple...”","Ruler Whitefloat immediately recounted his experience in the Divine Life Palace, adding a lot of details to the story.","The Divine Life Palace that he had talked about was arrogant and domineering, taking advantage of the situation to bully others. However, it was completely different from his actual experience.","The scrawny old man listened silently and did not reply. After Ruler Whitefloat finished speaking, he shook his head and said, “Alright, I understand. You may leave.”","Ruler Whitefloat’s face turned anxious as he hurriedly asked, “Hall Master, are we just going to let it go like this...?”","Without waiting for him to finish, the skinny old man squinted his eyes and interrupted, “I said I got it, did you not hear me clearly?”","“...”","Ruler Whitefloat fell silent for a moment before cupping his hands and replying, “Then, Whitefloat will take his leave first.”","After saying that, Ruler Whitefloat turned around and walked out of the hall.","However, after he turned around, his expression suddenly became even gloomier and more ruthless.","After a while, the pavilion fell into silence.","The skinny old man raised his head and suddenly looked at the pitch-black void and sighed, “Palace Master Bing Ye, what should we do next?”","Chi chi chi.","The air twisted and a silver-haired child around seven or eight years old appeared.","The child was about seven or eight years old. He had red lips and white teeth. However, he had silver hair and silver eyebrows. His eyes revealed a maturity that did not match his age.","No one would have thought that this handsome and adorable child was the first Hall Master of the Great Void Temple, Supreme Bing Ye!","“Hmph, let’s not talk about the exaggeration in Whitefloat’s words for now. Supreme Gai Fu of the Divine Life Palace is an ancient figure from the same era as the divine Emperor. Even I have to treat him with the respect of a junior when I see him. He’s already very lucky to be able to come back alive!” The silver-haired child sneered and shook his head. His gaze then fell on the skinny old man’s face and he said, “Jiu Kun, I heard that you were the one who chose this Deputy Hall Master? You have bad taste this time.”","The scrawny old man sighed and replied, “Whitefloat is actually a good person, except for his love of adding oil and vinegar.”","After a pause, the skinny old man changed the topic and continued to ask, “Palace Master Bing Ye, there’s one thing that Whitefloat was right about. Are we just going to let the matter of the Divine Son go like this?”","“What else do you want to do?” Supreme Bing Ye shook his head and said, “The Grand Tribe Ceremony is about to begin. I heard that during this grand ceremony, that lord will distribute 10 seats in the universe and choose 10 people to listen to his lecture. Our top priority now is to fight for a place for our Great Void Temple among these 10 seats. Other matters are not as important as this.”","“What? Ten seats?” The scrawny old man was shocked and said, “In the last Grand Tribe Ceremony, didn’t that lord only distribute seven seats? Why are there so many of them this time?”","Supreme Bing Ye pondered for a moment before saying, “When I was on the ancient path of stars, I heard someone say that his lordship is going to choose three of the most talented of the universe’s Ultimate Rulers to sit on his seat. That’s why there are three extra seats for him to listen to the Dao.”","“Palace Master Bing Ye, now that the Divine Son is dead, does that mean that our Great Void Temple has no chance of winning the three seats of the Ultimate Ruler?” The scrawny old man pondered for a while and said with a frown.","Upon hearing this, Supreme Bing Ye smiled faintly and said, “Don’t worry. Our Divine Emperor has already made arrangements for the candidates for the Ultimate Ruler’s seat. The Divine Son is just a substitute.”","“Oh?” The scrawny old man seemed to have thought of something when he heard this. He suddenly raised his eyes, and the divine light in his eyes grew three inches.","“Could it be...Sir Divine Emperor is planning to release Qiu Long?”","Supreme Bing Ye smiled mysteriously and did not reply.","....","At the same time, it was not just the Great Void Temple. Top powers like the Great Sun Divine Kingdom and the Da Feng Divine Kingdom also received news of the deaths of the heaven’s favorites who were sent to the Tarot Ruins.","After some investigation, a name ‘Jian Wushuang’ came into their sight.","Within the first Prince’s residence in the Da Feng Divine Kingdom.","An extremely handsome young man wearing a violet-golden void python robe was standing in front of a railing with his hands behind his back.","In his hand, he held a black light mirror. The image reflected in the mirror was the moment when Jian Wushuang had killed the Third Prince.","His face was full of pain as he muttered to himself, “My dear third brother, I told you not to go to the Tarot Ruins, but you insisted on going. Look at you now, you’ve died in someone else’s hands. Why don’t you listen to my advice...?","“Why? Why did you do that?”","“You should have died in my hands!!!”","As the young man spoke, he suddenly laughed in a low voice.","His handsome face was filled with joy.","After a while, he calmed down and looked down at the scene of Jian Wushuang killing the Third Prince in the dark light mirror. He laughed evilly and said, “Jian Wushuang? Very good. To thank you for helping me get rid of my third brother, I’ve decided to kill you.”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, the mystic light mirror shattered into pieces.","The young man released his hand and looked into the distance with a cold smile.","...","The Divine Life Palace, the fourth mountain range, the river of enlightenment...","‘Jian Wushuang, you deserve to be killed!’","‘Damn Jian Wushuang!’","“Release me! I’m going to fight you to the death!”","“Argh! Jian Wushuang, try to kill me again if you have the ability.”","Bang!","A sword light flashed, and the river of enlightenment quieted down."]},{"number":4200,"title":"Chapter 4200 Demonic Wind Ruler","paragraphs":["4200 Demonic Wind Ruler","“Ah! Jian Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang! I’m telling you, you’re in big trouble!”","“You’re finished, you’re finished!”","“I’m going to report this to Supreme Gai Fu! I’m going to tell them that you’re oppressing me!”","!!","“Jian Wushuang! You’re about to be driven out of the Divine Life Palace! Hahahahahaha! Burp!”","Bang!","Another sword light came, and the river of enlightenment fell silent again.","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace by the river did not know whether to laugh or cry when they saw this.","In the beginning, they were worried that Jian Wushuang would cause trouble. However, when they found out that the River Spirit was fine after being killed, and the rules in the river of comprehension became stronger, they followed Jian Wushuang.","At the bottom of the river of enlightenment, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged with his eyes closed. The extremely dense aura of laws wrapped around him and was absorbed by Jian Wushuang.","In Jian Wushuang’s divine body, the eighth rule imprint started to appear gradually and it extended at an extremely slow speed.","The integration of each rule would become more difficult and take longer each time. Jian Wushuang had already planned to cultivate in seclusion for a long time.","This time, Jian Wushuang did not devour any Dao fruit that could speed up the integration of order principles. Back then, the sword spirit of the Tarot sword had controlled his body. In order to quickly improve his strength, divine herbs had been poured into his stomach like candy. Therefore, the medicinal properties in his body were too strong, and he had to remove the impurities from them first.","The fifth stage Ruler realm was the second last barrier to breaking through to the Supreme level, and so this breakthrough was extremely important.","Jian Wushuang would never allow any medicinal impurities to remain in his body!","...","Time flew by, and the sea changed.","In the blink of an eye, ten thousand years had passed.","In the past 10000 years, many special creatures had entered the Divine Life Palace, creating many legendary stories.","Jian Wushuang’s story gradually faded away.","The River Spirit in the river of enlightenment had long given up on cursing. Like an emotionless corpse, it allowed Jian Wushuang to oppress it.","One day, a small whirlpool suddenly appeared on the dark surface of the Dao Comprehension River.","With the appearance of this small whirlpool, the water of the Dao Comprehension River suddenly boiled. The dense principles hidden in the water instantly became chaotic.","“W-what’s going on?”","“Dammit! Who is disturbing my breakthrough?”","“The river of enlightenment has always been fine. How did it suddenly become like this?”","Puff! Puff! Puff! Puff! Puff!","In an instant, countless figures rushed out of the river of enlightenment and floated in the air.","Among them, a burly man looked at the vortex and shouted in a low voice with a livid face, “Bastard!”","“What’s wrong, Demonic Wind Ruler?”","Immediately, a large group of disciples of the Divine Life Palace swarmed toward the tall man with a burly figure.","The tall and burly man was called Demonic Wind Ruler, a peak stage five Ruler. He had entered the Divine Life Palace eight thousand years ago and was a creation-level creature. His divine power was more than eight hundred times stronger, and he was the most talented of the new batch of special life forms.","Thus, he had quite a bit of prestige among the new disciples of the Divine Life Palace. He was firmly in the leader’s position, and he was even known as the number one expert below the Ultimate Ruler realm!","Hmph, someone is in the river of enlightenment and has disturbed the energy of the principles. Demonic Wind Ruler said with an unsightly expression.","He had only been one step away from fusing with the ninth law and breaking through to the Ultimate Ruler realm, but the appearance of the whirlpool had sucked away all the law energy in the river of enlightenment, causing him to fail in his attempt to break through.","At this moment, he was extremely furious.","“Eh? Who dares to interrupt Demonic Wind Ruler’s cultivation?”","“Who doesn’t know that senior apprentice brother Demonic Wind is about to break through to the Ultimate Ruler realm? Why are you here to cause trouble?”","The new disciples of the Divine Life Palace said with righteous indignation.","“Have all the people in the river of enlightenment come out?” Demonic Wind Ruler asked with a sinister expression.","A new disciple glanced at the figure standing in the void and quickly replied, “Demonic Wind, everyone in the river of enlightenment has come out.”","“Is that so?”","The Demonic Wind Ruler looked down and saw that the whirlpool in the river of enlightenment was like a black hole, sucking away all the law energy within and expanding at a visible rate.","“Then what is this?” Demonic Wind Ruler pointed at the vortex with his chin.","The surrounding disciples of the Divine Life Palace looked at each other and could not help but frown.","In the past ten thousand years, they remembered that they were the only ones who had entered the river of enlightenment.","“Demonic Wind Ruler, I know! There’s indeed one more person who hasn’t come out of the river of enlightenment!”","A round-faced disciple suddenly shouted.","“Who is it?” Ruler windfiend and the others all turned to look at the round-faced disciple.","At the same time, the Demonic Wind Ruler made up his mind. He was definitely going to teach the person who had disturbed the energy of the principles in the river of enlightenment a lesson and caused him to fail in his attempt to break through to the final Ruler realm a lesson!","He was confident that he was invincible against any other Ultimate Ruler, and that the Ultimate Ruler of the Divine Life Palace would never come to the dao comprehension river.","The round-faced disciple could not help but feel a little timid under the gazes of so many people. He wiped the sweat from his forehead and replied in a low voice, “Demonic Wind Ruler, I remember that there is a senior brother named Jian Wushuang in the river of enlightenment.”","“Jian Wushuang?”","When everyone heard this, they looked at each other.","As for Demonic Wind Ruler, he frowned.","He had heard of Jian Wushuang’s name before. When he had first come to the Divine Life Palace, he had heard many elders in the divine Palace talk about how talented Jian Wushuang was and how powerful his battle strength was. He was only a fourth stage Ruler, but he was able to fight an Ultimate Ruler.","However, Demonic Wind Ruler scoffed at this.","He did not believe that Jian Wushuang, who was only a fourth stage Ruler, could fight against the Ultimate Ruler.","In his opinion, Jian Wushuang had been demonized and that was just a rumor.","He had also asked the elders in the divine Palace which Ultimate Ruler Jian Wushuang had fought. The elders in the Divine Life Palace were speechless and could only stammer about the battle between Jian Wushuang and the Ninth Kalpa King in the trial arena.","Demonic Wind Ruler felt even more disdainful.","Trial arena?","That was suppressing the cultivation of two people to the same level. Could it be considered a battle with the Ultimate Ruler?","“Hmph, when Jian Wushuang comes out, I’d like to see how strong the rumored ‘number one genius of the Divine Palace’ is.” Demonic Wind Ruler let out a cold snort."]}]);
